# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**All-or-nothing:** a partial shift (web onion, identity clearnet) breaks oauth2-proxy email matching ([oauth2-proxy-keycloak.cfg.j2:32](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/sso_proxy/oauth2-proxy-keycloak.cfg.j2) sets `email_domains = \"{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}\"`). Fresh onion nodes only; migrating an existing clearnet node is out of scope (base DN + all identities would shift)."
msgstr "**Visu vai neko:** daļēja nobīde (Tīmekļa sīpols, identitātes tīkls) Pārtraukumi2-proxy e-pasta saskaņošana ([oauth2-proxy-keycloak.cfg.j2:32](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/sso_proxy/oauth2-proxy-keycloak.cfg.j2) komplekti `email_domains = \"{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}\"`). Tikai svaigi sīpolu mezgli; migrējot esošo cleannet mezglu ir ārpus jomas (bāzes DN + visas identitātes mainītos)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Allowlist on ``tools/call``:** Filtering only ``tools/list`` would leave every unlisted operation callable by name."
msgstr "**Atļaut sarakstu ``tools/call``:** Tikai filtrēšana ``tools/list`` atstātu katru sarakstā neiekļauto operāciju, ko var saukt pēc nosaukuma."

