# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Ansible authenticates via AppRole with caller-set ids.** First init uses the root token in memory only, enables AppRole, writes the inventory-generated `role_id` and `secret_id` through `role-id` / `custom-secret-id`, then revokes the root token. Later deploys log in with those inventory credentials."
msgstr "**Autentificējas caur AppRole ar zvanītāja iestatītu ID.** Pirmais init izmanto saknes marķieri tikai atmiņā, ļauj AppRole, raksta inventāra ģenerēts `role_id` kā arī `secret_id` caur `role-id` / `custom-secret-id`, tad atsauc saknes marķieri. Vēlāk izvieto pieslēdzas ar šiem inventāra datiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Ansible meta `dependencies:`** from each role's `meta/main.yml`."
msgstr "**Ansible meta `dependencies:`** no katras lomas `meta/main.yml`."

