# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized Deployment:** Leverage Docker for streamlined setup, management, and scalability."
msgstr "**Konteineru izvietošana:** Sviras Docker racionalizēta uzstādīšana, pārvaldība, un mērogojamība."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Containerized Deployment:** Utilizes Docker and Docker Compose for isolated, reliable deployment."
