# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Contract probe:** The ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` probe presents the ``mcp_bearer``, asserts the served tool surface matches the pinned contract, and separately asserts that an unauthenticated ``initialize`` is refused with a 4xx and discloses no tool inventory."
msgstr "**Kontrolzonde:** E ir o pa s ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` zonde parāda ``mcp_bearer``, apgalvo, ka apkalpo instrumentu virsmas atbilst pinned līgumu, un atsevišķi apgalvo, ka neautenticated ``initialize`` ir atteikta ar 4xx un neatklāj nekādu rīku inventāru."

