# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable Webmail and Administration:** Provides a modern web interface for managing emails and administrative tasks with ease."
msgstr "**Pielāgojams Webmail and Administration:** Nodrošina modernu tīmekļa saskarni e-pastu un administratīvo uzdevumu pārvaldīšanai ar vieglumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customizable:** Easily configurable to point to your own source code or documentation."
msgstr "**Pielāgojams:** Viegli konfigurējami norādīt uz savu pirmkodu vai dokumentāciju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customization & Theming:** Adapt the look and feel of your wiki with skins, CSS, and scripting."
msgstr "**Pielāgošana & tēmēšana:** Pielāgot izskatu un justies jūsu wiki ar ādas, CSS, un skriptu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customization**: You may need to customize the playbook, especially the ``{{users.client.username}}`` variable, to suit your specific setup."
msgstr "**Pielāgošana**: Jums var būt nepieciešams pielāgot playbook, jo īpaši ``{{users.client.username}}`` mainīga, lai atbilstu jūsu konkrēto iestatījumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Customization**: You may need to customize the playbook, especially the `{{users.client.username}}` variable, to suit your specific setup."
