# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Nebrīdināt par ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao saglabā Vault metrisko vārdtelpu, un veselīgu nenoslēgtu mezglu izstaro ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, tāpēc ziņojums par ``== 0`` pastāvīgi ugunsgrēki. Lietot ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 aizzīmogoti); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` koborāti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so an alert on `== 0` fires permanently. Use `/v1/sys/health` (503 while sealed); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` corroborates."
msgstr "**Nebrīdināt par `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao saglabā Vault metrisko vārdtelpu, un veselīgu nenoslēgtu mezglu izstaro `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, tāpēc ziņojums par `== 0` pastāvīgi ugunsgrēki. Lietot `/v1/sys/health` (503 aizzīmogoti); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` koborāti."

