# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**End-to-end validated in CI on 2026-06-02:** `test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` (3-node DinD + NFS server) reaches all 17 steps green; `15_assert_state.sh` confirms `replicas: 1/1` after drain, the pre-drain marker on the NFS-backed `mediawiki_images` volume is readable from the new node, and MediaWiki HTTP responds inside the rescheduled container. See run logs at `/tmp/act-swarm-nfs-110.log`."
msgstr "**Beigu datums apstiprināts CI 2026-06-02:** `test-deploy-swarm-nfs.yml` (3-mezgla Dind + NFS serveris) sasniedz visus 17 pakāpieni zaļi; `15_assert_state.sh` apstiprina `replicas: 1/1` pēc drenāžas – pirmsdrenāžas marķieris uz NFS atbalstīta `mediawiki_images` apjoms ir lasāms no jaunā mezgla, un MediaWiki HTTP atbild pārplānotajā konteinerā. Skatīt palaist žurnālus pie `/tmp/act-swarm-nfs-110.log`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enforce 2FA and Use a Password Manager** Administrators MUST enforce [2FA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multi-factor_authentication) and SHOULD use a password manager with auto-generated passwords. We recommend [KeePass](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KeePass). The KeePass database can be stored securely in your Nextcloud instance and synchronized between devices."
msgstr "**Īstenot 2FA un izmantot paroli pārvaldnieku** Administratoriem ir jānodrošina izpilde [2FA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multi-factor_authentication) un būtu jāizmanto paroli pārvaldnieks ar auto ģenerētām parolēm. Mēs iesakām [KeePass](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KeePass). KeePass datu bāzi var glabāt droši jūsu Nextcloud instanci un sinhronizēt starp ierīcēm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
