# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory & Warehouse:** Manage stock levels, transfers, and warehouse operations. Supports barcode scanning, batch picking, and advanced routing."
msgstr "**Inventāra & noliktava:** Pārvaldīt krājumu līmeni, nodošanu, un noliktavas operācijas. Atbalsta svītrkodu skenēšanu, masveida apstrādi un uzlabotu maršrutēšanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Inventāra mapes.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) zvani [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), kas rada vienu mapi par kārtu pie `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (vai tikai `<inventory-dir>` ja ir viena kārta). Katrai mapei, `build_dev_inventory` atrisina kārtas per-app varianta derīgo slodzi un bakes to inventarizācijas `host_vars` kā `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` aizstāj. Tāpēc inventarizācija ir izslēgta uz diska ar variantu; nav nepieciešams palaist laika selektoru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory pin**: set `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` in `group_vars` or `host_vars` of the target environment."
msgstr "**Inventarizācijas pin**: noteikts `test_e2e_playwright_keep: \"true\"` skaits `group_vars` vai `host_vars` mērķvidē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
