# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Ierakstīšana taustiņā:** kur: Keycloak izvietošanā, funkcijas nosaka ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` un LiteLLM Gateway lasīt platformas OIDC galapunkti no ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` kā arī ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Parakstīties uz ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` nes administratora lietotājvārdu. LiteLLM apkalpo SSO līdz pieciem kontiem ``litellm_usertable`` un atsakās aiz ka bez ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

