# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP is declared, not wired.** A role states an *mcp* block in *meta/services.yml*, and the vocabulary, discovery and rendering layer derives endpoints, clients, credentials and network edges from it. A client-provider pairing is declared once, on the provider; *sys-svc-mcp-reconcile* converges clients from the complete provider set; a refused pairing is expressed as off rather than gated at the call site; and *svc-ai-mcp-adapter* is a reusable per-provider sidecar rather than a standalone application. The contract is proven on deploy, including refusal on *initialize* and the tool inventory itself. The design, its delegation rules and a machine-checkable audit live under [docs/contributing/design/role/services/mcp.md](docs/contributing/design/role/services/mcp.md)."
msgstr "**Tiek deklarēta MCP, nevis vadu.** A loma nosaka a *mcp* bloks iekšā *meta/services.yml*, un vārdu krājums, atklājums un renderēšanas slānis iegūst galapunktus, klienti, akreditācijas datus un tīkla malas no tā. vienu reizi pakalpojumu sniedzējam tiek paziņots par klienta–piegādātāja pāriem; *sys-svc-mcp-reconcile* saplūdina klientus no visas pakalpojumu sniedzēja kopas; atteiktā pāru uzskaite tiek izteikta kā “off”, nevis “gated” izsaukuma vietnē; un *svc-ai-mcp-adapter* ir atkārtoti izmantojams viens piegādātājs blakusvāģis, nevis atsevišķs pieteikums. Līgums ir pierādīts par izvietošanu, tostarp atteikumu par *inicializēt* un pats instruments inventarizāciju. Dizains, tā deleģēšanas noteikumi un mašīnpārbaudāmu revīziju tiešraidē zem [docs/contributing/design/role/services/mcp.md](docs/contributing/design/role/services/mcp.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Declares the `/mcp` path over streamable HTTP as an internal, bearer-token-authenticated endpoint served by the `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` instance running as compose service `giteamcp`. The adapter listens on container port `8080` and is never published to a host port or fronted by the public reverse proxy; clients reach it as `http://giteamcp:8080/mcp` on the container network. It is off by default and switches on only where Hermes Agent or OpenClaw is part of the deployment."
msgstr "**MCP servera līgums:** paziņo par `/mcp` trajektorija pār straumējamu HTTP kā iekšēju, uzrādītāja-kena-autentificētu beigu punktu, ko izmanto `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` komponēt pakalpojumu `giteamcp`. Uz adaptera klausās konteinera ostā `8080` un nekad nav publicēts uzņēmējas ostas vai priekšā publiskā reversā starpnieks; klienti sasniedz to kā `http://giteamcp:8080/mcp` konteineru tīklā. Tas ir izslēgts pēc noklusējuma un ieslēgts tikai tad, ja Hermes Agent vai OpenClaw ir daļa no izvietošanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Declares the ``/mcp`` path over streamable HTTP as an internal, bearer-token-authenticated endpoint served by the ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` instance running as compose service ``giteamcp``. The adapter listens on container port ``8080`` and is never published to a host port or fronted by the public reverse proxy; clients reach it as ``http://giteamcp:8080/mcp`` on the container network. It is off by default and switches on only where Hermes Agent or OpenClaw is part of the deployment."
