# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Declares the built-in MCP server at `/api/mcp` over streamable HTTP as an internal, bearer-token-authenticated endpoint, and generates the token that MCP clients present. Adding the MCP Server integration itself stays a Home Assistant onboarding step."
msgstr "**MCP servera līgums:** Deklarē iebūvētu MCP serveri `/api/mcp` pār straumējamu HTTP kā iekšēju, uzrādītāja token-authenticated galarezultātu, un rada marķierierīci, ko MCP klientiem klāt. Pievienojot MCP servera integrāciju pats paliek Home Assistant iekāpšanas pakāpiens."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Declares the built-in MCP server at ``/api/mcp`` over streamable HTTP as an internal, bearer-token-authenticated endpoint, and generates the token that MCP clients present. Adding the MCP Server integration itself stays a Home Assistant onboarding step."
msgstr "**MCP servera līgums:** Deklarē iebūvētu MCP serveri ``/api/mcp`` pār straumējamu HTTP kā iekšēju, uzrādītāja token-authenticated galarezultātu, un rada marķierierīci, ko MCP klientiem klāt. Pievienojot MCP servera integrāciju pats paliek Home Assistant iekāpšanas pakāpiens."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Fronts GitLab's built-in MCP server with the repository-owned adapter. Clients reach `/mcp` on the `gitlabmcp` sidecar; the adapter alone talks to `/api/v4/mcp` upstream, so only the contracted tools are reachable."
msgstr "**MCP servera līgums:** Priekšpuses GitLabIebūvētais MCP serveris ar repozitorijam piederošo adapteri. Klienti sasniedz `/mcp` par `gitlabmcp` blakusvāģis; adapteris vien runā ar `/api/v4/mcp` augšpus, tāpēc tikai līgumi instrumenti ir sasniedzami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server contract:** Fronts GitLab’s built-in MCP server with the repository-owned adapter. Clients reach ``/mcp`` on the ``gitlabmcp`` sidecar; the adapter alone talks to ``/api/v4/mcp`` upstream, so only the contracted tools are reachable."
msgstr "**MCP servera līgums:** Priekšpuses GitLabir iebūvēts MCP serveris ar repozitorijam piederošu adapteri. Klienti sasniedz ``/mcp`` par ``gitlabmcp`` blakusvāģis; adapteris vien runā ar ``/api/v4/mcp`` augšpus, tāpēc tikai līgumi instrumenti ir sasniedzami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server surface:** Serve the ``mcp-server`` plugin’s streamable-HTTP endpoint on the container network, guarded by an administrator API token and limited to the read-only tool default."
msgstr "**MCP servera virsma:** Pasniedz ``mcp-server`` Name API marķieris un ierobežots ar tikai lasāmu rīku noklusējumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP server surface:** Serve the `mcp-server` plugin's streamable-HTTP endpoint on the container network, guarded by an administrator API token and limited to the read-only tool default."
msgstr "**MCP servera virsma:** Pasniedz `mcp-server` Name API marķieris un ierobežots ar tikai lasāmu rīku noklusējumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP state is a variant axis.** Roles that gain an MCP surface MUST express the enabled/disabled split through `meta/variants.yml` so CI matrix runs cover both states."
msgstr "**MCP stāvoklis ir varianta ass.** Lomas, kas iegūst MCP virsmu jāizpauž iespējoto/deaktivizēto sadalīt caur `meta/variants.yml` Tātad CI matrica aptver abus stāvokļus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MCP surface is the native `mcp_server` integration under the [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) contract.** The role's `meta/services.yml` declares `mcp` with `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, served under the role's canonical origin per 025. No third-party MCP add-on is used when the native integration covers the need."
msgstr "**MCP virsma ir dzimtā `mcp_server` Integrācija [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) līgums.** Nozīme `meta/services.yml` deklarē `mcp` kur: `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, ko pasniedz saskaņā ar lomu kanonisko izcelsmi 025. Trešo personu MCP pievienošanu neizmanto, ja vietējā integrācija aptver vajadzību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MTU Configuration:** Deploys a template-based script to set the MTU on all defined internet interfaces."
msgstr "**MTU konfigurācija:** Izvieto uz veidnēm balstītu skriptu, lai iestatītu MTU visās definētajās interneta saskarnēs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Machine identity:** AppRole is configured independently of human login, so services and automation use their own identities and short-lived tokens instead of a shared administrator token."
msgstr "**Mašīnas identitāte:** AppRole ir konfigurēta neatkarīgi no cilvēka pieteikšanās, tāpēc pakalpojumi un automatizācija izmanto savas identitātes un īslaicīgos žetonus, nevis kopīgotu administratora marķieri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Made Snipe-IT admin bootstrap idempotent** and treated known *users_groups* duplicate constraint errors as non-fatal while keeping strict failure handling for other cases"
msgstr "**Made Snipe- IT admin bootstrap idempotent** un ārstētajiem pacientiem *users_groups* divkārša ierobežojuma kļūdas, kas nav letālas, vienlaikus saglabājot stingras kļūdas citos gadījumos"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** is a powerful, extensible e-commerce platform built with PHP. It supports multi-store setups, advanced catalog management, promotions, checkout flows, and a rich extension ecosystem."
msgstr "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open source)** ir jaudīga, paplašināma e-komercijas platforma, kas būvēta ar PHP. Tā atbalsta multi-veikalu uzstādījumus, modernu katalogu pārvaldību, akcijas, izrakstīšanās plūsmas, un bagātīgu paplašināšanas ekosistēmu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When ``web-app-mailu`` is present, the ``helpdesk`` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr "**Pasta biļete:** Kad ``web-app-mailu`` ir klāt, ``helpdesk`` pastkaste ir automātiska un Zammad aptaujā to, lai izveidotu biļetes no ienākošā pasta."

