msgid "**OIDC provider:** inserts the Keycloak provider into `oauth_providers`. Idempotent via `ON CONFLICT (tenant_id, provider) DO UPDATE`."
msgstr "**OIDC nodrošinātājs:** ievieto Keycloak pakalpojuma sniedzējs uz `oauth_providers`. Idepotent caur `ON CONFLICT (tenant_id, provider) DO UPDATE`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC single sign-on and SMTP:** rendered into ``gitlab.yml`` and an ``smtp_settings.rb`` initializer."
msgstr "**OIDC viena pierakstīšanās un SMTP:** pārveidots ``gitlab.yml`` un ``smtp_settings.rb`` inicializētājs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC single sign-on and SMTP:** rendered into `gitlab.yml` and an `smtp_settings.rb` initializer."
msgstr "**OIDC viena pierakstīšanās un SMTP:** pārveidots `gitlab.yml` un `smtp_settings.rb` inicializētājs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC** via [`web-app-keycloak`](../web-app-keycloak/) — enabled when the `sso` service is active (`flavor: oidc`, native in-app \"OpenID\" login). Adds `enable-login-with-oidc`."
