# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sales & Service CRM:** Accounts, Contacts, Leads, Opportunities, Cases, Campaigns and more 📊"
msgstr "**Pārdošana un serviss CRM:** Konti, Kontaktinformācija, Vadi, iespējas, lietas, kampaņas un citi 📊"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sandbox** (precedence 3): everything else runs under `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Writes outside `allowWrite` fail with `EROFS`; reads from `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, etc. are denied; outbound connections to anything not in `allowedDomains` fail."
msgstr "**Smilšu kaste** (prioritāte 3): viss pārējais darbojas zem `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Raksti ārpus `allowWrite` neizdevās ar `EROFS`; skan no `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, uc ir liegti; izejošie savienojumi ar kaut ko nav `allowedDomains` neizdoties."

# translated-by: libretranslate
