# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor = compose sidecar**, `network_mode: host`, keys on a named volume, restored from the vaulted mint **before** Tor starts. Backup via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."
msgstr "**Tor = kompozīts blakusvāģis**, `network_mode: host`, atslēgas uz nosauktā apjoma, atjaunots no velvētas kaltuves **pirms** Tors sākas. Rezerves kopēšana caur `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor as a first-class deployment axis.** The new *svc-net-tor* role routes onion names through Tor via DNS instead of per-app proxies, offers a chutney flavor for private-net test deployments, and ties its dnsmasq listener to ownership rather than the deploy mode. Applications follow: server-side OIDC discovery and token exchange reach plaintext onion issuers through the SOCKS proxy (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), session cookies drop the *Secure* flag where an onion cannot carry it (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), and mail authenticates on the submission port the onion relay actually serves. The deploy matrix gained a tor axis with an onion marker plus enforced and exclusive modes, and lint now requires the onion in every variant. See the [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."
msgstr "**Tor kā pirmās klases izvietošanas ass.** Jaunais *svc-net-tor* lomu maršruti sīpolu nosaukumi caur Tor caur DNS, nevis per-app proxies, piedāvā čutnija garšu privātā tīkla testa izvietojumu, un saites tās dnsmasq klausītājs īpašumtiesības, nevis izvietojuma režīmā. Seko programmas: servera puses OIDC atklāšana un marķieru apmaiņa sasniedz vienkārša teksta sīpolu emitentus, izmantojot SOCKS starpniekserveri (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), sesijas sīkdatnes nometiet *Drošs* karodziņš, ar kuru sīpolam nevar nēsāt (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), un pasta autentificē iesniegšanas portu sīpolu relejs faktiski kalpo. Izvietošanas matricu ieguva tor ass ar sīpolu marķieri plus piespiedu un ekskluzīvu režīmu, un lint tagad prasa sīpolu katrā variantā. Skatīt [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) LASĪT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
