msgid "**`database_encoding`** (string):"
msgstr "**`database_encoding`** (virkne):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`default:` (optional)** is a Jinja string used as the credential's value when the inventory does not provide one."
msgstr "**`default:` (Pēc izvēles)** ir Jinja virkne, ko izmanto kā atrunu vērtību, ja inventārs tādu nesniedz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (prioritāte 1): strukturāli destruktīvas formas ir bloķēti tieši, pat ja smilšu kastē. Ietilpst čaulas cilpas (`for`/`while`/`until`), krusteniskais repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, priviliģēts `gh` darbības vārdi (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), un mutatis mutandis `gh api` darbības vārdi (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge ceļi)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`disable-onboarding`** is in `PENPOT_FLAGS` so users land directly on the dashboard (sovereign install; also keeps the project/asset flows testable)."
msgstr "**`disable-onboarding`** ir `PENPOT_FLAGS` lai lietotāji zemi tieši uz paneļa (valsts instalāciju; arī tur projektu / aktīvu plūsmas pārbaudāms)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`docker exec` is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NEVER invoke `docker exec` (nor nested `docker exec … docker exec …` into the DiD stack) directly. Always reach the live stack through `make` targets (e.g. `make compose-exec`, or the role-specific targets the `Makefile` exposes). If no `make` target covers what you need, ask the operator instead of falling back to raw `docker exec`."
msgstr "**`docker exec` FORBIDEN. ⛔** Jums NEKAD nav jāpiesauc `docker exec` (neligzdo `docker exec … docker exec …` uz DiD steku) tieši. Vienmēr sasniegt dzīvot kaudze caur `make` Mērķi (Piemēram, `make compose-exec`, vai uzdevumiem specifiskie mērķi `Makefile` apstarošana). Ja nē `make` mērķis attiecas uz to, kas jums ir nepieciešams, jautājiet operatoram, nevis krīt atpakaļ uz neapstrādātu `docker exec`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`duplicate_owner` (1):** `web-app-litellm`. This role is only the UI of the separately classified LiteLLM service role, which owns any future MCP gateway contract."
msgstr "**`duplicate_owner` (1):** `web-app-litellm`. Šī loma ir tikai atsevišķi klasificētās LiteLLM pakalpojumu funkcijas UI, kam pieder jebkurš nākotnes MCP vārteja līgums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`extensions/`** stays local. Extensions are rebuilt from the role-managed git source on every install — no shared state needs to survive a node move."
msgstr "**`extensions/`** paliek vietēja. Paplašinājumi tiek pārbūvēti no lomu pārvaldīta git avota katrā instalējumā — nevienai dalītai valstij nav nepieciešams izdzīvot mezgla gājienu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`external.sh` — real job-pickup smoke test (optional).** Uses `RUNNER_API_TOKEN` to confirm the runners registered and are online via the GitHub API, dispatches a smoke workflow, and polls it to completion. Skipped automatically when no token is present."
msgstr "**`external.sh` — īsts dūmu tests darba vietā (Pēc izvēles).** Lietojumi `RUNNER_API_TOKEN` lai apstiprinātu skrējējus, kas reģistrēti un ir tiešsaistē, izmantojot GitHub API, nosūta dūmu darba plūsmu, un aptaujā to pabeigt. Automātiski izlaists, ja nav marķiera."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`frappe`** (Gunicorn) — Python web backend"
msgstr "**`frappe`** (Gunicorn) — Python tīmekļa aizmugure"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`host_execution_boundary` (47):** `dev-arduino`, `dev-core`, `dev-java`, `dev-locales`, `dev-make`, `dev-nix`, `dev-nodejs`, `dev-python`, `drv-epson-multiprinter`, `drv-intel`, `drv-lid-switch`, `drv-non-free`, `dsk-base`, `dsk-bluray-player`, `dsk-chromium`, `dsk-code`, `dsk-copyq`, `dsk-docker`, `dsk-dotlinker`, `dsk-firefox`, `dsk-git`, `dsk-gnome`, `dsk-gnome-caffeine`, `dsk-gnome-extensions`, `dsk-gnome-terminal`, `dsk-gnt-claude`, `dsk-gnt-codex`, `dsk-gnt-cursor`, `dsk-gnt-pi`, `dsk-gnucash`, `dsk-jrnl`, `dsk-keepassxc`, `dsk-laya`, `dsk-libreoffice`, `dsk-micro`, `dsk-neovim`, `dsk-nextcloud`, `dsk-obs`, `dsk-qbittorrent`, `dsk-retroarch`, `dsk-spotify`, `dsk-ssh`, `dsk-torbrowser`, `dsk-virtualbox`, `dsk-zoom`, `gen-hunspell`, `user-workstation`. These roles operate a workstation, developer toolchain, device, or host package; bridging them would amount to shared shell, filesystem, browser-session, device, or host execution without an application-specific remote identity. `dsk-base` and `user-workstation` provision the login account the other desktop roles write for, which is the host execution boundary itself rather than an application behind it."
msgstr "**`host_execution_boundary` (47):** `dev-arduino`, `dev-core`, `dev-java`, `dev-locales`, `dev-make`, `dev-nix`, `dev-nodejs`, `dev-python`, `drv-epson-multiprinter`, `drv-intel`, `drv-lid-switch`, `drv-non-free`, `dsk-base`, `dsk-bluray-player`, `dsk-chromium`, `dsk-code`, `dsk-copyq`, `dsk-docker`, `dsk-dotlinker`, `dsk-firefox`, `dsk-git`, `dsk-gnome`, `dsk-gnome-caffeine`, `dsk-gnome-extensions`, `dsk-gnome-terminal`, `dsk-gnt-claude`, `dsk-gnt-codex`, `dsk-gnt-cursor`, `dsk-gnt-pi`, `dsk-gnucash`, `dsk-jrnl`, `dsk-keepassxc`, `dsk-laya`, `dsk-libreoffice`, `dsk-micro`, `dsk-neovim`, `dsk-nextcloud`, `dsk-obs`, `dsk-qbittorrent`, `dsk-retroarch`, `dsk-spotify`, `dsk-ssh`, `dsk-torbrowser`, `dsk-virtualbox`, `dsk-zoom`, `gen-hunspell`, `user-workstation`. Šīs lomas darbojas darbstacija, izstrādātājs rīkķēde, ierīce, vai uzņēmēja pakotne; savienojot tās būtu koplietošanas čaula, filesystem, pārlūkprogrammas sesijas, ierīce, vai uzņēmējas izpildi bez lietojumprogrammai specifisku tālvadības identitāti. `dsk-base` kā arī `user-workstation` nodrošina pieteikšanās kontu citu darbvirsmas lomas rakstīt, kas ir uzņēmējas izpilde robeža pati, nevis programma aiz tā."

