# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`web-app-homeassistant` deploys Home Assistant in Container mode.** The role uses the official `home-assistant/home-assistant` container (no Supervisor, no add-on store, not privileged), following the standard `web-app-*` contract (`meta/*`). Add-on management is out of scope; the `mcp_server` core integration does not need the Supervisor."
msgstr "**`web-app-homeassistant` izvietojumi Home Assistant konteineru režīmā.** Loma izmanto amatpersona `home-assistant/home-assistant` Konteiners (nav uzraudzītājs, nav papildu veikals, nav priviliģēts), ievērojot standartu `web-app-*` līgums (`meta/*`). Papildu vadība ir ārpus darbības jomas; `mcp_server` pamatintegrācijai uzraudzītājs nav vajadzīgs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
