# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**tor** -- whether the row deploys behind the node onion. Driven by ``sweep // 2`` so it does NOT flip in lockstep with the mode; a row walks all four mode/tor combinations over four sweeps instead of only two."
msgstr "**tor** -- vai rinda izvietojas aiz mezgla sīpola. Vadītājs ``sweep // 2`` Tātad tas nav uzsist lockstep ar režīmu; rinda iet visas četras režīma /tor kombinācijas pa četriem slaucīšanu nevis tikai divas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**v3 address algorithm** (needed for offline mint): `address = base32(PUBKEY ‖ CHECKSUM ‖ VERSION) + \".onion\"`, `CHECKSUM = SHA3-256(\".onion checksum\" ‖ PUBKEY ‖ VERSION)[:2]`, `VERSION = 0x03`, PUBKEY = 32-byte ed25519 master pubkey."
msgstr "**v3 adreses algoritms** (nepieciešama bezsaistes piparmētru): `address = base32(PUBKEY ‖ CHECKSUM ‖ VERSION) + \".onion\"`, `CHECKSUM = SHA3-256(\".onion checksum\" ‖ PUBKEY ‖ VERSION)[:2]`, `VERSION = 0x03`, PUBKEY = 32- baiti25519 meistars krogs."

