msgstr "Pieņēmums 9: `denyRead` uzskaita katru pilnvaru direktoriju 🔐"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "At boot, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` runs from ``init.groovy.d`` and mints an API token named ``infinito-mcp`` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through ``sys-token-store``, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the ``mcp_authorization`` filter."
msgstr "Pie zābaka, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` sākas ``init.groovy.d`` un piparmētru API marķieris ar nosaukumu ``infinito-mcp`` administratora konta, rakstot uz ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` pēc tam nolasa šo vērtību no tvertnes, turpina to caur ``sys-token-store``, un grūti nepadodas izmantošanu, kad kontrolieris noraida to. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` paceļ marķieri no veikala un klienta lomas veidot galvenes caur ``mcp_authorization`` filtrs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "At boot, `files/mcp-api-token.groovy` runs from `init.groovy.d` and mints an API token named `infinito-mcp` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to `/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token`. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through `sys-token-store`, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the `mcp_authorization` filter."
msgstr "Pie zābaka, `files/mcp-api-token.groovy` sākas `init.groovy.d` un piparmētru API marķieris ar nosaukumu `infinito-mcp` administratora konta, rakstot uz `/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token`. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` pēc tam nolasa šo vērtību no tvertnes, turpina to caur `sys-token-store`, un grūti nepadodas izmantošanu, kad kontrolieris noraida to. `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` paceļ marķieri no veikala un klienta lomas veidot galvenes caur `mcp_authorization` filtrs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "At most 20 selections on the priority line. The bound is the point: a priority line long enough to fill the whole queue window stops being a priority."
msgstr "Maksimums 20 prioritārās līnijas izvēles. Piesaiste ir punkts: prioritātes līnija, kas ir pietiekami gara, lai aizpildītu visu rindas logu, pārstāj būt prioritāte."

