# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "At the start of every new conversation, you MUST read [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json) and output a one-time summary: sandbox status with concrete `allowWrite`/`denyRead` paths, plus the counts of `permissions.allow`/`ask`/`deny`. Derive content from the live file; do not hardcode. Do not repeat unless the operator asks, and do not propose `/sandbox` when it is already active."
msgstr "Katras jaunas sarunas sākumā jums jālasa [.claude/settings.json](.claude/settings.json) un produkciju vienreizēju kopsavilkumu: smilšu kastes statusu ar betona `allowWrite`/`denyRead` ceļi, plus skaits `permissions.allow`/`ask`/`deny`. Atvasināt saturu no dzīvā faila; nav hardcode. Neatkārtojiet, ja vien operators nejautā un neierosina `/sandbox` ja tas jau ir aktīvs."

