msgstr "Biber (neadmīns) ir liegta piekļuve"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Biber is blocked by `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, which this role sets to true in `vars/main.yml`: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is either auto-login off, or a deploy step that promotes the OIDC-provisioned administrator account to sysop."
msgstr "Biber bloķē `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, ko šī loma uzticas `vars/main.yml`: katrs anonīms pieprasījums tiek atvairīts tieši atpakaļ identitātes nodrošinātājs, tāpēc pārbaudīts bezautentificēts nosēšanās pēc in-app piesakoties, ka persona līguma pieprasa nekad nevar ievērot šeit. Ceļš atpakaļ uz vispārējo personu ir vai nu auto-login off, vai izvietot soli, kas veicina OIDC-paredzēto administratora kontu sysop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Biber is blocked by ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin``, which this role sets to true in ``vars/main.yml``: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is either auto-login off, or a deploy step that promotes the OIDC-provisioned administrator account to sysop."
