# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Starpdienestu zondes (biber noliedz prometheus, biber noliedzot piemato, paneļa flīžu sasniedzamību) nav daļa no per-role biber persona. Viņi dzīvo paša pakalpojumu sniedzēja spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), vienu reizi parametrizēts uz pakalpojumu sniedzēja `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifests. Attiecībā uz paneļa, parametru scenāriju deleģē uz `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, kam pieder flīžu redzamība / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" op-out apgalvojumi vienā SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Starpdienestu zondes NAV daļa no per-roll administrator persona. Dashboard flīžu sasniedzamība pieder `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, kas deleģē katrai mērķstruktūrai `runDashboardCardScenario` palīgs `dashboard-card-flow.js` (redzami flīzes → klikšķi slodžu `#main iframe` → galvene \"Tab\" pogu pops iegults jaunā pārlūkā cilnē). Tas palīgs ir SPOT paneļa caurules mehānika; patērētāju specs NEDRĪKST atkārtoti īstenot kādu no šiem apgalvojumiem. Prometheus admin un skrāpju paritāte pieder `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach un trakeru klātbūtne pieder `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Katrs sniedzējs aprēķina apgalvojumu pār tā `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifests."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Apgalvojumi par starpdienestu virsmu (dakstiņu paneļa sasniedzamība, prometejs admin-novešanas un skrāpju paritāte, matomo admin-novešanas un kāpurķēžu esamība, biber-dened-at-prometheus, biber-noden-at-matomo) ir paša pakalpojumu sniedzēja spec. Katrs pakalpojumu sniedzējs parametrizē apgalvojumu par savu `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifests `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Patērētāju lomas persona nedrīkst dublēt šīs zondes."

