msgid "Declaring what the catalog already states is forbidden, because it duplicates a fact this project does not own and rots silently in the dangerous direction: a stale `supports_vision` keeps a model eligible for requests it can no longer serve. Cost is not declared either. Whether a route is free follows from what it is: a route with an `api_base` or a `mock_response` is served by this deployment and costs nothing, and a keyed route the catalog does not price sorts behind every route it does."
msgstr "Deklarējot, kas katalogā jau ir teikts, ir aizliegts, jo tas dublē faktu, ka šis projekts nepieder un klusi neplaužas bīstamajā virzienā: strupceļš `supports_vision` saglabā modeli, kas atbilst pieprasījumiem, kuru vairs nevar izmantot. Arī izmaksas nav deklarētas. Tas, vai maršruts ir brīvs, izriet no tā, kas tas ir: `api_base` vai a `mock_response` tiek apkalpots ar šo izvietošanu un neko nemaksā, un galvenais maršruts katalogā nav cenu paveidiem aiz katra maršruta tas dara."

