# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Deploys one chunk of the sweep. Every matrix row is a single `role#variant` carrying the deploy mode, onion state, distro and filesystem the rotation assigned it: `swarm` rows get a simulated 3-node DinD cluster with an NFS server plus a drain/reschedule state-survival assertion, `compose` and `host` rows run the single-node drill. When `whitelist` is empty, the discover job derives one from the branch's diff vs `origin/main`; see the \"Diff-driven app selection\" subsection in [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). A row marked 📖 -- the role's smallest variant, see [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- replays the role README's `### Production` block on the same runner once the deploy has released it."
msgstr "Izvieto vienu slaucīšanas gabalu. Katra matricas rinda ir viena `role#variant` veic izvietošanas režīmu, sīpolu stāvokli, distro un failu sistēmu rotāciju, kas tai piešķirta: `swarm` rindas saņemt modelētu 3- node Dind klasteris ar NFS serveri plus drenāžas/reschedule valsts izdzīvošanas apgalvojums, `compose` kā arī `host` rindas vada viena mezgla urbi. Kad `whitelist` ir tukšs, atklājējs darbs rodas viens no filiāles diff vs `origin/main`; skatīt \"Ar diff virzīta programmas izvēle\" apakšiedaļa [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). Aile atzīmēta 📖 -- lomu mazākais variants, skatīt [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- atkārto lomu LASĪTME s `### Production` bloķēt uz tā paša skrējēja, kad izvietošana ir izlaidis to."

