# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Direct-probe deny-checks MUST validate the response body, not only the status code. A `200 OK` is acceptable ONLY when the body contains provider-specific markers proving the response is the genuine provider surface. For prometheus, the markers are `prometheus_build_info` or `<title>Prometheus</title>`. For matomo, the markers are matomo's login-form markers or `piwik` and `matomo` strings in the body. Any 200 with a non-matching body is treated as a misconfigured proxy or a denial-as-200 surface and fails loudly. The deny-checks live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` and `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."
msgstr "Tiešās-prob-noliegšanas-pārbaudes ir jāapstiprina atbildes iestādi, ne tikai statusa kodu. A `200 OK` ir pieņemama TIKAI tad, ja struktūra satur konkrētam piegādātājam raksturīgus marķierus, kas pierāda, ka reakcija ir patiesā piegādātāja virsma. Prometeja gadījumā marķieri ir `prometheus_build_info` vai `<title>Prometheus</title>`. Parmatomo, marķieri irmatomo 's pieteikšanās formas marķieri vai `piwik` kā arī `matomo` stīgas ķermenī. Jebkurš 200 ar nesaskaņojošu struktūru tiek uzskatīts par nepareizi konfigurētu starpniekserveri vai atteikumu kā-200 virsmu un neizdodas skaļi. Nolieguma pārbaudes dzīvo paša pakalpojumu sniedzēja spec (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` kā arī `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
