msgstr "Virziens"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Direction gates the wiring: a `server` role only exposes `/mcp`, a `client` role only consumes, a `both` role does either. Implementation precedence is `native > plugin > sidecar > external`; a `sidecar`/`external` server gets its own service entry and port rather than reusing the app's primary HTTP port."
msgstr "Virziena vārti vadu: a `server` tikai atmasko `/mcp`, a `client` loma tikai patērē, a `both` loma ir vai nu. Īstenošanas prioritāte ir `native > plugin > sidecar > external`; a `sidecar`/`external` serveris saņem savu pakalpojumu ierakstu un portu, nevis atkārtoti izmanto lietotnes primāro HTTP portu."

