# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumenti a `services.matomo.track: false` nepiemērošana `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Nozīme saglabā `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (tā loma-wiring līgums paliek izpildīti) bet `roles_with_service('matomo')` nometiet to no `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` un matomo tracker2e līgums. Rezervēts statiskajam failam (autoindekss) kā arī 301-redirect vhosts, kas veic nav lietotājam vērsta HTML lapā vērts `_paq` Trakeris. Marķieris pievienots `track:` dati atzīmēt lookup godus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Dokumenti a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` nepiemērošana `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Nozīme saglabā `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (tā loma-wiring līgums paliek izpildīti) bet `roles_with_service('prometheus')` nometiet to no `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Rezervēts 301-atkārtoti - tikai vhosts, kas nekad kalpo pieprasījumu, izmantojot lua-resty-prometheus, tāpēc tie neizdala `app=\"<role>\"` etiķetes un nav skrāpējumiem mērķa. Marķieris pievienots `scrape:` dati atzīmēt lookup godus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Dokumenti `unsafe-*: true` karogs `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. ir jābūt pārī ar `Reason:` tajā pašā rindā nosaukt to, kas pārtraukumus bez relaksācijas. `unsafe-inline` atkārtoti pievieno inline izpildi XSS vajadzībām un `unsafe-eval` atkārtoti pievieno virknei kodēt, tāpēc karogs jāpārbauda pret darbojošos programmu, nevis jānokopē no citas lomas."

