# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each verb folder MUST contain `all.sh` for every discovered application and MAY contain `selection.sh` for one or more apps passed via `apps` (or as a positional argument where supported)."
msgstr "Katrai darbības vārdu mapei jāsatur `all.sh` par katru atklāto pieteikumu un MAI satur: `selection.sh` vienai vai vairākām lietotnēm, kas nodotas caur `apps` (vai kā pozicionālu argumentu, ja to atbalsta)."

