# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Health proves the host boots, not that it holds its data. Before the backup the drill seeds one token into every subject — a `.dr-drill-marker` file at the root of each backed-up volume, a row in `infinito_dr_marker` in each database with a dump — then forces one more backup run so the generation under test carries it, and afterwards requires every one of them back. A volume silently dropped or a dump replayed empty fails here; before, both passed."
msgstr "Veselība pierāda saimnieka zābaki, nevis, ka tas tur savus datus. Pirms rezerves sējmašīnas sēklas vienu iegriezt katrā priekšmets — a `.dr-drill-marker` fails pie saknes katra atbalstīto skaļumu, rinda `infinito_dr_marker` katrā datu bāzē ar izgāztuvi – tad piespiež vēl vienu rezerves palaist, lai paaudze zem testa veic to, un pēc tam prasa katru no tiem atpakaļ. Skaļums klusi samazinājās vai izgāztuve replayed tukšs neizdodas šeit; pirms tam, abi garām."

