# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Infinito.Nexus is not one application. It is a repository of building blocks for deploying, operating, and maintaining self-hosted systems."
msgstr "Infinito.Nexus nav viens pieteikums. Tā ir krātuve, kas sastāv no elementiem, lai izvietotu, darbojas, un uztur pašhosted sistēmām."

