msgstr "Ievades nosaukums -> burtisks tās vērtību segments atveras ar, veidnes kārtība."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "Ieguldījumi"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` (the SPOT for the deployment domain; defined in ``default.env`` and exported by ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh``; the development inventory reads the same env var for the play's ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``), ``HOSTS_ENTRY_IP`` (optional; address the domains map to, default ``127.0.0.1``)."
msgstr "Ieguldījumi (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` (SPOT izvēršanas domēnam; definēts ``default.env`` un eksportē: ``scripts/meta/env/load.sh``; attīstības inventarizācija skan pats env var par play s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY``), ``HOSTS_ENTRY_IP`` (pēc izvēles; adresēt domēnu karti uz, noklusējuma ``127.0.0.1``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``). Optional ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (consumed by ``derive_includes``)."
msgstr "Ieguldījumi (env): ``APP_ID``, ``INV_PATH`` (noklusētais ``/tmp/inv/devices.yml``). Pēc izvēles ``INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`` (patērē ``derive_includes``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``INV_DIR`` — inventory dir holding ``host_vars/*.yml`` (default ``/tmp/inv``)."
msgstr "Ieguldījumi (env): ``INV_DIR`` — uzskaites direkcija ``host_vars/*.yml`` (noklusētais ``/tmp/inv``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (default ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``). A second ed25519 keypair is generated at ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) and its public half lands in ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` so the DR drill's backup host can pull over the ``user-backup`` ssh-wrapper. The ``applications`` block written into the extras file carries the ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source device paths, which is all the DR drill reads back from it. The deploy-facing overrides, including ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (derived per round from ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), are baked by the matrix orchestrator into the provisioner's host_vars merge (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NOT into the extras file: extra-vars replace the whole inventory ``applications`` dict and would strip every generated credential. ``users`` carries the same hazard for the same reason, and its authorized_keys travel the same merge channel. The deploy-facing twin ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` therefore carries everything except ``applications`` and ``users``."
msgstr "Ieguldījumi (env): ``NFS_IP``, ``MGR_IP``, ``MGR``, ``OUT_PATH`` (noklusētais ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-extras.yml``), ``KEY_PATH`` (noklusētais ``/tmp/swarm-nfs-admin.key``). A otrais25519 Keypair ģenerē ``INFINITO_SWARM_BACKUP_KEY`` (SPOT: default.env) un valsts puse zemes ``users.backup.authorized_keys`` lai DR urbi rezerves saimnieks var pull pār ``user-backup`` ssh-wrapper. E ir o pa s ``applications`` bloks ierakstīts ekstras failā satur ``local-2-device`` mount/target/source ierīces celiņi, kas ir visi DR urbis nolasa atpakaļ no tā. Uz izvietošanu vērstā bloķēšana, tostarp ``remote-2-local.backup_providers`` (iegūts vienā kārtā no ``utils.tests.swarm.backup_repos``), ir cep matrices orķestra uz piegādātāja host_vars apvienot (INFINITO_VARS_PAYLOAD), NAV ekstras failu: extra-vars aizstāt visu inventāra ``applications`` dict un varētu svītrot katru radīta credential. ``users`` tā paša iemesla dēļ rada tādu pašu apdraudējumu un authorized_keys ceļot to pašu apvienot kanālu. Uz izvietošanu vērstais dvīnis ``<OUT_PATH stem>.deploy.yml`` tāpēc veic visu, izņemot ``applications`` kā arī ``users``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inputs come from the merged application config (``services.<key>.image`` and ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` and ``version=`` keyword overrides bypass those values for ad-hoc references (e.g. side-car init containers that do not appear in the services map)."
msgstr "Ievadi nāk no apvienotās programmas konfigurācijas (``services.<key>.image`` kā arī ``services.<key>.version``). ``image=`` kā arī ``version=`` Atslēgvārds apiet šīs ad- hoc atsauču vērtības (Piemēram, blakusvāģu init konteineri, kas nav iekļauti pakalpojumu kartē)."

