msgid "Key under which the pre-created ``<entity>`` network appears in the rendered compose file, which is what docker compose stores in the ``com.docker.compose.network`` label. An app that provides its own ``shared_net`` gets that network under its entity key and renders a separate unnamed ``default``; every other app renders ``default`` with the entity as its name. :func:`render_compose_networks` derives its own branch from this same call, so the label a caller stamps cannot drift from what is rendered."
msgstr "Atslēga, saskaņā ar kuru iepriekš izveidots ``<entity>`` tīkls parādās renderēta kompose failu, kas ir tas, ko docker kompose veikalos ``com.docker.compose.network`` etiķete. Lietotne, kas nodrošina savu ``shared_net`` saņem šo tīklu zem savas vienības atslēgas un padara atsevišķu nenosauktu ``default``; katra cita lietotne padara ``default`` ar uzņēmuma nosaukumu. :func:`render_compose_networks` iegūst savu atzaru no šī paša zvana, tāpēc etiķete zvanītāja pastmarkas nevar novirzīties no tā, kas tiek renderēts."

