msgid "Open Questions"
msgstr "Atvērt jautājumus"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI consumes MCP through its native tool-server support. Every deployed shared MCP server role is rendered into `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` as a `type: mcp` entry."
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI patērē MCP, izmantojot savu vietējo rīku-serveru atbalstu. Katrs izvietotais dalītais MCP servera loma tiek renderēta `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS` kā a `type: mcp` ierakstu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI consumes MCP through its native tool-server support. Every deployed shared MCP server role is rendered into ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` as a ``type: mcp`` entry."
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI patērē MCP, izmantojot savu vietējo rīku-serveru atbalstu. Katrs izvietotais dalītais MCP servera loma tiek renderēta ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` kā a ``type: mcp`` ierakstu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI sends `POST /v1/chat/completions` with `model: hermes` or `model: openclaw` to the broker, authenticated with the broker key and carrying the `X-OpenWebUI-User-*` headers (`ENABLE_FORWARD_USER_INFO_HEADERS=true`)."
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI sūtīšanu `POST /v1/chat/completions` kur: `model: hermes` vai `model: openclaw` brokerim, kas autentificēts ar brokeru atslēgu un `X-OpenWebUI-User-*` galvenes (`ENABLE_FORWARD_USER_INFO_HEADERS=true`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI's `ToolServerConnection` accepts bearer, session, system_oauth and oauth_2.1. A server whose scheme it cannot present is skipped rather than registered with an unusable credential, so a basic-auth server such as Jenkins does not appear here."
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI's `ToolServerConnection` pieņem uzrādītāju, sesiju, system_oauth kā arī oauth_2.1. Serveris, kura shēmu tā nevar uzrādīt, ir izlaists, nevis reģistrēts ar neizmantojamu akreditācijas, lai pamata auth serveri, piemēram, Jenkins neparādās šeit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI: [openwebui.com](https://openwebui.com)"
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI: [openwebui.com](https://openwebui.com)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI: `openwebui.com <https://openwebui.com>`__"
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI: `openwebui.com <https://openwebui.com>`__"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI’s ``ToolServerConnection`` accepts bearer, session, system_oauth and oauth_2.1. A server whose scheme it cannot present is skipped rather than registered with an unusable credential, so a basic-auth server such as Jenkins does not appear here."
msgstr "Atvērt WebUI's ``ToolServerConnection`` pieņem uzrādītāju, sesiju, system_oauth kā arī oauth_2.1. Serveris, kura shēmu tā nevar uzrādīt, ir izlaists, nevis reģistrēts ar neizmantojamu akreditācijas, lai pamata auth serveri, piemēram, Jenkins neparādās šeit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open `/app/erpnext` — ERPNext landing page renders (not bare Frappe desk)."
msgstr "Atvērt `/app/erpnext` — ERPNext piezemēšanās lapu atveidojumi (nav tukša Frappe galds)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Open a [Pull Request](artefact/git/pull-request.md)."
msgstr "Atvērt [Izvilkšanas pieprasījums](artefact/git/pull-request.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
