# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Owns `_APPLICATIONS_DEFAULTS_CACHE`, `_VARIANTS_CACHE`, and `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_application_defaults`, `get_variants`, `get_merged_applications`. Strictly ansible-free at import time so the GitHub Actions runner-host CLI path (`cli.administration.deploy.development.init` -> `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` -> `get_variants`) keeps working without ansible installed."
msgstr "Pašu kapitāls `_APPLICATIONS_DEFAULTS_CACHE`, `_VARIANTS_CACHE`, un `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE`. Publiska API: `get_application_defaults`, `get_variants`, `get_merged_applications`. Stingri bez ansible importa laikā tā GitHub darbības runner-host CLI ceļš (`cli.administration.deploy.development.init` - BAR `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` - BAR `get_variants`) turpina strādāt bez ansible uzstādīta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Owns `_MERGED_DOMAINS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_merged_domains`. The domain map is intentionally derived from the applications view rather than living in a parallel top-level overrides path. Per-app domain declarations live in `applications.<app>.domains` and flow through the regular applications-merge pipeline."
msgstr "Pašu kapitāls `_MERGED_DOMAINS_CACHE`. Publiska API: `get_merged_domains`. Domēnu karte ir apzināti atvasināta no lietojumprogrammas skata, nevis dzīvo paralēlā augšējā līmenī, kas aizstāj ceļu. Per-app domēna deklarācijas tiešraidē `applications.<app>.domains` un plūst caur regulāru lietojumprogrammu-merge cauruļvadu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Owns `_USERS_DEFAULTS_CACHE` and `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE`. Public API: `get_user_defaults`, `get_merged_users`. The Ansible-facing `users` lookup plugin consumes `get_merged_users` directly from this module (`from utils.cache.users import get_merged_users`)."
msgstr "Pašu kapitāls `_USERS_DEFAULTS_CACHE` kā arī `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE`. Publiska API: `get_user_defaults`, `get_merged_users`. Uz Assible vērsta `users` Lookup spraudnis patērē `get_merged_users` tieši no šī moduļa (`from utils.cache.users import get_merged_users`)."

