# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "PR pipelines use `cancel-in-progress: true` so only the newest run per PR and event type is active. The group does not always reap a long orchestrator sweep, which then leaves the newer run parked on `pending`; [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) cancels those leftovers through the API, see [cancel/README.md](../../../../scripts/github/cancel/README.md)."
msgstr "PR cauruļvadu izmantošana `cancel-in-progress: true` Tātad tikai jaunākais palaist katram PR un notikumu tipam ir aktīvs. Grupa ne vienmēr pļauj garu orķestra slaucītāju, kas pēc tam atstāj jaunāku skrienošo stāvēt `pending`; [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) atceļ šos pārpalikumus caur API, skat. [cancel/README.md](../../../../scripts/github/cancel/README.md)."

