# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Pure function — reads role metadata via cached YAML helpers and emits ``PlanEntry`` tuples; no filesystem side effects. The include set per round is resolved by the ``CombinedResolver`` (see ``.legacy_resolver``): each role contributes its own pulled-in providers and the include is the union. A service-key is therefore pulled in as soon as ANY role in the round-aware closure says it should be (literal ``True`` OR the ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, both accepted by ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); if EVERY role marks it ``False`` it stays out of the include."
msgstr "Tīra funkcija — nolasa lomu metadatus, izmantojot YAML palīgus un izstarojumus ``PlanEntry`` tuples; nav failu sistēmas blakusparādības. Iekļaujot komplektu uz vienu kārtu, izšķir: ``CombinedResolver`` (skatīt ``.legacy_resolver``): katra loma veicina savu ierauts pakalpojumu sniedzējiem un ietver ir savienība. Tāpēc pakalpojuma atslēgu velk, tiklīdz kāda loma apaļā-aware slēgšanu saka, ka tas būtu (burtisks ``True`` VAI ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja veidlapa, abas pieņemtas ar ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); ja katru reizi loma iezīmē to ``False`` tas nav iekļauts."

