# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reads variables from env file (default: .env, generated from default.env)"
msgstr "Lasa mainīgos no env faila (noklusētais: .env, radīts no default.env)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real Nextcloud integration coupling: end-to-end tests now assert genuine two-way OAuth/API coupling for *gitlab*, *mattermost*, *openproject*, *zammad*, *peertube*, *discourse*, *github*, *google*, *jira*, *mastodon*, *matrix*, *moodle* and *suitecrm*, rather than the mere presence of a connect button. All integration OAuth credentials are stored Nextcloud-encrypted via ICrypto (sensitive app values), OpenProject and Zammad secrets survive a re-deploy, and OpenWebUI/Ollama is wired in as a real *integration_openai* chat backend. Bridges with no Nextcloud-33 plugin (Moodle, SuiteCRM) are disabled."
msgstr "Īsta Nextcloud Integrācijas sakabe: testi “no gala līdz galam” tagad pierāda patiesu divvirzienu OAuth/API sakabes ierīce *gitlab*, *Vissvarīgākais*, *atklāts projekts*, *zammad*, *peertube*, *diskurss*, *gitubs*, *google*, *hira*, *mastodons*, *matrica*, *emocionāls* kā arī *suitekrm*, nevis tikai klātbūtne savienojumu pogu. Visi integrācijas OAuth akreditācijas dati tiek saglabāti Nextcloud- šifrēts caur ICrypto (jutīgas lietotnes vērtības), OpenProject kā arī Zammad Noslēpumi izdzīvot atkārtoti izvietot, un OpenWebUI /Ollama ir pieslēgts kā īsts *integration_openai* tērzēšanas aizmugure. Tilti bez korpusa Nextcloud-33 spraudnis (Moodle, SuiteCRM) ir atspējoti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real scenario where the component is the surface, OR `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` with a pointer to the role-local test that covers it."
msgstr "Īsts scenārijs, ja komponents ir virsma, VAI `# nocheck: playwright-service-flag` ar norādi uz lomu lokālo testu, kas aptver to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real-Time Chat/App"
msgstr "Tērzēšana reāllaikā"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Real-time collaboration over WebSockets through the proxy."
msgstr "Reālā laika sadarbība pa WebSockets caur starpniekserveri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm definition, including the `preferred_username` mapper"
msgstr "Īstenības definīcija, tostarp `preferred_username` mapper"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm of the broker's service account (typically the same as user realm)."
msgstr "Brokera pakalpojumu konta realitāte (parasti tāds pats kā lietotāja valstība)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm the client is registered in"
msgstr "Realitāte, kurā klients ir reģistrēts"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Realm where end-user accounts live (typically same as admin realm)."
msgstr "Realm kur galalietotāju konti dzīvot (parasti tāds pats kā admin valstība)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Pamatojums"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Reason: pytest runs every test in one process. Without a shared cache each test re-walks the same tree and re-reads the same files; the walk cost multiplies by the number of tests that use it. Migrating a single test from a raw walk to `iter_project_files_with_content` dropped it from ~26 s to ~1.3 s because every subsequent test served the walk and the file contents from the process-level cache."
msgstr "Iemesls: pitests veic katru testu vienā procesā. Bez koplietošanas kešatmiņa katrs tests pārstaigā vienu un to pašu koku un atkārtoti nolasa tos pašus failus; pastaigas izmaksas palielinās ar testu skaitu, kas to izmanto. Viena testa migrēšana no neapstrādāta ceļa līdz `iter_project_files_with_content` nometa to no ~26 s līdz ~1.3 s jo katrs nākamais tests kalpoja pastaigas un faila saturu no procesa līmeņa kešatmiņa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Rebuilds the local inventory and keeps the runtime `.password` file."
