# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Sibling of `container_address` for service-level commands. While `container_address` resolves to a runtime container ID for `docker exec`, this lookup returns the addressable form for `container service ps`, `container service logs`, and `container ps --filter \"label=com.docker.swarm.service.name=...\"`."
msgstr "Saskare ar `container_address` dienesta līmeņa komandām. Kamēr `container_address` atrisina uz runtime konteinera ID priekš `docker exec`, šis lookup atgriež adresējamo formu `container service ps`, `container service logs`, un `container ps --filter \"label=com.docker.swarm.service.name=...\"`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Sidecars and adapters use an immutable version and digest, documented provenance and licence, a non-root user, a read-only root filesystem, dropped capabilities, no host or control-plane socket, explicit CPU/memory/PID limits, a provider-only network, and no unrelated outbound access."
msgstr "Blakusvāģi un adapteri izmanto nemaināmu versiju un sagremošanu, dokumentētu pirmavotu un licenci, lietotāju, kas nav root, tikai lasāmo saknes failu sistēmu, nomestās iespējas, nav saimnieka vai kontroles plaknes ligzdas, skaidri CPU/memory/PID ierobežojumi, tikai pakalpojumu sniedzēju tīkls un nesaistīta izejoša piekļuve."

