msgstr "Swarm režīms"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Swarm režīms - `<stack>_<service_key>`, atbilstības Docker Swarm norāda visus pakalpojumus un kā `container service ps` pieņem tos. Steka nosaukums ir atvasināts no ``application_id`` caur ``get_entity_name`` filtrs, spogulis kā ``docker stack deploy`` Komponē steka nosaukumu iekš ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Swarm režīms - čaulas apakščaula, kas atrisina darbojošā uzdevuma konteinera ID exec laikā, piem. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm nosaukt katru pakalpojumu ``<stack>_<key>`` un nepieņem prefiksu saskaņošana; palīgs veido šo nosaukumu no STACK un SERVICE_KEY args. Apakšrajons atliek izšķirtspēju uz exec brīdi, izvairoties no strupceļa ID un parse-time-neveiksmēm kļūdas, atgriežot atrisinātu vērtību vars-risinājuma laikā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Swarm režīms - tas pats atsauce, prefikss ar in-cluster reģistra resursdatoru:port (Piemēram, ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) kad ``swarm.registry.host`` kā arī ``swarm.registry.port`` ir noteikti. Ja nav konfigurēts neviens reģistrs, bars atgriežas neprefiksētajā formā."

