msgstr "Swarm varianta-matricas kārtas orķestrators."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm-aware deploy CLI command."
msgstr "Swarm-aware izvietot CLI komandu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm-test only (called by the swarm matrix after provision). In swarm an embedded per-app database (``shared: false``) resolves to a per-app mariadb whose volume is NFS-backed with no placement pin — InnoDB on NFS plus a free-floating task is unsupported (locking, split-brain). Embedded DBs are a compose-only pattern. Flipping every consumer's DB service to ``shared: true`` routes it to the central svc-db-* provider (as the baseline variant does), so no per-app DB is scheduled in swarm."
msgstr "Tikai sildtests (ko sauc bara matrica pēc nodrošinājuma). In barge iegulto vienu lietotnes datu bāzi (``shared: false``) atrisina uz per-app mariadb, kura apjoms ir NFS-nodrošināts bez izvietošanas pin – InnoDB uz NFS plus free-floating uzdevums ir nepamatots (Slēdzis, sadalīts smadzenes)Iegultie DB ir tikai komponējošs modelis. Katra patērētāja DB pakalpojuma izmantošana ``shared: true`` ved uz centrālo* pakalpojumu sniedzējs (kā pamata variants), tāpēc per-app DB nav plānots bars."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm: the device grant renders in compose mode only, matching the cadvisor precedent, because `docker stack deploy` drops `devices`. An embodied device is single-node by definition, so this is consistent rather than a gap, but the swarm path of the agent roles is never exercised with the robot role present."
msgstr "Swarm: ierīce piešķir padara tikai komponē režīmā, kas atbilst kadvizora precedentu, jo `docker stack deploy` Pilieni `devices`. Iespaidīgs ierīce ir viena mezgla pēc definīcijas, tāpēc tas ir konsekventi, nevis plaisa, bet bars ceļš aģenta lomas nekad netiek īstenota ar robota lomu klāt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
