msgstr "Docker/OCI datora nosaukums lietojumprogrammas konteineram: ``bounded_name`` pie 63- baitu ierobežojuma sethostname(2) izpildes panākšana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Flowise supervisor criteria are Phase 2, and reading both upstreams turned \"not built yet\" into a concrete blocker: `stdio_only`, the same reason `web-app-discourse` carries in [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). Neither agent's server mode speaks a transport a second container can reach."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Flowise uzraudzības kritēriji ir posms 2, un nolasot abus augšpusē pagriezts \"vēl nav uzbūvēts\" uz betona bloku: `stdio_only`, tas pats iemesls `web-app-discourse` pārnes [NBP 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). Ne aģenta servera režīms runā transportu otrs konteiners var sasniegt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe MCP component is experimental and unverified against the pinned Frappe v16."
msgstr "Frappe MCP komponents ir eksperimentāls un nepārbaudīts pret pinned Frappe v16."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe site-setup wizard is **bypassed** on first deploy via auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` with `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` arguments, plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus a post-start API call from the role's `tasks/` to mark the wizard as completed (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). A fresh deploy lands directly on the ERPNext desk."
msgstr "Frappe vietnes iestatīšanas vednis ir **apiet** uz pirmās izvietošanas, izmantojot auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` kur: `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` Argumenti plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus a pēc sākuma API zvans no lomas `tasks/` atzīmēt vedni kā pabeigtu (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). Svaigs izvietot zemes tieši uz ERPNext galds."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The GFS / global-server side of upstream (`Dockerfile.gfs`) is not deployed. Only the household instance (`Dockerfile.sh`) is."
msgstr "Augšupējā VFS / globālā servera puse (`Dockerfile.gfs`) netiek izvērsta. Tikai mājsaimniecības instance (`Dockerfile.sh`) Jā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The H1 emoji MUST come after the title text, not before it."
msgstr "P1 emoji ir jānāk pēc nosaukuma teksta, nevis pirms tā."

