msgstr "E ir o pa s Keycloak **Lietotāja info** lietotāja priekšskatījums satur `groups` masīvs ar pilnu ceļu. Ja tas tā nav, joma nesasniedz userinfo galapunktu un kartēšana neaizdegsies."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak OIDC client for ERPNext is **auto-provisioned** via `web-app-keycloak`, consistent with every other OIDC-consuming role in the repo."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Keycloak OIDC klients priekš ERPNext ir **automātiski piegādāts** caur `web-app-keycloak`, kas atbilst visām pārējām OIDC darbībām repo darījumā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree behind these paths is materialised by a per-application group-ldap-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), anchored at `/<group_root>/<application_id>` with `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Keycloak grupveida koks aiz šiem ceļiem ir materializēts ar vienu aplikāciju grup-ldap- mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), nostiprināts pie `/<group_root>/<application_id>` kur: `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree is built by **per-application** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Each deployed application gets one mapper anchored at `/roles/<application_id>` whose LDAP filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` surfaces only that application's role groups. The mapper uses the LDAP `description` attribute as the visible Keycloak group name, so the resulting group paths carry no redundant prefix."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Keycloak grupveida koku būvē **par katru pieteikumu** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Katra izvietotā programma saņem vienu kartētāju, kas ir noenkurots `/roles/<application_id>` kura LDAP filtrs `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` virsmas tikai to lietojumu lomu grupām. Kartētājs izmanto LDAP `description` atribūts kā redzamais Keycloak grupas nosaukums, tāpēc iegūtajiem grupas ceļiem nav lieka prefiksa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The MCP surface ships disabled by default and is independent of the host role's `lifecycle`: a `beta` host role MUST NOT imply that its MCP surface is stable. An MCP surface is only considered validated once its acceptance criteria are met end to end."
msgstr "MCP virsūdens kuģi, kas pēc noklusējuma ir atspējoti un ir neatkarīgi no uzņēmējas lomas `lifecycle`: a `beta` saimnieka loma NEDRĪKST norādīt, ka tā MCP virsma ir stabila. MCP virsmu uzskata par apstiprinātu tikai tad, kad tās pieņemšanas kritēriji ir izpildīti līdz beigām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The MDAD inventory is templated to enable a conservative-default bridge set plus Jitsi + Element Call. Bridge enablement is gated on `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 default-ON set (operator-confirmed): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Default-OFF (operator opts in): every bridge that needs a third-party API token the operator must obtain manually — `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, and the superseded `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."
msgstr "MAD inventarizācija ir samontēta tā, lai ieslēgtu konservatīvu-noklusējuma tilta komplektu plus Jitsi + Elementa izsaukumu. Tilta ieslēgšanās ir ieslēgta `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 Noklusētais (operatora apstiprināts): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Noklusējuma-OFF (operators izvēlas): katrs tilts, kam nepieciešama trešā persona API marķieris operatoram ir jāiegūst manuāli, `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, un aizstāto `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The MariaDB image tag to pull (e.g. `10.6`, `10.11`, or `latest`)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s MariaDB velkamais attēla tags (Piemēram, `10.6`, `10.11`, vai `latest`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Matomo API token is generated during the Matomo bootstrap and persisted to disk by `sys-token-store`. It is then resolved through `lookup('users')`, which hydrates tokens from the store at runtime."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Matomo API marķieris tiek ģenerēts laikā Matomo bootstrap un saglabājās diskā `sys-token-store`. To pēc tam atrisina ar `lookup('users')`, kas hidratē žetonus no noliktavas pie darba laikā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Matrix role gains an ansible flavor (requirement 025) built on a unified compose template, with full Docker-in-Docker isolation, host-network mode cascaded to the addons and Jitsi, a central Postgres backend sharing the MATRIX_POSTGRES variables, and a central coturn aligned to the shared coturn variables for the MASH role. A dedicated MDAD runner image (python 3.13-slim with docker 28.0.4 CLI, migration validated against v2026.05.18.0) mounts the Infinito self-signed CA into both the runner and Synapse, and bootstrap now recovers cleanly from a stale marker."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Matrix loma iegūst ageable garšu (prasība 025) būvēts uz unificētu komponēt veidni, ar pilnu Docker-in-Docker izolācija, saimniektīkla režīms kaskādē uz addons un Jitsi, centrālā Postgres aizmugure koplieto MATRIX_POSTGRES mainīgos lielumus un centralizētu kursu, kas saskaņots ar kopējiem apmaiņas mainīgajiem lielumiem attiecībā uz MASH lomu. Name (pitons 3.13-slim ar docker 28.0.4 CLI, migrācija apstiprināta pret v2026.05.18.0) Montes Infinito pašparakstīto CA gan skrējējs un Synapse, un bootstrap tagad atgūst tīri no strupas marķieri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Meta Infinite Graph is an essential tool for analyzing, auditing, and maintaining the modular structure of the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem. It provides a clear overview of all roles and how they are interconnected."
msgstr "Meta bezgalīgais grafiks ir būtisks instruments, lai analizētu, auditētu un uzturētu modulāro struktūru Infinito.Nexus ekosistēma. Tas sniedz skaidru pārskatu par visām lomām un to savstarpējo saistību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Certbot Automation role ensures that Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates stay valid without manual intervention. It enhances the security and reliability of web services by automating certificate lifecycle management."
msgstr "E ir o pa s NGINX Certbot Automation loma nodrošina, ka Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS sertifikāti paliek spēkā bez manuālas iejaukšanās. Tas uzlabo tīmekļa pakalpojumu drošību un uzticamību, automatizējot sertifikātu dzīves cikla pārvaldību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Certbot Automation role ensures that Let’s Encrypt SSL/TLS certificates stay valid without manual intervention. It enhances the security and reliability of web services by automating certificate lifecycle management."
msgstr "E ir o pa s NGINX Certbot Automation loma nodrošina, ka Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS sertifikāti palikt spēkā bez manuālas iejaukšanās. Tas uzlabo tīmekļa pakalpojumu drošību un uzticamību, automatizējot sertifikātu dzīves cikla pārvaldību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX File Server role sets up a simple and secure static file server using [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/). It provides an easy way to serve files over HTTPS, including directory listing, `.well-known` support, and automatic SSL/TLS certificate integration via Let's Encrypt."
msgstr "NGINX File Server loma izveido vienkāršu un drošu statisko failu serveri, izmantojot [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/). Tas nodrošina vienkāršu veidu, kā kalpot failus virs HTTPS, ieskaitot direktoriju sarakstu, `.well-known` atbalsts un automātiskā SSL/TLS sertifikātu integrācija caur Let's Encrypt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX File Server role sets up a simple and secure static file server using `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__. It provides an easy way to serve files over HTTPS, including directory listing, ``.well-known`` support, and automatic SSL/TLS certificate integration via Let’s Encrypt."
msgstr "NGINX File Server loma izveido vienkāršu un drošu statisko failu serveri, izmantojot `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__. Tas nodrošina vienkāršu veidu, kā kalpot failus virs HTTPS, ieskaitot direktoriju sarakstu, ``.well-known`` atbalsts, un automātiska SSL/TLS sertifikātu integrācija, izmantojot Let’s Encrypt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX HTTPS Certificate Retrieval role ensures that your NGINX-served domains have valid, automatically issued SSL/TLS certificates, improving web security without manual intervention."
msgstr "E ir o pa s NGINX HTTPS Certificate Retrieval funkcija nodrošina, ka jūsu NGINX piedāvātajiem domēniem ir derīgi, automātiski izsniegti SSL/TLS sertifikāti, uzlabojot tīmekļa drošību bez manuālas iejaukšanās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NGINX Static HTML Server role provides a simple and efficient method to publish static websites with HTTPS, perfect for personal homepages, landing pages, or small projects."
msgstr "NGINX statiskais HTML Server loma nodrošina vienkāršu un efektīvu metodi, lai publicētu statiskās mājas lapas ar HTTPS, ideāls personīgām mājas lapām, nolaišanās lapas, vai maziem projektiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The NSS half of *sys-hostname* becomes its own role, *sys-svc-nss*."
msgstr "E ir o pa s NSS puse no *sys-hostname* kļūst par savu lomu, *sys-svc-nss*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC client used by the application has the `groups` client scope attached as a **default** scope (not optional). The design note in [RBAC design](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) explains why."
msgstr "Lietotnē izmantotajam OIDC klientam ir `groups` klienta tvērums pievienots kā **noklusētais** darbības joma (nav fakultatīvs). Projektēšanas piezīme [RBAC konstrukcija](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) paskaidro, kāpēc."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC group path `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` already namespaces by application, so an `openbao-` prefix would be redundant, and the repo's other `meta/rbac.yml` files use bare role names."
msgstr "OIDC grupas ceļš `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` jau vārdtelpas pēc programmas, tāpēc `openbao-` prefikss būtu lieks, un repo citu `meta/rbac.yml` faili izmanto kailus lomu nosaukumus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, the Discourse round-trip by ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."
msgstr "OIDC pieteikšanās + RBAC ceļus sedz ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, Discourse par ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, the Discourse round-trip by `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."
msgstr "OIDC pieteikšanās + RBAC ceļus sedz `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, Discourse par `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) are mandatory because they gate SSO login: when one of them is the selected flavor and the system hides the native login form, an un-installed OIDC app leaves the instance with no usable login path. Failing at install time surfaces the version-pin mismatch immediately rather than as a downstream login timeout in the Playwright e2e suite."
msgstr "OIDC pieteikšanās ieejas punkti (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) ir obligāti, jo tie vārti SSO pieteikšanās: ja viens no tiem ir izvēlētā aromāts un sistēma slēpj vietējo pieteikšanās formu, neuzstādīta OIDC lietotne atstāj instanci bez izmantojamā pieteikšanās ceļu. Neveiksmīgs instalējot laikā virsmas versija-pin neatbilstība nekavējoties, nevis kā lejpusēja pieteikšanās noildze Playwright e2Suite."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC role's `groups_claim` (JSON-pointer capable) names the claim holding the user's groups; those values resolve against identity groups of `type=external` via group aliases on the auth mount, which carry the policies."
msgstr "OIDC loma `groups_claim` (JSON rādītājs spēj) norāda prasību, kurā atrodas lietotāju grupas; šīs vērtības ir noteiktas, salīdzinot ar `type=external` ar grupu segvārdiem auth mount, kas īsteno politiku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC username claim is paired with the LDAP login attribute by design. See [ldap.md](ldap.md) for the LDAP-side rule."
msgstr "OIDC lietotājvārdu pretenzija pēc dizaina tiek pārota ar LDAP pieteikšanās atribūtu. Skatīt [ldap.md](ldap.md) LDAP puses noteikumam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ONLY clean-skip mechanism is an EXPLICIT role-declared opt-out via env flag rendered in `templates/playwright.env.j2`:"
msgstr "TIKAI tīrās slēpes mehānisms ir EXPLICIT lomu deklarēts atteikums, izmantojot env karogu, kas `templates/playwright.env.j2`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Odoo configuration file is templated to `/etc/odoo/odoo.conf`"
msgstr "Odoo konfigurācijas fails ir sagatavis `/etc/odoo/odoo.conf`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Odoo configuration file is templated to ``/etc/odoo/odoo.conf``"
msgstr "Odoo konfigurācijas fails ir sagatavis ``/etc/odoo/odoo.conf``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The PR-scope short-circuits in [scope.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/pr/scope.sh) (documentation-only, agent-only) still apply at the entry layer. They skip the orchestrator entirely and are independent of the diff-driven whitelist resolution above."
msgstr "PR-scope īssavienojumi [scope.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/pr/scope.sh) (tikai dokumentācija, tikai aģents) joprojām uzklāj pie ieejas slānis. Viņi pilnībā izlaiž orķestru un ir neatkarīgi no iepriekš minētās diff virzītās baltā saraksta izšķirtspējas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright ``biber`` persona is blocked permanently. ``meta/services.yml`` restricts ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` to the ``web-app-baserow`` administrator RBAC group, so a non-admin identity is rejected by the oauth2-proxy before Baserow renders, and no deploy step provisions a Baserow account for that user."
msgstr "Playwright ``biber`` persona ir bloķēta pastāvīgi. ``meta/services.yml`` ierobežojumi ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` uz ``web-app-baserow`` administrators RBAC grupa, tāpēc nav admin identitāti noraida oauth2- pirms Baserow renders, un nav izmantot pakāpi noteikumi a Baserow uzskaita šo lietotāju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright `biber` persona is blocked permanently. `meta/services.yml` restricts `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` to the `web-app-baserow` administrator RBAC group, so a non-admin identity is rejected by the oauth2-proxy before Baserow renders, and no deploy step provisions a Baserow account for that user."
msgstr "Playwright `biber` persona ir bloķēta pastāvīgi. `meta/services.yml` ierobežojumi `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` uz `web-app-baserow` administrators RBAC grupa, tāpēc nav admin identitāti noraida oauth2- pirms Baserow renders, un nav izmantot pakāpi noteikumi a Baserow uzskaita šo lietotāju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright container image is declared in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` under the `playwright` service entry (`image:` + `version:`). CI mirrors that image into GHCR through the standard mirror pipeline before deploy tests run, so Playwright jobs do not depend on direct pulls from MCR during the test phase."
msgstr "Playwright konteinera attēls tiek deklarēts `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` zem `playwright` dienesta ieraksts (`image:` + `version:`). CI spoguļo šo attēlu GHCR caur standarta spoguļa cauruļvadu pirms testu veikšanas, tāpēc Playwright darbi nav atkarīgi no MCR tiešiem izvilkumiem testa posmā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright per-test default of 30 s is too tight for several flows. Use `test.setTimeout(<ms>)` at the top of the test body (after the gates) and document the reason in a comment when the scenario includes any of:"
msgstr "Playwright per- testa noklusējums 30 s ir pārāk saspringts vairākām plūsmām. Lietot `test.setTimeout(<ms>)` testa korpusa augšpusē (pēc vārtiem) un dokumentē iemeslu komentārā, ja scenārijā ir iekļauts kāds no šiem apstākļiem:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright spec at [`playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) currently exercises the **administrator** path only: Keycloak SSO into the admin backend plus the local form-login emergency hatch (`?fallback=local`). The non-admin RBAC path via the canonical `biber` user is not yet covered."
msgstr "Playwright specifikācijas [`playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) pašlaik **administrators** tikai ceļš: Keycloak SSO admin aizmugurē plus vietējā formā-login avārijas lūka (`?fallback=local`). Ne-admin RBAC ceļš caur kanonisko `biber` lietotājs vēl nav aptverts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright spec at ```playwright.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ currently exercises the **administrator** path only: Keycloak SSO into the admin backend plus the local form-login emergency hatch (``?fallback=local``). The non-admin RBAC path via the canonical ``biber`` user is not yet covered."
msgstr "Playwright specifikācijas ```playwright.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ currently exercises the **administrator** path only: Keycloak SSO into the admin backend plus the local form-login emergency hatch (``?fallback=local``). The non-admin RBAC path via the canonical ``biber`` lietotājs vēl nav aptverts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright suite in [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) gates its scenarios on the following shared services. Scenarios that depend on a service report as `skipped` when the corresponding `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false` in the staged `.env`:"
msgstr "Playwright numurs [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) izmanto savus scenārijus šādiem kopīgiem pakalpojumiem. Scenāriji, kas ir atkarīgi no pakalpojuma ziņojuma kā `skipped` ja atbilstošo `<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false` posmā `.env`:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright suite in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js <files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ gates its scenarios on the following shared services. Scenarios that depend on a service report as ``skipped`` when the corresponding ``<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`` in the staged ``.env``:"
msgstr "Playwright numurs `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js <files/playwright/playwright.spec.js>`__ izmanto savus scenārijus šādiem kopīgiem pakalpojumiem. Scenāriji, kas ir atkarīgi no pakalpojuma ziņojuma kā ``skipped`` ja atbilstošo ``<SERVICE>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`` posmā ``.env``:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright suite is split per login surface **and persona** (the runner globs every `*.js` under `files/playwright/`):"
msgstr "Playwright numurs ir sadalīts pa pieteikšanās virsmu **un persona** (skrējējs globs katru `*.js` zem `files/playwright/`):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright suite is split per login surface **and persona** (the runner globs every ``*.js`` under ``files/playwright/``):"
msgstr "Playwright numurs ir sadalīts pa pieteikšanās virsmu **un persona** (skrējējs globs katru ``*.js`` zem ``files/playwright/``):"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The PostgreSQL database is backed up by the central backup roles; the asset volume is backup-ready by convention."
msgstr "E ir o pa s PostgreSQL Datubāzi papildina centrālās rezerves lomas; aktīvu apjoms ir rezerves jau pēc vienošanās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Pull Request MUST be linked to the related work item in [project.infinito.nexus](https://project.infinito.nexus/) and back."
msgstr "Pull pieprasījumam jābūt saistītam ar saistīto darba [project.infinito.nexus](https://project.infinito.nexus/) un atpakaļ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Python helper is intentionally self-contained and unit-testable"
msgstr "Python palīgs ar nolūku ir autonoms un pārbaudāms"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The REST API answers ``inputs: null`` for a finished workflow_dispatch, so the inputs are recovered from the run itself: short ones from the title (``config_from_title``), the long ones from a called job's log (``inputs_from_jobs``), which the title truncates."
msgstr "ATPŪTA API atbildes ``inputs: null`` pabeigta workflow_dispatch, tāpēc ieejas tiek atgūti no paša palaist: īsās no nosaukuma (``config_from_title``), ilgie no sauc darba žurnālā (``inputs_from_jobs``), kas nosaukums saraustās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Root CA private key is generated **unencrypted** (automation-friendly). Protect file permissions."
msgstr "Tiek ģenerēta Saknes CA privātā atslēga **nešifrēts** (automatizācijai). Aizsargāt failu atļaujas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT declaration with the scope's override merged over it."
msgstr "SPOT deklarācija ar darbības jomu ir apvienota."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, next to ``modes``: both state what the role CAN do, which is why the deploy matrix narrows a row by them. ``meta/tests.yml`` is the other kind of statement - what CI should skip exercising - and an image that exists for one architecture only is not a testing preference."
msgstr "SPOT ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, blakus ``modes``: abi norāda, ko loma CAN darīt, tāpēc izvietojuma matrica sašaurina rindu ar tiem. ``meta/tests.yml`` ir cita veida paziņojums - ko CI vajadzētu izlaist izmantošanu - un attēls, kas pastāv tikai vienai arhitektūrai nav testēšanas priekšroka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. A missing ``modes`` block, a missing ``<mode>`` entry, or a missing ``enabled`` key all mean the role participates in that mode (default ``True``)."
msgstr "SPOT ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. A trūkst ``modes`` bloks, trūkst ``<mode>`` ieraksts vai tā trūkst ``enabled`` galvenais nozīmē lomu piedalās šajā režīmā (noklusētais ``True``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is parsed with a plain-string line parser instead of PyYAML: the env build runs during bootstrap (make install-system-python) before any Python dependency exists, so this module must stay stdlib-only. Only plain ``KEY: \"value\"`` entries can be read this way; a Jinja expression or a missing key is a hard error."
msgstr "SPOT ir parsed ar vienkāršu līniju parser, nevis PyYAML: env būvēt iet laikā bootstrap (veikt instalēšanu-system-python) pirms pastāv atkarība no Python, tāpēc šim modulim jāpaliek tikai stdlib. Tikai vienkāršs ``KEY: \"value\"`` ierakstus var lasīt šādā veidā; Jinja izteiksme vai trūkstoša atslēga ir cieta kļūda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSE session travels through the shared Redis channel layer, so the stream and the message POST may land on different replicas."
msgstr "SSE sesija ceļo caur kopīgoto Redis kanāla slānis, lai straume un ziņojums POST var nolaisties uz dažādām kopijām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (``sociallogin``) and LDAP (``user_ldap``) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (``sociallogin``) un LDAP (``user_ldap``) pieteikšanās virsmas sedz OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (prasības 017/018)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (`sociallogin`) and LDAP (`user_ldap`) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (`sociallogin`) un LDAP (`user_ldap`) pieteikšanās virsmas sedz OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (prasības 017/018)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The SSO back-channel pin, added automatically. On an onion deployment the OIDC endpoints handed to an application are public ``.onion`` authorities. That is right for the browser, which reaches them through Tor, but unroutable for the application's own server-side calls (code-to-token exchange, JWKS, userinfo): a container resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's resolver, not through DNS. Pinning the provider to a reachable address sends those calls over the local network to the proxy that already serves the vhost. Skipped unless the application has SSO enabled and the provider vhost is an ``.onion`` name, so it is a no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "SSO aizmugurējā kanāla tapa tiek pievienota automātiski. Par sīpolu izvietošanu OIDC galapunkti, kas nodoti pieteikumam, ir publiski pieejami ``.onion`` iestādes. Tas ir pareizi pārlūkprogrammai, kas sasniedz tos caur Tor, bet neparastā par pieteikumu paša servera puses zvaniem (kodu-to-ken apmaiņa, JWKS, userinfo): tvertnes izšķirtspēja ``.onion`` caur Tor atrisinātājs, nevis caur DNS. Pinning pakalpojumu sniedzējs uz sasniedzamu adresi nosūta šos zvanus pa lokālo tīklu uz starpniekserveri, kas jau kalpo vhost. Izlaists, ja vien pieteikums nav SSO iespējots un pakalpojumu sniedzējs vhost ir ``.onion`` vārds, tāpēc tas ir no-no-op par clearnet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Sphinx configuration, extensions and generators live in [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Deploy that role to build and serve the site."
msgstr "Sfinksa konfigurācija, paplašinājumi un ģeneratori dzīvo [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Izvietot šo lomu, lai izveidotu un kalpotu vietā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check emits warning annotations for HTTP `429`, `500`, and `503` (rate-limited or temporarily unavailable) via [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."
msgstr "URL sasniedzamības pārbaude izstaro HTTP brīdinājuma anotācijas `429`, `500`, un `503` (ar likmi ierobežota vai uz laiku nepieejama) caur [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check skips template placeholders and reserved local or example hosts such as `localhost` and `*.example`."
msgstr "URL sasniedzamības pārbaude izlaiž sagatavju vietturus un rezervētos lokālos vai piemēru saimniekus, piemēram: `localhost` kā arī `*.example`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats HTTP `401`, `403`, and `405` as reachable (auth-gated or method-restricted servers, not dead links)."
msgstr "URL sasniedzamības pārbaude apstrādā HTTP `401`, `403`, un `405` sasniedzams (auth-gated vai ar metodi ierobežota serveri, nav miris saites)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats read and connect timeouts as warnings."
msgstr "URL sasniedzamības pārbaude apstrādā lasīt un savienot noildzes kā brīdinājumus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The YAML key is the semantic short name. Each entry value MAY carry ``name`` (the docker volume name); when absent and ``type`` is ``volume``, callers default the docker name to the semantic key."
msgstr "YAML taustiņš ir semantiskais īsais nosaukums. Katra ieraksta vērtība VAR pārnest ``name`` (docker skaļuma nosaukums); ja nav un ``type`` ir ``volume``, zvanītāji noklusējuma dokera nosaukumu semantiskā taustiņa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Zammad helpdesk role completes its single-sign-on schema unification, with the variant matrix and Playwright test suite brought in line with the new shape."
msgstr "E ir o pa s Zammad helpdesk loma pabeidz savu single-sign-on shēmu apvienošanu, ar varianta matricu un Playwright testa komplektu, kas saskan ar jauno formu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [GitHub Actions self-hosted runner](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "E ir o pa s [GitHub darbības pašorganizēts skrējējs](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) ir aģents, kas vada GitHub Darbības darbplūsmas darbavietas uz savu infrastruktūru, nevis GitHub hosted mašīnas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`apps/`](apps/) subtree is split by verb (the user intent) and scope:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s [`apps/`](apps/) Apakškoku sadala pēc darbības vārda (lietotāja nodoms) un darbības joma:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`bundles/`](bundles/) subtree mirrors the same axes for inventory bundles (`fresh.sh` ≈ initialize, `update.sh` ≈ update)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s [`bundles/`](bundles/) apakškoki atspoguļo tās pašas asis inventarizācijas saišķiem (`fresh.sh` ≈ inicializē, `update.sh` ≈ atjaunināts)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [`container/`](container/) subtree holds the in-container halves invoked by the host wrappers and follows the same verb/scope layout; see [container/](container/README.md)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s [`container/`](container/) apakškoekā ir iekškonteinera uz pusēm, uz kurām norāda saimnieka aptinēji, un tai ir tāds pats darbības vārds/darbības lauks; skatīt [iepakojums/](container/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) repository is the RECOMMENDED way to define CLI shortcuts so frequently used commands do not have to be retyped. The effective repository is the `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` value in the generated `.env`."
msgstr "E ir o pa s [aizstājvārds](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) Repozitorijs ir REKOMENDĒTais veids, kā definēt CLI īsceļus, tāpēc bieži lietotām komandām nav nepieciešams tikt pārrakstītām. Efektīvais repozitorijs ir `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` saražotā vērtība `.env`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [lint.md](testing/lint.md) page covers repository-wide code quality expectations such as diff quality, maintainability, and conventions."
msgstr "E ir o pa s [lint.md](testing/lint.md) lapa aptver repozitorija visā koda kvalitātes gaidas, piemēram, diff kvalitāte, uzturamība, un konvencijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [per-role meta layout](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) already lists `addons`, `plugins`, and `modules` among the keys *inlined* under the primary service entity. This requirement promotes that concept to a first-class, per-file `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` topic (one file per addon, file root IS the addon spec), the same move requirement 011 made for `meta/info.yml` and requirement 008/009 made for other meta topics."
msgstr "E ir o pa s [meta per-rolā izkārtojums](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) jau saraksti `addons`, `plugins`, un `modules` starp atslēgām *inlineēts* saskaņā ar primāro pakalpojumu vienību. Šī prasība veicina šo jēdzienu, lai pirmās klases, par lietu `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` tēma (viens fails uz addon, faila sakne IS addon spec), tas pats gājiens prasība 011 izgatavots `meta/info.yml` un prasības 008/009 veikti citām meta tēmām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `.onion` is a **deploy-time input**: a CLI helper mints the v3 key offline during inventory build, vaults it, and sets `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. It must NOT be a runtime fact — `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is consumed at build time (LDAP base, CA, applications cache). The role restores the minted key into the hidden-service volume before Tor starts."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `.onion` s ta rē **Ekspluatācijas laika ieguldījums**: CLI palīgs kaltuvē v3 galvenais bezsaistē inventarizācijas veidošanas laikā, velves to, un komplekti `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. Tas nedrīkst būt runtime fakts: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` tiek patērēts būvēšanas laikā (LDAP bāze, CA, programmu kešatmiņa). Loma atjauno kalto atslēgu slēptā pakalpojuma apjomā pirms Tor sāk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `@playwright/test` version pinned into the rendered `package.json` comes from `playwright.version` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` via the `image_version` filter. That YAML value is the single source of truth for the Playwright version."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `@playwright/test` versija iepinās renderētā `package.json` ir no `playwright.version` skaits `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` caur `image_version` filtrs. Šī YAML vērtība ir vienīgais patiesības avots Playwright versijai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `API.cloudflare.api_token` value (declared in `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, read via `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) must contain a valid Cloudflare API Token.   This token is used for all DNS operations and ACME (SSL/TLS certificate) challenges that require access to your Cloudflare-managed domains."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `API.cloudflare.api_token` vērtība (deklarēti `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, lasīt caur `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) jābūt derīgam mākoņpārslimojumam API Token. Šo marķierierīci izmanto visām DNS operācijām un ACME (SSL/TLS sertifikāts) problēmas, kuru risināšanai nepieciešama piekļuve jūsu pārvaldītajiem domēniem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow grants broad access to the `docker` CLI (alongside every other shell command) under the assumption that no production containers share the host. Non-mutating-image subcommands (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) can disrupt or destroy container state. Under test-only usage, the blast radius is bounded to ephemeral state that can be recreated from the compose stack."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `Bash(*)` ļauj piešķirt plašu piekļuvi `docker` CLI (līdzās katrai citai čaulas komandai) saskaņā ar pieņēmumu, ka nevienam ražošanas konteineriem nav kopīga uzņēmēja. Nemutējoša attēla apakškomanda (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) var izjaukt vai iznīcināt konteinera stāvokli. Ja izmanto tikai testu, spridzināšanas rādiuss ir ierobežots līdz efemerālam stāvoklim, ko var atjaunot no komplekso kaudze."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow lets the agent run any Makefile target without prompting. The `Makefile` is checked into git and reviewed on every pull request, so targets themselves are trusted. Every action a target performs still runs inside the sandbox."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `Bash(*)` ļauj aģents palaist jebkuru Makefile mērķi bez lieku. E ir o pa s `Makefile` tiek pārbaudīts git un pārskatīts par katru pull pieprasījumu, tāpēc mērķi paši ir uzticami. Katru darbību mērķis veic joprojām iet iekšā smilšu kastē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `Corefile.tmpl` MUST be the source of truth. It is rendered to `Corefile` by [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), which substitutes its `${VAR}` placeholders in-process, using values from `.env` (generated from [default.env](../../default.env), overridable through the CLI's environment)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `Corefile.tmpl` Jābūt patiesības avotam. Tas ir padarīts par `Corefile` līdz [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), kas aizstāj `${VAR}` vietturi procesā, izmantojot vērtības no `.env` (radīts no [default.env](../../default.env), ko var ignorēt KKI vidē)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ ir aģents, kas vada GitHub Darbības darbplūsmas darbavietas uz savu infrastruktūru, nevis GitHub hosted mašīnas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Makefile` is the human-facing command surface for the repo. It MUST expose stable targets that people and CI are meant to run directly."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `Makefile` ir repo uz cilvēku vērstā komandvirsma. Tai ir jāatklāj stabili mērķi, kurus cilvēkiem un CI ir paredzēts vadīt tieši."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `OIDC` tree is a lazy group_var: it resolves in the consuming role's context, so the issuer family-aligns to that consumer (clearnet page → clearnet issuer, onion page → onion issuer). Inventory overrides therefore live under `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — an inventory-level `OIDC:` block would shadow the lazy resolution and is rejected by a constructor assert."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `OIDC` koks ir slinks group_var: tas ir saistīts ar patērējošo lomu, tādējādi emitentu ģimenes saista ar šo patērētāju; (cleannet lapa → cleannet emitent, onion lapa → sīpolu emitents). Inventarizācija tādējādi ignorē dzīvot zem `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — uzskaites līmeni, `OIDC:` bloks ēnu slinko izšķirtspēju un tiek noraidīts ar konstruktors apgalvo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Options` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see [NFS-backed volumes](#nfs-backed-volumes)): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `Options` noteikums ir tas, kas uztur spharm resursdators ar NFS atbalstīti apjomi uz dzīvot kopiju (skatīt [Ar NFS nodrošināti apjomi](#nfs-backed-volumes)): šāds apjoms ir atsevišķa failu sistēma, tāpēc momentuzņēmums datu saknes varētu iegūt to kā tukšu direktoriju un backup gūtu panākumus, turot neko. Deklarācija tiek pārbaudīta, nevis montāžas tabula, jo docker mounts šos apjomus lazily un nomontē tos, kad pēdējais konteiners apstājas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the `make runner-ci-deploy` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` mainīga izvēle distro-specifiski pakotņu uzstādīšanas uzdevumi (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux vai Fedora/EL). Šo lomu ir paredzēts vadīt ar `make runner-ci-deploy` Mērķis; skatīt beigu-to-end rokasgrāmatu zemāk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``(fqcn, version)`` pairs a requirements file declares, in order."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``(fqcn, version)`` pāriem prasību failu paziņo, secībā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` pins for *tool*."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` tapām *rīks*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` an installer should fetch for *tool*."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``(owner/repo, version)`` uzstādītājam vajadzētu saņemt *rīks*."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``API`` mapping as declared in the group_vars SPOT."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``API`` kartēšana, kā norādīts group_vars SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` fallback declared in ``default.env``."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` Reverss deklarēts ``default.env``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``Options`` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``Options`` noteikums ir tas, kas uztur spharm resursdators ar NFS atbalstīti apjomi uz dzīvot kopiju (skatīt `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): šāds apjoms ir atsevišķa failu sistēma, tāpēc momentuzņēmums datu saknes varētu iegūt to kā tukšu direktoriju un backup gūtu panākumus, turot neko. Deklarācija tiek pārbaudīta, nevis montāžas tabula, jo docker mounts šos apjomus lazily un nomontē tos, kad pēdējais konteiners apstājas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` mainīga izvēle distro-specifiski pakotņu uzstādīšanas uzdevumi (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux vai Fedora/EL). Šo lomu ir paredzēts vadīt ar ``make runner-ci-deploy`` Mērķis; skatīt beigu-to-end rokasgrāmatu zemāk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is **not** blocked: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The ``biber`` persona is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and ``biber`` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``administrator`` persona ir **nav** bloķēts: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ sēklas dzimtā OpenProject konts, kura parole ir Keycloak administrators noslēpums, tāpēc ceļojums notiek katrā variantā. E ir o pa s ``biber`` persona ir bloķēta tikai ``sso: false`` varianti – OpenProject tiek piedāvāta tikai administratoram un ``biber`` tiek piegādāts tikai caur auzu2- proxy uzticības-header tilts uz LDAP auth avota, ko šie varianti noņemt. Abi karogi ir skaidri deklarēti `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` provisions proxied identities with ``create_user(...)`` and no ``is_staff`` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``administrator`` persona ir papildus bloķēta, jo šī loma nekad nerada BookWyrm personāla konts. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` noteikumi proxied identitāti ar ``create_user(...)`` un nē ``is_staff`` karogs, un neviens uzdevums veicina esošo kontu, tāpēc administrators ierodas kā parasts loceklis bez admin virsmas izmantot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked because Decidim’s admin is a Devise account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role’s Playwright env therefore exposes ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` and no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``administrator`` persona ir bloķēta, jo Decidim” admin ” ir Devīzes konts, ko sēj ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` un Dodiet zīmes uz e-pasta adresi. Līdz ar to tiek atklāta loma Playwright env ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` un nē ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, kas ir mainīgais koplietošanas admin palīgs lasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, whose identifier is the ORM ``username`` rather than the e-mail Baserow’s own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``administrator`` persona ir bloķēta tikai tad, kad SSO ir izslēgts. Šajā konfigurācijā ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` ir nepatiess, tāpēc uzticamas header tilts ir neaktīvs un vienīgais konts ir Django superlietotāja bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` caur ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, kura identifikators ir ORM ``username`` nevis e-pastu Baserowtiek prasīta paša ierakstīšanās forma. Ar SSO ļāva galvenes tilts piegādā sesiju un persona darbojas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` and ``administrator`` Playwright personas are gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. When SSO is off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Two reasons:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``biber`` kā arī ``administrator`` Playwright personas ir gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. Kad SSO ir izslēgts, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Divi iemesli:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``biber`` persona žurnālus, izmantojot OIDC bez nepatikšanām; ko tā nevar darīt, ir pieteikties. Decidim izrakstīšanās ir ``data-method`` saistīt iekšpusē konta nolaižamā, tāpēc loma pati testi navigēt uz ``/users/sign_out`` tieši, nevis noklikšķinot pogu kopīgotājs varētu atrast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``context_agent`` kā arī ``contextagentmcp`` pakalpojumi ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` konteksts, tikai lasāms ar katru spēju samazinājās, un tas ir vienīgais MCP mērķa klienti tiek dota."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``dashboard`` pakalpojums ``meta/services.yml`` ir tikai patērētāju flīzes norāda uz MIGkanonisko domēnu; tas neuztur MIGUzdevuma līgums pilnībā atbilst sasniedzamības, kanonisko domēnu un satura veida scenārijiem ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus viesu persona. Ceļš atpakaļ uz vispārējo personu ir autentificēts MIG virsmas, kas augšpusē nav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dsk-gnucash`` role ensures that GnuCash is installed and maintained at its latest available version in the Pacman repositories."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``dsk-gnucash`` loma nodrošina, ka GnuCash tiek instalēta un uzturēta tās jaunākā pieejamā versija Pacman repozitorijos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dsk-qbittorrent`` role is tailored for users who require a reliable and user-friendly torrent client for downloading and sharing files via the BitTorrent protocol. qBittorrent is known for its balance of features, simplicity, and minimal impact on system resources."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``dsk-qbittorrent`` loma ir pielāgota lietotājiem, kuriem nepieciešams uzticams un lietotājam draudzīgs torrent klients, lai lejupielādētu un kopīgotu failus, izmantojot BitTorrent protokolu. qBittorrent ir pazīstama ar savu funkciju līdzsvaru, vienkāršību un minimālu ietekmi uz sistēmas resursiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dsk-torbrowser`` role uses the ``community.general.pacman`` module to:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``dsk-torbrowser`` loma izmanto ``community.general.pacman`` modulis uz:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``gitlab_repositories`` volume is declared ``nfs: false``, so in swarm mode it stays a plain node-local volume instead of being rewritten to the shared NFS backend. Gitaly is pinned to a single replica. When a swarm reschedule moves the gitaly task to another node, the repositories stay on the previous node’s local volume; move the volume data manually before rescheduling gitaly."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``gitlab_repositories`` deklarētais daudzums ``nfs: false``, tāpēc bara režīmā tas paliek vienkāršs mezgla lokāls apjoms, nevis tiek pārrakstīts uz kopīgoto NFS aizmuguri. Gitaly ir piestiprināta vienai kopijai. Kad swarm reschedule kustina gitaly uzdevumu uz citu mezglu, repozitoriji paliek uz iepriekšējā mezgla vietējo apjomu; pārvietot skaļuma datus manuāli pirms atkārtotas grafika gitaly."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``guest`` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``guest`` persona un lomu vietējā sasniedzamība, TLS un HSTS apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``guest`` persona is always live (no auth chain assumption) and the canonical-landing baseline test runs unconditionally."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``guest`` persona vienmēr ir dzīvs (Nav auth ķēdes pieņēmums) un kanonisko nosēšanās testu veic bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``hanzi`` label of every category the role id walks through."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``hanzi`` marķējums katras kategorijas lomu id iet cauri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``ldap`` service block in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ is intentionally pinned to literal ``false`` (see `TODO.md <./TODO.md>`__): the ``jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth`` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. ``discourse-ldap-auth`` therefore resolves to disabled until that block is flipped back to the dynamic group-membership form."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``ldap`` apkopes bloks iekšā ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ is intentionally pinned to literal ``false`` (see `TODO.md <./TODO.md>`__): the ``jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth`` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. ``discourse-ldap-auth`` tādējādi nolemj invalīdiem, līdz šis bloks tiek apgriezts atpakaļ uz dinamisko grupas dalībnieku formu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file in the ``dsk-docker`` role consists of two primary tasks:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``main.yml`` fails ``dsk-docker`` loma sastāv no diviem galvenajiem uzdevumiem:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file in the ``dsk-qbittorrent`` role includes the following task:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``main.yml`` fails ``dsk-qbittorrent`` loma ietver šādu uzdevumu:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file in the ``hunspell`` role includes two primary tasks:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``main.yml`` fails ``hunspell`` loma ietver divus galvenos uzdevumus:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``main.yml`` file within the ``java`` role consists of a single, but crucial task:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``main.yml`` datne ``java`` lomu veido viens, bet svarīgs uzdevums:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target invokes ``python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner``. You can also call it directly:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``make runner-ci-deploy`` mērķa izsaukumi ``python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner``. Jūs varat arī zvanīt tieši:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``oidc`` plugin (``pretix-oidc``, pinned to ``2.3.1``) is pip-installed at image build time and delivers Keycloak/OIDC login. It auto-enables whenever the SSO partner role (``web-app-keycloak``) is co-deployed and stays off otherwise."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``oidc`` spraudnis (``pretix-oidc``, piestiprināts pie ``2.3.1``) ir pip-instalēta attēla veidošanas laikā un nodrošina KeycloakPieteikšanās OIDC. Tas automātiski ļauj vienmēr, kad SSO partnera loma (``web-app-keycloak``) ir līdzizvietots un paliek ārpusē citādi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``owner/repo`` the current branch lives on, derived from its tracking remote (not gh's default repo, which may be the upstream)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``owner/repo`` pašreizējais atzars dzīvo, atvasināts no tā izsekošanas attāluma (ne gh saistību neizpildes repo, kas var būt augšpusē)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``role#variant`` selection token of one query row."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``role#variant`` izvēles marķieris ar vienu vaicājumu rindu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``s3.configure`` grant is required since SeaweedFS 4.39: a server started without an ``-s3.config`` has zero identities, and ListBuckets then returns an empty list to the consumer's access key, so the consumer reads the bucket as missing even though it exists."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``s3.configure`` dotācija ir nepieciešama, jo SeaweedFS 4.39: serveris palaists bez ``-s3.config`` ir nulles identitātes, un ListBuckets pēc tam atgriež tukšu sarakstu uz patērētāja piekļuves atslēgu, tāpēc patērētājs lasa spaini kā trūkstošu, lai gan tas pastāv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-front-inj-logout`` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application’s HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``sys-front-inj-logout`` Assible loma automātiski ieguļ viegls JavaScript fragmentu jūsu tīmekļa programmas HTML atbildes. Šis skripts identificē pieslēgšanās saites, pogas, formas un citus elementus, aizstāj to mērķa URL un nodrošina, ka lietotāji tiek novirzīti uz centrālo OIDC atslēgšanās galapunktu, nodrošinot konsekventu vienas atslēgšanās pieredzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using `Postfix <https://www.postfix.org/>`__, listening exclusively on ``localhost``."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` loma konfigurēta a **lokāls SMTP relejs** izmantojot `Postfix <https://www.postfix.org/>`__, klausoties tikai ``localhost``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``sys-svc-mail`` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``sys-svc-mail`` loma darbojas kā **centrālais pasta orķestra slānis** kas Infinito.Nexus kaudze."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``tag_only=True`` kwarg returns the reference WITHOUT the swarm registry prefix. Use it when the ref must be interpolated inline against the upstream registry rather than the in-cluster mirror."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``tag_only=True`` kwang atgriež atsauci BEZ barona reģistra prefiksa. Izmantojiet to, kad ref ir jāinterpolē ierindā pret augšpusējo reģistru, nevis uz spoguļa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``want=`` kwarg is intentionally ignored: want-path is ALWAYS the first positional argument so callers can't accidentally pass it both ways."
msgstr "E ir o pa s ``want=`` kwang tiek apzināti ignorēts: want-path ir ALWAYS pirmais pozicionāls arguments, lai zvanītāji nevar nejauši nodot to abos veidos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `addons` key MUST be removed from the \"inlined under the primary entity\" set in [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and documented as its own topic file."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `addons` atslēga jāizņem no \"Iekļauta zem primārā subjekta\" iestatīts [layout.md](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) un dokumentē kā savu tēmu failu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `administrator` persona MUST drive at least one admin-only interaction (admin panel toggle, realm settings change, user-management surface, …). Specs supply this via the `adminInteraction` callback on `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` under the same \"no generic default\" rule."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `administrator` persona jāvada vismaz viena tikai admin mijiedarbība (admin paneļa pārslēgt, reāllaika iestatījumu maiņa, lietotāja vadības virsma, ...). Specs piegādāt to, izmantojot `adminInteraction` Atzvanīšana `runAdminFlow(page, { adminInteraction })` saskaņā ar to pašu \"nav vispārēja noklusējuma\" noteikums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is **not** blocked: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The `biber` persona is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and `biber` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `administrator` persona ir **nav** bloķēts: [tasks/04_admin.yml](./tasks/04_admin.yml) sēklas dzimtā OpenProject konts, kura parole ir Keycloak administrators noslēpums, tāpēc ceļojums notiek katrā variantā. E ir o pa s `biber` persona ir bloķēta tikai `sso: false` varianti – OpenProject tiek piedāvāta tikai administratoram un `biber` tiek piegādāts tikai caur auzu2- proxy uzticības-header tilts uz LDAP auth avota, ko šie varianti noņemt. Abi karogi ir skaidri deklarēti [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. `files/sso/header_auth.py` provisions proxied identities with `create_user(...)` and no `is_staff` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `administrator` persona ir papildus bloķēta, jo šī loma nekad nerada BookWyrm personāla konts. `files/sso/header_auth.py` noteikumi proxied identitāti ar `create_user(...)` un nē `is_staff` karogs, un neviens uzdevums veicina esošo kontu, tāpēc administrators ierodas kā parasts loceklis bez admin virsmas izmantot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked because Decidim's admin is a Devise account seeded by `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role's Playwright env therefore exposes `ADMIN_EMAIL` and no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `administrator` persona ir bloķēta, jo Decidim's admin ir Devise konts, ko piedāvā `files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb` un Dodiet zīmes uz e-pasta adresi. Tāpēc lomu Playwright env atklāj `ADMIN_EMAIL` un nē `ADMIN_USERNAME`, kas ir mainīgais koplietošanas admin palīgs lasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `administrator` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` via `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, whose identifier is the ORM `username` rather than the e-mail Baserow's own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `administrator` persona ir bloķēta tikai tad, kad SSO ir izslēgts. Šajā konfigurācijā `PROXY_HEADER_SSO` ir nepatiess, tāpēc uzticamas header tilts ir neaktīvs un vienīgais konts ir Django superlietotāja bootstrapped by `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` caur `files/bootstrap_admin.py`, kura identifikators ir ORM `username` nevis e-pastu Baserowpieprasa paša pierakstīšanās formu. Ar SSO ļāva galvenes tilts piegādā sesiju un persona darbojas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `all` mode honors a per-interpreter stamp at `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (the suffix is the first 8 chars of `sha256(sys.executable)`, so host and container track independently even though `build/` is bind-mounted). Stamp dependencies are [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) and [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Group-targeted invocations always run and never touch the stamp."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `all` režīmā godina per-interpretators zīmogu pie `build/install-lint-<hash>.stamp` (sufikss ir pirmais 8 ir `sha256(sys.executable)`, lai saimnieks un konteineru dziesmu neatkarīgi, pat ja `build/` ir piesaistīts). Zīmogs atkarības ir [lint.sh](../../../scripts/install/lint.sh) kā arī [pyproject.toml](../../../pyproject.toml). Grupu mērķauditorijas atsauksmes vienmēr skrien un nekad nepieskaras zīmogam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `applications` lookup is the ONLY supported runtime entry point for merged application configuration."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `applications` lookup ir TIKAI atbalstīts runtime ieejas punkts apvienotai pieteikumu konfigurācijai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `ask` rules on `docker run*` / `docker build*` / `docker push*` / `docker login*` only catch the outermost invocation. Because the project uses Docker-in-Docker (for example `docker exec <helper-container> docker run ...`), a `docker run` invoked inside an exec'd helper container bypasses the ask-gate. The helper container has its own Docker daemon or a bind-mounted host socket, so the inner `docker run` executes directly."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `ask` noteikumi par `docker run*` / `docker build*` / `docker push*` / `docker login*` Noķer tikai attālāko piesaukumu. Jo projekts izmanto Docker- in- Docker (piemēram, `docker exec <helper-container> docker run ...`), a `docker run` izmantot iekšā exec'd palīga konteinerā apiet jautāt-vārtus. Palīga konteineram ir savs Docker dēmons vai piesaistāma saimnieka ligzda, tāpēc iekšējs `docker run` izpilda tieši."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `auto` alias exists and every other alias still resolves"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `auto` aizstājvārds pastāv un visi citi aizstājvārdu joprojām atrisina"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` and `administrator` Playwright personas are gated on `services.sso.enabled`. When SSO is off, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Two reasons:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `biber` kā arī `administrator` Playwright personas ir gated on `services.sso.enabled`. Kad SSO ir izslēgts, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) atveidojumi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` kā arī `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Divi iemesli:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` and `administrator` personas always end on a verified unauthenticated landing via the in-app logout button."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `biber` kā arī `administrator` persona, kas vienmēr beidzas uz pārbaudītu neautentisticated nosēšanās, izmantojot in-app atteikt pogu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `biber` persona MUST drive at least one role-specific interaction that a regular end-user would perform (post a message, open a settings tab, browse a content list, submit a form, …). Specs supply this via the `biberInteraction` callback on `runBiberFlow(page, { biberInteraction })`. There is NO generic default. A generic \"click any link\" assertion tests nothing role-specific, so the helper is a no-op until the spec provides a callback."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `biber` personai jāvada vismaz viena lomai specifiska mijiedarbība, ko veiktu regulārs galalietotājs (post ziņojumu, atveriet iestatījumu cilni, pārlūkojiet satura sarakstu, iesniedziet veidlapu, ...). Specs piegādāt to, izmantojot `biberInteraction` Atzvanīšana `runBiberFlow(page, { biberInteraction })`. Nav vispārīgs noklusējuma. Vispārējs \"klikšķiniet uz jebkuras saites\" apgalvojums pārbauda neko lomu specifisku, tāpēc palīgs ir no-op līdz spec sniedz atzvana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim's sign-out is a `data-method` link inside the account dropdown, so the role's own tests navigate to `/users/sign_out` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `biber` persona žurnālus, izmantojot OIDC bez nepatikšanām; ko tā nevar darīt, ir pieteikties. Decidima izrakstīšana ir `data-method` saistīt iekšpusē konta nolaižamā, tāpēc loma pati testi navigēt uz `/users/sign_out` tieši, nevis noklikšķinot pogu kopīgotājs varētu atrast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `build-ci-images` stage uses [call-images-build-ci.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-images-build-ci.yml) to build Docker images for the target distributions (`arch`, `debian`, `ubuntu`, `fedora`, `centos`). These images are consumed by all subsequent test jobs."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `build-ci-images` lietojumi stadijā [call-images-build-ci.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-images-build-ci.yml) veidot Docker attēlus mērķa distributīviem (`arch`, `debian`, `ubuntu`, `fedora`, `centos`). Šos attēlus patērē visi turpmākie testa darbi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `bundles=` make arg (comma-separated bundle names) is REQUIRED for both entry points. The compose-deploy recipe sets the resulting `bundles` env var read by these scripts."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `bundles=` veikt arg (ar komatu atdalītu saiņu nosaukumi) ir vajadzīgs abiem ieejas punktiem. Kompozīt-deploy recepte nosaka rezultātā `bundles` env var lasīt ar šiem skriptiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `cache` decision is exposed via `Profile.cache_stack_enabled()` in [profile.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/profile.py). When active:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `cache` lēmums ir pakļauts, izmantojot `Profile.cache_stack_enabled()` skaits [profile.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/profile.py). Kad aktīvs:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `cli.contributing.mirror.cleanup` module deletes GHCR container packages filtered by prefix and visibility. Use it to remove stale private mirror packages that were pushed before the repository switched to `GITHUB_TOKEN`-based authentication (which now makes packages public automatically)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `cli.contributing.mirror.cleanup` modulis dzēš GHCR konteinera pakotnes filtrē ar prefiksu un redzamību. Izmantojiet to, lai noņemtu strupo privāto spoguļu pakotnes, uz kurām tika grūsti pirms krātuve pārslēdzās `GITHUB_TOKEN`- pamatojoties uz autentificēšanu (kas tagad padara paketes publiski pieejamu automātiski)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `code-quality-gate` requires linting, code tests, and security checks to all pass before deploy tests are triggered."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `code-quality-gate` prasa linumu, kodu testus un drošības pārbaudes, lai visi iziet pirms izvietošana testi tiek uzsākta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `context_agent` and `contextagentmcp` services in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) render only while `mcp.enabled` is true. The first runs `ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent`, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares `credentials.context_agent_app_secret` with the ExApp registration as `APP_SECRET`. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `context_agent` kā arī `contextagentmcp` pakalpojumi [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) renderēt tikai tad `mcp.enabled` ir taisnība. Pirmie braucieni `ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent`, klausās savā iekšējā ostā tikai AppAPI, un akcijas `credentials.context_agent_app_secret` ar Exapp reģistrāciju kā `APP_SECRET`. Otrais ir adapteris blakusvāģis, būvēts no inscened `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` konteksts, tikai lasāms ar katru spēju samazinājās, un tas ir vienīgais MCP mērķa klienti tiek dota."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `dashboard` service in `meta/services.yml` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG's canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role's contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `dashboard` pakalpojums `meta/services.yml` ir tikai patērētāju flīzes norāda uz MIGkanonisko domēnu; tas neuztur MIG. Uzdevuma līgums pilnībā atbilst sasniedzamības, kanonisko domēnu un satura veida scenārijiem `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, plus viesu persona. Ceļš atpakaļ uz vispārējo personu ir autentificēts MIG virsmas, kas augšpusē nav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `default:` points at the central `API` block in [group_vars/all/18_api.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/18_api.yml), so an operator fills the provider in one place while the role keeps the shape the value must have."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `default:` punkti centrālajā `API` bloks iekšā [group_vars/all/18_api.yml](../../../../../group_vars/all/18_api.yml), tāpēc operators aizpilda pakalpojumu sniedzēju vienā vietā, bet loma saglabā formu vērtība ir jābūt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `deploy` router target and `make compose-exec` / `make network-trust-ca` helpers."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `deploy` maršrutētāja mērķi un `make compose-exec` / `make network-trust-ca` palīgi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `dsk-gnucash` role ensures that GnuCash is installed and maintained at its latest available version in the Pacman repositories."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `dsk-gnucash` loma nodrošina, ka GnuCash tiek instalēta un uzturēta tās jaunākā pieejamā versija Pacman repozitorijos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `dsk-qbittorrent` role is tailored for users who require a reliable and user-friendly torrent client for downloading and sharing files via the BitTorrent protocol. qBittorrent is known for its balance of features, simplicity, and minimal impact on system resources."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `dsk-qbittorrent` loma ir pielāgota lietotājiem, kuriem nepieciešams uzticams un lietotājam draudzīgs torrent klients, lai lejupielādētu un kopīgotu failus, izmantojot BitTorrent protokolu. qBittorrent ir pazīstama ar savu funkciju līdzsvaru, vienkāršību un minimālu ietekmi uz sistēmas resursiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `dsk-torbrowser` role uses the `community.general.pacman` module to:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `dsk-torbrowser` loma izmanto `community.general.pacman` modulis uz:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `file.path` pairs that decide each role type."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `file.path` pāri, kas nosaka katru lomu veidu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `gitlab_repositories` volume is declared `nfs: false`, so in swarm mode it stays a plain node-local volume instead of being rewritten to the shared NFS backend. Gitaly is pinned to a single replica. When a swarm reschedule moves the gitaly task to another node, the repositories stay on the previous node's local volume; move the volume data manually before rescheduling gitaly."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `gitlab_repositories` deklarētais daudzums `nfs: false`, tāpēc bara režīmā tas paliek vienkāršs mezgla lokāls apjoms, nevis tiek pārrakstīts uz kopīgoto NFS aizmuguri. Gitaly ir piestiprināta vienai kopijai. Kad swarm reschedule pārvieto gitaly uzdevumu citā mezglā, repozitoriji paliek iepriekšējā mezgla lokālajā apjomā; skaļuma datus pārvieto manuāli pirms gitaly pārplānošanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `groups` client scope emits the OIDC `groups` claim with `full.path=true`, so consumers receive entries shaped like:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `groups` klienta darbības joma emitē OIDC `groups` prasība ar `full.path=true`, līdz ar to patērētāji saņem šādus ierakstus:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `guest` persona MUST never reach the role's authenticated surface. An empty-credentials submission against Keycloak MUST be rejected by the IdP."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `guest` Persona nekad nesasniedz lomu autentificētu virsmu. Pret tukšiem kuģiem Keycloak IdP ir jānoraida."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `guest` persona un lomu vietējā sasniedzamība, TLS un HSTS apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `guest` persona is always live (no auth chain assumption) and the canonical-landing baseline test runs unconditionally."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `guest` persona vienmēr ir dzīvs (Nav auth ķēdes pieņēmums) un kanonisko nosēšanās testu veic bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `infinito_` prefix in the filename MUST be present iff the owned key carries the `INFINITO_` prefix."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `infinito_` prefikss faila nosaukums jābūt klāt, jaf pieder atslēga nes `INFINITO_` prefikss."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `ldap` service block in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) is intentionally pinned to literal `false` (see [TODO.md](./TODO.md)): the `jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth` plugin breaks Discourse bootstrap on recent versions. `discourse-ldap-auth` therefore resolves to disabled until that block is flipped back to the dynamic group-membership form."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `ldap` apkopes bloks iekšā [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) ir apzināti piesaistīts burtiskai `false` (skatīt [TODO.md](./TODO.md)): `jonmbake/discourse-ldap-auth` spraudņa pārtraukumi Discourse bootstrap par jaunākajām versijām. `discourse-ldap-auth` tādējādi nolemj invalīdiem, līdz šis bloks tiek apgriezts atpakaļ uz dinamisko grupas dalībnieku formu."

# [zvana.lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint`
# fani katru lint pārbaudīt paralēli, plus hadolint SARIF darbu. Tas ir
# jāiziet, pirms cauruļvads turpinās.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `lint` job runs [call-lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint` fans every lint check out in parallel, plus a hadolint SARIF job. It MUST pass before the pipeline continues."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `lint` Darbi [call-lint.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-lint.yml): `make lint` fani katru lint pārbaudīt paralēli, plus hadolint SARIF darbu. Tas ir jāiziet, pirms cauruļvads turpinās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `listmonk` service command runs `./listmonk --install --idempotent --yes` on every container start, so the schema is seeded automatically on the first deploy."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `listmonk` servisa komandas komandas `./listmonk --install --idempotent --yes` uz katra konteinera starta, tāpēc shēma tiek izsēta automātiski pirmajā izvietojumā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `listmonk` service command runs `./listmonk --upgrade --yes` on every container start, so schema migrations apply automatically when a new image is deployed."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `listmonk` servisa komandas komandas `./listmonk --upgrade --yes` katrā konteinera sākumā, tāpēc shēmas migrācija tiek piemērota automātiski, kad tiek izvietots jauns attēls."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `lookup('database', ...)` API is the convenience accessor for database connection values; it resolves the active direct database service from the role-local keys above."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `lookup('database', ...)` API ir ērts accessor datubāzes savienojuma vērtībām; tas atrisina aktīvo tiešo datu bāzes pakalpojumu no lomu vietējās atslēgas iepriekš."

