msgid "The `main.yml` file within the `java` role consists of a single, but crucial task:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `main.yml` datne `java` lomu veido viens, bet svarīgs uzdevums:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `make runner-ci-deploy` target invokes `python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner`. You can also call it directly:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `make runner-ci-deploy` mērķa izsaukumi `python -m cli.administration.deploy.runner`. Jūs varat arī zvanīt tieši:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `oidc` plugin (`pretix-oidc`, pinned to `2.3.1`) is pip-installed at image build time and delivers Keycloak/OIDC login. It auto-enables whenever the SSO partner role (`web-app-keycloak`) is co-deployed and stays off otherwise."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `oidc` spraudnis (`pretix-oidc`, piestiprināts pie `2.3.1`) ir pip-instalēta attēla veidošanas laikā un nodrošina KeycloakPieteikšanās OIDC. Tas automātiski ļauj vienmēr, kad SSO partnera loma (`web-app-keycloak`) ir līdzizvietots un paliek ārpusē citādi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pre-commit` hooks are installed automatically by `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-machine overrides go into the process environment before invoking `make` (e.g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` honors caller-set values via setdefault semantics."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `pre-commit` āķus uzstāda automātiski `make environment-bootstrap`. Viena mašīna ignorē iet uz procesa vidē pirms piesakās `make` (Piemēram, `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` godina zvanītāja iestatītās vērtības, izmantojot setdefault semantics."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pull_request` orchestrator then waits for and consumes those images."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `pull_request` Tad orķestra vadītājs gaida un patērē šos attēlus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `rbac_group_path` lookup plugin is the only sanctioned producer of OIDC group paths in this repository. Tests in this directory MUST cover invariants that protect that contract: callsite shape, role declaration consistency, and the ban on inline `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` constructions introduced by requirement 005."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `rbac_group_path` Lookup spraudnis ir vienīgais sodītais OIDC grupas ceļu ražotājs šajā repozitorijā. Testi šajā direktorijā ir jāietver invariantes, kas aizsargā šo līgumu: callite forma, lomu deklarāciju konsekvenci, un aizliegums tiešsaistē `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` ar prasību ieviestās konstrukcijas 005."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `redirect_uris` lookup generates `https://<domain>/*` per SSO consumer, which covers the UI and API callbacks but not a localhost one. Machine access goes through AppRole (Decision #2) instead. Documented as a limitation in the README."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `redirect_uris` Lookup ģenerē `https://<domain>/*` katram SSO patērētājam, kas aptver SRN un API zvani, bet ne localhost vienu. Mašīnas piekļuve iet caur AppRole (Lēmums #2) vietā. Dokumentēts kā ierobežojums LASĪTUMĀ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` flag is retained as belt-and-suspenders. If `Bash(*)` were ever removed, the sandbox auto-allow would still cover the common shapes, but it is no longer the primary gate."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` karodziņu saglabā kā drošības jostas un drošības jostas atsprādzēšanas ierīci. Ja `Bash(*)` tika kādreiz noņemti, smilšu kaste auto-tauku joprojām segtu kopējās formas, bet tas vairs nav primārie vārti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sandbox.network` block governs outbound and local connectivity from inside the sandbox."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `sandbox.network` bloks regulē izejošo un vietējo savienojamību no iekšpuses smilšu kastē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `scripts/` tree MUST contain executable shell entry points and shell helper files only."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `scripts/` koka MUST satur tikai izpildāms čaulas ieejas punktus un čaulas palīga failus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `security-codeql` job runs the CodeQL scan (catalogued in the `Security and linting` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)). A failing scan MUST fail `code-quality-gate` and thereby block all downstream deploy, install, and environment tests."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `security-codeql` darbs veic kodaQL skenēšanu (kataloģizēts `Security and linting` tabula [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)). Neveiksmīgai skenēšanai jāizdodas `code-quality-gate` un tādējādi bloķēt visu lejpusējo izvietot, uzstādīt, un vides testus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-front-inj-logout` Ansible role automatically embeds a lightweight JavaScript snippet into your web application's HTML responses. This script identifies logout links, buttons, forms, and other elements, overrides their target URLs, and ensures users are redirected to a central OIDC logout endpoint, providing a consistent single sign‑out experience."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `sys-front-inj-logout` Asible loma automātiski ieguļ vieglu JavaScript fragmentu jūsu tīmekļa programmas HTML atbildes. Šis skripts identificē pieslēgšanās saites, pogas, formas un citus elementus, aizstāj to mērķa URL un nodrošina, ka lietotāji tiek novirzīti uz centrālo OIDC atslēgšanās galapunktu, nodrošinot konsekventu vienas atslēgšanās pieredzi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail-smtp` role configures a **local SMTP relay** using [Postfix](https://www.postfix.org/), listening exclusively on `localhost`.   It is designed to be used as a fallback when no central Mailu instance is available, enabling applications and system services to send email via `localhost:25` without additional configuration."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `sys-svc-mail-smtp` loma konfigurēta a **lokāls SMTP relejs** izmantojot [Postfikss](https://www.postfix.org/), klausoties tikai `localhost`. To paredzēts izmantot kā rezerves, ja nav centrālā Mailu ir pieejams piemērs, kas ļauj lietojumprogrammām un sistēmas pakalpojumiem sūtīt e-pastu, izmantojot `localhost:25` bez papildu konfigurācijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `sys-svc-mail` role acts as the **central mail orchestration layer** in the Infinito.Nexus stack.   It wires together:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `sys-svc-mail` loma darbojas kā **centrālais pasta orķestra slānis** kas Infinito.Nexus kaudze. Tās vadi kopā:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-cli` framework runs `files/test/test.sh` sourcing variables from `templates/test.env.j2` after each deploy cycle. Check both the deploy output and the CLI test output before declaring a fix complete."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `test-e2e-cli` ietvari `files/test/test.sh` mainīgo lielumu izmantošana `templates/test.env.j2` pēc katra izvēršanas cikla. Pārbaudiet gan izvietot produkciju un CLI testa produkciju pirms pasludinot noteikt pabeigta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role MUST stage `files/playwright/` recursively (so `addons/` is included) and discover specs recursively."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `test-e2e-playwright` MŪSU loma `files/playwright/` rekursīvi (Tātad `addons/` ir iekļauts) un atklāt specs rekursīvi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-e2e-playwright` role discovers Playwright-enabled roles through the presence of `templates/playwright.env.j2`. For each discovered role it:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `test-e2e-playwright` loma atklāj Playwright iespējotas lomas ar klātbūtni `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Par katru atklāto lomu tā:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test-workspace` stage runs the workspace workflow listed in the `Infrastructure tests` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `test-workspace` posms vada darbvirsmas darbplūsmu sarakstā `Infrastructure tests` tabula [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

# [zvana.test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test`
# ventilē bloku, integrāciju, linumu un ārējos komplektus paralēli uz skrējēja
# saimnieka. Tam jāiziet `code-quality-gate`.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `test` job runs [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` fans the unit, integration, lint and external suites out in parallel on the runner host. It MUST pass `code-quality-gate`."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `test` Darbi [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` ventilē bloku, integrāciju, linumu un ārējos komplektus paralēli uz skrējēja saimnieka. Tam jāiziet `code-quality-gate`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `tor` input decides what the onion axis is allowed to do at all:"
msgstr "E ir o pa s `tor` ievade nosaka, ko sīpola ass vispār drīkst darīt:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `users` lookup is the ONLY supported runtime entry point for merged user configuration."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `users` Lookup ir TIKAI atbalstīts runtime ieejas punkts apvienotai lietotāja konfigurācijai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `utils/` tree MUST contain Python helper modules and helper packages only."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `utils/` koka MUST satur Python palīga moduļi un palīga paketes tikai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `vars/main.yml` of the role MUST define the variables referenced in `args:` by reading them from `meta/services.yml` through the `lookup('config', ...)` filter. This keeps `meta/services.yml` as the single source of truth."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `vars/main.yml` par lomu jānosaka mainīgos `args:` Izlasot tos no `meta/services.yml` caur `lookup('config', ...)` filtrs. Tas uztur `meta/services.yml` kā vienīgo patiesības avotu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `version:` MUST stay pinned to an exact Playwright version and distro pair such as `v1.59.1-noble`. You MUST NOT switch this to a mutable tag such as `latest`, because mutable upstream tags are more vulnerable to CDN propagation delays and make flaky CI failures much harder to reason about."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `version:` Jāsaglabā piespraude precīzai Playwright versijai un distro pārim piemēram `v1.59.1-noble`. Jūs NEDRĪKST pārslēgt šo uz mutable tag, piemēram, `latest`, jo mutable augšpusējie tagi ir vairāk neaizsargāti pret CDN izplatīšanās kavējumiem un padarīt pārslveida CI neveiksmes daudz grūtāk spriest par."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `🛡️ Trusted` label flips the build source to the PR head and unlocks the Docker Hub credentials; without it the safe base merge ref is built with no organization secrets. Restrict who may set the label via repository label permissions / branch protection so only maintainers can grant it."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `🛡️ Trusted` Etiķete uzspiež būvēšanas avotu PR galvai un atbloķē Docker Hub akreditācijas datus; bez tās drošā bāze apvieno ref ir veidota bez organizācijas noslēpumiem. Ierobežot, kurš var noteikt etiķeti, izmantojot repozitorija etiķetes atļaujas / filiāles aizsardzību, lai tikai uzturētāji var piešķirt to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `🧩 Subset` label must exist in the repository's label set and is applied through the PR labels UI. Both the `pull_request` and `pull_request_target` events carry a `labeled` trigger, so adding it starts a fresh run."
msgstr "E ir o pa s `🧩 Subset` etiķetei jābūt repozitorija etiķešu komplektā, un to piemēro, izmantojot PR etiķetes UI. Gan `pull_request` kā arī `pull_request_target` blakusparādībām Jums izpaužas smagi, lūdzu izstāstiet to savam ārstam vai farmaceitam. `labeled` trigeris, tāpēc pievienojot tas sākas jaunu palaist."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The access token paired with `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."
msgstr "Piekļuvi marķierierīcei savieno ar `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The action masks its own result: the fact is the whole rendered tree with every application's credentials, so it never reaches a log regardless of `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."
msgstr "Darbība maskē savu rezultātu: fakts ir viss renderēts koks ar katru pieteikumu akreditācijas, tāpēc tas nekad sasniedz log neatkarīgi no `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The active window has a default retention of 7 entries. A higher count is fine for short bursts of releases, but the active changelog SHOULD stay short enough that scrolling it is cheap."
msgstr "Aktīvajam logam ir noklusētā saglabāšana 7 ierakstus. Lielāks skaits ir soda par īsiem pārrāvumiem releases, bet aktīvais changelog būtu palikt pietiekami īss, ka ritinot tas ir lēts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The actual app deploy runs inside a **sealed throwaway Docker daemon** and is torn down on exit, so the host's own stack is never touched. Several runners can share one host (or coexist with other workloads) safely."
msgstr "Faktiskā lietotnes izvietošana darbojas iekšpusē a **aizvākots metamais dokera dēmons** un ir torn uz leju izejot, tāpēc uzņēmēja paša kaudze nekad nav pieskāries. Vairāki skrējēji var dalīties vienā saimniekā (vai līdzās citām darba slodzēm) droši."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` instead. A lint that rejects the placeholder has to land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "Uzgalis `digest` nepieskaras. Visi desmit `implementation: adapter` lomas veikt identisku vietturis `sha256:` seko sešdesmit četras nulles, shēma tikai pārbauda, ka priedēklis, un darbojas attēls ir atrisināts caur `lookup('container_image', …)` vietā. Slīpam, kas noraida vietturi, jānolaižas kopā ar īstiem sagremojumiem, nevis pirms tiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Tas ir tas, kas to saista. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) nosauc deviņus lasīt rīkus `calendar`, `contacts` kā arī `files` — trīs kategorijas, kuru `is_available` ir beznosacījumu, tāpēc komplekts neatšķiras no kuriem izvēles progr izvietošanas instalēt. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` atsaka jebkuru rīku ārpus šī saraksta un jebkuru rīku, kas ir marķēts `mutating` kamēr `mutating_tools_enabled` ir nepatiess, un tas atsakās sākt vispār, ja līgums ir `schema_sha256` neatbilst failam. Atteikums notiek blakusvāģī, tāpēc tas pieder katram klientam neatkarīgi no tā, ko katrs renderē lokāli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Tas ir tas, kas to saista. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` neatbilst failam. Atteikums notiek blakusvāģī, tāpēc tas pieder katram klientam neatkarīgi no tā, ko katrs renderē lokāli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` to the provider in the header named by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (default `Authorization`), formatted by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (default `Bearer {key}`, where `{key}` is the credential)."
msgstr "Uzgaļa `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` pakalpojuma sniedzējam galvenē, ko sauc `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (noklusētais `Authorization`), noformēts ar `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (noklusētais `Bearer {key}`, kur `{key}` ir credential)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`` to the provider in the header named by ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER`` (default ``Authorization``), formatted by ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT`` (default ``Bearer {key}``, where ``{key}`` is the credential)."
msgstr "Uzgaļa ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`` pakalpojuma sniedzējam galvenē, ko sauc ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER`` (noklusētais ``Authorization``), noformēts ar ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT`` (noklusētais ``Bearer {key}``, kur ``{key}`` ir credential)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The admin UI sits behind Keycloak"
msgstr "Admin UI atrodas aizmugurē Keycloak"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The admin assertion MUST additionally prove admin authorisation (admin panel, management menu, \"Users\" / \"Settings\" / \"Administration\" link visible in the DOM). A scenario that lands on the same surface as `biber` and stops there MUST NOT claim admin coverage."
msgstr "Admin apgalvojums papildus jāpierāda admin atļauja (admin panelis, vadības izvēlne, \"Users\" / \"Settings\" / \"Administration\" DOM redzamā saite). Scenārijs, kas nolaižas uz tās pašas virsmas, kā `biber` un apstājas tur NEDRĪKST pieprasīt admin segumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator is provisioned as an `XWiki.XWikiUsers` object without a `password` property (see [`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`](./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2)), and every privileged operation of the role authenticates as the built-in `superadmin` with `credentials.superadminpassword`. Neither credential is the Keycloak secret the shared persona helpers submit, and `biber` has no XWiki user page at all — only the administrator page is created ([`tasks/03_administrator.yml`](./tasks/03_administrator.yml)) — while the OIDC group mapping stays commented out in [`templates/xwiki.properties.j2`](./templates/xwiki.properties.j2). [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The Keycloak coupling is instead proven through XWiki's own login action by the addon spec [`files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`](./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js)."
msgstr "Administratoram ir `XWiki.XWikiUsers` objekts bez `password` Īpašība (skatīt [`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`](./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2)), un katra priviliģētā darbība lomu autentificē kā iebūvēto `superadmin` kur: `credentials.superadminpassword`. Ne akreditācijas nav Keycloak slepenībā kopīgo personu palīgi iesniedz, un `biber` nav XWiki lietotāja lapa vispār — tiek izveidota tikai administratora lapa ([`tasks/03_administrator.yml`](./tasks/03_administrator.yml)) — kamēr OIDC grupas kartēšana paliek komentēts [`templates/xwiki.properties.j2`](./templates/xwiki.properties.j2). [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) tādēļ deklarē `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` kā arī `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Keycloak tā vietā ir pierādīts, izmantojot XWikipaša pieteikšanās darbība ar addon spec [`files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`](./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator is provisioned as an ``XWiki.XWikiUsers`` object without a ``password`` property (see ```templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`` <./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2>`__), and every privileged operation of the role authenticates as the built-in ``superadmin`` with ``credentials.superadminpassword``. Neither credential is the Keycloak secret the shared persona helpers submit, and ``biber`` has no XWiki user page at all — only the administrator page is created (```tasks/03_administrator.yml`` <./tasks/03_administrator.yml>`__) — while the OIDC group mapping stays commented out in ```templates/xwiki.properties.j2`` <./templates/xwiki.properties.j2>`__. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The Keycloak coupling is instead proven through XWiki’s own login action by the addon spec ```files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js>`__."
msgstr "Administratoram ir ``XWiki.XWikiUsers`` objekts bez ``password`` Īpašība (skatīt ```templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`` <./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2>`__), and every privileged operation of the role authenticates as the built-in ``superadmin`` with ``credentials.superadminpassword``. Neither credential is the Keycloak secret the shared persona helpers submit, and ``biber`` has no XWiki user page at all — only the administrator page is created (```tasks/03_administrator.yml`` <./tasks/03_administrator.yml>`__) — while the OIDC group mapping stays commented out in ```templates/xwiki.properties.j2`` <./templates/xwiki.properties.j2>`__. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The Keycloak coupling is instead proven through XWiki’s own login action by the addon spec ```files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js>` ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, which drives the native form and the ``module=Login&action=logout`` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Administratora ceļojums ir apskatīts ``files/playwright/auth.spec.js``, kas vada vietējo formu un ``module=Login&action=logout`` izrakstīšanās. Tam pašam failam pieder noliedzošs-profesionāls, kas pierāda, ka biber nevar sasniegt admin virsmu — pakalpojuma sniedzēja puses apgalvojums, ka personas palīgi apzināti vairs nedublē. Ceļš atpakaļ uz vispārējo personu ir Keycloak klients Matomo plus uz lietotāju grupām orientēti noteikumi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: the integrated OIDC path is proven at the STS ``AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`` tier, and the LDAP variant additionally drives the Console form login and logout. The path back to the generic administrator persona is a Console build that surfaces the configured IdP on its login form."
msgstr "Administratora ceļojums ir apskatīts ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: integrētais OIDC ceļš ir pierādīts pie STS ``AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity`` līmenis, un LDAP variants papildus vada Console formas pieteikšanās un atteikšanās. Ceļš atpakaļ uz ģenērisko administratoru persona ir Console būvēt, kas virsmas konfigurēto IdP savā pieteikšanās formā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/auth.spec.js`, which drives the native form and the `module=Login&action=logout` sign-out. The same file owns the deny-probe proving biber cannot reach the admin surface — the provider-side assertion the persona helpers deliberately no longer duplicate. The path back to the generic personas is a Keycloak client for Matomo plus group-driven user provisioning."
msgstr "Administratora ceļojums ir apskatīts `files/playwright/auth.spec.js`, kas vada vietējo formu un `module=Login&action=logout` izrakstīšanās. Tam pašam failam pieder noliedzošs-profesionāls, kas pierāda, ka biber nevar sasniegt admin virsmu — pakalpojuma sniedzēja puses apgalvojums, ka personas palīgi apzināti vairs nedublē. Ceļš atpakaļ uz vispārējo personu ir Keycloak klients Matomo plus uz lietotāju grupām orientēti noteikumi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The administrator journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: the integrated OIDC path is proven at the STS `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` tier, and the LDAP variant additionally drives the Console form login and logout. The path back to the generic administrator persona is a Console build that surfaces the configured IdP on its login form."
msgstr "Administratora ceļojums ir apskatīts `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`: integrētais OIDC ceļš ir pierādīts pie STS `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` līmenis, un LDAP variants papildus vada Console formas pieteikšanās un atteikšanās. Ceļš atpakaļ uz ģenērisko administratoru persona ir Console būvēt, kas virsmas konfigurēto IdP savā pieteikšanās formā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The advertised tool contract matches what the hub serves"
msgstr "Reklamētā rīka līgums atbilst tam, ko centrmezgls apkalpo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MAY bind listening sockets on `localhost` (e.g. `make compose-up`, `python -m http.server`, dev servers). Required for any local end-to-end testing."
msgstr "Aģents VAR saistīt klausīšanās ligzdas `localhost` (Piemēram, `make compose-up`, `python -m http.server`, dev serveri). Vajadzīgs jebkurai vietējai testēšanai no gala līdz galam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MAY write to the paths listed in `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite`. All other paths are read-only by default."
msgstr "Aģents VAR rakstīt uz ceļiem, kas uzskaitīti `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite`. Visi pārējie ceļi ir lasāms tikai pēc noklusējuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT create any git commit until every Acceptance Criterion in this document is checked off (`- [x]`)."
msgstr "Aģents NEDRĪKST neradīt nekādas saistības, kamēr nav pārbaudīts katrs pieņemšanas kritērijs šajā dokumentā (`- [x]`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT interrupt work to ask about tier changes. Recommendations appear as a single line at the start of the next response after the threshold is crossed."
msgstr "Aģents NEDRĪKST pārtraukt darbu, lai jautātu par līmeņu izmaiņām. Ieteikumi parādās kā viena rinda nākamās atbildes sākumā pēc sliekšņa pārsniegšanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT repeat this notice within the same conversation."
msgstr "Aģents nedrīkst atkārtot šo paziņojumu tajā pašā sarunā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST NOT run `git checkout`, `git switch`, or any other command that changes `HEAD`, stages files, or modifies the working tree. `git push` operates on refs by name and does not require `<branch>` to be checked out. The push goes to the local `origin` remote."
msgstr "Aģents nedrīkst palaist `git checkout`, `git switch`, vai jebkura cita komanda, kas mainās `HEAD`, posmi failus, vai maina darba koku. `git push` darbojas pēc nosaukuma un neprasa `<branch>` tiks pārbaudīts. Grūdienu dodas uz vietējo `origin` attālināti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST execute this requirement **autonomously** once Proposed Decisions are confirmed. Open clarifications only when a decision is genuinely ambiguous and would otherwise block progress; default to the intent already captured in this document and proceed."
msgstr "Pārstāvim jāizpilda šī prasība **autonomi** pēc ierosināto lēmumu apstiprināšanas. Atklāti precizējumi tikai tad, ja lēmums patiešām ir neskaidrs un pretējā gadījumā bloķētu progresu; noklusējums šajā dokumentā jau ietvertajam mērķim un turpinās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent MUST execute this requirement **autonomously**. Open clarifications only when a decision is genuinely ambiguous and would otherwise block progress; default to the intent already captured in this document and proceed. Avoid back-and-forth questions on choices already resolved in [Confirmed Decisions](#confirmed-decisions)."
msgstr "Pārstāvim jāizpilda šī prasība **autonomi**. Atklāti precizējumi tikai tad, ja lēmums patiešām ir neskaidrs un citādi bloķētu progresu; noklusējums šajā dokumentā jau ietvertajam mērķim un turpinās. Izvairieties no jautājumiem par jau atrisinātajām izvēlēm [Apstiprinātie lēmumi](#confirmed-decisions)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent can do anything the granted devices allow. A GPIO or I2C grant means it can drive whatever is wired to those pins; a video grant means it can watch the room; a serial grant means it can talk to whatever sits on the bus. The allowlist is the entire boundary, which is why an empty one is refused and why the device must be dedicated, single-tenant and network-segmented."
msgstr "Aģents var darīt jebko, ko ļauj piešķirtās ierīces. GPIO vai I2C dotācija nozīmē, ka tā var vadīt neatkarīgi no tā, kas ir vadus ar šīm tapām; video dotācija nozīmē, ka tā var skatīties telpā; sērijas dotācija nozīmē, ka tā var runāt ar jebkuru sēž uz autobusa. Atļauju saraksts ir visa robeža, tāpēc tukšo atsaka un tāpēc ierīcei jābūt veltītai, vienam tenantam un tīkla segmentam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent holds no model credential: it calls `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`, and the broker relays the call to LiteLLM with the broker's own virtual key and the owner in the OpenAI `user` field, and logs a `relay` event with owner, platform, path and upstream status."
msgstr "Aģentam nav modeļa akreditācijas: tas sauc `http://agent-broker:<port>/llm/v1`, un brokeris relays zvanu uz LiteLLM ar brokera paša virtuālo atslēgu un īpašnieks OpenAI `user` lauks un apaļkoki a `relay` notikums ar īpašnieku, platformu, ceļu un augšpusējo statusu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent images run on arm64"
msgstr "Aģenta attēli darbojas uz rokas64"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent speaks the Anthropic Messages API, which the LiteLLM gateway serves alongside its OpenAI routes. The role writes ``~/.claude/settings.json`` with an ``env`` block carrying the gateway URL, the workstation’s key and the model aliases to use, so every request leaves the machine through the gateway and is accounted there."
msgstr "Aģents runā Antropiskās vēstis API, ko LiteLLM vārteja kalpo līdzās saviem OpenAI maršrutiem. Loma raksta ``~/.claude/settings.json`` ar ``env`` bloķēt līdzi vārtejas URL, darbstacijas atslēgu un modeļa aizstājvārdus izmantot, tāpēc katrs pieprasījums atstāj mašīnu caur vārteju un tiek uzskaitīts tur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agent speaks the Anthropic Messages API, which the LiteLLM gateway serves alongside its OpenAI routes. The role writes `~/.claude/settings.json` with an `env` block carrying the gateway URL, the workstation's key and the model aliases to use, so every request leaves the machine through the gateway and is accounted there."
msgstr "Aģents runā Antropiskās vēstis API, ko LiteLLM vārteja kalpo līdzās saviem OpenAI maršrutiem. Loma raksta `~/.claude/settings.json` ar `env` bloķēt līdzi vārtejas URL, darbstacijas atslēgu un modeļa segvārdus izmantot, tāpēc katrs pieprasījums atstāj mašīnu caur vārteju un tiek uzskaitīts tur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The agents are real, self-hostable, open-source platforms, each deployed as its own role:"
msgstr "Aģenti ir reālas, pašpietiekamas, atvērtā pirmkoda platformas, katra izvietota kā sava loma:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The alias is served and is not read as a route without a backend"
msgstr "Segvārds tiek pasniegts un netiek lasīts kā maršruts bez aizmugures"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The alias raises rather than serving a default"
msgstr "Aizstājvārdu rada nevis apkalpo noklusējuma"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The alias routes rather than falling back, proven by the model that answers"
msgstr "Aizstājvārdu maršruti, nevis krīt atpakaļ, ko pierāda modelis, kas atbild"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The allowlist covers the `Bash(*)` wildcard plus the non-Bash tools (`Read`, `Edit`, `Write`, `WebSearch`) and per-domain `WebFetch` entries (the wildcard form is inert, see row below). The real gating for Bash lives in the `ask` and `deny` lists below: mutating `gh`/`docker`/`git` shapes land in `ask`, and structurally destructive shapes (`rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, shell loops, `git push --force*`, mutating `gh api` verbs, etc.) are blocked outright by `deny`. The sandbox (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`) bounds the blast radius of everything that does execute."
msgstr "Atļauju saraksts aptver: `Bash(*)` tramplīns plus ne- bash rīki (`Read`, `Edit`, `Write`, `WebSearch`) un katram domēnam `WebFetch` ieraksti (aizstājējzīmju forma ir inerta, skatīt rindu zemāk;). Īstais vārtu Bash dzīvo `ask` kā arī `deny` turpmāk uzskaitītie saraksti: mutatis mutandis `gh`/`docker`/`git` veido zemi `ask`, un strukturāli postošas formas (`rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, čaulas cilpas, `git push --force*`, mutatis mutandis `gh api` darbības vārdi utt.) tiek bloķēti tieši ar `deny`. Smilšu kaste (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`) ierobežo sprādziena rādiuss visu, kas izpilda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The anonymous volume cleanup service."
msgstr "Anonīmā apjoma tīrīšanas pakalpojums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ansible flavor maps each true flag to the matching ``matrix_<bridge>_enabled`` MDAD var; the compose flavor builds the ``MATRIX_BRIDGES`` loop from the enabled ``mechanism: bridge`` addons (see Addons below)."
msgstr "Ansible aromāts kartes katru patieso karogu uz saskaņošanas ``matrix_<bridge>_enabled`` MDAD var; komponētais aromāts ``MATRIX_BRIDGES`` cilpa no ieslēgta ``mechanism: bridge`` addons (skatīt papildinājumus zemāk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ansible flavor maps each true flag to the matching `matrix_<bridge>_enabled` MDAD var; the compose flavor builds the `MATRIX_BRIDGES` loop from the enabled `mechanism: bridge` addons (see Addons below)."
msgstr "Ansible aromāts kartes katru patieso karogu uz saskaņošanas `matrix_<bridge>_enabled` MDAD var; komponētais aromāts `MATRIX_BRIDGES` cilpa no ieslēgta `mechanism: bridge` addons (skatīt papildinājumus zemāk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ansible-flavor tasks render an MDAD inventory under `{{ instance_dir }}mdad/inventory/host_vars/matrix.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}/vars.yml` from a Jinja template (`templates/flavor/ansible/mdad-vars.yml.j2`). The infinito-nexus role then invokes MDAD via `ansible.builtin.command` running `ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup.yml --tags={{ playbook_tags }}` against that checkout."
msgstr "Ansible- flavor uzdevumi padara MDAD inventarizāciju saskaņā ar `{{ instance_dir }}mdad/inventory/host_vars/matrix.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}/vars.yml` no Jinja veidnes (`templates/flavor/ansible/mdad-vars.yml.j2`). Infinito-nexus loma tad atsaucas uz MDAD, izmantojot `ansible.builtin.command` darbojas `ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup.yml --tags={{ playbook_tags }}` pret šo izrakstīšanās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app does not require sessions or queues (rarely safe)"
msgstr "Programmai nav nepieciešamas sesijas vai rindas (reti drošs)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app password never reaches a client. Clients present ``credentials.mcp_bearer`` to the sidecar; the sidecar presents the app password upstream. Revoking one does not revoke the other."
msgstr "Lietotnes parole nekad nesasniedz klientu. Klātesošie klienti ``credentials.mcp_bearer`` blakusvāģim; blakusvāģis piedāvā lietotnes paroli augšpusē. Viena atcelšana neatceļ otru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app password never reaches a client. Clients present `credentials.mcp_bearer` to the sidecar; the sidecar presents the app password upstream. Revoking one does not revoke the other."
msgstr "Lietotnes parole nekad nesasniedz klientu. Klātesošie klienti `credentials.mcp_bearer` blakusvāģim; blakusvāģis piedāvā lietotnes paroli augšpusē. Viena atcelšana neatceļ otru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app runs as a single Docker container and requires no database or backend setup, enabling secure and frictionless QR generation anywhere."
msgstr "Lietotne darbojas kā viens Docker konteiners un tai nav nepieciešama datubāzes vai aizmugures iestatīšana, kas ļauj droši un bezriska QR ģenerēt jebkur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app stack for `<role>` is still running."
msgstr "Lietotnes kaudze priekš `<role>` joprojām darbojas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application loader (`utils/cache/applications.py`) reads every `meta/addons/<id>.yml` like the other file-rooted meta topics and **normalises the enable state**: `required: true` defaults to enabled, an optional addon defaults to disabled, and an explicit `enabled` value is preserved verbatim. No new repo-wide dictionary is introduced."
msgstr "Piemērošanas iekrāvējs (`utils/cache/applications.py`) lasīt katru `meta/addons/<id>.yml` tāpat kā citi failu rooted meta tēmas un **normalizē iespējoto stāvokli**: `required: true` noklusētais, ko ieslēgt, optional addon defaults to disabled, and a defined `enabled` vērtība tiek saglabāta stenogramma. Nav ieviesta jauna repo mēroga vārdnīca."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application ships no logout control at `2026.6.16`, so the Playwright administrator persona is declared blocked."
msgstr "Pieteikšanās kuģi nav atteikšanās kontrole pie `2026.6.16`, tāpēc Playwright administrators persona tiek pasludināta par bloķētu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application ships no logout control at ``2026.6.16``, so the Playwright administrator persona is declared blocked."
msgstr "Pieteikšanās kuģi nav atteikšanās kontrole pie ``2026.6.16``, tāpēc Playwright administrators persona tiek pasludināta par bloķētu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The application_id to match."
msgstr "E ir o pa s application_id lai atbilstu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The apps each variant round of *app* deploys."
msgstr "Lietotnes katra varianta cikla *lietotne* izvieto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The appview is useful without the bridge; the bridge is useless without both endpoints. Separable lifecycle, separable failure domain."
msgstr "Apskate ir noderīga bez tilta; tilts ir nederīgs bez abiem galapunktiem. Atdalāms dzīves cikls, atdalāms atteices domēns."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is built around one simple idea: keep the parts small, explicit, and reusable, then combine them into a full stack only when a bundle needs them."
msgstr "Arhitektūra ir veidota ap vienu vienkāršu ideju: saglabāt detaļas mazas, skaidri, un atkārtoti izmantojamas, tad apvienot tos pilnā kaudze tikai tad, kad saišķis nepieciešams tos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is replayed like the distro rather than left to the rotation: it is the machine the job ran on, not a preference the deploy may fall back from, so the title states what it actually was."
msgstr "Arhitektūra tiek replayed kā distro, nevis pa kreisi uz rotāciju: tas ir mašīna darbs skrēja, nevis priekšrocība izvietošana var atkāpties no, tāpēc nosaukums norāda, kas tas patiesībā bija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architecture is the one axis a deploy job cannot apply to itself: the distro is installed and the filesystem is built, but the CPU arrives with the runner. The matrix therefore carries the runner label with the row (`ubuntu-latest` for amd64, `ubuntu-24.04-arm` for arm64), `runs-on` reads it, and the job asserts `uname -m` against what it was assigned before deploying anything, so a label that stops resolving to arm64 hardware fails loudly instead of reporting an arm64 row green from an amd64 machine."
msgstr "Arhitektūra ir viena ass, uz kuru izvietošanas darbs nevar attiecināt sevi: distro ir uzstādīts un tiek uzbūvēta failu sistēma, bet CPU ierodas kopā ar skrējēju. Tāpēc matrica nes skrējēja etiķeti ar rindu (`ubuntu-latest` lietošanai64, `ubuntu-24.04-arm` Rokai64), `runs-on` lasa to, un darbs apgalvo `uname -m` pret to, kas tas tika piešķirts pirms izvietojot kaut ko, tā etiķete, kas pārtrauc atrisināt roku64 aparatūra neizdodas skaļi, nevis ziņo roku64 rinda zaļa no amd64 mašīna."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The architectures one role's rows may draw from this run."
msgstr "Arhitektūrā viena loma rindas var izdarīt no šīs kārtas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The archive CLI is byte-idempotent. Re-running it on an already-processed tree leaves every file unchanged: CHANGELOG.md is rewritten only when its target content differs from disk, the per-release archive files are never overwritten, and the package changelogs are only rewritten when the regenerated content differs from disk. This makes it safe to run from a pre-commit hook, a release script, or by hand without keeping track of state."
msgstr "Arhīvs CLI ir baitu idempotents. Atkārtota darbināšana uz jau apstrādāta koka atstāj katru failu nemainītu: CHANGELOG.md tiek pārrakstīts tikai tad, ja tā mērķa saturs atšķiras no diska, per-release arhīva faili nekad netiek pārrakstīti, un pakotņu changelogi tiek pārrakstīti tikai tad, kad atjaunotais saturs atšķiras no diska. Tas padara to droši palaist no pre-commit āķis, atbrīvošanas skripts, vai ar rokām, nesekojot stāvokli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The argv list, proxy-free."
msgstr "Argv saraksts, bez starpniekservera."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The artefacts (`*.sql.gz`, `*-files.tar`, `*-private-files.tar`) land under `/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/` inside the backend container."
msgstr "Artefakti (`*.sql.gz`, `*-files.tar`, `*-private-files.tar`) zeme zem `/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/` aizmugures konteinerā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The artefacts (``*.sql.gz``, ``*-files.tar``, ``*-private-files.tar``) land under ``/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/`` inside the backend container."
msgstr "Artefakti (``*.sql.gz``, ``*-files.tar``, ``*-private-files.tar``) zeme zem ``/home/frappe/frappe-bench/sites/next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/private/backups/`` aizmugures konteinerā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The asset host for the current deployment: the internal CDN origin when web-svc-cdn is deployed with flavor internal, else jsdelivr."
msgstr "Pašreizējās izvēršanas aktīvu resursdators: CDN iekšējā izcelsme, kad web-svc-cdn tiek izvērsta ar garšu iekšējo, citi jsdelivr."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The audit MUST classify these as `db-extension` (out of scope), so a later sweep does not mistake them for app addons. If a future role mixes app addons and DB extensions under one key, the migration MUST split them by destination."
msgstr "Revīzijā tie jāklasificē kā: `db-extension` (ārpus darbības jomas), tāpēc vēlāk slaucīšana nav kļūda viņiem par app addons. Ja nākotnes loma sajauc lietotnes addons un DB paplašinājumus ar vienu atslēgu, migrācijai tie jāsadala pēc galamērķa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The audit is the role tree itself: every fact about a role's MCP surface lives in its own `meta/services.yml`, so a separate artifact would be a copy that can go stale. `grep -l '^mcp:' roles/*/meta/services.yml` enumerates the integrated roles."
msgstr "Revīzija ir pats lomu koks: katrs fakts par lomu MCP virsmas dzīvo savā `meta/services.yml`, tāpēc atsevišķs artefakts būtu kopija, kas var iet strupceļā. `grep -l '^mcp:' roles/*/meta/services.yml` uzskaita integrētās lomas."

# bars tas nedrīkst būt ``host-gateway``: ka segvārds atrisina vienu mezglu,
# bet openresty publicē :80 kur: ``mode: host`` zem ``node.role == manager``,
# tāpēc katra kopija uz darba ņēmēja uzzvanīja savu vārteju un marķieru
# apmaiņa nomira ar "Connection atteikts" (7b1839681, ko mēra uz piltuves
# 31340965955). Tāpēc Swarm saņem steka saimnieka izcilo adresi -- galamērķi
# svc-net-tor jau sūta visu slēpto pakalpojumu satiksmes. ``ansible_facts``
# nes to, jo komposs fails tiek renderēts vienreiz ar pārvaldnieku kā
# inventāra resursdatoru un bars piemēro pats ``extra_hosts`` katram
# uzdevumam.
