# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The entity-keyed purge primitive ``scripts/container/purge/entity/nginx.sh`` (driven by the app-keyed orchestrator ``apps.sh`` as a sibling of ``db.sh``, ``compose.sh``, ``dir.sh``) invokes this module to remove the vhost files belonging to a given compose entity. The mapping entity -> apps -> domains is resolved via ``utils.roles.entity.apps.apps_for_entity`` plus ``utils.domains.list.build_applications_from_roles`` / ``utils.domains.application_domain_index.iter_app_domains`` so the helper stays ansible-free and runnable inside the infinito container without a templar context."
msgstr "Organisma atslēgas tīrīšanas primitīvs ``scripts/container/purge/entity/nginx.sh`` (vadījis lietotnes taustiņu orķestris ``apps.sh`` kā brālis vai māsa ``db.sh``, ``compose.sh``, ``dir.sh``) izmanto šo moduli, lai noņemtu vhost failus, kas pieder konkrētā komponēt vienību. Kartēšanas vienība -> lietotnes -> domēni tiek atrisināti caur ``utils.roles.entity.apps.apps_for_entity`` plus ``utils.domains.list.build_applications_from_roles`` / ``utils.domains.application_domain_index.iter_app_domains`` līdz ar to palīgs bez trauka bez trauka bez trauka ir vadāms un nevaldāms."

