msgstr "NEDRĪKST veikt šādas funkcijas: `BIBER_*` env taustiņus, ne biber scenārijs; aizverot katru objektu ir NOOP izņemot, kad strupe env-key parādās; tādā gadījumā noņemt to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following roles have an MCP surface confirmed from upstream or project-owned documentation at requirement creation time. Each row is an implementation candidate, not proof that the current role already exposes MCP."
msgstr "Turpmāk minētajām lomām ir MCP virsma, kas apstiprināta no augšpusējai vai projektam piederošas dokumentācijas prasību izstrādes laikā. Katra rinda ir īstenošanas kandidāts, nevis pierādījums, ka pašreizējā loma jau pakļauj MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The following roles have an upstream MCP path that this deployment cannot use. Each declares a `services.mcp` block carrying only `blocker`, `source_url` and `notes`, with `enabled` and `shared` false, so the role stays out of discovery while the audit still reports why it is not integrated:"
msgstr "Turpmāk minētajiem uzdevumiem ir augšupējs MCP ceļš, ko izvēršana nevar izmantot. Katrs paziņo a `services.mcp` tikai bloku `blocker`, `source_url` kā arī `notes`, kur `enabled` kā arī `shared` Aplams, tāpēc loma paliek no atklāšanas, kamēr revīzija joprojām ziņo, kāpēc tā nav integrēta:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The format is the docker-compose `.env`-subset: flat `KEY=value` lines, `#` for comments, optional surrounding double/single quotes for values that contain whitespace or special characters. Anything more exotic (nested mappings, multiline values, variable expansion) is rejected so drift between the file and its consumers stays loud."
msgstr "Formāts ir docker-kompozīts `.env`-apakškomplekts: plakans `KEY=value` līnijas, `#` atsauksmēm – fakultatīvi ap dubultu/vienu pēdiņu vērtībām, kas satur atstarpi vai īpašas rakstzīmes. Jebkas eksotiskāks (ligzdotā kartēšana, daudzrindu vērtības, mainīga paplašināšana) tiek noraidīta, tāpēc tiek saglabāta skaļa atšķirība starp lietu un tās patērētājiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The former `roles/web-app-nextcloud/vars/plugins/sociallogin.yml` is deleted; the install/enable/configure tasks read `applications.web-app-nextcloud.addons.sociallogin.config` instead."
msgstr "Pirmais `roles/web-app-nextcloud/vars/plugins/sociallogin.yml` svītro; install/enable/configure Nolasīti uzdevumi `applications.web-app-nextcloud.addons.sociallogin.config` vietā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The forward is per-variant: `meta/variants.yml` may drop the flag, and the role then loses the `HiddenServicePort` in that variant."
msgstr "Priekšpostenis katram variantam: `meta/variants.yml` var nomest karogu, un loma tad zaudē `HiddenServicePort` šajā variantā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The four served schemas are pinned in [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) and hashed into `tools.schema_sha256`; the adapter refuses to start when the two disagree."
msgstr "Četras pasniegtās shēmas ir iestrādātas [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) un ir iestājies `tools.schema_sha256`; adapteris atsakās sākt, kad abi nepiekrīt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The four served schemas are pinned in ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ and hashed into ``tools.schema_sha256``; the adapter refuses to start when the two disagree."
msgstr "Četras pasniegtās shēmas ir iestrādātas ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ and hashed into ``tools.schema_sha256``; adapteris atsakās sākt, kad abi nepiekrīt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The front-page CSP + canonical-domain baseline is ungated and always runs."
msgstr "Priekšējās lapas CSP + kanonisko domēnu bāzes līnija ir ungated un vienmēr iet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full CSP test surface lives in the same module: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (returns the parsed directive map), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (verifies the optional `<meta http-equiv>` echo is a subset of the response header), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM-side `securitypolicyviolation` capture), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (asserts neither the DOM stream nor `diagnostics.cspRelated` carries a violation), and the `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` constant. Specs MUST require these from `./personas`; inline copies are forbidden and caught at review."
msgstr "Pilna CSP testa virsma atrodas tajā pašā modulī: `assertCspResponseHeader(response, label)` (atgriež parsētās direktīvas karti), `assertCspMetaParity(page, headerDirectives, label)` (pārbauda izvēles `<meta http-equiv>` eholote ir atbildes galvenes apakškopa), `installCspViolationObserver(page)` + `readCspViolations(page)` (DOM- puse `securitypolicyviolation` Notveršana), `expectNoCspViolations(page, diagnostics, label)` (neapgalvo ne DOM plūsmu, ne `diagnostics.cspRelated` izdara pārkāpumu), kā arī `EXPECTED_CSP_DIRECTIVES` konstanti. Īpaši noteikumi ir nepieciešams tos no `./personas`; tiešsaistes kopijas ir aizliegtas un nozvejotas pie pārskatīšanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full branch name MUST follow one of the patterns below, depending on whether the change targets a specific role or is general:"
msgstr "Pilns filiāles nosaukums jāievēro viens no modeļiem zemāk, atkarībā no tā, vai izmaiņas mērķi konkrētu lomu vai ir vispārēja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full contributor guide is available at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Pilnīgs ceļvedis ir pieejams [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full documentation portal is available at [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."
msgstr "Pilns dokumentācijas portāls ir pieejams [docs.infinito.nexus](https://docs.infinito.nexus/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The full path string."
msgstr "Pilna ceļa virkne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gate is applied inside [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), which the `run-policy` job invokes. When `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` and `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, the job emits `should_run=false` and every downstream job is skipped."
msgstr "Vārti tiek piemēroti iekšpusē [push_ci_policy.sh](../../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/push_ci_policy.sh), ko `run-policy` darba izsaukumi. Kad `GITHUB_REF == refs/heads/main` kā arī `CI_RUN_ON_MAIN != 'true'`, darba rada `should_run=false` un katrs pakārtotais darbs tiek izlaists."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway is therefore pinned on **variant 2** for every consumer that ships three variants, and left on variant 0 for the two-variant roles, whose round 2 falls back to it. One `make compose-deploy variant=2` run exercises eight of the nine confirmed roles. `web-app-nextcloud` is the exception: its AI surface has always lived on its own variant 7, alongside the other bridged partners it distributes across budget bins."
msgstr "Vārteja tāpēc ir piespraude **variants 2** katram patērētājam, kas kuģi trīs variantus, un atstāj uz varianta 0 divvariantu lomām, kuru 2 atgriežas pie tā. Viens `make compose-deploy variant=2` vada vingrinājumus astoņas no deviņām apstiprinātajām lomām. `web-app-nextcloud` ir izņēmums: tā AI virsma vienmēr ir dzīvojusi ar savu variantu 7, kopā ar citiem pagaidu partneriem tas sadala pa budžeta tvertnēm."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway mints its virtual keys from the inventory it is deployed from, and a workstation is deployed from a different one. The key is therefore an operator-supplied credential on the workstation side: mint it on the server, then put it into the workstation inventory."
msgstr "Vārtejas kaltuves savas virtuālās atslēgas no inventāra tas ir izvietots no, un darbstacija ir izvietota no cita. Tādēļ atslēga ir operatora izsniegts kredīts darbstacijas pusē: kalt to uz servera, tad nodot to darbstacijas inventāra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `anthropic/*` model"
msgstr "Vārteja publicē `anthropic/*` modelis"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `openai/*` model, and the CLI test asserts their absence"
msgstr "Vārteja publicē `openai/*` modelis, un CLI tests apgalvo, ka nav"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The gateway publishes no `openrouter/auto` model"
msgstr "Vārteja publicē `openrouter/auto` modelis"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated Root CA certificate can be injected into containers (e.g. via `sys-svc-compose-ca`) so that containers trust your internal TLS endpoints."
msgstr "Izveidoto Saknes CA sertifikātu var ievadīt konteineros (piem., izmantojot `sys-svc-compose-ca`) lai konteineri uzticētos jūsu iekšējiem TLS parametriem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated Root CA certificate can be injected into containers (e.g. via ``sys-svc-compose-ca``) so that containers trust your internal TLS endpoints."
msgstr "Izveidoto Saknes CA sertifikātu var ievadīt konteineros (piem., izmantojot ``sys-svc-compose-ca``) lai konteineri uzticētos jūsu iekšējiem TLS parametriem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generated `.env` is the single effective configuration source for all tooling. `make dotenv` composes it from `default.env`, the environment handlers, and finally your personal `custom.env`."
msgstr "Izveidotais `.env` ir vienīgais efektīvais konfigurācijas avots visiem instrumentiem. `make dotenv` Sastāv no `default.env`, vides apstrādātāji, un visbeidzot savu personīgo `custom.env`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generation layout belongs to baudolo, which writes it, so the file names and subdirectory below are read from the generation's own manifest rather than restated here. Restating them would let a rename on its side leave the globs matching nothing, which reads as \"this generation holds no databases\" rather than as a failure."
msgstr "Paaudzes izkārtojums pieder baudolo, kas to raksta, tāpēc zemāk esošie failu nosaukumi un apakšdirektorijs tiek lasīti no pašas paaudzes manifesta, nevis šeit atjaunoti. Atjaunojot tos ļautu pārdēvēt tās pusē atstāt globs saskaņojot neko, kas skan kā \"šai paaudzei nav datubāzu\" nevis kā neveiksme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generator owns only the sections it can derive from metadata:"
msgstr "Ģeneratoram pieder tikai sadaļas, ko tas var iegūt no metadatiem:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "Generic dramaturga biber un administratora personas ir bloķētas caur `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` kā arī `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Pants 11 skaidrs atteikums). Bluesky sociālās-app ir mobilā pirmā SPA, kuras atslēgšanās / konta kontrole atrodas aiz profila izvēlnē auth-surface pārbaude nevar sasniegt. Bespoke \"OIDC: auzu2- proxy + pieteikšanās-broker piliens a Bluesky sesija uz social-app caur Keycloak (variants)\" tests un tā LDAP varianta ekvivalents `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` jau pārbaudīt abas personas autentificēties pareizi (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt ir klāt pēc starpnieka nodošanas). Pēc tam, kad stabils selektors sociālo app profila izvēlne nolaižas augšpusē, nometiet atteikumus un ļaujiet persona palīgi vadīt paneļa → app → atteikties brauciena beigām līdz beigām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this deployment is to provide a production-ready, scalable WordPress instance with multisite capabilities and enhanced performance. By automating the custom image build and configuration processes via Docker Compose and Ansible, it minimizes manual intervention, reduces errors, and allows you to concentrate on building great content."
msgstr "Šīs ieviešanas mērķis ir nodrošināt jau saražotu, mērogojamu WordPress piemēram ar daudzvietīgām iespējām un uzlabotu veiktspēju. Automatizējot pielāgotus attēla veidošanas un konfigurācijas procesus caur Docker Compose un Ansible, tas samazina manuālo iejaukšanos, samazina kļūdas, un ļauj koncentrēties uz ēkas lielisku saturu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to deliver a **hassle-free, production-ready reverse proxy** for self-hosted containers, suitable for homelabs and small-scale production workloads."
msgstr "Šīs funkcijas mērķis ir panākt **bez hasle, ražošanas gatavi reversais starpniekserveris** pašsamitētiem konteineriem, kas ir piemēroti homelabs un neliela apjoma ražošanas slodzei."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to provide a **single source of truth for theming** across your infrastructure."
msgstr "Šīs funkcijas mērķis ir nodrošināt **viens patiesības avots viņiem** visā infrastruktūrā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The goal of this role is to provide a **single source of truth for theming** across your infrastructure.   It makes all applications feel like part of the same ecosystem, visually and functionally."
msgstr "Šīs funkcijas mērķis ir nodrošināt **viens patiesības avots viņiem** visā infrastruktūrā. Tas padara visus lietojumus justies kā daļu no vienas ekosistēmas, vizuāli un funkcionāli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The group stays primary. It reaps within seconds of a run being created and needs no runner, while the fallback first has to win a runner slot — from the very pool the superseded sweep is saturating, so it is slowest exactly when it is needed. Measured waits in this repository range from under a minute to about twenty. That is the cost of the fallback, and the reason it is a fallback rather than the mechanism."
msgstr "Grupa paliek primārā. Tas pļauj dažu sekunžu laikā pēc tam, kad tiek izveidots skrējiens, un nav nepieciešams skrējējs, bet atkāpšanās vispirms ir uzvarēt skrējējs slots — no paša baseina aizstātā slaucīšana ir piesātināta, tāpēc tas ir lēnākais tieši tad, kad tas ir nepieciešams. Šajā repozitorijā izmērītie gaidi svārstās no mazāk par minūti līdz aptuveni divdesmit. Tās ir rezerves izmaksas, un iemesls ir atkāpšanās, nevis mehānisms."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper hard-fails on unknown service names. Adding a new gate requires both the env-template flag and at least one `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')` call in the spec; the parity guards [test_env_services_match.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_env_services_match.py) and [test_spec_env_gates.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_spec_env_gates.py) enforce that contract."
msgstr "Palīgs grūti atteicas uz nezināmiem pakalpojumu nosaukumiem. Jaunu vārtu pievienošanai nepieciešams gan intemplāta karogs, gan vismaz viens `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')` izsaukt spec; paritātes aizsargi [test_env_services_match.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_env_services_match.py) kā arī [test_spec_env_gates.py](../../../../../tests/integration/roles/playwright/test_spec_env_gates.py) izpilda šo līgumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper may print:"
msgstr "Palīgs var drukāt:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper module `utils/roles/meta_lookup.py` exposes `get_role_run_after(role) -> list[str]` and `get_role_lifecycle(role) -> str | None`. All consumers of these fields use the helper instead of hand-rolled derivations. The helper returns `[]` / `None` gracefully when `meta/services.yml` is absent or when the field is not set."
msgstr "Palīga modulis `utils/roles/meta_lookup.py` apstarošana `get_role_run_after(role) -> list[str]` kā arī `get_role_lifecycle(role) -> str | None`. Visi šo lauku patērētāji izmanto palīgu, nevis rokas atvasinājumus. Palīdzība atgriežas `[]` / `None` graciozi kad `meta/services.yml` nav klāt vai lauks nav iestatīts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The helper script `BIN_RESOLVE_CONTAINER_ID` is deployed by sys-svc-compose during the constructor stage. It refuses to run on non-manager nodes (exit 64) and reports clear errors when the service has no running task (exit 65) or the task is not yet bound to a container (exit 66)."
msgstr "Palīga skripts `BIN_RESOLVE_CONTAINER_ID` izmanto sys-svc-compose konstruktora darbības laikā. Tas atsakās darboties pa nevadītāja mezgliem (izeja 64) un ziņo skaidras kļūdas, ja pakalpojumam nav darba uzdevuma (izeja 65) vai uzdevums vēl nav saistīts ar konteineru (izeja 66)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The high-level structure:"
msgstr "Augsta līmeņa struktūra:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The history with SAMPLE appended, truncated to the newest WINDOW entries."
msgstr "Vēsture ar pielikumā pievienoto PARAUGU, kas atbilst jaunākajiem WINDOW ierakstiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The hook is looked up via the path constant `NEXTCLOUD_CNODE_PLUGIN_TASKS_PATH` defined in [vars/main.yml](../../../vars/main.yml). Missing files MUST be tolerated; the corresponding step skips cleanly."
msgstr "Āķi uz augšu caur ceļa konstanti `NEXTCLOUD_CNODE_PLUGIN_TASKS_PATH` definēts [vars/main.yml](../../../vars/main.yml). Trūkst failu ir pieļaujams; atbilstošais solis izlaiž tīri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The hook reads every catalogued field a request can act on, not a chosen few: the context window and output cap, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling`, `supports_tool_choice`, `supports_parallel_function_calling`, `supports_response_schema`, `supports_pdf_input`, `supports_audio_input`, `max_images_per_prompt`, `supports_system_messages`, `mode`, `deprecation_date`, both per-token prices, `supports_prompt_caching` and `tpm`."
msgstr "Āķis nolasa katru kataloģizētu lauku, uz kuru pieprasījums var darboties, nevis tikai dažus: konteksta logu un izvada vāciņu, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling`, `supports_tool_choice`, `supports_parallel_function_calling`, `supports_response_schema`, `supports_pdf_input`, `supports_audio_input`, `max_images_per_prompt`, `supports_system_messages`, `mode`, `deprecation_date`, abas cenas uz vienu marķieri, `supports_prompt_caching` kā arī `tpm`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The host environment variable `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` (set on the host shell, by `act --env INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true`, or by the GitHub Actions repository variable forwarded into each `test-deploy-*.yml` workflow as `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP: ${{ vars.INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP }}`)."
msgstr "Saimnieciskās vides mainīgais `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` (iestatīts uz saimnieka čaula, ko `act --env INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP=true`, vai ar GitHub darbību repozitorija mainīgo pārsūtīti katrā `test-deploy-*.yml` darbplūsmu kā `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP: ${{ vars.INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP }}`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The host stays responsible for host-level concerns."
msgstr "Uzņēmējs atbild par uzņemošā līmeņa jautājumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
