# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The in-play loader (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) uses each role's variant-free base config (the assembled `meta/<topic>.yml` payload) as the default and lets the inventory's `applications.<app>` overrides win via deep merge: the inventory itself is the source of truth for what variant a round runs against. Variant 0 enumerates every dynamic service-key from `meta/services.yml` with `enabled: true, shared: true` so the \"all flags on\" baseline is explicit and deep-merge with a non-baseline override yields the expected variant-N shape (see [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) for the file-format rule and [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) for the lint guard)."
msgstr "Iekrāvējs spēlē (`utils.cache.applications.get_merged_applications`) izmanto katras lomas bezvarianta bāzes konfigurāciju (samontēts `meta/<topic>.yml` lietderīgā krava) kā noklusējuma un ļauj inventāra `applications.<app>` aizstāj uzvarēt, izmantojot dziļu saplūšanu: pats inventārs ir patiesības avots par to, kāds variants kārta iet pret. Variants 0 uzskaita katru dinamisko pakalpojuma atslēgu no `meta/services.yml` kur: `enabled: true, shared: true` Tātad \"visi karogi\" bāzlīnija ir skaidra un dziļa, bez bāzlīnijas izslēdzot sagaidāmo N varianta formu (skatīt [variants.md](../artefact/files/role/variants.md) datnes formāta noteikumam un [test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py](../../../tests/integration/roles/meta/variants/test_non_baseline_explicit_disables.py) Stiepes aizsargam)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The include set passed to stage 2 is built per round by the matrix planner: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) and [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) call `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` in [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), which resolves each round's include via `_resolve_round_include` in [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) using the [CombinedResolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) with `follow_run_after=False`. The swarm test path computes its include separately via [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), reading the active variant map from `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Both expand the selection along two transitive paths:"
msgstr "Iekļaut komplektu nodots uz posmu 2 to katrā kārtā būvējis matricas plānotājs: [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) kā arī [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) izsaukums `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` skaits [planner.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/planner.py), kas atrisina katras kārtas ietver caur `_resolve_round_include` skaits [legacy_resolver.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/legacy_resolver.py) izmantojot [KombinētaisResolver](../../../cli/meta/roles/applications/resolution/combined/resolver.py) kur: `follow_run_after=False`. bara testa ceļš aprēķina tā ietver atsevišķi, izmantojot [derive_includes.py](../../../utils/tests/swarm/derive_includes.py), lasot aktīvā varianta karti no `INFINITO_APP_VARIANTS`. Abi paplašināt izvēli pa diviem tranzīta ceļiem:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The index is rebuilt on every run so it cannot drift from what is on disk: a manually deleted index gets restored, and a stale link to a removed archive gets dropped. The function stays byte-idempotent: when the resulting content matches what is already on disk, the file is not rewritten."
msgstr "Indekss tiek pārbūvēts katrā braucienā, lai tas nevarētu novirzīties no tā, kas atrodas uz diska: tiek atjaunots manuāli dzēsts indekss, un tiek nomesta strupceļa saite uz noņemtu arhīvu. Funkcija paliek baitu idempotent: kad iegūtais saturs atbilst tam, kas jau ir uz diska, fails netiek pārrakstīts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The injector runs when `services.javascript.enabled` is enabled."
msgstr "Inžektors darbojas, kad: `services.javascript.enabled` ir ieslēgts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The inputs a retrigger reproduces: every dispatch input except the selection it computes itself."
msgstr "Ievades retrigger reproducē: katru nosūtīšanas ieejas, izņemot izvēli, tā aprēķina sevi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The install task path for every addon MUST honour the `required` field:"
msgstr "Instalēt uzdevumu ceļu katram addon jāciena `required` lauks:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The install-test workflows listed in the `Infrastructure tests` table of [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md) run in parallel once `code-quality-gate` is green. All of them MUST pass `test-install-gate`."
msgstr "Instalēšanas testa darbplūsmas, kas uzskaitītas `Infrastructure tests` tabula [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md) palaist paralēli vienu reizi `code-quality-gate` zaļš. Tiem visiem ir jāiztur `test-install-gate`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The installer script is fetched from the official release location"
msgstr "Uzstādītājs skripts tiek ielādēts no oficiālā atbrīvošanas vietu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The installers therefore never ask GitHub which version is current: that made every install non-reproducible and turned a DNS hiccup into a hard `make install-lint` failure."
msgstr "Tāpēc uzstādītāji nekad lūgt GitHub kas versija ir pašreizējais: kas padarīja katru instalēt nav reproducējams un pagrieza DNS žagas grūti `make install-lint` neveiksme."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The instructions test used to be a job of its own that picked one random role per run. Riding along on a deploy row instead costs no extra runner and covers every role the sweep touches. The row it rides on is the role's smallest variant -- the one enabling the fewest services -- because that is the shape the README's Production block describes: the bare role, with the optional providers switched off."
msgstr "Instrukcijas tests bija darbs pats, kas izvēlējās vienu nejaušo lomu katrā braucienā. Braukšana pa izvietojuma rindu tā vietā nemaksā papildu skrējējs un aptver katru lomu slaucīšana pieskaras. Rinda, uz kuras tas brauc, ir lomas mazākais variants, kas nodrošina vismazākos pakalpojumus, jo tā ir forma, ko apraksta LASĪTME ražošanas bloks: kaila loma, izslēdzot izvēles pakalpojumu sniedzējus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The integration MUST distinguish two directions:"
msgstr "Integrācijai jānodala divi virzieni:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The inventory itself is the bundle."
msgstr "Pati inventarizācija ir pakete."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The inverse of every other scenario, and deliberately so. Formalised as its own role in [034-svc-ai-robot.md](034-svc-ai-robot.md). Here Hermes is given full rights to explore and drive **one dedicated machine** so it can map its own hardware and act in the physical world: the robot platform idea. This is only coherent under Decision #12."
msgstr "Par apgriezto jebkuru citu scenāriju, un apzināti tā. Formalizēta kā sava loma [034-svc-ai-robot.md](034-svc-ai-robot.md). Šeit Hermes tiek dotas visas tiesības izpētīt un vadīt **viena īpaša iekārta** lai tā varētu kartēt savu aparatūru un rīkoties fiziskajā pasaulē: robota platformas ideja. Tas ir saskaņā tikai ar Lēmumu #12."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The inverse of what :func:`assign` builds, kept next to it so the two cannot drift: consumers that hand-rolled their own regex over raw role ids silently matched nothing once job titles carried display names, and every failure went unreported."
msgstr "Pretējs tam, ko :func:`assign` veido, tur blakus, lai abi nevar dreifēt: patērētāji, kas ar roku velmēja savu regex pār neapstrādātu lomu ID klusē neko nesakrita, kad darba nosaukumi bija displeja nosaukumus, un par katru neveiksmes tika ziņots."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The job log is the source: it records all inputs verbatim, including the ones the title renders as a glyph and the ones it renders not at all. The title fills the gaps when a log is unreadable."
msgstr "Darba žurnāls ir avots: tas ieraksta visas ieejas stenogrammu, ieskaitot tos nosaukums renders kā glifu un tie, ko tas renderē nav vispār. Nosaukums aizpilda tukšumus, kad žurnāls nav lasāms."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "Brauciens ir iekļauts ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, kas sēklas izkraušanas karogu, noklikšķina GitLab-slot saite, pārbauda kanāla skatu, un zīmes, izmantojot ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` pievieno dalībnieku apmaiņu. Ceļš atpakaļ uz sugas personām ir SSO kontrole, kuras pieejamais vārds atbilst koplietotajam matricam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "Brauciens ir iekļauts `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, kas sēklas izkraušanas karogu, noklikšķina GitLab-slot saite, pārbauda kanāla skatu, un zīmes, izmantojot `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` pievieno dalībnieku apmaiņu. Ceļš atpakaļ uz sugas personām ir SSO kontrole, kuras pieejamais vārds atbilst koplietotajam matricam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) drives it through Shopware's own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` selects how it signs in — through the `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into `.sw-login__content` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Pats ceļojums netiek atmests. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) virza to cauri Shopware's paša selektori: autentificēts aizmugures apgalvojums, pēc tam pieslēdzas caur lietotāja darbībām, pārslēdzoties un atgriežoties pie pieteikšanās formas. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` izvēlas, kā tas parādās – caur `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` pakalpojuma sniedzējs saite, ka AdminOpenAuth pievieno `.sw-login__content` kad SSO ir ieslēgts, izmantojot vietējo paroli formu, kad tā ir izslēgta. E ir o pa s `guest` persona un lomu vietējā sasniedzamība, TLS un HSTS apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) drives both personas through Funkwhale's own chain: `/login`, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale's own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when `services.ldap.enabled` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Pats ceļojums netiek atmests. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) vada abas personas caur Funkwhalepaša ķēde: `/login`, Keycloak brauciens turp un atpakaļ, kad vien starpniekserveris vārti šajā maršrutā, tad Funkwhale's pašu pierakstīšanās forma, autentificēts virsmas apgalvojums, un pierakstīšanās atpakaļ uz anonīmo valsti. To izlaiž, ja: `services.ldap.enabled` ir nepatiesa, jo neviens persona tur Funkwhale šajā variantā. E ir o pa s `guest` persona un bāzes apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. ```files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`` <./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js>`__ drives it through Shopware’s own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. ``SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED`` selects how it signs in — through the ``a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button`` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into ``.sw-login__content`` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The ``guest`` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Pats ceļojums netiek atmests. ```files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`` <./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js>`__ drives it through Shopware’s own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. ``SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED`` selects how it signs in — through the ``a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button`` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into ``.sw-login__content`` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The ``guest`` persona un lomu vietējā sasniedzamība, TLS un HSTS apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. ```files/playwright/test-native-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-native-login.js>`__ drives both personas through Funkwhale’s own chain: ``/login``, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale’s own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when ``services.ldap.enabled`` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Pats ceļojums netiek atmests. ```files/playwright/test-native-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-native-login.js>`__ drives both personas through Funkwhale’s own chain: ``/login``, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale’s own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when ``services.ldap.enabled`` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The ``guest`` persona un bāzes apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

