# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot's containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout ([layout.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)) and is modeled on [`web-app-openproject`](../web-app-openproject/) and [`web-app-baserow`](../web-app-baserow/)."
msgstr "Pieminētā loma Penpot's konteinerizēts steks aiz standarta Infinito.Nexus reversā starpniekserveris un vada to uz centrālo identitāti, rezerves, un paneļa infrastruktūru. Tas seko per- role meta izkārtojumam ([layout.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md)) un ir modelēts [`web-app-openproject`](../web-app-openproject/) kā arī [`web-app-baserow`](../web-app-baserow/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role brings up Penpot’s containerized stack behind the standard Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy and wires it into central identity, backup, and dashboard infrastructure. It follows the per-role meta layout (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) and is modeled on ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>`__."
msgstr "Pieminētā loma Penpotir konteinera kaudze aiz standarta Infinito.Nexus reversā starpniekserveris un vada to uz centrālo identitāti, rezerves, un paneļa infrastruktūru. Tas seko per- role meta izkārtojumam (`layout.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/layout.md>`__) un ir modelēts ```web-app-openproject`` <../web-app-openproject/>`__ and ```web-app-baserow`` <../web-app-baserow/>` ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Loma būvē liesās pasūtījuma attēlu virs amatpersonas Jira Programmatūras attēls, paredz pastāvīgu apjomu, un pakļauj app aiz jūsu atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveri. Mainīgo lielumu kontrole image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM kaudžu izmēru ir auto-iegūts no uzņēmējas RAM ar drošiem vāciņiem, lai novērstu `Xms > Xmx`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a lean custom image on top of the official Jira Software image, provisions persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Variables control image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to prevent ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Loma būvē liesās pasūtījuma attēlu virs amatpersonas Jira Programmatūras attēls, paredz pastāvīgu apjomu, un pakļauj app aiz jūsu atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveri. Mainīgo lielumu kontrole image/version/volumes/domains/SSO. JVM kaudžu izmēru ir auto-iegūts no uzņēmējas RAM ar drošiem vāciņiem, lai novērstu ``Xms > Xmx``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid `Xms > Xmx`."
msgstr "Loma būvē minimālu pielāgotu attēlu virs amatpersonas Confluence attēlu, sagatavo pastāvīgus apjomus, un pakļauj app aiz jūsu atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveri. Konfigurāciju nosaka mainīgie (attēls, versija, sējumi, domēni, OIDC). JVM kaudzes lieluma ir auto-iegūts no uzņēmējas RAM ar drošiem vāciņiem, lai izvairītos no `Xms > Xmx`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role builds a minimal custom image on top of the official Confluence image, prepares persistent volumes, and exposes the app behind your reverse proxy. Configuration is driven by variables (image, version, volumes, domains, OIDC). JVM heap sizing is auto-derived from host RAM with safe caps to avoid ``Xms > Xmx``."
msgstr "Loma būvē minimālu pielāgotu attēlu virs amatpersonas Confluence attēlu, sagatavo pastāvīgus apjomus, un pakļauj app aiz jūsu atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveri. Konfigurāciju nosaka mainīgie (attēls, versija, sējumi, domēni, OIDC). JVM kaudzes lieluma ir auto-iegūts no uzņēmējas RAM ar drošiem vāciņiem, lai izvairītos no ``Xms > Xmx``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether ``pip`` from ``ansible_python_interpreter`` supports ``--break-system-packages`` and only uses it (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older ``pip`` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Par lomu pārbauda, vai ``pip`` no ``ansible_python_interpreter`` balsti ``--break-system-packages`` un tikai izmanto to (plus ``PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1``) ja pieejams. Tādējādi tiek saglabāta ``pip`` versijas (Piemēram, dažas CentOS/RHEL sistēmas)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role checks whether `pip` from `ansible_python_interpreter` supports `--break-system-packages` and only uses it (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) when available. This keeps the role compatible with older `pip` versions (e.g., some CentOS/RHEL systems)."
msgstr "Par lomu pārbauda, vai `pip` no `ansible_python_interpreter` balsti `--break-system-packages` un tikai izmanto to (plus `PIP_BREAK_SYSTEM_PACKAGES=1`) ja pieejams. Tādējādi tiek saglabāta `pip` versijas (Piemēram, dažas CentOS/RHEL sistēmas)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures a systemd service and timer which executes the CSP crawler periodically against all NGINX domains."
msgstr "Loma konfigurē sistemātisko servisu un taimeri, kas periodiski izpilda CSP rāpuli pret visiem NGINX domēniem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role configures and deploys a containerized PhpMyAdmin instance using Docker Compose. It optionally integrates with a central database and uses dynamic Ansible variables to support flexible deployments in both production and homelab environments."
msgstr "Loma konfigurē un izvieto konteinerus PhpMyAdmin piemēram, izmantojot Docker Compose. Tas pēc izvēles integrējas centrālajā datu bāzē un izmanto dinamiskus mainīgos lielumus, lai atbalstītu elastīgu ieviešanu gan ražošanas, gan mājas lapu vidē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as ``http://jupyter:8888`` once it declares ``jupyter`` in its own ``meta/services.yml`` with ``enabled`` and ``shared`` set. ``web-app-openwebui`` ships that flag and sends ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` with it."
msgstr "Loma paziņo, ka nav skaļuma: kodols, kas izpilda kodu tērzēšana rakstīja saņem svaigu filesystem par katru restart. Patērētājs to sasniedz kā ``http://jupyter:8888`` tiklīdz tā paziņo ``jupyter`` atsevišķi ``meta/services.yml`` kur: ``enabled`` kā arī ``shared`` iestatīts. ``web-app-openwebui`` kuģi, kas kuģo un nosūta ``CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter`` Ar to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role declares no volume: a kernel that executes code a chat wrote gets a fresh filesystem on every restart. A consumer reaches it as `http://jupyter:8888` once it declares `jupyter` in its own `meta/services.yml` with `enabled` and `shared` set. `web-app-openwebui` ships that flag and sends `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` with it."
msgstr "Loma paziņo, ka nav skaļuma: kodols, kas izpilda kodu tērzēšana rakstīja saņem svaigu filesystem par katru restart. Patērētājs to sasniedz kā `http://jupyter:8888` tiklīdz tā paziņo `jupyter` atsevišķi `meta/services.yml` kur: `enabled` kā arī `shared` iestatīts. `web-app-openwebui` kuģi, kas kuģo un nosūta `CODE_EXECUTION_ENGINE=jupyter` Ar to."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single ``registry:2`` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group’s host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` resolves to ``compose`` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Nozīme ir viena ``registry:2`` piemēram, izmantojot starpniekservera režīmā tās inventāra grupas saimnieks. Jo grupai parasti ir tieši viens resursdators (bara pārvaldnieks), ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE`` atrisina ``compose`` lomai; multi-host ventilators-out par kešatmiņu pati ir ārpus darbības jomas v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys a single `registry:2` instance in pull-through proxy mode on its inventory group's host. Because the group typically holds exactly one host (the swarm manager), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `compose` for the role; multi-host fan-out for the cache itself is out of scope for v1."
msgstr "Nozīme ir viena `registry:2` piemēram, izvilkt-through starpniekservera režīmā tās inventāra grupas resursdators. Jo grupai parasti ir tieši viens resursdators (bara pārvaldnieks), `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` atrisina `compose` lomai; multi-host ventilators-out par kešatmiņu pati ir ārpus darbības jomas v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys end-to-end on the project's reference distribution and is covered by **at least** a smoke-level Playwright spec, but neither the deploy nor the spec depth is considered production-grade."
msgstr "Uzdevumi, kas attiecas uz projekta atsauces izplatīšanu, ir izklāstīti **vismaz** dūmu līmenis Playwright spec, bet ne izvietojumu, ne spec dziļumu uzskata par ražošanas kvalitātes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the frontend and owns the templates and their tuning; the dev compose stack has no inventory to render them with and comes through here instead. Every value still has one home: the hosts and repositories come from the ``cache:`` declarations, the nginx tuning from the role's ``vars/main.yml``, and only the backend address differs, because the dev stack reaches Nexus over a compose network alias while the role reaches it by its configured container."
msgstr "Loma izvieto frontend un pieder veidnes un to tuning; dev kompožu kaudze nav inventarizācijas, lai padarītu tos ar un nāk caur šeit vietā. Katrai vērtībai joprojām ir viena mājas: saimnieki un krātuves nāk no ``cache:`` paziņojumi, kas izriet no ``vars/main.yml``, un tikai aizmugures adrese atšķiras, jo dev kaudze sasniedz Nexus virs komponēt tīkla segvārdus, bet loma sasniedz to ar tā konfigurēto konteineru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via `SEMAPHORE_*` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak `administrator` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via `semaphore user add --admin --external`; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Loma izvieto vienu Semaphore konteineru (ar iestrādātu darba skrējēju) un vadus to platformas caur `SEMAPHORE_*` vides mainīgie lielumi. Uzstādīšanas vednis tiek apiets, sējot sākotnējo admin no padarītajiem noslēpumiem, tāpēc svaigu izvietot zemes tieši Semaphore pieteikšanās lapā. Kad SSO ir ieslēgts, Keycloak `administrator` ir izveidota izvietošanas laikā kā ārējo Semaphore admin caur `semaphore user add --admin --external`; OIDC zvanu atbilst to pa e-pastu un paraksta operatoru kā Semaphore admin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys the single Semaphore container (with its embedded task runner) and wires it into the platform via ``SEMAPHORE_*`` environment variables. The setup wizard is bypassed by seeding the initial admin from rendered secrets, so a fresh deploy lands directly on the Semaphore login page. When SSO is enabled, the Keycloak ``administrator`` is created at deploy time as an external Semaphore admin via ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; the OIDC callback matches it by email and signs the operator in as a Semaphore admin."
msgstr "Loma izvieto vienu Semaphore konteineru (ar iestrādātu darba skrējēju) un vadus to platformas caur ``SEMAPHORE_*`` vides mainīgie lielumi. Uzstādīšanas vednis tiek apiets, sējot sākotnējo admin no padarītajiem noslēpumiem, tāpēc svaigu izvietot zemes tieši Semaphore pieteikšanās lapā. Kad SSO ir ieslēgts, Keycloak ``administrator`` ir izveidota izvietošanas laikā kā ārējo Semaphore admin caur ``semaphore user add --admin --external``; OIDC zvanu atbilst to pa e-pastu un paraksta operatoru kā Semaphore admin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys two containers on its inventory group's host: the repository manager and its nginx frontend. Both run in compose mode on the manager, like the sibling [svc-registry-cache](../svc-registry-cache/README.md)."
msgstr "Loma izvieto divus konteinerus tās inventāra grupas saimnieks: repozitorija pārvaldnieks un tā nginx priekšpuse. Abi palaist komponēt režīmā vadītājs, piemēram, brālis [svc-registry-cache](../svc-registry-cache/README.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role deploys two containers on its inventory group’s host: the repository manager and its nginx frontend. Both run in compose mode on the manager, like the sibling `svc-registry-cache <../svc-registry-cache/README.md>`__."
msgstr "Uzskaites grupas saimnieka uzdevums ir izvietot divus konteinerus: repozitorija pārvaldnieku un Nginx priekšpusi. Abi palaist komponēt režīmā vadītājs, piemēram, brālis `svc-registry-cache <../svc-registry-cache/README.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role directory name is the `application_id`. For example `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` is exposed as `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` as `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, and so on."
msgstr "Direktorijas nosaukums ir `application_id`. Piemēram `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/services.yml` iedarbojas kā `applications['web-app-mailu'].services`, `roles/web-app-mailu/meta/server.yml` kā `applications['web-app-mailu'].server`, Un tā tālāk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role does NOT carry \"known broken\" warnings in its `README.md`."
msgstr "Nozīme NAV \"zināms lūzums\" brīdinājumi `README.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role does not exist on disk yet (or only as a placeholder `meta/services.yml`). It is listed in this state so that contributors can discover what the project intends to ship next."
msgstr "Loma vēl nepastāv uz diska (vai tikai kā vietturis `meta/services.yml`). Tas ir minēts šajā stāvoklī, lai datu sniedzēji var atklāt, ko projekts plāno nosūtīt nākamo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role enables a ready-to-use Arduino development setup by installing necessary tools and configuring user permissions for serial access."
msgstr "Šī loma ļauj izmantot Arduino izstrādes konfigurāciju, uzstādot nepieciešamos rīkus un konfigurējot lietotāja atļaujas sērijveida piekļuvei."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment."
msgstr "Šī loma nodrošina, ka Docker un Docker Compose ir klāt, integrē būtiskas rezerves, remonts, un veselības pārbaudes funkcijas, un atbalsta tīrīšanas vai pilna atiestatīšanas režīmi svaigu Docker vidē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ensures that Docker and Docker Compose are present, integrates essential backup, repair, and health check roles, and supports cleanup or full reset modes for a fresh Docker environment.   When enabled via `MODE_CLEANUP` or `MODE_RESET`, it will automatically prune unused Docker resources.   `MODE_RESET` additionally restarts the Docker service after cleanup."
msgstr "Šī loma nodrošina, ka Docker un Docker Compose ir klāt, integrē būtiskas rezerves, remonts, un veselības pārbaudes funkcijas, un atbalsta tīrīšanas vai pilna atiestatīšanas režīmi svaigu Docker vidē. Kad ieslēgts caur `MODE_CLEANUP` vai `MODE_RESET`, tas automātiski apgriež neizmantotos Docker resursus. `MODE_RESET` papildus pārstartē Docker servisu pēc sakopšanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the [MCP Server plugin](https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/), baked into the image alongside the other plugins in `files/plugins.txt`. The surface is declared as the `mcp` service in `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Par lomu liecina Jenkins kā MCP serveri caur [MCP Servera spraudnis](https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/), cep attēlu kopā ar citiem spraudņiem `files/plugins.txt`. Virsmu deklarē kā: `mcp` pakalpojums `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes Jenkins as an MCP server through the `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, baked into the image alongside the other plugins in ``files/plugins.txt``. The surface is declared as the ``mcp`` service in ``meta/services.yml``."
msgstr "Par lomu liecina Jenkins kā MCP serveri caur `MCP Server plugin <https://plugins.jenkins.io/mcp-server/>`__, cep attēlu kopā ar citiem spraudņiem ``files/plugins.txt``. Virsmu deklarē kā: ``mcp`` pakalpojums ``meta/services.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes a Model Context Protocol surface through the ``webservice_mcp`` protocol plugin, baked into the image at ``webservice/mcp`` and served by the NGINX sidecar."
msgstr "Šī loma caur ``webservice_mcp`` protokola spraudnis, iebūvēts attēlā ``webservice/mcp`` un apkalpo NGINX blakusvāģis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role exposes a Model Context Protocol surface through the `webservice_mcp` protocol plugin, baked into the image at `webservice/mcp` and served by the NGINX sidecar."
msgstr "Šī loma caur `webservice_mcp` protokola spraudnis, iebūvēts attēlā `webservice/mcp` un apkalpo NGINX blakusvāģis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role follows Infinito.Nexus conventions:"
msgstr "Turpmāk minētās funkcijas Infinito.Nexus konvencijas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role has never been deployed. ``lifecycle`` is ``alpha``, so CI deploys it from the next run on; that run is its first execution. See `TODO.md <TODO.md>`__."
msgstr "Šī loma nekad nav izmantota. ``lifecycle`` ir ``alpha``, tāpēc CI izvieto to no nākamās palaist, kas ir tās pirmā izpilde. Skatīt `TODO.md <TODO.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role has never been deployed. `lifecycle` is `alpha`, so CI deploys it from the next run on; that run is its first execution. See [TODO.md](TODO.md)."
msgstr "Šī loma nekad nav izmantota. `lifecycle` ir `alpha`, tāpēc CI izvieto to no nākamās palaist, kas ir tās pirmā izpilde. Skatīt [TODO.md](TODO.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role has reached end of life: it still ships in `roles/` for now but the project does NOT commit to testing or maintaining it (retired prototypes, proprietary products, superseded apps)."
msgstr "Nozīme ir sasniegusi mūža beigas: tas joprojām kuģi `roles/` tagad, bet projekts nav apņemties testēšanu vai uzturēšanu (Norakstīti prototipi, patentēti produkti, aizstātas lietotnes)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role id *text* names, or None when it names no role."
msgstr "Par lomu id *Teksts* vārdi, vai nav, ja tas nenosauc lomu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role id a deploy job ``name`` encodes, or None if it is not one."
msgstr "Nozīme ``name`` kodēt, vai Neviens, ja tas nav viens."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role ids the pins select, deduplicated, in the order given -- what the discovery query filters on. The axes are applied afterwards, on the rows the query returned."
msgstr "Loma IDs adatas izvēlieties, deduplicat, dotajā secībā -- ko atklājums vaicājumu filtrus. Asi tiek piemēroti pēc tam, uz rindām vaicājums atgriezts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes Matomo tracking configuration and injects the corresponding tracking script into your HTML."
msgstr "Uzdevumos ietilpst: Matomo sekošanas konfigurāciju un injicē atbilstošo sekošanas skriptu savā HTML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom ``auth_oauth_https`` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard ``auth_oauth`` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the ``web.base.url`` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Loma ietver paražu ``auth_oauth_https`` addon, kas labo OAuth pāradresē URI, kad darbojas aiz reversā starpniekservera ar TLS izbeigšanu. Standarts ``auth_oauth`` modulis var nepareizi ģenerēt HTTP novirzīt URIs. Šis addons ignorē uzvedību, ko izmantot ``web.base.url`` sistēmas parametrs, nodrošinot, ka HTTPS vienmēr tiek izmantots."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role includes a custom `auth_oauth_https` addon that fixes OAuth redirect URIs when running behind a reverse proxy with TLS termination. The standard `auth_oauth` module may incorrectly generate HTTP redirect URIs. This addon overrides the behavior to use the `web.base.url` system parameter, ensuring HTTPS is always used."
msgstr "Loma ietver paražu `auth_oauth_https` addon, kas labo OAuth pāradresē URI, kad darbojas aiz reversā starpniekservera ar TLS izbeigšanu. Standarts `auth_oauth` modulis var nepareizi ģenerēt HTTP novirzīt URIs. Šis addons ignorē uzvedību, ko izmantot `web.base.url` sistēmas parametrs, nodrošinot, ka HTTPS vienmēr tiek izmantots."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role injects a global CSS link for consistent theming across your site."
msgstr "Loma ievada globālu CSS saiti, lai saskaņotu tos visā jūsu vietnē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **Nix** using either the native package manager (where supported and reliable) or the **official installer** with **SHA256 verification**."
msgstr "Loma uzstādās **Nix** izmantojot vai nu vietējo pakotņu pārvaldnieku (ja tas ir pamatots un uzticams) vai **oficiālais uzstādītājs** kur: **SHA256 pārbaude**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured ``msmtprc`` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated ``msmtp-mta`` package, it configures a direct ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` compatibility symlink to ``msmtp``."
msgstr "Loma uzstādās **msmtp**, risina specifiskas paketes atšķirības (ieskaitot EPEL bootstrap par EL ģimenes saimniekiem, ja nepieciešams), un izvieto iepriekš konfigurētu ``msmtprc`` fails caur Jinja2. Par distros bez veltīta ``msmtp-mta`` pakotne, tā konfigurēta tieša ``/usr/bin/sendmail`` savietojamības simsaite uz ``msmtp``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs **msmtp**, handles distro-specific package differences (including EPEL bootstrap on EL-family hosts when required), and deploys a pre-configured `msmtprc` file via Jinja2. For distros without a dedicated `msmtp-mta` package, it configures a direct `/usr/bin/sendmail` compatibility symlink to `msmtp`."
msgstr "Loma uzstādās **msmtp**, risina specifiskas paketes atšķirības (ieskaitot EPEL bootstrap par EL ģimenes saimniekiem, ja nepieciešams), un izvieto iepriekš konfigurētu `msmtprc` fails caur Jinja2. Par distros bez veltīta `msmtp-mta` pakotne, tā konfigurēta tieša `/usr/bin/sendmail` savietojamības simsaite uz `msmtp`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs ``dockreap`` using Python tooling and runs it with the ``--no-confirmation`` flag to ensure automatic, non-interactive cleanup."
msgstr "Loma uzstādās ``dockreap`` izmantojot Python rīku un vada to ar ``--no-confirmation`` karogs, lai nodrošinātu automātisku, neinteraktīvu sakopšanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs `dockreap` using Python tooling and runs it with the `--no-confirmation` flag to ensure automatic, non-interactive cleanup."
msgstr "Loma uzstādās `dockreap` izmantojot Python rīku un vada to ar `--no-confirmation` karogs, lai nodrošinātu automātisku, neinteraktīvu sakopšanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a health check script along with a ``systemd`` service and timer to run these checks at scheduled intervals."
msgstr "Loma uzstāda veselības pārbaudes skriptu kopā ar ``systemd`` pakalpojumu un taimeris, lai veiktu šīs pārbaudes ieplānotos intervālos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a health check script along with a `systemd` service and timer to run these checks at scheduled intervals.   If unhealthy or failed containers are detected, the configured failure notifier (via `sys-ctl-alm-compose`) is triggered."
msgstr "Loma uzstāda veselības pārbaudes skriptu kopā ar `systemd` pakalpojumu un taimeris, lai veiktu šīs pārbaudes ieplānotos intervālos. Ja neveselīgi vai neizdevās konteineri tiek atklāti, konfigurēta neveiksme paziņotājs (caur `sys-ctl-alm-compose`) tiek iedarbināta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a ``systemd`` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes."
msgstr "Loma uzstāda skriptu un ``systemd`` pakalpojumu ar taimeri, lai periodiski skenēt pārpalikumu anonīmu apjomu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a script and a `systemd` service with a timer to periodically scan for leftover anonymous volumes.   This helps prevent wasted disk space and leftover resources from old deployments."
msgstr "Loma uzstāda skriptu un `systemd` pakalpojumu ar taimeri, lai periodiski skenēt pārpalikumu anonīmu apjomu. Tas palīdz novērst izniekotu diska vietu un palikušos resursus no vecajām izvietošanām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Loma instalē sistematizētu vienību, kas momentuzņēmums katru konfigurēto avota direktoriju `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, cieši saistīts ar iepriekšējo paaudzi. Neobligāti avoti tiek izlaisti, ja nav (CA šifrēšanas režīmā, ACME/certbot pašparakstītā režīmā). Paaudze pievienojas to pašu rezerves koku pull un ierīces lomas patērēt, lai tā plūst uz rezerves resursdatoru un šifrētu ierīci automātiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let’s Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Loma instalē sistematizētu vienību, kas momentuzņēmums katru konfigurēto avota direktoriju ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, cieši saistīts ar iepriekšējo paaudzi. Neobligāti avoti tiek izlaisti, ja nav (CA šifrēšanas režīmā, ACME/certbot pašparakstītā režīmā). Paaudze pievienojas to pašu rezerves koku pull un ierīces lomas patērēt, lai tā plūst uz rezerves resursdatoru un šifrētu ierīci automātiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the `@openai/codex` npm package and, when the workstation also runs [`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/), writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on `127.0.0.1`, so the workstation's virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Loma nosaka `@openai/codex` npm pakete un, kad darbstacija arī darbojas [`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/), raksta pakalpojumu sniedzēja profilu, kas nosūta katru pabeigšanu vārtejā pa cilpas adresi dzinējs publicē to. Nekas neatstāj mašīnu: vārti atbild uz `127.0.0.1`, tāpēc darbstacijas virtuālā atslēga nekad nešķērso tīklu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the ``@openai/codex`` npm package and, when the workstation also runs ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``, so the workstation’s virtual key never crosses a network."
msgstr "Loma nosaka ``@openai/codex`` npm pakete un, kad darbstacija arī darbojas ```svc-ai-litellm`` <../svc-ai-litellm/>`__, writes a provider profile that sends every completion to the gateway over the loopback address the engine publishes it on. Nothing leaves the machine: the gateway answers on ``127.0.0.1``, tāpēc darbstacijas virtuālā atslēga nekad šķērso tīklu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the correct SSH client package for the following platforms:"
msgstr "Loma uzstāda pareizo SSH klienta paketi šādām platformām:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the pinned upstream AppImage and puts it on `PATH`. Upstream signs its assets with the Tauri updater key and publishes no digest, so the role pins a sha256 taken from the released build itself and the download is verified against it. A rebuilt or replaced asset fails the deploy instead of being installed."
msgstr "Loma uzstāda tapu augšpusē AppImage un liek to uz `PATH`. Augšupzīmē savus aktīvus ar Tauri atjaunotāja atslēgu un nepublicē sagremot, tāpēc lomu tapas sha256 ņem no izlaisto būvēt sevi un lejupielāde tiek pārbaudīta pret to. Pārbūvēts vai nomainīts aktīvs neizpilda izvietojumu, nevis tiek uzstādīts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs the pinned upstream AppImage and puts it on ``PATH``. Upstream signs its assets with the Tauri updater key and publishes no digest, so the role pins a sha256 taken from the released build itself and the download is verified against it. A rebuilt or replaced asset fails the deploy instead of being installed."
msgstr "Loma uzstāda tapu augšpusē AppImage un liek to uz ``PATH``. Augšupzīmē savus aktīvus ar Tauri atjaunotāja atslēgu un nepublicē sagremot, tāpēc lomu tapas sha256 ņem no izlaisto būvēt sevi un lejupielāde tiek pārbaudīta pret to. Pārbūvēts vai nomainīts aktīvs neizpilda izvietojumu, nevis tiek uzstādīts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role is a critical component in a secure backup scheme. By isolating backup operations to a dedicated user, it minimizes the risk of unauthorized actions. The role configures the SSH environment so that only specific, allowed commands can be executed, and it sets up passwordless sudo rights for rsync, ensuring smooth and secure backup operations."
msgstr "Loma ir svarīgs elements drošā dublējuma shēmā. Izdalot rezerves kopēšanas operācijas specializētam lietotājam, tas samazina nesankcionētu darbību risku. Loma konfigurē SSH vidi, lai varētu izpildīt tikai konkrētas, atļautas komandas, un tā uzstāda bez maksas sudo tiesības rsync, nodrošinot gludas un drošas rezerves operācijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role is designed to be **distribution-agnostic** and works on:"
msgstr "Šīs funkcijas mērķis ir: **amazināšanās** un strādā pie:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role is designed to solve common automation pitfalls such as:"
msgstr "Šī loma ir paredzēta, lai atrisinātu kopīgas automatizācijas kļūdas, piemēram:"

