msgstr "Šīs funkcijas ir šādas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provides the foundation for SSH-based workflows and is designed to be used as a dependency by other roles that require SSH functionality."
msgstr "Loma nodrošina pamatu SSH bāzētām darbplūsmām un veidota tā, lai to izmantotu kā atkarību no citām lomām, kurām nepieciešama SSH funkcionalitāte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (``gitlab_config``, ``gitlab_data``, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
msgstr "Jaunā loma GitLab Gadījumi. Pirms CNG Omnibus izvietošanas apjomi, noslēpumi un dublējumi (``gitlab_config``, ``gitlab_data``, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) neemigrē vai neatjauno SDG izkārtojumā; izmanto, salīdzinot ar jaunu datubāzi un tukšiem tilpumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (`gitlab_config`, `gitlab_data`, `/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json`) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
msgstr "Jaunā loma GitLab Gadījumi. Pirms CNG Omnibus izvietošanas apjomi, noslēpumi un dublējumi (`gitlab_config`, `gitlab_data`, `/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json`) neemigrē vai neatjauno SDG izkārtojumā; izmanto, salīdzinot ar jaunu datubāzi un tukšiem tilpumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `sso.shared` to `false`, and the role ships no `meta/users.yml` and no account provisioning; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) only configures the build service. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the `biber` or `administrator` persona, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Loma publicē publisku dokumentācijas vietni. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) adatas `sso.enabled` kā arī `sso.shared` līdz `false`, un kuģa loma `meta/users.yml` un nav konta uzkrājumu; [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) Konfigurē tikai būvēšanas servisu. [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) Tikai vadi konteinera un starpniekservera steku un posmi Sfinx rīku uz būvēt kontekstā. Nav konta un auth ķēdes par `biber` vai `administrator` persona, tātad [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) deklarē `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` kā arī `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` persona un bāzes sasniedzamība un CSP apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role publishes a public documentation site. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability and CSP assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Loma publicē publisku dokumentācijas vietni. ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled`` and ``sso.shared`` to ``false``, and the role ships no ``meta/users.yml`` and no account provisioning; ```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__ only configures the build service. ```tasks/main.yml`` <./tasks/main.yml>`__ only wires the container and proxy stack and stages the Sphinx tooling into the build context. There is no account and no auth chain for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona un bāzes sasniedzamība un CSP apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders ``settings.yml`` from the deployment’s own secret key and mounts it read-only. ``formats`` carries ``json`` next to ``html``, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Nozīme ``settings.yml`` no izvietošanas pašas slepeno atslēgu un mounts to tikai lasāms. ``formats`` nes ``json`` blakus ``html``, jo mašīna patērētājs saņem HTTP 403 par JSON mērķa kritēriju citādi, un likmes ierobežotājs ir off, jo vienīgie klienti ir platformas pakalpojumi konteineru tīklā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role renders `settings.yml` from the deployment's own secret key and mounts it read-only. `formats` carries `json` next to `html`, because a machine consumer gets HTTP 403 on the JSON endpoint otherwise, and the rate limiter is off since the only clients are platform services on the container network."
msgstr "Nozīme `settings.yml` no izvietošanas pašas slepeno atslēgu un mounts to tikai lasāms. `formats` nes `json` blakus `html`, jo mašīna patērētājs saņem HTTP 403 par JSON mērķa kritēriju citādi, un likmes ierobežotājs ir off, jo vienīgie klienti ir platformas pakalpojumi konteineru tīklā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the `-full` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "Loma ir `-full` attēls, kas nes OCR un valodu paketes, un kalpo to ostā 9998 tikai konteineru tīklā. Neviens ports netiek publicēts un netiek izveidots starpniekserveris."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the ``-full`` image, which carries the OCR and language packs, and serves it on port 9998 inside the container network only. No port is published and no proxy entry is created."
msgstr "Loma ir ``-full`` attēls, kas nes OCR un valodu paketes, un kalpo to ostā 9998 tikai konteineru tīklā. Neviens ports netiek publicēts un netiek izveidots starpniekserveris."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the upstream ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` image behind the central reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Everything the application keeps lives in one volume at ``/data``: the SQLite database, uploaded media, and installed apps. The administrator account is provisioned from the role’s generated credential, and the role finishes the upstream first-boot wizard over the API so the front page renders a login form instead of a setup screen."
msgstr "Loma virzās augšup ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` attēls aiz centrālā reversā starpniekservera paša kanoniskā domēna. Viss, ko lietojumprogramma uztur, dzīvo vienā sējumā ``/data``: SQLite datubāze, augšupielādētie mediji un instalētās lietotnes. Administratora konts tiek nodrošināts no lomas radīta credential, un loma beidzas augšpusējā pirmā sādža vednis pār API tāpēc priekšējā lapa padara pieteikšanās formu, nevis uzstādīšanas ekrāns."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role runs the upstream `ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome` image behind the central reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Everything the application keeps lives in one volume at `/data`: the SQLite database, uploaded media, and installed apps. The administrator account is provisioned from the role's generated credential, and the role finishes the upstream first-boot wizard over the API so the front page renders a login form instead of a setup screen."
msgstr "Loma virzās augšup `ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome` attēls aiz centrālā reversā starpniekservera paša kanoniskā domēna. Viss, ko lietojumprogramma uztur, dzīvo vienā sējumā `/data`: SQLite datubāze, augšupielādētie mediji un instalētās lietotnes. Administratora konts ir nodrošināts no lomu radīta credential, un loma beidzas augšpusē pirmā-boot vednis pār API tāpēc priekšējā lapa padara pieteikšanās formu, nevis uzstādīšanas ekrāns."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role scans NGINX server block `.conf` files for domains, HEAD-requests each domain, compares the response against per-domain expected codes, and reports mismatches via `sys-ctl-alm-compose`. It is scheduled via a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps. Include this role and define `on_calendar_health_NGINX`. The role installs `requests` via `pip` automatically."
msgstr "Loma skenē NGINX servera bloku `.conf` faili domēniem, HEAD pieprasa katru domēnu, salīdzina atbildi ar katram domēnam paredzētajiem kodiem un ziņo neatbilstības, izmantojot `sys-ctl-alm-compose`. Tas ir plānots, izmantojot sistemātisko taimeri periodisku veselības pārbaudes. Iekļaut šo lomu un definēt `on_calendar_health_NGINX`. Loma uzstāda `requests` caur `pip` automātiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role scans NGINX server block ``.conf`` files for domains, HEAD-requests each domain, compares the response against per-domain expected codes, and reports mismatches via ``sys-ctl-alm-compose``. It is scheduled via a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps. Include this role and define ``on_calendar_health_NGINX``. The role installs ``requests`` via ``pip`` automatically."
msgstr "Loma skenē NGINX servera bloku ``.conf`` faili domēniem, HEAD pieprasa katru domēnu, salīdzina atbildi ar katram domēnam paredzētajiem kodiem un ziņo neatbilstības, izmantojot ``sys-ctl-alm-compose``. Tas ir plānots, izmantojot sistemātisko taimeri periodisku veselības pārbaudes. Iekļaut šo lomu un definēt ``on_calendar_health_NGINX``. Loma uzstāda ``requests`` caur ``pip`` automātiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role selections go out as display names (``utils.roles.display``), so the run title reads them back the way the deploy jobs are titled. The workflow decodes them again before any consumer sees a role id."
msgstr "Lomu izvēles tiek izmantotas kā attēlošanas vārdi (``utils.roles.display``), tāpēc palaist nosaukums lasa tos atpakaļ tā, kā izvieto darbavietas ir virsraksts. Darbplūsma tos atkal dekodē, pirms kāds patērētājs saskata lomu id."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role self-validates via the scripts in ``files/test/``, discovered and run by ``test-e2e-cli`` during deploy. ``test.sh`` orchestrates two complementary checks:"
msgstr "Loma pašvalidējas caur skriptiem iekš ``files/test/``, atklāja un vada ``test-e2e-cli`` izvietošanas laikā. ``test.sh`` organizē divas papildu pārbaudes:"

