msgstr "Nozīme joprojām ir kuģiem un joprojām iztur pārbaudes, bet operatoriem ir jāemigrē prom no tās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role takes none of its own. ``user-workstation`` reads ``WORKSTATION_USER`` and the ``users`` entry it names."
msgstr "Šī loma neieņem nevienu no savām. ``user-workstation`` lasītājs ``WORKSTATION_USER`` un ``users`` ieraksta to nosaukumus."

