# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role then stages the Playwright project to a local staging directory, renders a `.env` file from `templates/playwright.env.j2`, optionally waits until the application is reachable, and executes Playwright inside a Docker image derived from the central Playwright package version."
msgstr "Pēc tam loma iestudē Playwright projektu vietējā inscenējumu direktorijā, padara `.env` fails no `templates/playwright.env.j2`, pēc izvēles gaida, līdz pieteikums ir sasniedzams, un izpilda Playwright iekšpusē Docker attēlu, kas atvasināts no centrālās Playwright paketes versiju."

