# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role therefore installs the editor and leaves the endpoint override to the operator. Nothing here pretends to configure a gateway that the product does not accept from a file."
msgstr "Līdz ar to šī funkcija uzstāda redaktoru un atstāj beigu punktu operatora ziņā. Nekas šeit izliekas konfigurēt vārteju, ka produkts nepieņem no faila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role titles that name an upstream product rather than describe a job."
msgstr "Nozīmes, kas nosauc iepriekšējo produktu, nevis raksturo darbu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role uses a multi-stage Dockerfile:"
