# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project's front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "Šī loma veido un vada Bridgy Fed kā Docker konteiners aiz projekta priekšējās-proxy. Fakultatīvs Firestore-emulators blakusvāģis Datastore režīmā nodrošina glabāšanas aizmuguri neražošanas izvēršanai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project’s front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "Šī loma veido un vada Bridgy Fed kā Docker konteiners aiz projekta priekšējās procesora vietas. Fakultatīvs Firestore-emulators blakusvāģis Datastore režīmā nodrošina glabāšanas aizmuguri neražošanas izvēršanai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official ``php:8.3-fpm`` base."
msgstr "Šī loma veido savu Moodle attēls no augšas Moodle avots papildus amatpersonai ``php:8.3-fpm`` bāzes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official `php:8.3-fpm` base."
msgstr "Šī loma veido savu Moodle attēls no augšas Moodle avots papildus amatpersonai `php:8.3-fpm` bāzes."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds on ``sys-stk-backend`` by adding a reverse-proxy frontend for HTTP access to your database service."
msgstr "Šīs funkcijas pamatā ir ``sys-stk-backend`` pievienojot atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveri HTTP piekļuvei jūsu datu bāzes servisam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds on `sys-stk-backend` by adding a reverse-proxy frontend for HTTP access to your database service."
msgstr "Šīs funkcijas pamatā ir `sys-stk-backend` pievienojot atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveri HTTP piekļuvei jūsu datu bāzes servisam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds the API image from ``files/Dockerfile``, bakes a snapshot of the deployed working tree into it and serves it at ``api.<domain>``. The container keeps one bare git repository with the branches and tags of core, of every public fork (discovered through the GitHub forks endpoint) and the snapshot as the ref ``deployed``, and fetches on a fixed interval. Every data endpoint takes a ``ref``: ``deployed``, a commit SHA, a branch or tag of core, or ``<owner>:<branch or tag>`` of a fork. Translations come from the ``core`` gettext catalogs under ``locale/``, which ``make i18n-extract`` and ``make i18n-translate`` maintain."
msgstr "Šī loma veido API attēls no ``files/Dockerfile``, bakes momentuzņēmums izvietoto darba koku tajā un kalpo to ``api.<domain>``. Konteiners tur vienu tukša git repozitoriju ar filiālēm un tagus serdes, katra publiskā dakša (GitHub dakšu galarezultātā) un momentuzņēmums kā ref ``deployed``, un atnes uz fiksētu intervālu. Katram datu beigu punktam ir nepieciešams a ``ref``: ``deployed``, uztic SHA, serdes zaru vai birku, vai ``<owner>:<branch or tag>`` dakšiņas. Tulkojumi nāk no ``core`` gettext katalogi zem ``locale/``, kas ``make i18n-extract`` kā arī ``make i18n-translate`` uztur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds the API image from `files/Dockerfile`, bakes a snapshot of the deployed working tree into it and serves it at `api.<domain>`. The container keeps one bare git repository with the branches and tags of core, of every public fork (discovered through the GitHub forks endpoint) and the snapshot as the ref `deployed`, and fetches on a fixed interval. Every data endpoint takes a `ref`: `deployed`, a commit SHA, a branch or tag of core, or `<owner>:<branch or tag>` of a fork. Translations come from the `core` gettext catalogs under `locale/`, which `make i18n-extract` and `make i18n-translate` maintain."
msgstr "Šī loma veido API attēls no `files/Dockerfile`, bakes momentuzņēmums izvietoto darba koku tajā un kalpo to `api.<domain>`. Konteiners tur vienu tukša git repozitoriju ar filiālēm un tagus serdes, katra publiskā dakša (GitHub dakšu galarezultātā) un momentuzņēmums kā ref `deployed`, un atnes uz fiksētu intervālu. Katram datu beigu punktam ir nepieciešams a `ref`: `deployed`, uztic SHA, serdes zaru vai birku, vai `<owner>:<branch or tag>` dakšiņas. Tulkojumi nāk no `core` gettext katalogi zem `locale/`, kas `make i18n-extract` kā arī `make i18n-translate` uztur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role builds upon core workstation and package management components to deliver a clean, editor-ready base for developers. It installs core tools and editors necessary to begin building, editing, and managing source code projects."
msgstr "Šī loma balstās uz pamata darbstacijas un paketes pārvaldības komponentiem, lai nodrošinātu tīru, redaktoram gatavu bāzi izstrādātājiem. Tā uzstāda pamata rīkus un redaktorus, kas nepieciešami, lai sāktu veidot, rediģēt un pārvaldīt pirmkoda projektus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role can optionally bootstrap a Django superuser inside the Baserow container (useful for initial setup and automation)."
msgstr "Šī loma var fakultatīvi bootstrap Django superlietotājs iekšpusē Baserow Konteiners (noder sākotnējai uzstādīšanai un automatizācijai)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role cleans up failed Docker backups by configuring a systemd service and timer to execute the cleanup operations periodically."
msgstr "Šī loma satīra neizdevās Docker rezerves kopijas, konfigurējot sistematizētu servisu un taimeri, lai periodiski veiktu tīrīšanas operācijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role cloudflare DNS bootstrap: parent host A/AAAA (and optional CAA), runs once per play."
msgstr "Šī loma cloudflare DNS bootstrap: vecāku uzņēmēja A/AAAA (un izvēles CAA), darbojas vienu reizi spēlē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role combines Docker Compose with a central RDBMS role to automatically provision database containers with backup, user, and permission management."
msgstr "Šī loma apvieno Docker Compose ar centrālo RDBMS lomu, lai automātiski nodrošinātu datubāzu konteinerus ar dublējumu, lietotāju un atļauju pārvaldību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role combines the central RDBMS role (``sys-svc-rdbms``) with Docker Compose to deliver a ready-to-use containerized database environment."
msgstr "Šī loma apvieno centrālo RDBMS lomu (``sys-svc-rdbms``) kur: Docker Compose lai nodrošinātu lietošanai gatavu konteineru datubāzes vidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role combines the central RDBMS role (`sys-svc-rdbms`) with Docker Compose to deliver a ready-to-use containerized database environment."
msgstr "Šī loma apvieno centrālo RDBMS lomu (`sys-svc-rdbms`) kur: Docker Compose lai nodrošinātu lietošanai gatavu konteineru datubāzes vidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures GNOME Shell extensions and installs the CLI GNOME Extension Manager for managing extensions."
msgstr "Šī loma konfigurē GNOME Shell Paplašinājumi un instalē CLI GNOME paplašinājumu pārvaldnieku paplašinājumu pārvaldībai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures Nginx to perform 301 redirects based on a list of source→target domain mappings."
msgstr "Šī funkcija konfigurē Nginx, lai veiktu 301 novirza, pamatojoties uz avota→mērķa domēna kartēšanas sarakstu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a basic user environment (shell dotfiles and SSH authorized_keys) for a user selected via ``user_key``."
msgstr "Šī funkcija konfigurē lietotāja pamata vidi (čaulas punkti un SSH authorized_keys) lietotājam izvēlēts caur ``user_key``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a basic user environment (shell dotfiles and SSH authorized_keys) for a user selected via `user_key`."
msgstr "Šī funkcija konfigurē lietotāja pamata vidi (čaulas punkti un SSH authorized_keys) lietotājam izvēlēts caur `user_key`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a systemd timer to periodically start a corresponding service. It uses a Jinja2 template to create a timer unit file that specifies the scheduling parameters (such as OnCalendar and RandomizedDelaySec) and then restarts the timer service accordingly."
msgstr "Šī loma konfigurē sistemātisko taimeri, lai periodiski palaistu atbilstošu servisu. Tas izmanto Jinja2 sagatave, lai izveidotu taimera vienības failu, kas norāda plānošanas parametrus (piemēram, OnCalendar un RandomizedDelaySec) un pēc tam attiecīgi pārstartē taimera servisu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/), and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Šī funkcija konfigurē [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) serveris, lai izvietotu statisku HTML mājaslapu droši virs HTTPS. Tā automatizē domēna konfigurāciju, SSL/TLS sertifikāta iegūšanu izmantojot [Šifrēt](https://letsencrypt.org/), un nodrošina jūsu vietne ir gatava ražošanai ar minimālu iestatīšanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Šī funkcija konfigurē `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ serveris, lai izvietotu statisku HTML mājaslapu droši virs HTTPS. Tā automatizē domēna konfigurāciju, SSL/TLS sertifikāta iegūšanu izmantojot `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, un nodrošina jūsu vietne ir gatava ražošanai ar minimālu iestatīšanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role core role for Nginx HTML injection of Matomo, theming, iFrame and JS snippets based on application feature flags."
msgstr "Šī loma ir Nginx HTML injicēšanai Matomo, thesing, iFrame un JS fragmentus, pamatojoties uz pieteikumu funkciju karogiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role create Cloudflare wildcard DNS records (*.parent) for parent hosts; no base or*.apex records."
msgstr "Šī loma izveidot Cloudflare wildcard DNS ierakstus (*. vecāka) vecākiem saimniekiem; nav bāzes vai*.apex ieraksti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Šis uzdevums rada īpašu administratora lietotāju vietējo administratīvo uzdevumu veikšanai. Administrators konts ir konfigurēts pieprasīt paroli, izpildot [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), nodrošinot drošu privilēģiju eskalāciju. Drošības apsvērumu dēļ ieteicams izmantot šo speciāli administratoru, nevis noklusējuma saknes kontu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Šis uzdevums rada īpašu administratora lietotāju vietējo administratīvo uzdevumu veikšanai. Administrators konts ir konfigurēts pieprasīt paroli, izpildot `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, nodrošinot drošu privilēģiju eskalāciju. Drošības apsvērumu dēļ ieteicams izmantot šo speciāli administratoru, nevis noklusējuma saknes kontu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like `MODE_RESET` or `MODE_CLEANUP`."
msgstr "Šī loma rada elastīgu direktoriju izkārtojumu, lai pārvaldītu Docker Compose projekti visā vidē. Tas nodrošina katalogi ir inicializēts, fakultatīvi atiestatīt, un tur tīru, izmantojot iekšējo karogu, piemēram, `MODE_RESET` vai `MODE_CLEANUP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like ``MODE_RESET`` or ``MODE_CLEANUP``."
msgstr "Šī loma rada elastīgu direktoriju izkārtojumu, lai pārvaldītu Docker Compose projekti visā vidē. Tas nodrošina katalogi ir inicializēts, fakultatīvi atiestatīt, un tur tīru, izmantojot iekšējo karogu, piemēram, ``MODE_RESET`` vai ``MODE_CLEANUP``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared ``user`` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH ``authorized_keys``."
msgstr "Šī loma rada darbstaciju lietotāja definēto *WORKSTATION_USER* un konfigurē savu pamata vidi. Tas iekļaujas kopējā ``user`` loma, lai izvietotu čaulas dotfiles un SSH ``authorized_keys``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared `user` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH `authorized_keys`."
msgstr "Šī loma rada darbstaciju lietotāja definēto *WORKSTATION_USER* un konfigurē savu pamata vidi. Tas iekļaujas kopējā `user` loma, lai izvietotu čaulas dotfiles un SSH `authorized_keys`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user selected via WORKSTATION_USER and configures the user environment."
msgstr "Šī loma izveido darbstacijas lietotāju izvēlēto caur WORKSTATION_USER un konfigurē lietotāja vidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2` tam pašam mehānismam. Mattermost Team Edition kuģi nav dzimtā OIDC sniedzējs, tāpēc loma cūciņas Keycloak par GitLab OAuth lauks (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` skaits `templates/env.j2`); iegūto ieejas punktu `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, pārmarķēts \"SSO ar Infinito.Nexus\" līdz `templates/javascript.js.j2`, kuru dalītā palīga vārda balstīta pieteikšanās matrica neatzīst. Mattermost v11+ arī kalpo `/landing` intersticiāla neautentificētiem apmeklētājiem, kas notīra tikai vienreiz `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` tiek sēta pirms navigācijas, un dalītajam palīgam nav init-cript āķa, lai to izdarītu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same reason. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `sso.shared: false`: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` or `BIBER_PASSWORD` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2` šā paša iemesla dēļ. `meta/services.yml` adatas `sso.enabled: false` kā arī `sso.shared: false`: MIG kalpo iepriekš izgudrots Meta bezgalīgs grafika pār savu komponēt kaudze un nav pieteikšanās virsmas, bez kontiem, un nav autentificēts valsts vispār. Tātad env fails padara nē `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` vai `BIBER_PASSWORD` lasītājiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` in `vars/main.yml`, attached in `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2` divu dažādu iemeslu dēļ. E ir o pa s MinIO Konsoles versija šeit nekad nepadara SSO pogu — `/api/v1/login` atbildes `redirectRules: null` tomēr identitātes nodrošinātājs ir reģistrēts serveris pusē – tāpēc nav lappusē OIDC ieejas punktu koplietošanas palīgs, lai noklikšķiniet. Biber ir bloķēts, jo vienīgais MinIO politika loma rada ir administrators RBAC grupas ceļš (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` skaits `vars/main.yml`, pievienots `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) kā arī MinIO nav pašapkalpošanās pierakstīšanās, tāpēc bibder kartes nav politikas un nav autentificētas virsmas nevienā līmenī."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The wiki's bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` in `tasks/04_admin.yml` with `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2` divu dažādu iemeslu dēļ. Wiki birokrāts un sisop ir vietējais konts, ko izveidojis `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` skaits `tasks/04_admin.yml` kur: `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — vietējo `credentials.administrator_password`, nevis Keycloak slēpt persona palīgs veic `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` nav pareizs, tāpēc neviena dzimtā forma nepieņem šo paroli, un `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` nolaiž Keycloak identitāte uz atsevišķa, e-pasta, ko sauc par wiki konta, kam nav isop tiesību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`, backed by the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`) and not the normal-realm `ADMIN_PASSWORD` the helper types."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak nodrošina SSO, nevis patērē to: `meta/services.yml` nav `sso` bloks (gads `keycloak` Servisa deklarācija `provides: sso`) un tapas `logout.enabled: false`, tāpēc kanonisko URL nav ne auzu2- proxy vārti, ne in-app OIDC pieteikšanās saiti kopīgotu personu palīgiem, lai noklikšķinātu vai piesakās no. Administratora persona papildus nav sasniedzama, jo Keycloak's tikai admin virsma ir kapteinis-realm konsole, kas pieņem pastāvīgo super-admin kontu (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` skaits `vars/main.yml`, ko atbalsta loma vietējā līmenī `credentials.administrator_password`) un nevis normāls realitāte `ADMIN_PASSWORD` palīdzības veidi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu OIDC dakša interposes savu `/sso/login` lapa, kas satur lokālu pieteikšanās formu blakus `openid-connect/auth` saite, bet autentificēts Roundcube virsma nes `openid-connect/logout` saite; dalītais palīgs atbilst pieteikšanās kontrolēm ar pieejamu nosaukumu un nevar pateikt divas intervālu, tāpēc tas noklikšķina uz atteikšanās. Administratora persona ir bloķēta otru, neatkarīgu iemeslu dēļ: Mailu admin virsma ir atsevišķa Flask lietotne, kas uzstādīta pie `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), nevis `/webmail/` virsū OIDC atzvans nolaižas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo holds no Keycloak client, so the OIDC round-trip the shared helper waits for never happens; the administrator signs in on Matomo's native `index.php?module=Login` form against the local superuser configured in `vars/main.yml`. Biber is blocked for a different reason: the role provisions exactly one Matomo account, that same superuser, and has no per-user provisioning, so biber has no Matomo identity at all."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` kā arī `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` adatas `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo nav Keycloak klients, tāpēc OIDC Round-trip kopīgo palīgs gaida nekad nenotiek; administrators zīmes uz Matomoir dzimtā `index.php?module=Login` forma pret vietējo superlietotājs konfigurēts `vars/main.yml`. Biber ir bloķēta cita iemesla dēļ: loma noteikumi tieši viens Matomo konts, ka pats superlietotājs, un nav viens lietotājs nodrošinājumu, tāpēc biber nav Matomo identitāte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle vietnes administratoru izveido `install_database.php` skaits `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` un pielīdzināja katru pāreju, gan no `administrator` lietotājs, tāpēc dzimtā forma un identitātes sniedzējs veikt vienu noslēpumu. SSO variantā `tasks/04_oidc.yml` komplekti `alternateloginurl` Tātad `/login/index.php` atlec uz OIDC spraudni un pārraksta katru `mdl_user` rinda uz `auth='oidc'`, tā kā neviena veidlapa nepieņem nekādu noslēpumu; SSO-off varianti in `meta/variants.yml` nav OIDC ķēdes, ko aizstāt. Viens env fails tiek renderēts par lomu, nevis par variantu, tāpēc karogam ir jātur sliktākajā gadījumā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "Ar šo uzdevumu paziņo: `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sēž aiz auzu2- kura `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` skaits `meta/services.yml` atzīst tikai `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` kā arī `roles/web-app-kix/user`; Biber pieder ne, tāpēc starpnieks noliedz viņu pirms KIX renderē jebko. Iet uz starpniekserveri KIX ir divu posmu pieteikšanās: SPA joprojām piedāvā savu aģenta formu `/auth` kas saista pret LDAP, un dalītais persona palīgs nav otrā posma pēc Keycloak turp un atpakaļ."

