# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses ``svc-db-postgres`` and ``web-svc-coturn`` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Šis uzdevums ir saistīts ar OpenTalk kaudze, izmantojot Docker Compose un atmasko tīmekļa ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` caur centrālo reverso starpniekserveri. Tas vada Rust kontrolieri, LiveKit WebRTC mediju serveri, React web frontend, veltīta Redis, MinIO kontrollera aktīvu spainis, a RabbitMQ brokeris un OpenTalk MP sanāksmju reģistrators4 arhīvi. Izvēršana ir integrēta ar kopīgu Keycloak sfēra, izmantojot OIDC, un atkārtoti izmanto ``svc-db-postgres`` kā arī ``web-svc-coturn`` relāciju datiem un STUN/TURN. Identitātes vadus skatīt `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ kā arī `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

