# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the Python pull script that talks to each remote provider, installs the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock`. The remote side must expose a chrooted SSH/SFTP endpoint that publishes its backup tree: deploy [user-backup](../user-backup/) for the chrooted pull account and [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the published tree bounded."
msgstr "Šī loma izvieto Python pull skriptu, kas runā ar katru attālināto pakalpojumu sniedzēju, uzstāda sistemātisko pakalpojumu, kas vada to konfigurētajā grafikā (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL`), un ar `sys-lock`. Attālinātajai pusei jāatklāj izrobots SSH/SFTP galapunkts, kas publicē tā rezerves koku: izvietot [user-backup](../user-backup/) choseed pull kontu un [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) turēt publicēto koku norobežotu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the Python pull script that talks to each remote provider, installs the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via ``sys-lock``. The remote side must expose a chrooted SSH/SFTP endpoint that publishes its backup tree: deploy `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ for the chrooted pull account and `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the published tree bounded."
msgstr "Šī loma izvieto Python pull skriptu, kas runā ar katru attālināto pakalpojumu sniedzēju, uzstāda sistemātisko pakalpojumu, kas vada to konfigurētajā grafikā (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL``), un ar ``sys-lock``. Attālinātajai pusei jāatklāj izrobots SSH/SFTP galapunkts, kas publicē tā rezerves koku: izvietot `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ choseed pull kontu un `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ turēt publicēto koku norobežotu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the broker together with a container-API socket proxy in Compose and Swarm deployments. Open WebUI reaches the broker as a second OpenAI connection and forwards the caller's identity. The broker checks the caller's Keycloak group, creates or starts that caller's agent under the isolating runtime, forwards the request to it and streams the answer back. Agents reach their model only through the broker, which relays each call to the shared LiteLLM gateway with its own key and tags it with the owner."
msgstr "Šis uzdevums ir izvietot brokeru kopā ar konteineruAPI ligzdas starpniekserveri Kompožu un Swarm izvietojumus. Atvērt WebUI sasniedz brokeri kā otru OpenAI savienojumu un pāradresē zvanītāja identitāti. Starpnieks pārbauda zvanītāja Keycloak grupa, rada vai sāk, ka zvanītāja aģents zem izolēšanas palaist laiku, uz priekšu pieprasījumu uz to un plūsmas atbildi atpakaļ. Aģenti sasniedz savu modeli tikai caur brokeri, kas relej katru zvanu uz kopīgo LiteLLM vārteja ar savu atslēgu un tags to ar īpašnieku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the broker together with a container-API socket proxy in Compose and Swarm deployments. Open WebUI reaches the broker as a second OpenAI connection and forwards the caller’s identity. The broker checks the caller’s Keycloak group, creates or starts that caller’s agent under the isolating runtime, forwards the request to it and streams the answer back. Agents reach their model only through the broker, which relays each call to the shared LiteLLM gateway with its own key and tags it with the owner."
msgstr "Šis uzdevums ir izvietot brokeru kopā ar konteineruAPI ligzdas starpniekserveri Kompožu un Swarm izvietojumus. Atvērt WebUI sasniedz brokeri kā otru OpenAI savienojumu un pāradresē zvanītāja identitāti. Starpnieks pārbauda zvanītāja Keycloak grupa, rada vai sāk, ka zvanītāja aģents zem izolēšanas palaist laiku, priekšu pieprasījumu uz to un plūsmas atbildi atpakaļ. Aģenti sasniedz savu modeli tikai caur brokeri, kas relej katru zvanu uz kopīgo LiteLLM vārteja ar savu atslēgu un tags to ar īpašnieku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role deploys the official ``jitsi/{web,prosody,jicofo,jvb}`` images as a single-domain Jitsi Meet stack. Authentication is bridged to the central Keycloak via JWT (prosody validates RS256 tokens whose issuer is the realm’s OIDC endpoint), and to OpenLDAP via prosody ``mod_auth_ldap2`` in the LDAP-only matrix variant. The web container sits behind the central openresty reverse proxy at ``meet.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}``; the media plane (jvb) publishes UDP ``10000/udp`` on the host."
msgstr "Šis uzdevums ir izvietot amatpersonas ``jitsi/{web,prosody,jicofo,jvb}`` attēli kā viens domēns Jitsi Meet kaudze. Autentificēšana tiek pārvilkta uz centrālo Keycloak caur JWT (prosody validē RS256 marķieri, kuru emitents ir reāllaika OIDC galapunkts), un uz OpenLDAP caur prozodiju ``mod_auth_ldap2`` tikai LDAP matricas variantā. Tīmekļa konteiners atrodas aiz centrālās openresty reversā starpniekservera ``meet.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}``; mediju plakne (jvb) publicē UDP ``10000/udp`` uz namatēva."

