# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Three settings keys in `vars/main.yml` are silent no-ops on v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` and `security.captcha_secret`. The live `settings` table carries a single `security.captcha` object (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), so all three `UPDATE`s match zero rows and neither `ON_ERROR_STOP` nor the reaper notices. hCaptcha has therefore never been active, which also makes the `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` rationale in `templates/playwright.env.j2` describe protection that is not there. Rewrite the three keys as one object, then decide whether a captcha on the public subscription form is wanted at all."
msgstr "Trīs iestatījumu atslēgas iekš `vars/main.yml` ir kluss nav ops uz v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` kā arī `security.captcha_secret`. Tiešraide `settings` uz galda ir viens `security.captcha` objekts (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), tātad visas trīs `UPDATE`s atbilst nulles rindām un ne `ON_ERROR_STOP` nedz arī ziņas par pļāvēju. Tāpēc hCaptcha nekad nav bijis aktīvs, kas arī padara `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` pamatojums `templates/playwright.env.j2` apraksta aizsardzību, kuras tur nav. Pārrakstīt trīs atslēgas kā vienu objektu, tad izlemt, vai captcha uz publiskās abonēšanas forma ir vēlama vispār."

