msgid "True when *application_id* is reachable over the node onion, i.e. when svc-net-tor is deployed for it (``services.tor.enabled``) AND at least one of its services opts in with ``exposed: true``, which is what earns a ``HiddenServicePort`` (``collect_exposed_ports``)."
msgstr "Patiess, kad *application_id* ir sasniedzama pa mezgla sīpolu, t.i., kad svc-net-tor ir izvietots tā vajadzībām (``services.tor.enabled``) UN vismaz viens no tās pakalpojumiem izvēlas ar ``exposed: true``, kas ir tas, kas pelna ``HiddenServicePort`` (``collect_exposed_ports``)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "True when /proc/version mentions microsoft or wsl. False otherwise."
msgstr "Patiess, kad /proc/versija min microsoft vai wsl. Pretējā gadījumā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
