# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream MDAD is a fully-fledged Ansible playbook (`setup.yml` plus a top-level role `matrix-base` that pulls in roughly seventy sub-roles). It is NOT a drop-in Ansible role: it expects to be the root playbook with its own inventory hosts (`matrix.{{ DOMAIN }}` style) and its own `host_vars/<host>/vars.yml`."
msgstr "Augšpusēja MDAD ir pilnvērtīga Ansible playbook (`setup.yml` plus augstākā līmeņa loma `matrix-base` kas ievelk aptuveni septiņdesmit apakšlomos). Tas nav piliens-in Ansible loma: tā sagaida būt saknes playbook ar savu inventāra saimniekiem (`matrix.{{ DOMAIN }}` stils) un pati `host_vars/<host>/vars.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream OpenTalk supports two `[user_search].backend` values: `keycloak_webapi` and `disabled`. There is no native LDAP backend, so binding OpenTalk directly to OpenLDAP would require a custom backend that is not currently maintained."
msgstr "Augšupceļš OpenTalk atbalsta divus `[user_search].backend` vērtības: `keycloak_webapi` kā arī `disabled`. Nav dzimtā LDAP aizmugure, tāpēc saistošs OpenTalk tieši uz OpenLDAP būtu nepieciešama pielāgota aizmugure, kas pašlaik netiek uzturēta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Augšupceļš ``host:port``: komponēt ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; bars ``<entity>:<internal>`` (dalīta pārklājuma segvārds) pielikuma priekšpusei vai ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` blakusvāģiem (sso-proksi). A ``host_gateway`` Lietotne vada mezgla lokālo zem bara un publicē savu vietējo portu uz resursdatoru, lai pārklātais starpniekserveris sasniedz to ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` caur uzņēmēja vārteju (zvanītājs nosaka šo off reālā DEPLOYMENT_MODE, jo šādas lietotnes piespiest kompožu stila renderēšana). Trūkst bara iekšējās ostas grūti neveiksmes."

