msgid "Upstream registries (Docker Hub, quay.io, mcr.microsoft.com, ghcr.io) impose **rate limits** and occasionally have **availability issues**. CI on GitHub-hosted runners also sees **IP-range- and geo-dependent failures**, plus transient `403`, `429`, and `5xx` responses when many jobs pull the same image directly from upstream. This is especially visible with Playwright images sourced from `mcr.microsoft.com`."
