# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Iet a (iespējams ligzdot) akreditācijas shēmu un emitēt vienu velves bloku uz vienu skalāra lapu ``dest_node``. Neizlemtie dikti (Piemēram, ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) Rekursē uz ligzdu CommentedMaps, lai katra lapa kļūst par savu velves šifrētu ierakstu, nevis tiek sabrukusi caur ``str(dict)`` uz Python-repr blob (salūzušo rezultātu regresija 26428080957 Darbi 77797371397 kā arī 77797371442 aizstāj web-app-espocrm kā arī web-app-listmonk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
