# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When changing the primary email domain (e.g., from `cymais.cloud` to `infinito.nexus`), it is **not enough** to simply rename mailbox directories on disk. Mailu manages domain and user records in its internal database, and Dovecot maintains index files inside each Maildir. A blind rename will lead to login failures, rejected mail, or corrupted mail indices."
msgstr "Mainot primāro e- pasta domēnu (Piemēram, no `cymais.cloud` līdz `infinito.nexus`), tas ir **Nepietiek** vienkārši pārdēvēt pastkastītes uz diska. Mailu pārvalda domēnu un lietotāja ierakstus savā iekšējā datubāzē, un Dovecot uztur indeksa failus katrā Maildir. Akls pārvārds novedīs pie pieteikšanās kļūdām, noraidīta pasta vai bojāta pasta indeksiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When commits are ready to ship, you MUST instruct the operator to run `git-sign-push` outside the sandbox. The CLI is provided by [git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), declared as a dev dependency in [pyproject.toml](pyproject.toml); install it via `make install-python-dev`."
msgstr "Kad saistības ir gatavas kuģim, jums ir jānorāda operators palaist `git-sign-push` ārpus smilšu kastes. KLI nodrošina: [Git-maintainer-tools](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-maintainer-tools), deklarēta kā dev atkarība [pyproject.toml](pyproject.toml); instalēt to caur `make install-python-dev`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
