# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With no `apps=`, the loop defaults to **every application, most-complex first** (the `complexity` CLI: `infinito meta roles applications complexity --sort \"desc weight\" --format string`). That is a large run (one compose plus one swarm deploy per app), so narrow it with `apps=` while iterating."
msgstr "Nav `apps=`, cilpa noklusē uz **katru pieteikumu, lielākā daļa komplekss vispirms** (gads `complexity` KLI: `infinito meta roles applications complexity --sort \"desc weight\" --format string`). Tas ir liels palaist (viens komponēt plus viens bars izvieto vienu lietotni), tik sašaurināt to ar `apps=` kamēr atkārtoju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the broker deployed, Open WebUI runs with `BYPASS_MODEL_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`. A deploy-time step grants every LiteLLM model public read access and each agent model read access for its `agent-user` group only. A `svc-ai-litellm` deploy repeats that step in a running Open WebUI, so a model added to the gateway is visible to every user without an Open WebUI deploy."
msgstr "Brokeris ir izvietots, Open WebUI darbojas ar `BYPASS_MODEL_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`. Izvēršanas laika posms piešķir katru LiteLLM modelis publisko lasīšanas piekļuvi un katrs aģents modelis lasīt piekļuvi tās `agent-user` tikai grupa. A `svc-ai-litellm` izvietot atkārto šo soli darbojas Open WebUI, tāpēc modelis pievienots vārtejai ir redzams katram lietotājam bez Open WebUI izvietot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the label set, the `detect-affected-roles` job in [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) calls [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), which runs the [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) module. The module reads the first fenced block whose YAML carries a `roles:` key (the heading text is not matched) and emits that list as the `whitelist` output, which flows into the deploy tests as precedence rung 2 above. Without the label, the diff-driven precedence applies."
msgstr "Ar etiķetes komplektu `detect-affected-roles` darbs [entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/entry-pr-change-orchestrate.yml) zvani [pr_affected_roles.sh](../../../../scripts/github/resolve/pr_affected_roles.sh), kas [cli.meta.ci.subset_roles](../../../../cli/meta/ci/subset_roles.py) modulis. Modulis nolasa pirmo iežogoto bloku, kura YAML nes `roles:` atslēga (virsraksta teksts nav saskaņots) un emitē šo sarakstu kā `whitelist` izlaide, kas ieplūst izvēršanas testos kā prioritārais posms 2 iepriekš. Bez etiķetes piemēro diff noteikto prioritāti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` reads the token stored for ``administrator`` under this role’s id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC ``initialize`` call, mints a replacement through ``gitlab-rails runner`` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through ``sys-token-store``, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the ``mcp`` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Ar iespējotu servisu, ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` nolasa marķieri, kam saglabāta ``administrator`` saskaņā ar šīs lomas id, zondē to pret skriešanas instance ar JSON-RPC ``initialize`` zvaniet, piparmētru aizvietotāju caur ``gitlab-rails runner`` ja trūkst saglabātās marķierierīces vai tā tiek noraidīta, ieraksta jauno marķierierīci atpakaļ caur ``sys-token-store``, un neīsteno izmantošanu, kad re-profe joprojām noraida. Izkaltā žetons ir personīga piekļuve žetonu, kas ``mcp`` darbības joma ar 364- diena beidzas. Šī joma tiek izfiltrēta no interaktīvā marķiera, tāpēc marķieri šim parametram tiek veidoti programmatiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "With the service enabled, `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` reads the token stored for `administrator` under this role's id, probes it against the running instance with a JSON-RPC `initialize` call, mints a replacement through `gitlab-rails runner` when the stored token is missing or rejected, writes the fresh token back through `sys-token-store`, and fails the deploy when the re-probe is still rejected. The minted token is a personal access token carrying the `mcp` scope with a 364-day expiry. That scope is filtered out of the interactive token picker, so tokens for this endpoint are created programmatically."
msgstr "Ar iespējotu servisu, `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` nolasa marķieri, kam saglabāta `administrator` saskaņā ar šīs lomas id, zondē to pret skriešanas instance ar JSON-RPC `initialize` zvaniet, piparmētru aizvietotāju caur `gitlab-rails runner` ja trūkst saglabātās marķierierīces vai tā tiek noraidīta, ieraksta jauno marķierierīci atpakaļ caur `sys-token-store`, un neīsteno izmantošanu, kad re-profe joprojām noraida. Izkaltā žetons ir personīga piekļuve žetonu, kas `mcp` darbības joma ar 364- diena beidzas. Šī joma tiek izfiltrēta no interaktīvā marķiera, tāpēc marķieri šim parametram tiek veidoti programmatiski."

