# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] A sealed instance is detectable: `/v1/sys/health` returns 503 (asserted by `test-seal-status.js`) and an alert rule fires on that condition. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alert now ships with the role itself, in `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, which the `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenates into the Prometheus rule file. The health-code contract is asserted by the spec suite and the healthy path was confirmed live (200 in both compose and swarm), but the **firing** condition was never observed — that needs an instance deliberately sealed, which the AppRole-only admin model makes awkward to arrange in a test.* **Correction from implementation:** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, so the gauge is `vault_core_unsealed`, not `openbao_core_unsealed` — and it is unusable as an alert source here: on a healthy, demonstrably unsealed node it is emitted as `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so `== 0` would fire permanently. Use the health endpoint as the primary signal, with `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` as the metric-side corroboration. The alert rule itself is still outstanding."
msgstr "[ ] Noslēgta instance ir nosakāma: `/v1/sys/health` atgriež 503 (apstiprina `test-seal-status.js`) un brīdinājuma noteikums ugunsgrēks šādā stāvoklī. *An `OpenBaoSealed` brīdina tagad kuģi ar pašu lomu, jo `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, ko `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenas in the Prometheus noteikumu datne. Veselības kods līgums tiek apgalvots ar spec suite un veselīgs ceļš tika apstiprināts dzīvot (200 gan komponē, gan baros), bet **apdedzināšana** stāvoklis nekad nav novērots — tam ir nepieciešama instance ar nodomu noslēgta, kuru AppRole tikai admin modelis padara neērti sakārtot testa.* **Labojums pēc īstenošanas:** OpenBao saglabā Vault metrisko vārdtelpu, tāpēc mērierīce ir `vault_core_unsealed`, ne `openbao_core_unsealed` — un tas ir nelietojams kā brīdinājuma avots šeit: uz veselīga, pierādāmi nenoslēgta mezgla tas tiek emitēts kā `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, Tāpēc `== 0` varētu uguns uz visiem laikiem. Kā primāro signālu izmantot veselības mērķa kritēriju ar `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` kā metriskās puses koroborāciju. Pats trauksmes noteikums joprojām nav izpildīts."

