# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating an agent optionally provisions a dedicated platform user account via the existing `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mechanism; the agent authenticates as that account (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), and deploying against an existing account instead also works. **Partly done:** the account half is implemented and linted (see [Agent identity](#agent-identity)); the MCP half is **blocked** on no deployed provider offering per-user OAuth, which is the bar [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) sets before `auth_subject: user` may be declared."
msgstr "[ ] Aģenta izveidošana pēc izvēles nodrošina īpašu platformas lietotāja kontu, izmantojot esošo `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mehānisms; aģents autentificējas kā šis konts (OIDC dashboard pieteikšanās, MCP `auth_subject: user`), un izvietošanu pret esošo kontu vietā arī strādā. **Daļēji paveikts:** konta puse ir ieviesta un apskalota (skatīt [Aģenta identitāte](#agent-identity)); MCP puse ir **bloķēts** par nav izvietots pakalpojumu sniedzējs piedāvā katram lietotājam OAuth, kas ir bar [NBP 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) uzstāda pirms `auth_subject: user` var deklarēt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Credentials un slepeni URL komponenti ir prom no žurnāliem, radīts neslepenu konfigurāciju, API atbildes, uzdevumu izvade, Playwright pēdas un izņēmuma teksts. **Trīs no sešām virsmām tiek turētas statiski:** žurnāli un uzdevumu izvade [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), kas prasa `no_log` vai `mask_values` par jebkuru MCP uzdevumu, kas gan apstrādā noslēpumu un izdrukas; Atskaņotwright pēdas pēc [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), kas aizliedz `playwright.env.j2` no izciršanas `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` vai `key_credential` URL komponente. Ģenerētai neslepenai konfigurācijai ir nepieciešama slepena/neslepena renderēto failu klasifikācija, kas vēl nepastāv; API atbildes un izņēmuma teksts ir palaišanas posma novērojumi."

