# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The LDAP scenario MUST be gated via `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('ldap')` so a deploy with `disable=ldap` reports the scenario as `skipped: LDAP_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, never `failed`."
msgstr "[ ] LDAP scenārijs ir jānosaka, izmantojot `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('ldap')` izvietot ar `disable=ldap` paziņo scenāriju kā `skipped: LDAP_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, nekad `failed`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The LDAP scenario MUST exercise BOTH the canonical admin user and the canonical non-admin RBAC user `biber` (per [017](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md)). A role that only asserts the admin path under LDAP MUST flag the biber follow-up in its README until it is added."
msgstr "[ ] LDAP scenārijs jāizmanto BOTH kanonisko admin lietotāju un kanonisko ne-admin RBAC lietotāju `biber` (par [017](017-playwright-biber-rbac-coverage.md)). Loma, kas tikai apgalvo admin ceļu zem LDAP ir atzīmēt biber turpinājums tās LASĪTME līdz tas tiek pievienots."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The Playwright specs of web-app-docs, web-app-keycloak and web-app-dashboard cover the German page, the German logout panel and the German dashboard."
msgstr "[ ] Playwright specifikācijas web-app-docs, web-app-keycloak kā arī web-app-dashboard uz Vācijas lapas, Vācijas izslēgšanas paneļa un Vācijas paneļa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] The `{ at_uri ↔ mobilizon_event_id }` mapping persists to a role-local store and is designed to support future dedup for a reverse path (Open Question 4)."
msgstr "[ ] E ir o pa s `{ at_uri ↔ mobilizon_event_id }` kartēšana turpinās uz lomu lokālo veikalu un ir izstrādāta, lai atbalstītu nākotnes dedup apgrieztam ceļam (Atvērt jautājumu 4)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The agent can read a granted sensor and actuate a granted output through its embodied access. **Blocked:** see [Hardware blockers](#hardware-blockers)."
msgstr "[ ] Aģents var nolasīt piešķirto sensoru un iedarbināt piešķirto produkciju, izmantojot tā iemiesoto piekļuvi. **Bloķēts:** skatīt [Aparatūras blokatori](#hardware-blockers)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The agent receiver (container port `8000`) is mapped to a host port (Decision #4) and reachable for TLS agent registration."
msgstr "[ ] Aģenta saņēmējs (konteinera osta `8000`) ir kartēts uz resursdatora portu (Lēmums #4) un var saņemt TLS aģentu reģistrāciju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The aggregator cache persists to a role-local volume declared in `meta/volumes.yml` and survives a container restart."
msgstr "[ ] Apkopotāja kešatmiņa saglabājas līdz vietējai lomai, kas deklarēta `meta/volumes.yml` un izdzīvo konteineru restart."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The app is reachable at its generated canonical domain (`penpot.design.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`, e.g. `penpot.design.infinito.nexus`)."
msgstr "[ ] Lietotne ir sasniedzama pie tās ģenerētā kanoniskā domēna (`penpot.design.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`, piemēram, `penpot.design.infinito.nexus`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The audit reproduces every row of the [Current State Audit](#current-state-audit), including the `bridge`-mechanism (`web-app-matrix`), the newly surveyed `plugin`/`extension` roles (`web-app-discourse`, `web-app-pretix`, `web-app-mattermost`, `desk-chromium`, `desk-firefox`, `desk-gnome`), and the out-of-scope `db-extension` roles (`web-app-mobilizon`, `web-app-bookwyrm`), and records, per role, the addon ids, their `mechanism`, their `required` state, and their `bridges`."
msgstr "[ ] Revīzija atspoguļo katru [Pašreizējā valsts revīzija](#current-state-audit), tostarp `bridge`- mehānisms (`web-app-matrix`), nesen aptaujāto `plugin`/`extension` lomas (`web-app-discourse`, `web-app-pretix`, `web-app-mattermost`, `desk-chromium`, `desk-firefox`, `desk-gnome`)un ārpus darbības jomas `db-extension` lomas (`web-app-mobilizon`, `web-app-bookwyrm`), un ieraksti par katru lomu, addon ID, to `mechanism`, to `required` stāvoklis, un to `bridges`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The biber scenario MUST end on a deterministic post-login surface (a URL, a heading, or a stable role-specific selector) that is observable to a non-admin user. Asserting on admin-only UI from the biber session is forbidden. The point of the scenario is to prove the non-admin path works, not to re-test admin."
msgstr "[ ] Biber scenārijs jānobeidz uz deterministisku post-login virsmas (URL, kursu vai stabilu lomu specifisku selektoru) kas ir novērojama ne-admin lietotājam. Asserting uz admin tikai UI no bibder sesijas ir aizliegta. Scenārija mērķis ir pierādīt neadmin ceļa darbu, nevis atkārtoti pārbaudīt admin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The biber scenario MUST follow the `biber: <flow>` naming convention from 019 Rule 3, enforced by [test_naming.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/persona/test_naming.py). A role that legitimately cannot run a biber journey opts out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` per 019 Rule 11."
msgstr "[ ] Bībera scenārijam ir jāseko `biber: <flow>` Nosaucot konvenciju no 019 Pants 3, izpilda: [test_naming.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/persona/test_naming.py). Loma, ka likumīgi nevar palaist biber ceļojums izvēlas, izmantojot `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` skaits `templates/playwright.env.j2` par 019 Pants 11."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The biber scenario MUST gate on the same service flags that the matching admin scenario uses (typically `oidc`, `ldap`, or both), via the `skipUnlessServiceEnabled` helper from [006](README.md#archive). Operators running with `disable=oidc` MUST see the biber scenario as `skipped` with the canonical reason string, never as `failed`."
msgstr "[ ] Biber scenārijs MUST vārti uz tiem pašiem pakalpojumu karogiem, kas atbilst admin scenārijs izmanto (parasti `oidc`, `ldap`, vai abi), izmantojot `skipUnlessServiceEnabled` palīgs no [006](README.md#archive). Operatori darbojas ar `disable=oidc` BĪBELES Scenārijs `skipped` ar kanonisko iemeslu virknes, nekad kā `failed`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] The chosen auth integration is provisioned non-interactively: for LDAP, `jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth` is installed and configured against `svc-db-openldap` (server/bind/search/attributes); for the OIDC plugin, it is installed and pointed at Keycloak."
msgstr "[ ] Izvēlētā auth integrācija ir nodrošināta neinteraktīvi: LDAP, `jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth` ir uzstādīta un konfigurēta pret `svc-db-openldap` (server/bind/search/attributes); par OIDC spraudnis, tas ir uzstādīts un norādīja uz Keycloak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
