# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `files/playwright/test-login-ldap-biber.js`: LDAP login path, gated on `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('ldap')`."
msgstr "[ ] `files/playwright/test-login-ldap-biber.js`: LDAP pieteikšanās ceļš, gated on `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('ldap')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `files/playwright/test-login-native-administrator.js`: break-glass local admin login, gated to **ldap-disabled** (Semaphore forces LDAP-only form auth when ldap is enabled); the skip carries a reason naming `LDAP_SERVICE_ENABLED`."
msgstr "[ ] `files/playwright/test-login-native-administrator.js`: break-stikla lokālā admin login, ganed uz **ldap-disabled** (Semafore spēki LDAP- tikai forma auth kad ldap ir ieslēgta); izlaist ir iemesls nosaukt `LDAP_SERVICE_ENABLED`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `files/playwright/test-login-oidc-biber.js` and `test-login-oidc-administrator.js`: OIDC personas reach an authenticated surface, drive a role-specific interaction (e.g. open the Projects list / admin Users panel), and log out to a verified unauthenticated landing. Gated on `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('sso')`."
msgstr "[ ] `files/playwright/test-login-oidc-biber.js` kā arī `test-login-oidc-administrator.js`: OIDC personas sasniegt autentificētu virsmu, vadīt lomu specifiska mijiedarbība (Piemēram, atver projektu sarakstu / admin lietotāju paneli), un iziet uz pārbaudītu bezautentiska nosēšanās. Platums: `skipUnlessServiceEnabled('sso')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `lookup('tls', '<x>.onion')` → http/disabled/80, no ACME attempted; app vhosts serve onion `server_name`s on `:80`; every app reachable at `<sub>.<NODE_ONION>.onion` through `HiddenServicePort 80 → 127.0.0.1:80`."
msgstr "[ ] `lookup('tls', '<x>.onion')` → http/disabled/80, nav ACME mēģinājums; app vhosts kalpot sīpolu `server_name`irs `:80`; katru lietotni, ko var `<sub>.<NODE_ONION>.onion` caur `HiddenServicePort 80 → 127.0.0.1:80`."

