# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) at the repository root holds the most recent releases inline. Older releases live one-file-per-version under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/), linked from the `## Older Releases` section at the bottom of the active changelog."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) krātuvē root tur jaunākās releases inline. Gados vecāki izlaidumi dzīvot vienu failu per- version zem [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/), saistīts ar `## Older Releases` aktīvā izmaiņu žurnāla apakšdaļā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) is trimmed; every older entry is written to its own file under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/) named `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, and the `## Older Releases` index at the bottom of the active changelog is rebuilt from the archive directory listing so it never drifts away from what is on disk."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) ir apstrādāts; katrs vecāks ieraksts ir rakstīts uz savu failu saskaņā [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/) nosaukums `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, kā arī `## Older Releases` indekss apakšā aktīvā changelog tiek pārbūvēts no arhīva direktoriju sarakstā, tāpēc tas nekad dreifē prom no tā, kas ir uz diska."

