# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Hugo](https://gohugo.io/) is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: [gohugoio/hugoDocs](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs)) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "[Hugo](https://gohugo.io/) ir ātrs, vienreizējs statisks vietnes ģenerators, kas rakstīts Go. Šī loma veido Hugo vieta no augšas Git repozitorijs (noklusētais: [gohugoio/hugoDocs](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs)) attēla veidošanas laikā un kalpo renderētam HTML/CSS/JS nginx. Nav datu bāzes, nav programmu servera, un nav dinamiskas aizmugures pie palaišanas."

