# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[NFS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System) (Network File System) is a kernel-level protocol for sharing files over a network. The server exports a directory tree under defined access rules; clients mount it as if it were a local filesystem."
msgstr "[NFS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System) (Tīkla failu sistēma) ir kodola līmeņa protokols failu kopīgošanai tīklā. Serveris eksportē direktoriju koku saskaņā ar noteiktiem piekļuves noteikumiem; klienti to montē tā, it kā tā būtu lokāla failu sistēma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[NFS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System) (Network File System) lets a host mount a directory exported by a remote server as if it were a local filesystem. The client packages provide the kernel helpers and userspace tools to perform that mount."
msgstr "[NFS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System) (Tīkla failu sistēma) ļauj datoram montēt mapi, ko eksportē attālināts serveris, it kā tā būtu lokāla failu sistēma. Klienta paketes nodrošina kodola palīgus un userpace rīkus, lai veiktu šo mount."

