# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] A restore procedure is documented and executed once end to end: restore the volume, redeploy, and confirm the instance auto-unseals and a previously stored secret is still readable. Drill run on the variant-2 stack: container quiesced, `openbao_data` archived (33 MB), the live volume **wiped to zero entries**, restored from the archive, and restarted — OpenBao came back `initialized: true, sealed: false` with the secret, the PKI root CA and all five policies recovered. This also confirms the documented dependency: the restored store is only readable because the seal key in the inventory was unchanged."
msgstr "[x] Atjaunošanas procedūra tiek dokumentēta un izpildīta, kad beidzas: atjauno skaļumu, pārdislocē, apstiprina instance auto-unseals un iepriekš glabāts noslēpums joprojām ir lasāms. Drils darbojas ar variantu2 kaudze: konteiners quiesced, `openbao_data` arhivēts (33 MB), dzīvsvars **Notīrīti līdz nullei**, atjaunots no arhīva, un restartēja - OpenBao atgriezās `initialized: true, sealed: false` ar noslēpumu, PKI saknes CA un visas piecas politikas atgūti. Tas arī apstiprina dokumentēto atkarību: atjaunotais veikals ir lasāms tikai tāpēc, ka inventāra zīmoga atslēga bija nemainīga."

