# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint accepts `implementation: adapter` only with one allowed adapter type and all mandatory immutable-source, credential, endpoint, limit, and tool-contract fields. [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) rejects a type outside `MCP_ADAPTER_TYPES`, a `specification_path` that is not a checked-in file under `roles/<role>/files/`, a missing `specification_sha256`, and a server-capable block missing `credential`, `endpoint` or `limits` — each with its required sub-keys."
msgstr "[x] Lint pieņem `implementation: adapter` tikai ar vienu atļauto adaptera tipu un visiem obligātajiem nemaināmajiem avotiem, kredentiālajiem, galapunktiem, ierobežojumiem un instrumentu līguma laukiem. [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) noraida tipu ārpus `MCP_ADAPTER_TYPES`, a `specification_path` kas nav pārbaudīts fails zem `roles/<role>/files/`, trūkst `specification_sha256`, un trūkst servera darbspējīgā bloka `credential`, `endpoint` vai `limits` — katram ar nepieciešamajiem apakštaustiņiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Lint allows role-level service dependencies that are not addon bridges, such as Friendica's `sso` front-door auth gate, to remain in `meta/services.yml` without appearing under an unrelated addon's `bridges:`."
msgstr "[x] Lint ļauj lomu līmeņa pakalpojumu atkarības, kas nav addon tilti, piemēram Friendica's `sso` Priekšējo durvju auth vārti, palikt `meta/services.yml` neparādās zem nesaistīta addona `bridges:`."

