msgstr "[x] LASĪTĀJS nepārprotami brīdina, ka fiziskās aparatūras drošība (E-stop, kustības/strāvas ierobežojumi, droša vadu sistēma) ir operatora atbildība un ārpus platformas darbības jomas; loma apgalvo, ka nav drošības garantijas, ko tas nepiemēro."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The README states explicitly that the volume backup is **worthless without the seal key**, that the seal key's authoritative home is the encrypted inventory (it is not covered by `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, whose sources are `DIR_SECRETS`, the CA and the ACME material), and what the recovery keys can and cannot do."
msgstr "[x] LASĪTME skaidri norāda, ka skaļuma rezerves kopija ir **bezvērtīgs bez zīmoga taustiņa**, ka zīmoga atslēga ir autoritatīvs mājās ir šifrēts inventāra (uz to neattiecas `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, kuru avoti ir `DIR_SECRETS`, CA un ACME materiāls), un ko atveseļošanās atslēgas var un nevar darīt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The README states the consequence of Decision #2 that surfaced during implementation: because the root token is revoked and the recovery keys are **not** persisted (persisting them would be the write-back the AppRole bootstrap exists to avoid), the Ansible AppRole is the *only* administrative path into the instance. Losing or out-of-band-changing those credentials means rebuilding from the volume backup plus the seal key."
msgstr "[x] LASĪTUMĀ ir noteiktas Lēmuma #2 ka parādījās īstenošanas laikā: jo saknes marķieris ir atsaukts un atgūšanas atslēgas ir **nav** saglabājās (saglabāt tos būtu rakstīt atpakaļ AppRole bootstrap pastāv, lai izvairītos no), Ansible AppRole ir *tikai* administratīvais ceļš instancei. Šo datu zudums vai izmainīšana ārpus joslas nozīmē pārbūvi no skaļuma rezerves kopijas plus zīmoga taustiņu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The [`roles_with_service`](../../plugins/lookup/roles_with_service.py) lookup, extended for `direction in [server, both]` and endpoint metadata, returns the connection data client roles need for enabled shared MCP server roles, without adding a generated repository-wide application dictionary."
msgstr "[x] E ir o pa s [`roles_with_service`](../../plugins/lookup/roles_with_service.py) Lookup, pagarināts `direction in [server, both]` un galapunktu metadati, atgriež savienojuma datu klienta lomas, kas nepieciešamas, lai aktivizētu kopīgotu MCP servera lomas, nepievienojot ģenerētu repozitorija mēroga lietojumprogrammu vārdnīcu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `agent-broker.agents` keys reach the running broker from `meta/services.yml`, so an inventory override changes its behaviour."
msgstr "[x] E ir o pa s `agent-broker.agents` atslēgas sasniegt skriešanas brokeris no `meta/services.yml`, tāpēc inventāra ignorēt mainīt savu uzvedību."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `container_backup` service is wired with `backup.no_stop_required: false`, so the container is quiesced for a consistent copy of the raft volume."
msgstr "[x] E ir o pa s `container_backup` pakalpojums ir pieslēgts ar `backup.no_stop_required: false`, tāpēc konteiners ir wiesced konsekventu kopiju plosta apjomu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `seal \"static\"` stanza reads its key via `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`; the key is a `meta/secrets.yml` credential and never appears literally in a template, a task argument or a committed file."
msgstr "[x] E ir o pa s `seal \"static\"` stanza lasa savu atslēgu caur `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`; atslēga ir `meta/secrets.yml` credential un nekad parādās burtiski veidnē, uzdevuma argumentu vai apņēmusies failu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The `test-e2e-playwright` role stages `files/playwright/` recursively and discovers specs recursively, so `files/playwright/addons/*.spec.js` are staged and run."
msgstr "[x] E ir o pa s `test-e2e-playwright` lomu posmi `files/playwright/` rekursīvi un atklāj specs rekursīvi, tāpēc `files/playwright/addons/*.spec.js` ir inscenēti un darbojas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The agent MUST iterate on this workflow per [Workflow Loop](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) until it passes end to end on the default branch's runner. The requirement is NOT closed while the workflow is red."
msgstr "[x] Aģentam ir jāatkārto šī darbplūsma per [Darbplūsmas cilpa](../agents/action/iteration/workflow.md) līdz brīdim, kad tas pāriet līdz beigām uz noklusējuma filiāles skrējējs. Šī prasība NAV slēgta, kamēr darbplūsma ir sarkana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The agent runtime stays isolated; any host-metrics dashboard is either embedded or a separate `runc` sidecar and does not force the agent tier out of the isolated runtime."
msgstr "[x] Aģenta runtime paliek izolēts; jebkurš host-metrics paneļa ir vai nu iegulta vai atsevišķu `runc` blakusvāģi un nepiespiež aģenta līmeni no izolētā noskriešanas laika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The application loader reads `meta/addons/` for every role and exposes `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>` through `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."
msgstr "[x] Piemērošanas iekrāvējs `meta/addons/` par katru lomu un atmasko `applications.<role_id>.addons.<addon_id>` caur `lookup('config', application_id, 'addons.<addon_id>')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The asset-storage volume is backed up via the existing backup role(s)."
msgstr "[x] Aktīvu uzglabāšanas apjomu papildina pašreizējā rezerves loma(s)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The clone respects the role-wide CA-trust env so HTTPS clone works behind the local CA terminator."
msgstr "[x] Klons respektē lomu visā CA-trust env tāpēc HTTPS klons darbojas aiz vietējā CA terminatora."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The compose flavor's deprecated status is surfaced in `roles/web-app-matrix/README.md` (lifecycle/`meta/info.yml::deprecated` is not part of the schema; the deprecation contract lives in the README and the `tasks/main.yml` dispatch comment)."
msgstr "[x] Komponēt garšas novecojusi statusu ir virsmas `roles/web-app-matrix/README.md` (dzīves cikls/`meta/info.yml::deprecated` nav daļa no shēmas; deprekācijas līgums dzīvo LASĪTME un `tasks/main.yml` nosūtīt komentāru)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The container healthcheck uses `sealedcode=200&uninitcode=200` so a freshly created, not-yet-initialised container becomes healthy enough for the init task to run, while the monitoring probe keeps the strict codes. Both halves asserted by `test-seal-status.js`; the deploy's init step only ran because the pre-init container reported healthy."
msgstr "[x] Konteinera veselības pārbaude izmanto `sealedcode=200&uninitcode=200` Tik tikko radīts, ne-vēl-inicializēts konteiners kļūst pietiekami vesels, lai init uzdevums darboties, bet uzraudzības zonde saglabā stingrus kodus. Abas puses apgalvoja, ka `test-seal-status.js`; izvietojuma init solis ilga tikai tāpēc, ka pirms init konteineru ziņoja veselīgi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The dashboard at `/de/` shows the German translation of at least one card description and one menu category."
msgstr "[x] Panelis `/de/` norāda vismaz vienas kartes aprakstu un vienas izvēlnes kategorijas tulkojumu vācu valodā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The declarative user configuration can assign `mcp` to one application without assigning it to any other application."
msgstr "[x] Deklaratīvā lietotāja konfigurācija var piešķirt `mcp` vienam pieteikumam, nepiešķirot to citam pieteikumam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The deploy fails when a role declares the AI surface enabled while its configuration still carries an empty or unresolved API key, so a silently unauthenticated surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[x] Izvietošana neizdodas, ja kāda loma paziņo, ka AI virsma ir iespējota, kamēr tās konfigurācija joprojām ir tukša vai neatrisināta API galvenais, tāpēc klusi neautentificēta virsma nevar sasniegt zaļo izvietojumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The deploy resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` per role from inventory: `swarm` iff `len(groups[application_id]) > 1`, else `compose`. Topology is the single source of truth; there is no per-role mode flag."
msgstr "[x] Izvēršanas risinājumi `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` pēc inventarizācijas lomas: `swarm` iff `len(groups[application_id]) > 1`, citi `compose`. Topoloģija ir vienīgais patiesības avots; nav karoga par lomu režīmā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The existing [svc-prx-openresty](../../roles/svc-prx-openresty/) remains the reverse proxy under BOTH `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` AND `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`. No new reverse-proxy role is introduced by this requirement. This preserves the full `sys-front-inj-*` frontend-injection pipeline ([roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2](../../roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2)) — CSP-meta stripping, head/body snippet injection for Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout — which is openresty-Lua-specific and has no equivalent in Traefik without a non-trivial plugin port."
msgstr "[x] Spēkā esošais [svc-prx-openresty](../../roles/svc-prx-openresty/) paliek pretējais starpnieks saskaņā ar Both `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` UN `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`. Ar šo prasību netiek ieviesta jauna reversā starpnieka loma. Tas saglabā visu `sys-front-inj-*` priekšgala iesmidzināšanas caurule ([roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2](../../roles/sys-front-inj-all/templates/body_filter.lua.j2)) — CSP-meta-svītru uzlikšana, galvas/ķermeņa fragmentu injekcija Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Atteikties – kas ir openresty-Lua-specific un nav ekvivalenta Traefik bez ne-trivial spraudnis ports."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The existing backup documentation gains an NFS section covering: snapshot semantics on the NFS server, restore procedure, and interaction with the existing `svc-bkp-*` roles."
msgstr "[x] Esošā rezerves dokumentācija iegūst NFS sadaļu, kas aptver: momentuzņēmumu semantiku uz NFS servera, atjaunošanas procedūru un mijiedarbību ar esošo `svc-bkp-*` lomas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The first prompt of an entitled user creates exactly one agent for that user and platform and returns the agent's answer in Open WebUI."
msgstr "[x] Pirmais uzvedums par tiesīgais lietotājs rada tieši vienu aģentu šim lietotājam un platformai un atgriež aģenta atbildi Open WebUI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The first slice is dashboard-only; no chat-platform connector is required for a green deploy."
msgstr "[x] Pirmais šķēle ir paneļa tikai; nav tērzēšanas platformas savienotājs ir nepieciešama zaļā izvietojumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The gateway rejects unauthenticated requests; each consumer authenticates with its own LiteLLM virtual key, and revoking one key blocks only that consumer."
msgstr "[x] Vārteja noraida neautentiskus pieprasījumus; katrs patērētājs autentificējas ar savu LiteLLM virtuālo atslēgu, un atceļ vienu galveno bloku tikai šo patērētāju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The generated redirect URIs cover both `/v1/auth/oidc/callback` and `/ui/vault/auth/oidc/oidc/callback` (the `redirect_uris` wildcard), and the OpenBao OIDC role's `allowed_redirect_uris` lists them explicitly. Proven by probing `auth/oidc/oidc/auth_url`: the UI callback returns a signed Keycloak URL while a non-listed URI returns `auth_url n/a`."
msgstr "[x] Izveidotais novirzītais URIs pārklāj abus `/v1/auth/oidc/callback` kā arī `/ui/vault/auth/oidc/oidc/callback` (gads `redirect_uris` tramplīns), kā arī OpenBao OIDC loma `allowed_redirect_uris` skaidri uzskaitīti. Pierādīts, piesakoties `auth/oidc/oidc/auth_url`: SRN atzvanīšana atgriež parakstītu Keycloak URL, kamēr sarakstā neiekļauts URI atgriež `auth_url n/a`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The group→policy mapping is driven by `lookup('rbac_group_path', application_id='web-app-openbao', role='<role>')`; no group path is assembled inline."
msgstr "[x] Grupa→politikas kartēšanu virza `lookup('rbac_group_path', application_id='web-app-openbao', role='<role>')`; nav grupas ceļš ir salikts ierindā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The hook excludes a candidate whose capabilities cannot serve the request (context window, vision, tools, output length), reading them from LiteLLM's catalog and letting a declared `traits` mapping override it."
msgstr "[x] Āķis izslēdz kandidātu, kura spējas nevar kalpot pieprasījumam (konteksta logs, redze, instrumenti, izejas garums), lasot tos no LiteLLM katalogu un ļaujot deklarēto `traits` kartēšana to aizstāj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The hook reads every catalogued field a request can act on, a demanded capability is proven before use, and a disqualifier fires only on explicit evidence."
msgstr "[x] Āķis nolasa katru kataloģizētu lauku, uz kuru pieprasījums var reaģēt, pirms izmantošanas ir pierādītas vajadzīgās spējas, un diskvalificētājs ugunsgrēku tikai ar skaidriem pierādījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The image is pinned to `openbao/openbao:2.6.2` (no `:latest`, no `v` prefix)."
msgstr "[x] Attēls ir piestiprināts pie `openbao/openbao:2.6.2` (nav `:latest`, nē `v` prefikss)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The listener runs with `tls_disable = true` and is reachable only on the role-local docker network and the localhost-bound `ports.local.http`; it is not bound on `0.0.0.0` of the host."
msgstr "[x] Klausītājs darbojas ar `tls_disable = true` un ir sasniedzama tikai lomu-vietējā docker tīklā un localhost-saistīts `ports.local.http`, tas nav saistošs `0.0.0.0` no uzņēmēja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The logout panel takes the text direction of every language from `meta/languages.yml`."
msgstr "[x] Atteikšanās panelis ņem teksta virzienu no katras valodas `meta/languages.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[x] The metrics endpoint is not reachable through `sys-svc-proxy` from outside the role-local docker network. It **was** publicly readable (HTTP 200 through the proxy) until a `location = /v1/sys/metrics { deny all; }` was added in the role's `templates/proxy.conf.j2`; `test-rbac-denial.js` now asserts the endpoint never answers 200 on the public surface."
msgstr "[x] Ar `sys-svc-proxy` ārpus vietējā dokera tīkla. Tas **bija** publiski lasāms (HTTP 200 caur starpniekserveri) līdz `location = /v1/sys/metrics { deny all; }` tika pievienots `templates/proxy.conf.j2`; `test-rbac-denial.js` tagad apgalvo galapunkts nekad atbildēt 200 uz sabiedriskās virsmas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The native `mcp_server` integration is enabled and declared in `meta/services.yml` as `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, conforming to the [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) schema and lint."
msgstr "[x] Dzimtā `mcp_server` integrācija ir ieslēgta un deklarēta `meta/services.yml` kā `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, kas atbilst [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) shēmu un lint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The operational metadata stays role-local: authoritative source, transport, authentication, real credential subject, read/write scope, tool allowlist, proposed implementation, selected consumers, and blocker all live in the role's own `meta/mcp.yml`, and [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) enforces their shape there. A generated report aggregating them was removed: scope and credential subject were identical for every role, so the table restated its sources instead of deriving anything from them."
msgstr "[x] Operatīvie metadati paliek vietēji: autoritatīvs avots, transports, autentificēšana, reāls kredentisks priekšmets, lasīšanas/rakstīšanas joma, rīku atļaušanas saraksts, ierosinātā īstenošana, izvēlēti patērētāji, un bloķētājs visi dzīvo lomu pašu `meta/mcp.yml`, un [test_mcp_schema.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_schema.py) Uzspiež savu formu tur. Tika svītrots sastādīts ziņojums, kurā tās apkopotas: darbības joma un akreditācijas temats bija identiski katrai lomai, tāpēc tabulā tika atkārtoti minēti tās avoti, nevis kaut kas no tiem izriet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The play enables AppRole, sets the Ansible `role_id` and `secret_id` from the inventory credentials via `role-id` / `custom-secret-id`, and **revokes the root token before the play ends**; `bao token lookup` on the old root token fails afterwards."
msgstr "[x] Atskaņošana ļauj AppRole, uzstāda Ansible `role_id` kā arī `secret_id` no uzskaites datiem, izmantojot `role-id` / `custom-secret-id`, un **atsauc saknes marķieri pirms atskaņošanas beigām**; `bao token lookup` par veco saknes marķieri neizdodas pēc tam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The pre-call hook is a Python file the role renders next to `config.yaml` and LiteLLM imports by `module.instance`; `services.litellm.image` and its pinned version are unchanged."
msgstr "[x] Pirmsizsaukuma āķis ir Python fails, kura loma renderē blakus `config.yaml` un LiteLLM imports `module.instance`; `services.litellm.image` un tā pinned versija nav mainīta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The raft volume is declared `nfs: false` with a `# nocheck: nfs-false-data-loss` reason; no OpenBao state is placed on an NFS-backed volume in any mode."
msgstr "[x] Norāda plosta tilpumu `nfs: false` ar `# nocheck: nfs-false-data-loss` iemesls; nē OpenBao stāvokli jebkurā režīmā novieto uz tilpuma ar NFS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role declares menu tags: `design`, `penpot`, `prototyping`, `collaboration`, `ui-ux`, `figma-alternative`."
msgstr "[x] Loma deklarē izvēlnes tagus: `design`, `penpot`, `prototyping`, `collaboration`, `ui-ux`, `figma-alternative`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role emits a `Content-Security-Policy` header on the canonical surface, and the OpenBao UI renders without CSP violations under it. (`test-guest-persona.js` asserts the CSP injections; the UI renders and the in-page `fetch` to `/v1/...` is not blocked.)"
msgstr "[x] Loma rada `Content-Security-Policy` galvene uz kanoniskās virsmas, un OpenBao UI renderē bez CSP pārkāpumiem zem tā. (`test-guest-persona.js` apstiprina CSP injekcijas; SRN renderē un lappusē `fetch` līdz `/v1/...` nav bloķēta.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role exposes stack-management primitives (`deploy`, `update`, `remove`) consumable by the deploy pipeline of any role rendering a swarm stack."
msgstr "[x] Loma atklāj steka vadības primitīvi (`deploy`, `update`, `remove`) izlietojamo cauruļvada jebkuras funkcijas padarot baru steku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role generates a correct Nginx/CSP vhost using [csp_filters.py](../../plugins/filter/csp_filters.py) and the `nginx_vhost` logic (via `sys-stk-full` + `meta/server.yml` CSP flags)."
msgstr "[x] Loma rada pareizu Nginx / CSP vhost izmantojot [csp_filters.py](../../plugins/filter/csp_filters.py) un `nginx_vhost` loģika (caur `sys-stk-full` + `meta/server.yml` CSP karogi)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role hard-fails (placement/preflight guard) when targeted at a node carrying a shared-workload label or hosting other tenants."
msgstr "[x] Grūtības (novietojums/pirmslidojuma aizsargs) ja tas paredzēts mezglam, kam ir kopīga darba slodzes zīme vai kas mitina citus īrniekus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role is added to 025's MCP audit as a `server` role."
msgstr "[x] Šo lomu papildina 025MCP revīziju kā `server` loma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role is compatible with — and exercised by — the CLI script described under **CLI: `cli/administration/deploy/runner/`** below; deploying through that script against a fresh host MUST yield a working runner without manual post-steps."
msgstr "[x] Šī loma ir saderīga ar CLI skriptu, kas aprakstīts iepriekš. **KLI: `cli/administration/deploy/runner/`** zem; izvietojot caur šo skriptu pret svaigu resursdatoru jādod darba skrējējs bez manuālas post-soli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role is independently deployable (no implicit pull-in by other roles)."
msgstr "[x] Šī loma ir īstenojama neatkarīgi (nav citu lomu netiešas pievilkšanas)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role renders a valid `docker-stack.yml` for any role whose target host is in `svc-swarm-node`, derived from the same per-role inputs as today's `docker-compose.yml`."
msgstr "[x] Funkcija padara spēkā esošu `docker-stack.yml` katrai lomai, kuras mērķauditorija ir `svc-swarm-node`, atvasināts no tās pašas per-lome ieejas kā šodienas `docker-compose.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role runs on `arm64`."
msgstr "[x] Loma turpinās `arm64`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role service design docs link to the MCP contract and explain why stdio MCP is not enabled in deployed web roles by default."
msgstr "[x] Loma pakalpojumu dizaina docs saite ar MCP līgumu un paskaidro, kāpēc stdio MCP nav iespējota izvērstās tīmekļa lomas pēc noklusējuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role uses no node-local `force_bridge` network, so the swarm Prometheus can reach the native-metrics target (the `native_metrics_apps` lookup gates `force_bridge` apps out of the scrape). Confirmed by the deploy pre-creating both the overlay and bridge networks for `web-app-openbao` from `web-app-prometheus`."
msgstr "[x] Funkcija nelieto mezglu lokālu `force_bridge` tīkls, lai bars Prometheus var sasniegt vietējo rādītāju mērķi (gads `native_metrics_apps` skatīšanās vārti `force_bridge` lietotnes ārā no skrāpējumiem). Apstiprināts ar izvietošanu iepriekš radīt gan pārklājuma un tiltu tīklu `web-app-openbao` no `web-app-prometheus`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role's `README.md` documents the runner's purpose, the CLI entry point, and how to invoke it end-to-end."
msgstr "[x] Nozīme `README.md` dokumentē skrējēja mērķi, CLI ieejas punktu un to, kā to izmantot līdz galam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The role's compose template sets `service_update_order = 'stop-first'`, so a swarm rolling update never runs two tasks against the same raft directory. Confirmed on the live cluster: the service's `UpdateConfig.Order` is `stop-first` with `Replicas 1`."
msgstr "[x] Loma komponē sagatavju komplektus `service_update_order = 'stop-first'`, tāpēc bars ritošā atjauninājumu nekad veic divus uzdevumus pret vienu un to pašu plostu direktoriju. Apstiprināts uz dzīvā klastera: pakalpojuma `UpdateConfig.Order` ir `stop-first` kur: `Replicas 1`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The routing probe treats the alias as served rather than as a route without a backend, and fails when the gateway withholds it."
msgstr "[x] Maršrutēšanas zonde uztver segvārdus kā apkalpotus, nevis kā maršrutu bez aizmugures, un neiztur, kad vārti to aiztur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The runner choice is fixed to GitHub-hosted DinD for reproducibility — every PR run is identical and depends on no self-hosted infrastructure. Migrating to a self-hosted runner (e.g. [014](014-svc-runner-ci.md)) is a Future Extension, not part of this requirement."
msgstr "[x] Skrējēja izvēle ir fiksēta GitHub hosted Dind reproducējamībai — katrs PR palaist ir identisks un ir atkarīgs no nav pašsaturēta infrastruktūra. Pārcelšanās uz pašsaņemamu skrējēju (Piemēram, [014](014-svc-runner-ci.md)) ir nākotnes paplašinājums, kas nav šīs prasības daļa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The same CLI test proves from the broker's `relay` events that a `hermes` and an `openclaw` agent each got a model answer from LiteLLM, independent of what the model wrote."
msgstr "[x] Tas pats CLI tests pierāda no brokeru `relay` pacientiem, kuri `hermes` un `openclaw` aģents katrs saņēma modeļa atbildi no LiteLLM, neatkarīgi no tā, ko modelis rakstīja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The same request picks the same model twice, with no inference and no download on any path."
msgstr "[x] Tas pats pieprasījums izvēlas vienu un to pašu modeli divreiz, bez secinājumiem un bez lejupielādes jebkurā ceļā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The same spec grants `biber` the `agent-user` groups, logs in again and asserts an answer from `hermes` and from `openclaw` through Open WebUI."
msgstr "[x] Tās pašas specdotācijas `biber` gads `agent-user` grupas, piesakās atkal un apgalvo atbildi no `hermes` un no `openclaw` caur Open WebUI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The script accepts the following parameters:"
msgstr "[x] Skripts pieņem šādus parametrus:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The service carries `placement: manager` with the raft/NFS reason in its `# nocheck: default-placement-manager` comment, so the swarm task cannot be rescheduled away from its volume. Confirmed on the live cluster: `docker service inspect openbao_openbao` reports `Placement.Constraints [\"node.role == manager\"]`."
msgstr "[x] Pakalpojums sniedz `placement: manager` ar plostu/NFS iemeslu `# nocheck: default-placement-manager` komentāru, tāpēc swarm uzdevumu nevar pārplānot prom no tā apjoma. Apstiprināts uz dzīvā klastera: `docker service inspect openbao_openbao` ziņojumi `Placement.Constraints [\"node.role == manager\"]`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[x] The socket proxy refuses `POST /containers/{id}/exec`, a container or service create carrying a host bind mount, and `DELETE /containers/{id}`."
msgstr "[x] Ligzdas starpniekserveris atsakās `POST /containers/{id}/exec`, konteiners vai pakalpojums izveidot nesot uzņēmēja saistošs mount, un `DELETE /containers/{id}`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The socket proxy serves the engine on the unix socket shared with the broker and publishes no port; in compose it runs with `network_mode: none`."
msgstr "[x] Ligzdas starpniekserveris kalpo dzinējam uz unix ligzda dalīta ar brokeri un nepublicē portu; komponē tas darbojas ar `network_mode: none`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack includes a Penpot **backend** container."
msgstr "[x] Steks satur Penpot **aizmugure** iepakojums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack includes a Penpot **exporter** container (required for SVG/PDF export and developer handoff)."
msgstr "[x] Steks satur Penpot **eksportētājs** Konteiners (nepieciešama SVG/PDF eksportam un izstrādātāja nodošanai)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack includes a Penpot **frontend** container."
msgstr "[x] Steks satur Penpot **Priekšpuse** iepakojums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack is rendered with **one `docker stack` per role** (consistent with today's one-compose-project-per-role model). Granular `docker stack deploy / update / rm` operations per role MUST be possible. A single global stack across all Infinito services is explicitly rejected."
msgstr "[x] Steks ir renderēts ar **viens `docker stack` pēc lomas** (atbilst šodienas vienkopus projekta modelim). Granulārs `docker stack deploy / update / rm` Jābūt iespējai veikt darbības pa funkcijām. Viens pasaules kaudze visos Infinito pakalpojumos ir nepārprotami noraidīts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack reaches a steady running state in every variant, and `make quality` is green tree-wide. `make quality` (docs + autoformat + the four suites) passes end to end — `test-external`, `test-integration`, `test-lint` and `test-unit` all green. All three variants reach a steady running state with `failed=0`."
msgstr "[x] Steks sasniedz stabilu darbības stāvokli katrā variantā, un `make quality` ir zaļš visā kokā. `make quality` (docs + autoformat + četri numuri) pāriet beigās `test-external`, `test-integration`, `test-lint` kā arī `test-unit` Viss zaļš. Visi trīs varianti sasniedz stabilu darbības stāvokli ar `failed=0`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The supported catalog adapters are documented and bounded so broad marketplaces do not produce unreviewable warning noise."
msgstr "[x] Atbalstītie kataloga adapteri ir dokumentēti un norobežoti tik plaši tirgi nerada nepārskatāmu brīdinājuma troksni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The three baseline personas are covered per the [Playwright contract](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): `guest` (never reaches an authenticated surface), `biber`, `administrator`, each in its own `test-*.js` module aggregated by `playwright.spec.js`, with SSO/LDAP steps guarded by `skipUnlessServiceEnabled`. `guest` runs live; `biber` and `administrator` are blocked with `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` under the contract's documented escape, each carrying a `# nocheck: persona-block-rationale` naming the role property that forces it — biber holds no OpenBao RBAC group by design, and the shared persona helper cannot drive OpenBao's method-select + popup + `postMessage` login. The administrator's OIDC journey is asserted instead by `test-oidc-login.js`, and biber's denial by `test-ldap-login.js`."
msgstr "[x] Trīs bāzes līnijas personas ir ietvertas par vienu [Atskaņošanaswright līgums](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): `guest` (nekad nesasniedz autentificētu virsmu), `biber`, `administrator`, katrs atsevišķi `test-*.js` modulis apkopots ar `playwright.spec.js`, ar SSO/LDAP soļiem, ko aizsargā `skipUnlessServiceEnabled`. `guest` tiešraidē; `biber` kā arī `administrator` ir bloķēti ar `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` saskaņā ar līguma dokumentētu izbēgšanu, katram no kuriem ir `# nocheck: persona-block-rationale` Nosaucot lomu īpašumu, kas to piespiež – biber tur nē OpenBao RBAC grupa pēc dizaina, un dalītā persona palīgs nevar vadīt OpenBao's metode- selektīvā + uznirstošs + `postMessage` pieteikšanās. Administratora OIDC braucienu apstiprina `test-oidc-login.js`, un biber noliegums ar `test-ldap-login.js`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The user identifier is templated from `{{ OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME }}`; the literal `preferred_username` does not appear in the role."
msgstr "[x] Lietotāja identifikators ir sagatavis no `{{ OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME }}`; burtisks `preferred_username` neparādās lomā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The vhost configures WebSocket upgrade so real-time collaboration (live cursors, comments) works (handled by the shared proxy template)."
msgstr "[x] Vhost konfigurēt WebSocket jauninājums tik reālā laika sadarbību (dzīvot kursori, komentāri) darbi (apstrādā koplietotā starpniekservera veidne)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The vhost supports HTTPS termination and routes to internal service names."
msgstr "[x] Vhost atbalsta HTTPS izbeigšanu un maršrutus uz iekšējiem pakalpojumu nosaukumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The workflow MUST create the inventory via the canonical `cli/administration/inventory/provision/` CLI (the same `infinito` entry point developers use locally — \"Create or update a full inventory for a host\"). The workflow MUST NOT hand-roll a YAML inventory from scratch. After the provision step, the workflow's only inventory edits MUST be: adding the three simulated hosts to the `svc-swarm-node` group, adding `swarm-mgr-01` to `svc-swarm-manager`, and adding all three simulated hosts to the `web-app-mediawiki` group so the pilot role's `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` resolves to `swarm`. Any other inventory mutation is forbidden."
msgstr "[x] Darbplūsmu MUST izveidot inventarizāciju, izmantojot kanonisko `cli/administration/inventory/provision/` CLI (tas pats `infinito` ieejas punkta izstrādātāji izmanto lokāli — \"Izveidot vai atjaunināt pilnu uzskaiti resursdatoram\"). Darbplūsmu NEDRĪKST roku rollēt YAML inventāru no nulles. Pēc nodrošinājuma posma darbplūsmas vienīgā inventāra rediģēšanai jābūt: pievienojot trīs simulētos saimniekus `svc-swarm-node` grupa, pievienojot `swarm-mgr-01` līdz `svc-swarm-manager`, un pievienojot visus trīs simulētie saimnieki `web-app-mediawiki` grupa, lai izmēģinājuma lomu `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` atrisina `swarm`. Jebkura cita inventāra mutācija ir aizliegta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The workflow MUST report `failure` (not `skipped`, not `cancelled`) if any of the assertions above fail."
msgstr "[x] Darba plūsmai jāziņo `failure` (nav `skipped`, ne `cancelled`) ja kāds no iepriekš minētajiem apgalvojumiem neizdodas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] The workflow drains the node currently running the MediaWiki container, waits for the swarm scheduler to migrate the container to another node, then asserts:"
msgstr "[x] Darbplūsmas mezgls, kas darbojas MediaWiki konteiners, gaida, lai bars plānotājs migrēt konteineru uz citu mezglu, tad apgalvo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] This requirement is cross-linked from the implementing PR, and the PR is cross-linked back from here. Implementing PR: [infinito-nexus/core#611](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/pull/611)."
msgstr "[x] Šī prasība ir savstarpēji saistīta ar PR īstenošanu, un PR ir savstarpēji saistīta no šī brīža. Īstenošanas PR: [Infinito-nexus/core#611](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/pull/611)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] This template file exists as `000-template.md`."
msgstr "[x] Šis sagataves fails eksistē kā `000-template.md`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Three OpenBao policies of the same names exist, written from templates, following least privilege: `reader` has read-only capability on the application secret paths, `operator` adds create/update/delete there, and only `administrator` may touch `sys/policies`, `sys/auth` and `sys/mounts`."
msgstr "[x] Trīs OpenBao Uzrādāmā summa ietver jebkādu pārejas noteikumu ietekmi. `reader` spēj nolasīt tikai programmas slepenos ceļus, `operator` piebilst create/update/delete tur un tikai `administrator` pieskarieties `sys/policies`, `sys/auth` kā arī `sys/mounts`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Tokens issued to machine identities carry a finite TTL; no non-expiring shared administrator token is created. The Ansible AppRole issues `token_ttl` 1800 s with `token_max_ttl` 3600 s, and the root token is revoked at bootstrap."
msgstr "[x] Mašīnu identitātēm izdotajos žetonos ir ierobežots TTL; netiek radīta neekspirējoša dalīta administratora marķierierīce. Assible AppRole jautājumi `token_ttl` 1800 s ar `token_max_ttl` 3600 s, un saknes žetonu atsauc pie bootstrap."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Two users get two different containers, volumes, networks and bearer keys."
msgstr "[x] Divi lietotāji saņem divus dažādus konteinerus, apjomus, tīklus un nesēju atslēgas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Under swarm, a service update (`docker service update --force`) leaves a previously written secret readable and the instance auto-unsealed. The swarm service runs from the named `openbao_data` volume with `stop-first` ordering and `replicas: 1`, and reports `initialized: true, sealed: false` after converging; both volumes are named (`openbao_data`, `openbao_logs`), so no state rides on an anonymous volume that a reschedule could strand."
msgstr "[x] Zem bara, pakalpojumu atjaunināšana (`docker service update --force`) atstāj iepriekš uzrakstītu slepenu lasāmu un instanci automātiski nenoslēgtu. Swarm pakalpojums darbojas no nosauktā `openbao_data` tilpums `stop-first` pasūtīšana un `replicas: 1`, un ziņojumi `initialized: true, sealed: false` pēc saplūšanas; nosaukti abi tilpumi (`openbao_data`, `openbao_logs`), tā valsts brauc pa anonīmu skaļumu, ka pārplānojums varētu string."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Unit or integration tests validate the MCP service schema and reject unsafe defaults."
msgstr "[x] Vienības vai integrācijas testi apstiprina MCP pakalpojumu shēmu un noraida nedrošas noklusējuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Unit or integration tests validate the addon schema and reject unsafe or malformed entries."
msgstr "[x] Vienības vai integrācijas testi apstiprināt addon shēmu un noraidīt nedrošu vai nepareizi izveidots ierakstus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Unit tests cover the external addon discovery logic with fixture catalogs for a version bump, a newly discovered addon, and a marketplace entry intentionally ignored by the curated relevance rules."
msgstr "[x] Vienības testi aptver ārējā addon atklāšanas loģika ar armatūru katalogiem par versijas izciļņiem, jaunatklāts addon, un tirgus ieraksts apzināti ignorēts ar kūrēto atbilstību noteikumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Unit tests cover the idle sweep: it stops an idle agent, skips one that is serving a request or was just used, and does nothing while `idle_stop` is false."
msgstr "[x] Vienības testi aptver brīvgaitas pārbaude: tas aptur dīkstāves aģents, izlaiž vienu, kas apkalpo pieprasījumu vai tika vienkārši izmantots, un nedara neko, kamēr `idle_stop` nav taisnība."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Unit tests exercise extraction, the merge rules and the translator against a fake LibreTranslate server."
msgstr "[x] Vienību pārbaudes vingrinājumu ekstrakcija, apvienot noteikumus un tulkotājs pret viltus LibreTranslate serveris."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] V1 OIDC + administrator + biber Playwright specs land on the Frappe desk (matrix r3 5-passed-2-skipped on V1)."
msgstr "[x] V1 OIDC + administrators + biber Playwright specs zeme uz Frappe galda (matrice r3 5- garām.2-nostiprināts uz V1)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Volume mounts follow Infinito.Nexus conventions."
msgstr "[x] Seko skaļuma stiprinājumi Infinito.Nexus kongresos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] WebSocket upgrade to the SocketIO container is wired (`websocket` port in `meta/services.yml`, `BACKEND`/`SOCKETIO` env on the frontend nginx)."
msgstr "[x] WebSocket modernizācija uz SocketIO konteiners ir vadu (`websocket` osta `meta/services.yml`, `BACKEND`/`SOCKETIO` env uz priekšpuses nginx)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `services.mariadb.enabled` (always true for ERPNext) is unsatisfiable, `sys-stk-full` fails the deploy at the database-readiness gate before bench-bootstrap runs."
msgstr "[x] Kad `services.mariadb.enabled` (vienmēr attiecas uz ERPNext) nav pieņemams, `sys-stk-full` neizpilda izvietojumu pie datubāzes gatavības vārtiem pirms sola-bootstrap skriešanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `services.mariadb.shared=true` (V1 + matching `group_names`), Frappe connects to the central `svc-db-mariadb` via the in-stack `mariadb` network alias using svc-db-mariadb's `secrets.credentials.root_password` for `bench new-site`; when `shared=false` (V2/V3) `sys-svc-rdbms` templates a per-role MariaDB container and bench uses the consumer's per-role db password as root."
msgstr "[x] Kad `services.mariadb.shared=true` (V1 + saskaņošana `group_names`), Frappe savieno ar centrālo `svc-db-mariadb` caur tvertni `mariadb` tīkla aizstājvārds, kas izmanto svc-db-mariadb's `secrets.credentials.root_password` aizstāj `bench new-site`; kad `shared=false` (V2/V3) `sys-svc-rdbms` sagatavju skaits MariaDB tvertne un sols izmanto patērētāja per-role db paroli kā root."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, Frappe's LDAP Settings doctype is auto-configured by `tasks/05_ldap.yml` via `files/scripts/apply/ldap_source.py`. End-to-end LDAP-login (auto-create Frappe user from LDAP bind on first sign-in) is **deferred to a follow-up requirement** — needs additional Frappe-side attribute mapping + user-creation hooks; documented in README. The corresponding Playwright login specs (`test-login-via-ldap-*`) are intentionally absent in v1."
msgstr "[x] Kad `svc-db-openldap` ir `group_names`, Frappe LDAP iestatījumu doktipu automātiski konfigurē `tasks/05_ldap.yml` caur `files/scripts/apply/ldap_source.py`. Beigu LDAP pieraksts (automātiski izveidot Frappe lietotāju no LDAP piesaistās pie pirmās pierakstīšanās) ir **Atlikts uz papildu prasību** — nepieciešama papildu Frappe-side atribūtu kartēšana + lietotāju radīšanas āķi; dokumentēta LASĪTME. Atbilstošās Playwright pieteikšanās specifikācijas (`test-login-via-ldap-*`) ir apzināti prombūtnē v1."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, the `ldap` auth method is enabled and reads its attribute names, DNs and URI from `LDAP.*` only."
msgstr "[x] Kad `svc-db-openldap` ir `group_names`, `ldap` auth metode ir iespējota un lasa tās atribūtu nosaukumus, DNs un URI no `LDAP.*` tikai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `svc-db-postgres` is in `group_names`, the rendered MDAD inventory points Synapse + all enabled bridges at the central postgres host alias with the central root credential; no in-stack postgres container is spawned by MDAD."
msgstr "[x] Kad `svc-db-postgres` ir `group_names`, renderētie MDAD inventarizācijas punkti Synapse + visi iespējotie tilti centrālajā postgres host alias ar centrālo saknes credential; nav in-stack postgres konteiners nārsto ar MDAD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `svc-db-redis` is in `group_names`, the rendered inventory points Synapse + bridges at the central redis alias; no in-stack redis container is spawned by MDAD."
msgstr "[x] Kad `svc-db-redis` ir `group_names`, inventarizācijas punktus Synapse + tiltus pie centrālā redis segvārdu; neviens in-stack redis konteineru nārsto ar MAD."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `web-app-keycloak` is in `group_names`, the `redirect_uris` filter auto-includes `https://{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}/_synapse/client/oidc/callback` in the shared Keycloak client (no per-role Keycloak entry needed)."
msgstr "[x] Kad `web-app-keycloak` ir `group_names`, `redirect_uris` automātiski ietver filtru `https://{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}/_synapse/client/oidc/callback` kopā Keycloak klients (Nav vienam zvejas rīkam Keycloak nepieciešams ieraksts)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `web-app-keycloak` is in `group_names`, the existing `web-app-keycloak/redirect_uris` filter auto-includes ERPNext's `https://next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/*` in the realm's shared OIDC client (no per-role Keycloak entry needed)."
msgstr "[x] Kad `web-app-keycloak` ir `group_names`, esošo `web-app-keycloak/redirect_uris` automātiski ietver filtru ERPNext's `https://next.erp.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/*` valstības dalītais OIDC klients (Nav vienam zvejas rīkam Keycloak nepieciešams ieraksts)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `web-app-mailu` is NOT in `group_names`, `tasks/01_core.yml` skips the email subtask via `when: ERPNEXT_EMAIL_ENABLED` (verified by the V2 all-false variant deploying clean without an Email Account record)."
msgstr "[x] Kad `web-app-mailu` NAV `group_names`, `tasks/01_core.yml` izlaiž e- pasta apakšdarbu caur `when: ERPNEXT_EMAIL_ENABLED` (pārbauda V2 all-false variants izvietojot tīru bez e-pasta konta ierakstu)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `web-app-mailu` is in `group_names`, ERPNext's outbound `Email Account` is auto-configured by `tasks/06_email.yml` via `files/scripts/apply/email_account.py` (uses `db_insert`/`db_update` to bypass Frappe's deploy-time SMTP socket validation)."
msgstr "[x] Kad `web-app-mailu` ir `group_names`, ERPNextir izejošie `Email Account` ir autokonfigurēts ar `tasks/06_email.yml` caur `files/scripts/apply/email_account.py` (lietojumi `db_insert`/`db_update` lai apietu Frappe izvietojuma laika SMTP ligzdas apstiprināšanu)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When `web-app-mailu` is in `group_names`, the rendered inventory configures MDAD's outbound SMTP against the central Mailu endpoint."
msgstr "[x] Kad `web-app-mailu` ir `group_names`, padarītais inventārs konfigurē MDAD izejošo SMTP pret centrālo Mailu mērķa kritēriju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When a service runs with `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose`, network blocks remain identical to today (`bridge`, no encryption attribute)."
msgstr "[x] Kad pakalpojums darbojas ar `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose`, tīkla bloki joprojām ir identisks šodien (`bridge`, nav šifrēšanas atribūta)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When a service runs with `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose`, the volume block remains identical to today (local docker volumes, no `driver_opts`); the per-volume `nfs` flag is ignored under compose."
msgstr "[x] Kad pakalpojums darbojas ar `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose`, skaļuma bloks paliek identisks šodienai (vietējie docker apjomi, nē `driver_opts`); pēc apjoma `nfs` karogs tiek ignorēts ar kompožu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When a service runs with `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm` AND `storage.backend: nfs` AND the role is not pinned, each of its volumes MUST be rendered with the NFS driver block:"
msgstr "[x] Kad pakalpojums darbojas ar `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm` UN `storage.backend: nfs` UN loma nav piestiprināta, katram tās apjomam jābūt renderētam ar NFS draivera bloku:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When a service runs with `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`, ALL its volumes MUST opt into NFS AND `storage.backend: nfs`; otherwise the service's role group should not contain multiple hosts. Mixing local-only volumes into a multi-host role under v1 is a configuration error: either route the role through compose (single host in group) or migrate the volume to NFS. The placement-constraint fallback used in earlier drafts is dropped in favour of free task placement (option 2b from the design brainstorm)."
msgstr "[x] Kad pakalpojums darbojas ar `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`, VISI tā apjomi jāizvēlas NFS un `storage.backend: nfs`; citādi dienesta funkciju grupā nevajadzētu būt vairākiem saimniekiem. Vietējo skaļumu sajaukšana ar vairāku serveru lomu1 ir konfigurācijas kļūda: vai nu maršrutu lomu, izmantojot komponēt (viens resursdators grupā) vai migrēt tilpumu uz NFS. Iepriekšējos uzmetumos izmantotais izvietojuma ierobežojums ir atcelts par labu bezmaksas uzdevumu izvietošanai (opcija 2b no dizaina prāta vētra)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] When a service runs with `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: swarm`, every per-role network declared today as `driver: bridge` MUST be rendered as `driver: overlay` with `attachable: true`. Cross-node service-to-service traffic depends on this — `bridge` networks are node-local and would break the swarm mesh."
