# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] `meta/info.yml`, `meta/server.yml`, `meta/main.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/variants.yml` exist and pass the repo's standard role-meta lint (per [008](README.md#archive))."
msgstr "[x] `meta/info.yml`, `meta/server.yml`, `meta/main.yml`, `meta/secrets.yml`, `meta/users.yml`, `meta/volumes.yml`, `meta/rbac.yml`, `meta/variants.yml` pastāv un nodod repo standarta lomu-meta lint (par [008](README.md#archive))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] `meta/languages.yml` lists exactly the 184 ISO 639-1 languages, each with English name, native name and direction `ltr` or `rtl`."
msgstr "[x] `meta/languages.yml` precīzi uzskaitīti 184 ISO 639-1 valodas, katra ar angļu nosaukumu, dzimto nosaukumu un virzienu `ltr` vai `rtl`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[x] `meta/rbac.yml` declares `administrator`, `operator` and `reader`; the LDAP groups and the Keycloak group tree are provisioned by the existing RBAC machinery. Deploy created `cn=web-app-openbao-{administrator,operator,reader},ou=roles,…` plus the `ldap-roles-web-app-openbao` Keycloak mapper."
