# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ groups Docker hosts into a single virtual host. A swarm has exactly one manager node in v1; managers run the Raft store and accept service-API calls."
msgstr "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ grupas Docker saimniekiem uz vienu virtuālo resursdatoru. Sharm ir tieši viens pārvaldnieks mezglu v1; vadītāji vada Raft veikalu un pieņemt pakalpojumu-API zvana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ is Docker’s built-in clustering and container-orchestration mode. It groups multiple Docker hosts into a single virtual host that can schedule services, replicate tasks, and route traffic via an internal mesh."
msgstr "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ ir iebūvēts Docker klasterēšanas un konteinera-orchestration režīms. Tas sagrupē vairākus Docker saimniekus vienā virtuālā resursdatorā, kas var plānot pakalpojumus, atkārtot uzdevumus un maršrutu satiksmi caur iekšējo tīklu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Dockerfile.sh` exposes 8124 for aiolibdatachannel signalling beside 8099. Nothing listens on it at rest, so only 8099 is published; whether it binds lazily during a call is untested."
msgstr "`Dockerfile.sh` apstarošana 8124 aiolibdatu kanāla signalizēšanai blakus 8099. Nekas neklausās uz to miera stāvoklī, tāpēc tikai 8099 tiek publicēts; vai tas saistās lazily laikā zvana netiek pārbaudīta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DomainLookup` resolves the SMTP host when `environment` points to an external Mailu deployment. Failures MUST fall back to `localhost`."
msgstr "`DomainLookup` atrisina SMTP datoru, kad `environment` norāda uz ārējo Mailu izvietošana. Neveiksmēm jāatgriežas pie `localhost`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT` maps the application's administrator group onto the Open WebUI admin role, and it also makes `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES` a sign-in gate. The env sets `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*` so every platform role passes that gate; narrow it only to a list that matches the `/roles/<app>/<role>` paths Keycloak emits."
msgstr "`ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT` kartē programmas administratora grupu Open WebUI admin loma, un tas arī padara `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES` ierakstīšanās vārti. Env komplekti `OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*` katru platformas lomu iet, ka vārti; sašaurināt to tikai uz sarakstu, kas atbilst `/roles/<app>/<role>` ceļi Keycloak emisijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ERPNext <https://erpnext.com/>`__ is an open-source ERP suite built on the `Frappe Framework <https://frappeframework.com/>`__. It covers finance, CRM, inventory, manufacturing, HR, sales, projects, and websites in one self-hosted stack."
msgstr "`ERPNext <https://erpnext.com/>`__ ir atvērtā koda ERP komplekts, kas veidots uz `Frappe Framework <https://frappeframework.com/>`__. Tas attiecas uz finansēm, CRM, inventāra, ražošanas, CR, pārdošanas, projekti, un tīmekļa vietnes vienā pašhosted kaudze."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Extension:AWS` (S3 file backend)"
msgstr "`Extension:AWS` (S3 faila aizmugure)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`External tests` verify live third-party state such as public registries or services when hermetic checks are insufficient."
msgstr "`External tests` pārbauda dzīvu trešo personu valsti, piemēram, publiskus reģistrus vai pakalpojumus, ja hermētiskās pārbaudes ir nepietiekamas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`FILE_ENVIRONMENT` (default: `/etc/environment`)"
msgstr "`FILE_ENVIRONMENT` (noklusētais: `/etc/environment`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`FORCE_CANCEL_AFTER_SECONDS` turns the cancel into an escalation. A cancel request does not stop a running step: the runner asks it to end, and a step that ignores the signal keeps going until its own `timeout-minutes`, which is 350 for a deploy. The concurrency group holds the newer run on `pending` until the occupant is *terminal*, not until it is cancel-requested, so a superseded sweep can block its branch for hours after being told to stop -- measured at eight minutes and counting, with ten deploy jobs untouched. After the wait, every run that is still not `completed` gets [`force-cancel`](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/actions/workflow-runs), which bypasses the conditions that keep it alive. The skipped cleanup steps are the price, and for a run that has already been superseded its artefacts are of no use to anyone. Leave the variable unset to cancel and walk away, which is what a closed pull request and a deleted branch want."
msgstr "`FORCE_CANCEL_AFTER_SECONDS` pārvērš atcelšanu eskalāciju. Anulēšanas pieprasījums neaptur skriešanas posmu: skrējējs to lūdz beigt, un solis, kas ignorē signālu turpina iet līdz brīdim, kad tas pats `timeout-minutes`, kas ir 350 izvietošanai. Konvalūtu grupa tur jaunāku palaist uz `pending` līdz *terminālis*, līdz brīdim, kad tas ir atcelts-pieprasījums , tāpēc aizstāts slaucīšana var bloķēt savu zaru uz stundām pēc tam, kad tiek teikts apstāties -- mēra pēc astoņām minūtēm un skaitīšanas, ar desmit izvietot darbus neskarta. Pēc tam, kad gaidīt, katru palaist, kas vēl nav `completed` kļūst [`force-cancel`](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/actions/workflow-runs), kas apiet nosacījumus, kas uztur to dzīvs. Izlaistās tīrīšanas soļi ir cena, un par palaist, kas jau ir aizstāti tās artefakti nav jēgas nevienam. Atstājiet mainīgo atiestatītu, lai atceltu un aizietu prom, kas ir tas, ko aizvērts vilkšanas pieprasījums un dzēsts zars vēlas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Fider <https://getfider.com/>`__ is an open-source community feedback and voting platform that allows teams to collect, prioritize, and track feature requests and ideas."
msgstr "`Fider <https://getfider.com/>`__ ir atklātā pirmkoda kopienas atsauksmes un balsošanas platforma, kas ļauj komandām savākt, prioritizēt, un dziesmu funkciju pieprasījumus un idejas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`FusionDirectory <https://www.fusiondirectory.org/>`__ is a web-based LDAP administration tool that manages users, groups, and other directory objects through a pluggable interface. The application stores all of its data in an external LDAP directory, which makes it the natural front-end for the project’s ``svc-db-openldap`` backend."
msgstr "`FusionDirectory <https://www.fusiondirectory.org/>`__ ir tīmekļa LDAP administrēšanas rīks, kas pārvalda lietotājus, grupas un citus direktoriju objektus, izmantojot pluggable interfeisu. Programma glabā visus savus datus ārējā LDAP direktorijā, kas padara to par dabīgu projekta priekšgalu ``svc-db-openldap`` aizmugure."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GET /v1/models` lists both platforms; Open WebUI shows each only to its group through model access grants."
msgstr "`GET /v1/models` uzskaita abas platformas; Open WebUI parāda katru tikai savai grupai, izmantojot modeļu piekļuves dotācijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GET /v1/sys/health` returns **503 when sealed** and 501 when uninitialised. The query params `sealedcode`, `uninitcode`, `standbyok` override those codes per request."
msgstr "`GET /v1/sys/health` atgriež **503 aizzīmogots** kā arī 501 ja tas nav inicializēts. Vaicājuma parametri `sealedcode`, `uninitcode`, `standbyok` aizstāt šos kodus pēc pieprasījuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /v1/sys/metrics?format=prometheus`. Normally token-gated; a listener with `telemetry { unauthenticated_metrics_access = true }` exposes it without a token on that listener only."
msgstr "`GET /v1/sys/metrics?format=prometheus`. Parasti žetonu-gated; klausītājs ar `telemetry { unauthenticated_metrics_access = true }` atklāj to bez žetonu uz šo klausītāju tikai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GH_TOKEN` env var"
msgstr "`GH_TOKEN` env var"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GH_TOKEN` must be available on the Ansible control node (`delegate_to: localhost`) for the `gh api` registration call to succeed. In CI this is forwarded into the DinD container by `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."
msgstr "`GH_TOKEN` jābūt pieejamai uz Ansible kontroles mezglā (`delegate_to: localhost`) tekstu `gh api` reģistrācijas zvanu, lai gūtu panākumus. CI to Dinda konteinerā `cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/run.py`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), from `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` in [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) belongs to GitLab's built-in `root` account, not to the Keycloak `administrator` username the persona signs in with, and no GitLab account is provisioned for `biber` at all — the OmniAuth sign-in is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "`GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2), no `GITLAB_INIT_ROOT_PASSWORD` skaits [`vars/main.yml`](./vars/main.yml)) pieder pie GitLabir iebūvēts `root` nevis Keycloak `administrator` lietotājvārds persona paraksta ar, un nav GitLab konts ir paredzēts `biber` vispār — OmniAuth pierakstīšanās ir vienīgais ceļš, kas to radītu. Divos `services.sso.enabled: false` Matrices varianti, ka ceļš ir noņemts, tāpēc [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) atveidojumi `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` kā arī `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` persona un bāzes apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` keeps OpenCloud from modifying the directory. User lifecycle is owned by the LDAP and Keycloak side."
msgstr "`GRAPH_LDAP_SERVER_WRITE_ENABLED=false` saglabā OpenCloud izmaiņas direktorijā. Lietotāja dzīves cikls pieder LDAP un Keycloak sānos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Generate app token` step"
msgstr "`Generate app token` Stāt"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (optional), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"
msgstr "`HOST`, `DISTRO`, `COUNT` (Pēc izvēles), `PORT`, `OWNER`, `REPO`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an agent runtime from Nous Research that runs tool-using agent sessions against OpenAI-compatible model backends. In gateway mode it serves an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, where clients address the agent with the same request shape they use for a plain model."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ ir aģenta runtime no Nous Research, kas vada rīku izmantošanas aģentu sesijas pret OpenAI savietojamiem modeļa aizmugurēm. Vārtejas režīmā tas apkalpo ar OpenAI saderīgu HTTP API, ja klienti vēršas pie aģenta ar tādu pašu pieprasījuma formu, tos izmanto vienkāršam modelim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "`Hermes Agent <https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/>`__ ir autonoma aģenta darba laiks. Šī loma to vada iemiesotā režīmā: uz mašīnas, kas tai ir veltīta, ar tiešu piekļuvi šīs mašīnas aparatūrai. Ja konteinera lomas liek kodola robežu starp aģentu un tā saimnieku, šeit robeža ir pati ierīce."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ is an open-source home automation platform that connects smart-home devices from many vendors behind a single local interface. It keeps device state, dashboards, and automation rules on the machine that runs it, and exposes them through a web interface, a REST API, and a built-in MCP server."
msgstr "`Home Assistant <https://www.home-assistant.io/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda mājas automatizācijas platforma, kas savieno viedās mājas ierīces no daudziem pārdevējiem aiz vienas vietējās saskarnes. Tas uztur ierīces stāvokli, paneļa, un automatizācijas noteikumus par mašīnu, kas to vada, un pakļauj tos caur web interfeisu, REST API, un iebūvētu MCP serveri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "`Hugo <https://gohugo.io/>`__ ir ātrs, vienreizējs statisks vietnes ģenerators, kas rakstīts Go. Šī loma veido Hugo vieta no augšas Git repozitorijs (noklusētais: `gohugoio/hugoDocs <https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs>`__) attēla veidošanas laikā un kalpo renderētam HTML/CSS/JS nginx. Nav datu bāzes, nav programmu servera, un nav dinamiskas aizmugures pie palaišanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — ar jaunu līniju atdalītus darbplūsmas ceļus, kas atbalsta konvalūtas grupas dalībniekus. Bez tā palīgi arī atceltu skriešanas nekad pārvaldīto grupu, piemēram, `cron-*` darbplūsmas, kas klausās `push`. Atvasināt sarakstu no `concurrency:` bloki, nevis no tā, kas izskatās saistīti: `entry-delete-branch.yml` atslēgas savu grupu par *svītrots* ref, tāpēc tas nav loceklis push grupas, un uzskaitot tas būtu push uz `main` atcelt nesaistītu zaru sakopšanu. Vērtība, kas neuzskaita ceļu vispār abortus, nevis klusi neatbilst neko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` env var for the inner compose wrapper"
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_FRONTEND_IP` Env var iekšējā kompozītā iesaiņojuma"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (default `8640` = 6 days) controls how long every Nexus proxy repo holds an upstream response before revalidating. The bootstrap helper applies it as `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, and `negativeCache.timeToLive`. The default is intentionally one day below the 7-day `Valid-Until` window Debian and Ubuntu generate in their apt `Release` files, so Nexus always refreshes the manifest before `apt-get update` would see it expired. Raise it for slow-moving upstreams when staleness is preferable to upstream load; lower it further for fast-moving feeds (`apt-debian-security`, branch-pinned tarballs) when staleness becomes visible."
msgstr "`INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_MAX_AGE_MIN` (noklusētais `8640` = 6 dienas) kontrolē, cik ilgi katram Nexus proxy repo pieder augšupēja reakcija pirms atkārtotas apstiprināšanas. Bootstrap palīgs to piemēro kā `contentMaxAge`, `metadataMaxAge`, un `negativeCache.timeToLive`. Noklusējums ir apzināti vienu dienu zem 7- diena `Valid-Until` logs Debian un Ubuntu radīt to t `Release` faili, tāpēc Nexus vienmēr atsvaidzina manifestu pirms `apt-get update` tas būtu beidzies. Paaugstināt to lēnai kustībai augšpusē, kad strupceļš ir labāks nekā augšpusēja slodze; nolaist to tālāk ātrgaitas barotnēm (`apt-debian-security`, sazarotas virknes tarbols) kad kļūst redzams strupceļš."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, optional `INSPECT_CMD` or positional args"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DISTRO`, `INFINITO_CONTAINER`, pēc izvēles `INSPECT_CMD` vai pozicionālie args"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` can still override the generated list explicitly"
msgstr "`INFINITO_DNS_HOSTS` joprojām var skaidri ignorēt ģenerēto sarakstu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME` (default: `INFINITO_VERSION`)"
msgstr "`INFINITO_VERSION_ENV_NAME` (noklusētais: `INFINITO_VERSION`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Integration tests` verify behavior across modules and runtime boundaries."
msgstr "`Integration tests` pārbaudīt uzvedību starp moduļiem un runtime robežas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` resolves the root role's config via `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` so `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` sees the variant-merged `services` map and discovers every shared provider the variant enables."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` atrisina saknes lomas konfigurāciju caur `get_variants(roles_dir)[app_id][N]` Tātad `resolve_schema_includes_recursive` redz variantu apvienoto `services` kartē un atklāj katru kopīgoto pakalpojumu sniedzēju, kuru variants ļauj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager` skips the variants overlay and reads the role's base `meta/<topic>.yml` payload directly via `_meta_role_config`."
msgstr "`InventoryManager` izlaiž variantus un lasa lomu bāzi `meta/<topic>.yml` kravnesība tieši caur `_meta_role_config`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`InventoryManager`-backed credential generator; `--variant N` selects which `variants.yml` overlay applies."
msgstr "`InventoryManager`- ar dzinēju apgādāts cilmes ģenerators; `--variant N` izvēlas kuru `variants.yml` Piemērots pārklājums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`JELLYFIN_*` env (double-underscore nesting), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; runs as `PUID/PGID`."
msgstr "`JELLYFIN_*` env (Divkārtēja ligzdošana), `JELLYFIN_PublishedServerUrl`, `TZ`; darbojas kā `PUID/PGID`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ is a free, open-source media server. This role deploys the official ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy, with Keycloak OIDC (web) and central LDAP authentication provisioned via the Jellyfin auth plugins."
msgstr "`Jellyfin <https://jellyfin.org>`__ ir bezmaksas, atvērtā pirmkoda multivides serveris. Šis uzdevums ir izvietot amatpersonas ``jellyfin/jellyfin`` tvertne aiz Infinito.Nexus atpakaļgaitas starpniekserveris, ar Keycloak OIDC (tīmekļa) un centrālo LDAP autentificēšanu nodrošina, izmantojot Jellyfin auth spraudņi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ is an open-source automation server that orchestrates the build, test, and deployment of software through pipelines, freestyle jobs, and a large plugin ecosystem."
msgstr "`Jenkins <https://www.jenkins.io/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda automatizācijas serveris, kas orķestrē būvēt, tests, un izvietošana programmatūras caur cauruļvadiem, frīstaila darbavietas, un liels spraudnis ekosistēmu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ is Atlassian’s issue and project-tracking platform. This role deploys Jira via Docker Compose, connects it to PostgreSQL, and adds proxy awareness, optional OIDC SSO, health checks, and production-oriented defaults for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ ir Atlassian jautājums un projektu izsekošanas platforma. Šī loma Jira caur Docker Compose, savieno to ar PostgreSQL, un papildina proxy izpratni, izvēles OIDC SSO, veselības pārbaudes, un ražošanas orientētas noklusējuma Infinito.Nexus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ is an open-source, end-to-end-encryptable video conferencing platform. Rooms run over WebRTC with a central Selective Forwarding Unit (jvb), an XMPP server (prosody) for signalling, and a conference focus daemon (jicofo)."
msgstr "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda, no gala līdz galam šifrējama videokonferenču platforma. Telpas pārlaistas pa WebRTC ar centrālo selektīvo pārsūtīšanas vienību (jvb), a r XMPP serveris (prozodija) signalizēšanai un konferences fokusa dēmonam (jikofo)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ is a free and open-source content management system that lets users build and run websites, intranets, and online applications without writing code. It exposes a component, module, and plugin architecture that authors and developers extend with custom content types, layouts, and integrations."
msgstr "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ ir bezmaksas un atvērtā pirmkoda satura pārvaldības sistēma, kas ļauj lietotājiem veidot un palaist tīmekļa vietnes, iekštīkli un tiešsaistes lietojumprogrammas bez rakstīšanas kodu. Tas pakļauj komponents, modulis, un spraudnis arhitektūra, ka autori un izstrādātāji paplašināt ar pielāgotu satura veidiem, izkārtojumi, un integrācija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ is a simple and effective command-line journal application that allows users to create and manage personal journal entries."
msgstr "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ ir vienkārša un efektīva komandrindas žurnāla programma, kas ļauj lietotājiem izveidot un pārvaldīt personīgos žurnālu ierakstus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ runs code in a managed kernel and returns its output. This role provides that kernel as a backend for other services rather than as a notebook UI for people."
msgstr "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ vada kodu pārvaldītā kodolā un atgriež tā produkciju. Šī funkcija nodrošina, ka kodols kā aizmugure citiem pakalpojumiem, nevis kā piezīmju SRN cilvēkiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` — keeps the newest run of each group instance alive and cancels only the older ones, which is the rule the concurrency group itself applies. It is what makes the fallback safe against races: the head SHA from the event payload goes stale while the job waits for a runner, and a `[skip ci]` or `GITHUB_TOKEN` push moves the branch tip without creating a run at all. Selecting by \"not the current head\" would then cancel the newest commit's CI and spare the stale one, or leave the branch with no CI at all. Selecting by \"not the newest run\" cannot, in any ordering."
msgstr "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` — uztur dzīvu katras grupas instances jaunāko skrējienu un atceļ tikai vecākās, kas ir noteikums, ko piemēro pati konvalūta grupa. Tas ir tas, kas padara rezerves droši pret sacīkstēm: galva SHA no notikuma derīgo kravu iet strupceļā, bet darbs gaida skrējējs, un `[skip ci]` vai `GITHUB_TOKEN` virzīt pārvietojas zara galu, neradot palaist vispār. Izvēlas pēc \"nav pašreizējā galva\" pēc tam atceltu jaunāko nodevuma CI un saglabātu strupceļu vienu, vai atstāt filiāli bez CI vispār. Izvēlas pēc \"nav visjaunākais starts\" nevar veikt nekādus pasūtījumus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEY` MUST be the owned variable's name."
msgstr "`KEY` Jābūt īpašumā esošā mainīgā lieluma nosaukums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ is an open-source IT service management and helpdesk platform forked from OTRS. It provides ticket management, configuration management, knowledge base, and reporting for IT service teams."
msgstr "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda IT pakalpojumu pārvaldības un palīdzības dienesta platforma, kas izveidota no OTRS. Tā nodrošina biļešu pārvaldību, konfigurācijas vadību, zināšanu bāzi un ziņošanu IT pakalpojumu komandām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single ``runsc`` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ ir OCI konteinera ieskrējiena laiks, kas palaiž katru konteineru vieglā virtuālā iekārtā ar savu kodolu, nevis dalās saimnieka kodolā. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ ir otrs izolēšanas runtime, ko piegādā kā vienu ``runsc`` binārā, kas pārtver konteineru syscalls lietotāja telpas kodolā un darbojas bez aparatūras virtualizācijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ is a free, open-source, cross-platform password manager that stores credentials in an encrypted local database compatible with the KeePass format."
msgstr "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ ir bezmaksas, atvērtā pirmkoda, starpplatformu paroli pārvaldnieks, kas glabā akreditācijas datus šifrētā lokālā datubāzē, kas ir saderīga ar KeePass formātu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.BIND_CREDENTIAL` (Vault)"
msgstr "`LDAP.BIND_CREDENTIAL` (Vault)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.FILTERS.USERS` provides reusable LDAP search filters:"
msgstr "`LDAP.FILTERS.USERS` nodrošina atkārtoti izmantojamus LDAP meklēšanas filtrus:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.RBAC` controls how application roles are represented:"
msgstr "`LDAP.RBAC` kontrolē, kā tiek attēlotas lietojumprogrammas lomas:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES` lists the LDAP attribute names that applications query:"
msgstr "`LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES` uzskaita LDAP atribūtu nosaukumus, kas lietojumprogrammas vaicājumu:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP.USER.OBJECTS` lists the structural and auxiliary object classes attached to user entries:"
msgstr "`LDAP.USER.OBJECTS` uzskaita strukturālās un palīgobjektu klases, kas pievienotas lietotāju ierakstiem:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, user/admin emails, oauth2-proxy `email_domains`, CA identity: all onion, mutually consistent (users `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` pass the oauth2-proxy email filter)"
msgstr "`LDAP_DN_BASE`, lietotāja/admin e-pasts, oauth2- proksijs `email_domains`, CA identitāte: viss sīpoli, savstarpēji saskanīgs (lietotāji `@<NODE_ONION>.onion` pabrauc garām olotei2-proxy e-pasta filtrs)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ is a runtime for open large language models. Its headless server mode loads models from a local store and answers chat and completion requests over an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API, so prompts and model weights stay on the machine that runs them."
msgstr "`LM Studio <https://lmstudio.ai/>`__ ir darba laiks atvērtiem lieliem valodu modeļiem. Tā bezgalvju servera režīms ielādē modeļus no vietējā veikala un atbild uz tērzēšanas un pabeigšanas pieprasījumiem pa OpenAI savietojamu HTTP API, tik ātri un modeļa svaru palikt uz mašīnas, kas vada tos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ is a local-first notification command center that aggregates Slack, mail, issue trackers and calendars into approvable action cards."
msgstr "`Laya <https://laya.aay.sh/>`__ ir vietējais pirmais paziņošanas komandcentrs, kas apkopo Slack, pasta, izdot trackers un kalendārus apstiprināmās darbības kartēs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Lint and syntax checks` catch style, formatting, and Ansible syntax problems early."
msgstr "`Lint and syntax checks` nozvejas stilu, formatēšana, un Ansible sintakses problēmas agri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that exposes an OpenAI-compatible HTTP API and forwards each request to a configured model backend, local or hosted. Clients authenticate with virtual API keys that the gateway issues and stores in its own database."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ ir LLM vārteja, kas atklāj OpenAI saderīgu HTTP API un nosūta katru pieprasījumu konfigurēta modeļa aizmugurei, lokālai vai uzturētai. Klienti autentificējas ar virtuālo API atslēgas, ka vārteja ir svarīga un saglabā savā datubāzē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ is an LLM gateway that puts a single OpenAI-compatible API in front of many model providers. Its admin UI is the gateway’s built-in web interface for virtual API keys, teams, budgets and rate limits, model routing, and request and spend logs."
msgstr "`LiteLLM <https://docs.litellm.ai/>`__ ir LLM vārteja, kas liek vienu OpenAI saderīgu API daudzu modeļu nodrošinātāju priekšā. Tās admin UI ir vārteja iebūvēta tīmekļa saskarne virtuālajai API atslēgas, komandas, budžetu un likmju ierobežojumi, modeļa maršrutēšana, un pieprasīt un tērēt žurnālus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Local deploy and E2E validation` checks whether apps and deployment flows work in a realistic local stack."
msgstr "`Local deploy and E2E validation` pārbauda, vai lietotnes un izvietošanas plūsmas darbojas reālā vietējā kaudzītē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Removes unused Docker containers, networks, images, and volumes."
msgstr "`MODE_CLEANUP`: Noņem neizmantotā Docker konteinerus, tīklus, attēlus, un apjomi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MODE_RESET`: Performs cleanup and restarts the Docker service."
msgstr "`MODE_RESET`: Veic sakopšanu un restartē Docker pakalpojumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ as a full-featured mail server (when available),"
msgstr "`Mailu <https://mailu.io/>`__ kā pilna Featured pasta serveri (ja pieejams),"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Mirrors `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."
msgstr "`MaxDirectMemorySize`. Spoguļi `INFINITO_CACHE_PACKAGE_HEAP`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemAvailable` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemAvailable` no /proc/meminfo MB. 0 par neveiksmi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`MemTotal` from /proc/meminfo in MB. 0 on failure."
msgstr "`MemTotal` no /proc/meminfo MB. 0 par neveiksmi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Metadata`: **Read** (default, cannot be removed)."
msgstr "`Metadata`: **Lasīt** (noklusētais, nevar noņemt)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) is a kernel-level protocol for sharing files over a network. The server exports a directory tree under defined access rules; clients mount it as if it were a local filesystem."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Tīkla failu sistēma) ir kodola līmeņa protokols failu kopīgošanai tīklā. Serveris eksportē direktoriju koku saskaņā ar noteiktiem piekļuves noteikumiem; klienti to montē tā, it kā tā būtu lokāla failu sistēma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Network File System) lets a host mount a directory exported by a remote server as if it were a local filesystem. The client packages provide the kernel helpers and userspace tools to perform that mount."
msgstr "`NFS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_File_System>`__ (Tīkla failu sistēma) ļauj datoram montēt mapi, ko eksportē attālināts serveris, it kā tā būtu lokāla failu sistēma. Klienta paketes nodrošina kodola palīgus un userpace rīkus, lai veiktu šo mount."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`N` → route a share of deploy jobs to your `[self-hosted, linux]` runners."
msgstr "`N` → maršrutu daļa izvietot darbus uz jūsu `[self-hosted, linux]` skrējēji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nexus Repository <https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository>`__ is a repository manager that proxies package registries and serves an artefact it has already fetched from local disk. `nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ sits in front of it and answers for the upstream hostnames themselves, so a package manager keeps the URLs it was built with and still reads through the proxy."
msgstr "`Nexus Repository <https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository>`__ ir repozitorija pārvaldnieks, kas proxies pakotņu reģistrus un apkalpo artefaktu, kas jau ir ielādēts no vietējā diska. `nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ atrodas tā priekšā un atbild uz augšpusējiem hostnames paši, tāpēc pakešu pārvaldnieks saglabā URL tas tika būvēts ar un joprojām lasa caur starpniekserveri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as a first-party mirror for the third-party assets other web applications declare in their CSP whitelists, so browsers fetch those assets from the deployment itself instead of contacting external hosts."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ ir augstas veiktspējas tīmekļa serveris un reversais starpniekserveris. Šī loma wrap Nginx kā pirmās puses spogulis trešās puses aktīviem citas tīmekļa lietojumprogrammas deklarēt savā CSP whitlists, tāpēc pārlūkprogrammas ielādēt šos aktīvus no izvietošanas pati, nevis sazināties ar ārējiem saimniekiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ is a high-performance web server and reverse proxy. This role wraps Nginx as an internal Content Delivery Network that serves static assets such as CSS and JavaScript bundles for other web applications in the stack."
msgstr "`Nginx <https://nginx.org/>`__ ir augstas veiktspējas tīmekļa serveris un reversais starpniekserveris. Šī loma ietina Nginx kā iekšēju Content Delivery Network kas apkalpo statiskos aktīvus, piemēram, CSS un JavaScript komplektus citām tīmekļa lietojumprogrammām stekā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ is a free, open-source application for video recording and live streaming, widely used for screencasts, broadcasting, and content creation."
msgstr "`OBS Studio <https://obsproject.com/>`__ ir bezmaksas atvērtā pirmkoda lietojumprogramma video ierakstīšanai un tiešraidei, ko plaši izmanto ekrāna pārraidīšanai, apraidei un satura radīšanai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` and `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` are paired on purpose. They MUST resolve to the same logical user on both sides so that an account created in OpenLDAP can sign in through Keycloak without an extra mapping step. Changing one without the other breaks LDAP-OIDC correlation."
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME` kā arī `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID` ir sapāroti uz mērķi. Viņiem ir atrisināt ar to pašu loģisks lietotājs no abām pusēm, lai konts izveidots OpenLDAP var pierakstīties caur Keycloak bez papildu kartēšanas soļa. Mainot vienu bez otras, tiek pārtraukta LDAP- OIDC korelācija."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` lists the claim names that downstream applications read out of the userinfo response and ID token:"
msgstr "`OIDC.ATTRIBUTES` uzskaita prasību nosaukumus, ko pakārtotās lietojumprogrammas nolasa no lietotājainfo atbildes un ID marķiera:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ is a local model server that runs open LLMs on your hardware and exposes a simple HTTP API. Prompts and data stay on your machines, making it the backbone for privacy-first AI."
msgstr "`Ollama <https://ollama.com>`__ ir lokāls modeļu serveris, kas atver LLM uz jūsu aparatūras un atklāj vienkāršu HTTP API. Pieprasa un datu palikt uz jūsu mašīnas, padarot to mugurkaulu privātuma pirmā MI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Open PR if … changed` step"
msgstr "`Open PR if … changed` Stāt"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
msgstr "`OpenBao <https://openbao.org/>`__ ir identitātes pamatā esošu noslēpumu un šifrēšanas pārvaldnieks, kuru pārvalda Linux Foundation. Tā glabā pieteikumu akreditācijas datus, API atslēgas, pakalpojumu un datu bāzes dati, automatizācija un aģentu identitātes, īslaicīgs žetonus un šifrēšanas atslēgas aiz politikas dzinējs, un var darboties kā iekšējo sertifikātu iestāde."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ is an open-source personal AI agent that runs on hardware you control. It ships a gateway process with a browser Control UI next to its CLI and TUI, keeps persistent memory and a workspace on disk, and performs browser and filesystem tasks inside its own sandbox."
msgstr "`OpenClaw <https://openclaw.ai/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda personīgo MI aģents, kas darbojas uz aparatūras jūs kontrolē. Tas kuģi vārteju procesu ar pārlūku Control UI blakus tās CLI un TUI, uztur pastāvīgu atmiņu un darba vietu uz diska, un veic pārlūkprogrammas un failu sistēmas uzdevumus iekšpusē tās sandbox."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ is a sovereign self-hosted file sync, share, and collaboration platform maintained by the Heinlein Group. It is a fork of the OpenCloud Infinite Scale codebase and is published as the ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` container image."
msgstr "`OpenCloud <https://opencloud.eu/>`__ ir suverēna paša hosted failu sinhronizācija, dalīties, un sadarbības platforma uztur Heinlein Group. Tas ir dakša no OpenCloud Bezgalīgs mērogs kodu bāze un tiek publicēts kā ``opencloudeu/opencloud`` tvertnes attēls."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ is a sovereign open-source video conferencing platform developed by the Heinlein Group. It combines a Rust controller, a LiveKit-based WebRTC media server, and a React web frontend."
msgstr "`OpenTalk <https://opentalk.eu/>`__ ir suverēna atvērtā pirmkoda videokonferenču platforma, ko izstrādājusi Heinlein Group. Tajā apvienots Rust kontrolieris, uz LiveKit bāzēts WebRTC mediju serveris un React web priekšpuse."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Social Home 2026.6.16 imports `logout` from `client/src/store/auth.ts` in exactly one place —   `client/src/main.tsx` wires it as the 401 handler via `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. No   component renders a logout control, so `personas/utils/logout.js` has nothing to click and the   admin journey cannot complete. The alternative — injecting a `[data-injected-logout]` button via   `templates/javascript.js.j2` — was rejected: the model   (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) points the button at   `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, which only exists for OIDC-gated roles, and this role deliberately runs   without SSO. Path back: upstream ships a logout control (or an in-app logout endpoint we can   target), then drop the flag and keep the `adminInteraction` already wired in the spec."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` : Sociālās mājas 2026.6.16 imports `logout` no `client/src/store/auth.ts` precīzi vienā vietā. `client/src/main.tsx` vada to kā 401 apstrādātājs caur `setUnauthorizedHandler(logout)`. Neviena sastāvdaļa padara atteikšanās kontroli, tāpēc `personas/utils/logout.js` nav ko noklikšķināt un admin ceļojums nevar pabeigt. Alternatīva — `[data-injected-logout]` poga caur `templates/javascript.js.j2` — tika noraidīts: modelis (`roles/web-app-prometheus/templates/javascript.js.j2`) norāda pogu `OIDC.CLIENT.LOGOUT_URL`, kas pastāv tikai OIDC-gated lomām, un šī loma apzināti darbojas bez SSO. Atpakaļceļš: augšpusējiem kuģiem atteikšanās kontrole (vai in-app logout galarezultāts mēs varam mērķēt), tad nomest karogu un saglabāt `adminInteraction` jau vadu spec."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared because the shared helper cannot reach Shopware's logout, not because the journey is untestable. The only logout control lives in `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, which the administration stylesheet keeps at `display: none` until its toggle is clicked, and that toggle is a bare `div` carrying no role, no `aria-haspopup` and no dropdown class — nothing in the helper's trigger set matches it. Its second fallback, following a same-origin settings link, misses as well because the administration is hash-routed and every settings target is `#/sw/settings/...`."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` tiek deklarēta, jo dalītais palīgs nevar sasniegt ShopwareAtteikties, nevis tāpēc, ka ceļojums ir nepārbaudāms. Vienīgā atteikšanās kontrole dzīvo `.sw-admin-menu__user-actions`, kas ir `display: none` līdz tā toggle ir noklikšķināts, un ka toggle ir tukša `div` nav pienākumu, nav `aria-haspopup` un nav nolaižamā klase — nekas palīga sprūda komplekts neatbilst tai. Tās otrais atkāpšanās, pēc vienas izcelsmes iestatījumu saiti, garām, kā arī tāpēc, ka administrācija ir hash-maršrutēts un katru iestatījumu mērķis ir `#/sw/settings/...`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` is declared for a second, independent reason, and two separate obstacles justify it."
msgstr "`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` tiek deklarēta otra, neatkarīga iemesla dēļ, un to attaisno divi atsevišķi šķēršļi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : The app authenticates against its own `platform_users` table. There is no OIDC client and no   auto-provisioning, so the biber account never exists inside Social Home. Path back: upstream   grows an OIDC/trusted-header auth path."
msgstr "`PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` : App autentificē pret savu `platform_users` tabula. Nav OIDC klienta un nav auto-pagaidu, tāpēc Bībeles konts nekad nav iekšā Social Home. Ceļš atpakaļ: augšpusē aug OIDC / uzticamu-header auth ceļu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` accepts a caller-supplied `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), and `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` accepts a caller-supplied `secret_id`. Both verified in [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (lines 889 and 1243)."
msgstr "`POST auth/approle/role/<name>/role-id` pieņem piegādāto zvanītāju `role_id` (`logical.UpdateOperation`), un `POST auth/approle/role/<name>/custom-secret-id` pieņem piegādāto zvanītāju `secret_id`. Abi pārbaudīti [`path_role.go`](https://github.com/openbao/openbao/blob/main/internal/builtin/credential/approle/path_role.go) (rindas 889 kā arī 1243)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`PROJECT_ROOT` is the repo root derived from this file's location."
msgstr "`PROJECT_ROOT` ir repo sakne, kas iegūta no šī faila atrašanās vietas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ is a minimal terminal coding agent with a lazy-loading skill system. This role installs it on a workstation and registers the platform’s model gateway as its provider."
msgstr "`Pi <https://github.com/earendil-works/pi>`__ ir minimāls termināla kodēšanas aģents ar slinkošanas prasmju sistēmu. Šī funkcija to uzstāda darbstacijā un reģistrē platformas modeļu vārteju kā tās nodrošinātāju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ is an open-source systems monitoring and alerting toolkit that collects and stores time-series metrics and provides a powerful query language (PromQL)."
msgstr "`Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda sistēmu monitoringa un brīdināšanas rīku komplekts, kas savāc un glabā laiksērijas metriku un nodrošina spēcīgu vaicājuma valodu (PromQL)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Pull requests`: **Read and write** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."
msgstr "`Pull requests`: **Lasīt un rakstīt** (`gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `scripts/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` faili VAR pastāvēt zem `scripts/` kā tikai dokumentācijas izņēmumus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`README.md` files MAY exist under `utils/` as documentation-only exceptions."
msgstr "`README.md` faili VAR pastāvēt zem `utils/` kā tikai dokumentācijas izņēmumus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (Alpine ≥3.18 HTTPS)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (Alpi ≥3.18 HTTPS)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (inner Dockerfile build, Alpine ≤3.17 HTTP)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (iekšdockerfile building, Alpine ≤3.17 HTTP)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apt-get install` (inner Dockerfile build, Debian/Ubuntu)"
msgstr "`RUN apt-get install` (iekšējs Dockerfile veidojums, Debian/Ubuntu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (inner Dockerfile build)"
msgstr "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (iekšējs Dockerfile veidojums)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_COUNT` defaults to `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (auto-scaled to hardware). Override explicitly when debugging a specific count."
msgstr "`RUNNER_COUNT` noklusētais `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (Automātiski mērogots uz aparatūru). Pārrakstīt skaidri, atkļūdot konkrētu skaitu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` is **required** and has no default; it is passed automatically by the CLI."
msgstr "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` ir **nepieciešams** un tam nav noklusējuma; KLI to nokārto automātiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` and `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` resolve from `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars when set (CI context), falling back to `meta/services.yml` for production deploys."
msgstr "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` kā arī `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` Izmainīt `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars kad noteikts (CI konteksts), kas atgriežas `meta/services.yml` ražošanai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) selects which test stages run."
msgstr "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) izvēlas testa posmus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ is a frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players powered by the `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ framework. It supports multiple UI styles including `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ and `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, and provides a unified interface for retro gaming across platforms."
msgstr "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ ir priekšpuse emulatoriem, spēļu dzinēji, un mediju spēlētājiem powered by `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ sistēma. Tas atbalsta vairākus UI stilus, tostarp `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ kā arī `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, un nodrošina vienotu saskarni retro spēļu pāri platformām."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ is a Node.js-based front-end application that simulates a roulette wheel in the browser."
msgstr "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ s ta rē Node.js- balstīta priekšējās-gala pieteikumu, kas simulē ruletes riteni pārlūkā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (base64 32 bytes, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) encrypts stored access keys; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` secure sessions."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (pamats64 32 baiti, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) šifrē saglabātās piekļuves atslēgas; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` drošas sesijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed the first admin (no setup wizard)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` sēj pirmo admin (nav iestatīšanas vedņa)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (file at `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uses `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` י `bolt` (fails `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres izmantošana `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus attribute mappings (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus atribūtu kartēšana (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON karte. Piegādātājs: `display_name`, `provider_url` (emitents), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Pārvirzīt ceļu ir `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaforei ir dzimtā OIDC — nē `oauth2-proxy` nepieciešams blakusvāģis.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` sets the externally-reachable base URL; required for correct OIDC redirects behind `sys-svc-proxy`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` uzstāda ārēji sasniedzamo bāzes URL; nepieciešams pareizai OIDC pāradresēšanai `sys-svc-proxy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` is emptied so the container never fetches the app catalog from github.com. Set it to a self-hosted catalog when one exists."
msgstr "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` ir iztukšots, tāpēc konteiners nekad neielādē programmu katalogu no github.com. Iestatiet to uz paša hosted katalogu, ja tāds pastāv."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` is unset — the SPA is same-origin. Needed only if a third-party client should talk to the API."
msgstr "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` ir atiestatīts — SPA ir vienāda izcelsme. Nepieciešams tikai tad, ja trešās puses klientam vajadzētu runāt ar API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` is pinned to 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` so the app's media cap stays inside `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Raising one without the other lets the volume outgrow its declared budget."
msgstr "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` ir piestiprināts pie 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` lai lietotnes multivides vāciņš paliktu iekš `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Paaugstinot vienu bez otra ļauj apjoms pāraugt savu deklarēto budžetu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ ir kriptogrāfiska tīkla protokols tīkla pakalpojumu drošai darbībai pa nenodrošinātu tīklu. E ir o pa s `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ projekts nodrošina atsauces īstenošanu, tostarp ``ssh-agent`` autentifikācijas atslēgu pārvaldībai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): desired state (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"
msgstr "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (virkne): vēlamais stāvoklis (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ is a metasearch engine. It forwards a query to other search engines and returns the merged result without an account and without a tracking profile."
msgstr "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ ir metameklēšanas dzinējs. Tas pārsūta vaicājumu citām meklētājprogrammām un atgriež apvienoto rezultātu bez konta un bez izsekošanas profila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ ir ātri sadalīta glabāšanas sistēma blobs, objekti, un faili. Tas atmasko3- Saderīgs API, tāpēc programmas glabāt un iegūt objektus ar standarta S3 SDK un CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ ir moderna tīmekļa UI un API darbojas Ansible playbooks, Terraform / OpenTofu plāni, un čaulas skripti grafiku vai pēc pieprasījuma. Šis uzdevums ir izvietot amatpersonas ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>` Tvertne aiz Infinito.Nexus reversais starpniekserveris ar centrālo PostgreSQL, dzimtā Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, un izvēles LDAP pieteikšanās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ ir pieteikums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ ir pieteikums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (default: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (noklusētais: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (default: `noble`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (noklusētais: `noble`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (resolved in `vars/main.yml` from `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` via `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (līmenis `vars/main.yml` no `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` caur `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (default: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (noklusētais: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (default: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (noklusētais: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ is a powerful and intuitive open-source project management platform tailored for agile teams. Whether you’re practicing Scrum, Kanban, or a custom hybrid workflow, Taiga offers a rich, customizable environment to plan, track, and collaborate on your projects, without the complexity of enterprise tools or the vendor lock-in of SaaS platforms."
msgstr "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ ir spēcīgs un intuitīvi atvērtā koda projektu vadības platforma pielāgota veiklām komandām. Vai jūs praktizējat Scrum, Kanban, vai pasūtījuma hibrīda darbplūsmu, Taiga piedāvā bagātīgu, pielāgojamu vidi, lai plānotu, izsekotu un sadarbotos ar saviem projektiem, bez uzņēmuma rīku sarežģītības vai SaaS platformu pārdevēja bloķēšanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ ir pieteikums."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` resolves the caller's token through `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` and presents it as the Bearer"
msgstr "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` atrisina zvanītāja marķieri caur `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` un prezentē to kā Bearer"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Unit tests` verify isolated logic."
msgstr "`Unit tests` pārbaudīt izolētu loģiku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`UsersLookup` yields the `no-reply` user dict used to derive `from` and `password`. Missing entries MUST yield an empty dict. The fallback for `from` is then `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."
msgstr "`UsersLookup` iegūst `no-reply` lietotāju diktāts, lai iegūtu `from` kā arī `password`. Trūkst ierakstiem ir jādod tukšs dikt. Atkāpšanās `from` ir tad `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ ir spēcīgs pirmkoda redaktors ar plašu spraudņu ekosistēmu, atbalstot izstrādes darbplūsmas daudzās valodās un platformās. Skatīt arī `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ un vispārīgi `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ par Vikipēdiju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ pēc izvēles garšu: izplatīšanas Code - OSS built, VSCodium, vai Microsoft paša binārā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ ir daudzpusīgs un plaši izmanto `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ tas piešķir pilnvaras miljoniem tīmekļa vietņu, sākot ar blogiem un portfeļiem un beidzot ar e-komerciju un korporatīvajām vietnēm. Šī izvietošana nodrošina konteineru WordPress piemēram optimizēta multivietnes darbību, modernu mediju pārvaldību, un plašu spraudnis atbalstu, kas ļauj jums pilnībā izmantot bagātīgas funkcijas WordPress programmatūra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ is an open-source helpdesk and ticketing system. Agents handle customer requests across email, chat, phone and web; customers can open tickets from a self-service portal."
msgstr "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ ir atvērtā pirmkoda palīdzības dienests un biļešu sistēma. Aģenti apstrādā klientu pieprasījumus pa e-pastu, tērzēšanu, tālruni un internetu; klienti var atvērt biļetes no pašapkalpošanās portāla."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ is a popular video conferencing application for online meetings, webinars, and collaboration."
msgstr "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ ir populārs video konferences pieteikumu tiešsaistes tikšanās, vebināri, un sadarbība."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → a device on the host, recovered over ssh then pulled; `[user@]host:/image` → the image is pulled and recovered locally (`device` / `full`)"
msgstr "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → ierīce uz datora, kas atgūta virs ssh, tad velk; `[user@]host:/image` → attēlu velk un reģenerē lokāli (`device` / `full`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_as_bool` MUST accept the usual string forms (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), booleans, and numbers. Every boolean decision in the fallbacks MUST use it so that `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` values coming from YAML, environment variables, or already-coerced facts all behave the same."
msgstr "`_as_bool` PIEŅEMIET parastās veidlapas (`true|false|yes|no|1|0|on|off`), būlieši un skaitļi. Katram boolean lēmumu rezerves jāizmanto, lai `SYSTEM_EMAIL_*` vērtības, kas nāk no YAML, vides mainīgie, vai jau coerced fakti visi rīkojas vienādi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_compute` MUST delegate to three other lookup plugins rather than re-reading project state directly:"
msgstr "`_compute` MUST deleģēt uz trim citiem Lookup plugins, nevis atkārtoti lasīt projekta stāvokli tieši:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`_shared.js` — env + login helpers (`penpotOidcLogin`, `penpotLdapLogin`, `penpotNativeLogin`, `penpotRegister`)."
msgstr "`_shared.js` — env + pieteikšanās palīgi (`penpotOidcLogin`, `penpotLdapLogin`, `penpotNativeLogin`, `penpotRegister`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"block-above\"``: the construct's own line, or any comment line above it within the same blank-line-delimited block. A gettext entry stacks several comments and repeats a URL in both ``msgid`` and ``msgstr``, so a marker has to cover the whole entry and survive whichever writer appends its comment last."
msgstr "``\"block-above\"``: būvēt savas līnijas, vai jebkuru komentāru līniju virs tā tajā pašā tukšas līnijas norobežots bloks. Gettext ieraksts kaudze vairākus komentārus un atkārto URL abos ``msgid`` kā arī ``msgstr``, tāpēc marķieris ir, lai aptvertu visu ierakstu un izdzīvot neatkarīgi rakstītājs pievieno savu komentāru pēdējo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"line-above\"``: marker must be on the immediately preceding non-empty line. Blank lines between marker and construct break the association."
msgstr "``\"line-above\"``: marķierim jābūt uz iepriekšējās netukšās rindas. Tukšas līnijas starp marķieri un konstrukciju pārraut asociāciju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"same-line\"``: marker must be on the construct's line."
msgstr "``\"same-line\"``: marķierim jābūt uz konstrukcijas līnijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``\"same-or-above\"`` (default): either of the above."
msgstr "``\"same-or-above\"`` (noklusētais): vai nu iepriekš minēto."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``#`` (Python, YAML, shell, conf, INI, …)"
msgstr "``#`` (Python, YAML, shell, conf, INI, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``#``, ``@``, ``+``, ``%`` and ``/`` introduce an axis and appear in neither a role id nor a display name, so the first of them is the seam."
msgstr "``#``, ``@``, ``+``, ``%`` kā arī ``/`` ieviest asi un parādās ne lomu id, ne displeja nosaukumu, tāpēc pirmais no tiem ir šuve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection`` is the JSON object ``{url, endpoint, model, secret}`` built from ``MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION``; ``url`` is ``LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL`` and ``secret`` is this role’s own ``credentials.litellm_api_key``. The braces are mandatory: a brace-free value is re-wrapped as ``{\"legacy\": ...}`` upstream and the provider falls back to the vendor endpoint at ``api.openai.com``."
msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProviderConnection`` ir JSON objekts ``{url, endpoint, model, secret}`` būvēts no ``MEDIAWIKI_LITELLM_CONNECTION``; ``url`` ir ``LITELLM_OPENAI_BASE_LOCAL_URL`` kā arī ``secret`` ir šīs funkcijas pašas ``credentials.litellm_api_key``. Breketes ir obligātas: vērtību bez lencēm pārtin kā ``{\"legacy\": ...}`` Augšup un pakalpojuma sniedzējs atgriežas pie pārdevēja galauzstādījuma ``api.openai.com``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` is ``open-ai``."
msgstr "``$wgAIEditingAssistantActiveProvider`` ir ``open-ai``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``$wgHTTPTimeout`` is raised inside the same block because core’s 25s is below a cold local model’s first token."
msgstr "``$wgHTTPTimeout`` ir pacelts tajā pašā blokā, jo serdes 25s zem aukstā vietējā modeļa pirmo marķieri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "``%%`` is \"contains\" for a scalar string value and \"is a member of\" for a set value; ``==`` / ``!=`` against a set mean membership / non-membership. String comparisons (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) are case-insensitive; ``< > <= >=`` are numeric. A bare expression with no operator (e.g. ``nextcloud``) is shorthand for ``name %% nextcloud``."
msgstr "``%%`` ir \"contains\" Skalāras virknes vērtībai un \"ir loceklis\" noteiktai vērtībai; ``==`` / ``!=`` pret kopumu nozīmē dalību / dalību. Virkne salīdzinājumu (``==`` ``!=`` ``%%``) ir nejutīgi pret konkrētiem gadījumiem; ``< > <= >=`` ir skaitliski. Tīra izteiksme bez operatora (Piemēram, ``nextcloud``) shorthand ``name %% nextcloud``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``'on-failure'`` or ``'on-failure:N'`` -> ``'on-failure'``"
msgstr "``'on-failure'`` vai ``'on-failure:N'`` - BAR ``'on-failure'``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(\"SKIPPED\", reason)`` when ping is unavailable or lacks CAP_NET_RAW"
msgstr "``(\"SKIPPED\", reason)`` ja ping nav pieejams vai trūkst CAP_NET_RAW"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``('', '')`` when the role has no instructions to replay or this sweep deploys no variant that could carry them."
msgstr "``('', '')`` ja lomai nav norādījumu par atkārtotu atskaņošanu vai šī atspēriena punkta izmantošana nav iespējama."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(1-based line number, text)`` for every line inside a ``## Credits`` section, ending at the next heading of any level."
msgstr "``(1-based line number, text)`` katrai rindai a ``## Credits`` iedaļa, kas beidzas pie nākamā virsraksta jebkurā līmenī."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(None, None)`` when every probe size is dropped"
msgstr "``(None, None)`` kad tiek nomesti visi zondes izmēri"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(files_glob, dump_glob)`` for the layout *names* describe."
msgstr "``(files_glob, dump_glob)`` izkārtojumam *nosaukums* apraksta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(healthcheck, source)`` where source is ``cache``, ``mirror``, ``upstream`` or ``none``. Reading upstream is the documented fallback for images the mirror does not carry; a caller that sweeps many images can use the counts to tell a fallback from a mirror that stopped working."
msgstr "``(healthcheck, source)`` kur avots ir ``cache``, ``mirror``, ``upstream`` vai ``none``. Lasīšana augšpus ir dokumentēts atkāpšanās attēliem spogulis nenes; zvanītājs, kas slauc daudzus attēlus var izmantot skaitu, lai pastāstītu atkāpšanās no spoguļa, kas pārstāja darboties."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(input name, opening literal, is_marker)`` per rendered segment, in template order."
msgstr "``(input name, opening literal, is_marker)`` par katru renderēto segmentu, veidnes secībā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` mapped to ``msgstr``; empty and fuzzy entries are left out, so their source text stands in."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` kartēts uz ``msgstr``; tukši un izplūduši ieraksti ir atstāti, tāpēc to avota teksts ir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pairs in source order."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pāri avota secībā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pairs; ``msgctxt`` may be ``None``."
msgstr "``(msgctxt, msgid)`` pāri; ``msgctxt`` var ``None``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(name, email)``, unchanged when the mailmap knows the address not."
msgstr "``(name, email)``, nemainīts, kad pastkarte zina adresi nav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(name, email)``; either is empty when neither source knows it."
msgstr "``(name, email)``; vai nu ir tukšs, ja neviens avots to nezina."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(payload_bytes, total_bytes)`` on success"
msgstr "``(payload_bytes, total_bytes)`` par panākumiem"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(role_id, node)`` pairs, manager repositories first."
msgstr "``(role_id, node)`` pāri, pārvaldnieks krātuves vispirms."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``(volume, engine)`` for every database volume that carries no dump."
msgstr "``(volume, engine)`` par katru datu bāzes apjomu, kas nes izgāztuves."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``--index`` then prints one chunk as the matrix JSON. Every chunk block runs the same computation and takes its own slice, so the blocks agree without passing state between them."
msgstr "``--index`` pēc tam izdrukā vienu gabalu kā matricu JSON. Katrs gabalu bloks veic to pašu aprēķinu un ņem savu šķēli, tāpēc bloki vienojas, nelaižot valsti starp tiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``--matrix`` renders the full ordered candidate list, so the matrix order IS the selection priority. Every human-facing view of that list goes through here rather than re-deriving the sort and the filter: hand-rolling ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` reads the wrong column (``compose`` is what a role can do, ``test_compose`` is what CI tests), which silently shows an order no run will ever take."
msgstr "``--matrix`` renderē pilnu pasūtīto kandidātu sarakstu, tāpēc matricas pasūtījums IS atlases prioritāte. Katrs cilvēcisks skatījums uz šo sarakstu šeit iet cauri, nevis pārdalot veidu un filtru: roku vilkšana ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` lasa nepareizu kolonnu (``compose`` ir tas, ko var darīt, ``test_compose`` ir kāds CI tests), kas klusi parāda rīkojumu neviens palaist nekad veikt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``.mailmap`` maps every address a person has committed under to their ``@infinito.nexus`` address, and that address names their profile: the local part is the profile slug. One social profile is therefore the single point of truth for an author, and nothing here keeps a second copy of their name, URL or avatar."
msgstr "``.mailmap`` kartē katru adresi, ko persona ir apņēmusies ``@infinito.nexus`` adrese, un ka adrese nosaukumu savu profilu: vietējā daļa ir profila gliemezis. Tāpēc viens sociālais profils ir viens patiesības punkts autoram, un nekas šeit netur otru sava vārda, URL vai avatara kopiju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``.po`` or ``.pot`` file."
msgstr "``.po`` vai ``.pot`` failu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``//`` (JS, JSONC, …)"
msgstr "``//`` (JS, JSONC, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/etc/systemd/system``, ``/run/systemd``, so MDAD’s ``systemctl`` calls target the deploy container’s systemd"
msgstr "``/etc/systemd/system``, ``/run/systemd``, tātad MDAD ``systemctl`` zvani mērķis izvietošana konteinera sistematizētu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/matrix``, MDAD’s data and config root"
msgstr "``/matrix``, MDAD datu un konfigurācijas root"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/mcp`` on the ``contextagentmcp`` adapter sidecar"
msgstr "``/mcp`` par ``contextagentmcp`` blakusvāģis"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/mcp`` on the ``gitlabmcp`` sidecar, internal port ``http``; the adapter reaches ``/api/v4/mcp`` on workhorse upstream"
msgstr "``/mcp`` par ``gitlabmcp`` blakusvāģis, iekšējā osta ``http``; adapteris sasniedz ``/api/v4/mcp`` par darba zirgiem augšpusē"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/mcp`` on the ``mattermostmcp`` sidecar; the adapter reaches ``/plugins/mattermost-ai/mcp-server/mcp`` on the ``mattermost`` service upstream"
msgstr "``/mcp`` par ``mattermostmcp`` blakusvāģis; adapteris sasniedz ``/plugins/mattermost-ai/mcp-server/mcp`` par ``mattermost`` augšupējs pakalpojums"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/opt/data/config.yaml``, owned by uid 10000"
msgstr "``/opt/data/config.yaml``, kas pieder UID 10000"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/usr/local/bin`` is NOT bind-mounted, even though MDAD writes a few helper scripts there. The runner’s ``ansible-core`` lives at ``/opt/ansible/bin/`` (out of the way) to keep the option open, but mounting the deploy container’s ``/usr/local/bin`` over the runner causes a Python ABI mismatch segfault (host Python is built differently from ``python:3.13-slim``). MDAD’s host-side helper scripts are not invoked by the deploy flow."
msgstr "``/usr/local/bin`` nav saistīts-montēt, pat ja MDAD raksta dažus palīgs skriptus tur. Skrējēja ``ansible-core`` dzīvi ``/opt/ansible/bin/`` (nost no ceļa) saglabāt iespēju atvērt, bet montāža izvietot konteineru s ``/usr/local/bin`` virs skrējējs izraisa Python ABI nesakritību segfault (resursdators Python ir būvēts atšķirīgi no ``python:3.13-slim``). MDAD saimnieka puses palīga skripti netiek izmantoti izvietojuma plūsmu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/var/run/docker.sock``, so MDAD-launched containers land in the same Docker daemon as the rest of the stack"
msgstr "``/var/run/docker.sock``, tāpēc MDAD nolaistie konteineri nosēžas tajā pašā Docker dēmonā kā pārējie kaudze"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/webservice/mcp/server.php`` on the canonical domain"
msgstr "``/webservice/mcp/server.php`` par kanonisko domēnu"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``<!-- … -->`` (HTML, Markdown)"
msgstr "``<!-- … -->`` (HTML iezīmēšana)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``API`` is a plain mapping, so an inventory that configures three providers replaces the whole declaration instead of merging into it, and every provider it does not name disappears. Resolving a hidden provider then raises, and a raising lookup inside a value the applications renderer is templating leaves the raw ``{{ ... }}`` text in place: the consumer stores template text, and ``| bool`` coerces it to False with a deprecation warning that fails the deploy on the warning gate."
msgstr "``API`` ir vienkārša kartēšana, tāpēc inventārs, kas konfigurē trīs pakalpojumu sniedzējus, aizstāj visu deklarāciju, nevis apvienojas tajā, un katrs pakalpojumu sniedzējs tā nosaukums nepazūd. Tad paslēptā pakalpojuma sniedzēja atjaunošana palielinās, un pieaugošais atsaukums vērtības iekšpusē programmu renderētājs ir templatings atstāj neapstrādātu ``{{ ... }}`` tekstu: patērētāju veikalos veidni tekstu, un ``| bool`` liek to False ar deprekācijas brīdinājumu, kas nespēj izvietot uz brīdinājuma vārtiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``Authorization: Bearer <token>``, a Moodle web-service token"
msgstr "``Authorization: Bearer <token>``, a Moodle tīmekļa servisa marķierierīce"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``Authorization`` header per server, from the discovery data"
msgstr "``Authorization`` galvene uz vienu serveri, no meklēšanas datiem"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``BARE_BOLD_RE``  ``**Name**`` that is not itself a link's text."
msgstr "``BARE_BOLD_RE`` ``**Name**`` tas pats par sevi nav saites teksts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``BYPASS_ADMIN_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`` keeps the grant meaningful for administrators too; upstream defaults it to true, which would let every administrator past any grant. ``ENABLE_OAUTH_GROUP_MANAGEMENT`` syncs the platform’s groups on login, so membership follows Keycloak."
msgstr "``BYPASS_ADMIN_ACCESS_CONTROL=false`` saglabā dotācijas nozīmi arī administratoriem; iepriekšējā posma saistību neizpildes gadījumā tā ir taisnība, kas ļautu katram administratoram iziet no dotācijas. ``ENABLE_OAUTH_GROUP_MANAGEMENT`` sinhronizē platformas grupas piesakoties, tāpēc dalība seko Keycloak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``CA_ROOT.cert_host`` (default: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.crt``)"
msgstr "``CA_ROOT.cert_host`` (noklusētais: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.crt``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``CA_ROOT.key_host`` (default: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.key``)"
msgstr "``CA_ROOT.key_host`` (noklusētais: ``/etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.key``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``CA_ROOT`` (mapping)"
msgstr "``CA_ROOT`` (kartēšana)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``DEV_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` mirrors ``INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` from ``default.env``; the pairing is drift-guarded."
msgstr "``DEV_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` spoguļi ``INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`` no ``default.env``; pāriem ir drifter-sargs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``DevInventorySpec`` is imported but deliberately absent from ``__all__``: listing a re-exported class makes autodoc document it here as well as in :mod:`.spec`, and sphinx then finds two targets for every annotation. Importing it from this package keeps working either way."
msgstr "``DevInventorySpec`` ir importēts, bet apzināti nav no ``__all__``: uzskaitot reeksportēto klasi padara autodoc dokumentu to šeit, kā arī :mod:`.spec`, un sfinkss tad atrod divus mērķus katrai anotācijai. To importēšana no šīs paketes turpina darboties abos virzienos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``EDGES``: the curated, web-verified upstream app↔app plugin/integration pages, each ``(source, target, url, kind)`` with ``kind`` in ``{\"check\", \"coin\"}``."
msgstr "``EDGES``: kūrētās, tīmekļa pārbaudītās augšpusējās lietotnes ↔app spraudnis/integrācijas lapas, katra ``(source, target, url, kind)`` kur: ``kind`` skaits ``{\"check\", \"coin\"}``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT`` maps the application’s administrator group onto the Open WebUI admin role, and it also makes ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES`` a sign-in gate. The env sets ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*`` so every platform role passes that gate; narrow it only to a list that matches the ``/roles/<app>/<role>`` paths Keycloak emits."
msgstr "``ENABLE_OAUTH_ROLE_MANAGEMENT`` kartē programmas administratora grupu Open WebUI admin loma, un tas arī padara ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES`` ierakstīšanās vārti. Env komplekti ``OAUTH_ALLOWED_ROLES=*`` katru platformas lomu iet, ka vārti; sašaurināt to tikai uz sarakstu, kas atbilst ``/roles/<app>/<role>`` ceļi Keycloak emisijas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``FILE_ENVIRONMENT`` (default: ``/etc/environment``)"
