# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`cluster_addr` MUST NOT be built from the container name. Compose sets `container_name:` explicitly, but swarm names every task `<stack>_<key>.<slot>.<taskid>`, so a container-name-derived address renders differently per mode. With `replicas: 1` the node only ever advertises to itself, so a loopback cluster address is mode-independent; the HA follow-up story revisits it."
msgstr "`cluster_addr` NEDRĪKST būt izgatavoti no iepakojuma nosaukuma. Kompožu komplekti `container_name:` skaidri, bet bars nosauc katru uzdevumu `<stack>_<key>.<slot>.<taskid>`, tāpēc konteinera nosaukuma iegūta adrese padara atšķirīgu katram režīmam. kur: `replicas: 1` mezgls reklamē tikai sevi, tāpēc cilpu klastera adrese nav atkarīga no režīma; HA turpinājuma stāsts to pārskata."

