# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`download` accepts conclusion filters (`-s` success, `-f` failed, `-c` cancelled, `-k` skipped; none fetches all), `-d` for the destination, and `-j` for the worker count. The per-job logs carry the real failing task and its error, and the artefacts carry the Playwright `error-context.md`, screenshots, and `playwright-junit.xml`."
msgstr "`download` pieņem secinājumu filtrus (`-s` panākumi, `-f` neizdevās, `-c` atcelti, `-k` izlaists; nav ziņu avotu), `-d` attiecībā uz galamērķi un `-j` darbinieku skaitam. Par-darba žurnālus veikt reālu neveiksmīgs uzdevums un tās kļūda, un artefakti veikt Playwright `error-context.md`, ekrānšāviņi un `playwright-junit.xml`."

