msgstr "`ensure()` Jāpalielina `RuntimeError` ar aprakstošu ziņojumu par kļūdu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ensure_mcp_entry` binds the MCP config entry to `llm_hass_api: [\"assist\"]` in [provision_mcp.py](../../roles/web-app-homeassistant/files/python/provision_mcp.py)"
msgstr "`ensure_mcp_entry` Piesaista MCP konfigurācijas ierakstu `llm_hass_api: [\"assist\"]` skaits [provision_mcp.py](../../roles/web-app-homeassistant/files/python/provision_mcp.py)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`entry-manual-steer.yml` declares `cancel-in-progress: true` outright on its own group, and the orchestrator reads `github.event_name` — which a called workflow inherits from its caller — so a manual sweep supersedes on both levels without an input to pass down."
msgstr "`entry-manual-steer.yml` deklarē `cancel-in-progress: true` tieši uz savu grupu, un orķestris lasa `github.event_name` — kuru sauc darbplūsma manto no sava zvanītāja — tāpēc abos līmeņos tiek aizstāta manuālā slaucīšana bez ievades, lai pārietu uz leju."

# un tas deg tikai uz `push`, kur `github.ref_name` vienmēr stumts filiāle.
# [ierakstu
# atceļsuperseded.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml)
# nes ne concurrency grupu savu — tas ir API atkāpšanās no šīs grupas — bet
# tās push darbs atkārto to pašu predikātu kā darbs `if`, tāpēc tas nekad
# nepieskaras `main` vai nu.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`entry-push-latest.yml` declares exactly that expression, and it fires only on `push`, where `github.ref_name` is always the pushed branch. [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) carries no concurrency group of its own — it is the API fallback for that group — but its push job repeats the same predicate as a job `if`, so it never touches `main` either."
msgstr "`entry-push-latest.yml` deklarē tieši šo izteicienu, un tas deg tikai uz `push`, kur `github.ref_name` vienmēr stumts filiāle. [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) nes ne concurrency grupu savu — tas ir API atkāpšanās no šīs grupas — bet tās push darbs atkārto to pašu predikātu kā darbs `if`, tāpēc tas nekad nepieskaras `main` vai nu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
