msgstr "`environment` lasītājs `external`, `TLS_ENABLED`, `DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`exposure: public` additionally requires a complete `limits` block."
msgstr "`exposure: public` papildus nepieciešama pilnīga `limits` bloku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`exposure: public` puts the endpoint on the role's own vhost, so it inherits what that vhost already provides: routing through the shared proxy, TLS from the platform certificate, `client_max_body_size` from `server.client_max_body_size`, and the proxy read timeout of the location it is mounted in."
msgstr "`exposure: public` liek galapunktu uz lomu paša vhost, tāpēc tas manto to, kas vhost jau sniedz: maršrutēšana caur koplietošanas starpniekserveri, TLS no platformas sertifikātu, `client_max_body_size` no `server.client_max_body_size`, un starpniekservera lasīšanas noildze vietā, kurā tas ir uzstādīts."

