# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`lmstudio/llmster-preview:cpu` publishes one `linux/amd64` manifest, runs `/app/daemon-run.sh` as its entrypoint and exposes `1234/tcp` (measured against the registry config blob on 2026-08-28). The role wires that server and the gateway routes `lmstudio/default` to it, but a completion additionally needs a model in the container's store on an x86 node with the memory to load it. Until such a node joins the deployment, verify the gateway against `svc-ai-ollama` and leave the LM Studio completion criterion unchecked."
msgstr "`lmstudio/llmster-preview:cpu` publicē vienu `linux/amd64` Saraksts `/app/daemon-run.sh` kā ieejas punktu un atmasko `1234/tcp` (mēra pēc reģistra konfigurācijas blob on 2026-08-28). Loma vadi, ka serveris un vārteja maršruti `lmstudio/default` uz to, bet pabeigšanas papildus nepieciešams modelis konteinera veikalā uz x86 mezgls ar atmiņu, lai to ielādētu. Līdz šāds mezgls pievienojas izvietošana, pārbaudīt vārteja pret `svc-ai-ollama` un atstāt LM Studio nav pārbaudīts pabeigšanas kritērijs."

