# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`noqa` and `nocheck` are case-insensitive synonyms in the parser. Every project rule MUST use `nocheck:` because `# noqa: <code>` is also parsed by ruff as a flake8 directive and warns on non-flake8 keys. Reserve `noqa:` for real flake8 / ruff codes (`E402`, `F401`, …). [test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py](../../../../tests/lint/filesystem/python/test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py) hard-rejects `# noqa: <code>` whose codes do not match `[A-Z]+\\d+`."
msgstr "`noqa` kā arī `nocheck` ir sinonīmi, kas parserā nav sinonīmi. Katram projekta noteikumam ir jāizmanto `nocheck:` jo `# noqa: <code>` tiek arī parsēts ar ruff kā pārslu8 direktīva un brīdinājumi par neplīst8 atslēgas. Rezerve `noqa:` Īstām pārslām8 / Rifa kodi (`E402`, `F401`, ...). [test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py](../../../../tests/lint/filesystem/python/test_noqa_only_ruff_codes.py) hard-rejects `# noqa: <code>` kuru kodi neatbilst `[A-Z]+\\d+`."

