# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-ai-robot` stays out of the platform list. It runs the same agent in embodied mode, which means it drops the isolating runtime on purpose and hands the container the host devices it is meant to drive. A broker platform is defined by the opposite: `runsc`, no host device, no host mount. Serving an embodied agent per user would either break that invariant or ship a robot that cannot reach its hardware."
msgstr "`svc-ai-robot` neiekļaujas platformas sarakstā. Tas darbojas pats aģents iemiesotā režīmā, kas nozīmē, ka tas pilieni izolēšanas runtime uz mērķi un rokas konteiners saimnieka ierīces tas ir paredzēts vadīt. Starpnieku platformu definē pretēji: `runsc`, nav saimniekdatora ierīces, nav saimniekdatora stiprinājums. Apkalpojot iemiesotu aģentu vienam lietotājam, tiktu vai nu salauzts, ka invariants vai kuģis robots, kas nevar sasniegt tā aparatūru."

