# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_e2e_playwright_skip_roles` (default: `[]`)"
msgstr "`test_e2e_playwright_skip_roles` (noklusētais: `[]`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_network_create_via_util.py` requires that role tasks creating Docker networks route through the shared utility, never inline `community.docker.docker_network` calls."
msgstr "`test_network_create_via_util.py` prasa, lai uzdevumi izveidot Docker tīklu maršrutu, izmantojot kopīgo lietderību, nekad iekš `community.docker.docker_network` zvana."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` caps inline multi-line SQL in Ansible tasks at three lines. Larger statements MUST live in a dedicated `.sql` file under the role's `files/` directory and be loaded explicitly so linters, formatters, and database tooling can operate on them."
msgstr "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` cokoli iekļaujas daudzrindu SQL Assible uzdevumos trīs rindās. Lielākiem paziņojumiem jādzīvo veltītā `.sql` datne ar funkciju `files/` direktoriju un jābūt ielādētiem skaidri tik linters, formatērijas, un datu bāzes rīku var darboties uz tiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` forbids `| default(...)` on Jinja expressions whose path resolves via `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Those keys are loaded unconditionally, so the default is dead code at best and silent SPOT decoupling at worst. Per-line suppression: `# nocheck: spot-default`."
msgstr "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` aizliedz `| default(...)` par Jinja izteiksmes, kuru ceļš atrisina caur `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Šīs atslēgas ir ielādētas bez nosacījumiem, tāpēc noklusējuma ir miris kods labākajā un kluss SPOT atkabināšanu sliktākajā. Per-line nomākšana: `# nocheck: spot-default`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `get_url:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.get_url`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` aizliedz bez piezīmēm `get_url:` moduļa nosaukums; uzdevumi jāizmanto `ansible.builtin.get_url`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `uri:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.uri`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` aizliedz bez piezīmēm `uri:` moduļa nosaukums; uzdevumi jāizmanto `ansible.builtin.uri`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` forbids literal `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; every gate MUST flow through the `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` variable."
msgstr "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` aizliedz burtisku `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; katrs vārti jāplūst caur `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` mainīga."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` forbids `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. The two-term `config` lookup raises on a missing key, so the Jinja `default(...)` filter never fires; the fallback MUST be passed as the lookup's third argument instead."
msgstr "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` aizliedz `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. Divu termiņu `config` lookup rada par trūkstošo atslēgu, tāpēc Jinja `default(...)` filtrs nekad ugunsgrēks; atkāpšanās jānokārto kā lookup trešais arguments vietā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` forbids `| default(...)` on a task's own `register:` output or input arguments inside its own conditionals, where the value is provably set."
msgstr "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` aizliedz `| default(...)` paša uzdevums `register:` izejas vai ieejas argumenti iekšpusē savu nosacījumu, kur vērtība ir pierādāmi noteikts."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` requires that every `sh -lc '...'` invocation containing a `|` pipeline starts with `set -o pipefail`, so failures mid-pipeline propagate."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` prasa, ka katru `sh -lc '...'` piesaukšana, kas satur `|` cauruļvads sākas ar `set -o pipefail`, tāpēc neveiksmes viduspipelīna propagandēt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` requires that Ansible `shell:` tasks stay on Bash and use Bash's `set -o pipefail` form, not the POSIX-`sh` workaround."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` prasa, ka Ansible `shell:` uzdevumi palikt uz Bash un izmantot Bash s `set -o pipefail` veidlapa, nevis POSIX-`sh` darbs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` scans top-level keys of `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` and `group_vars/**/*.yml` against every project `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` file. The suppression rule key is `unused-var` (see [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."
msgstr "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` skenē augšējā līmeņa atslēgas `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` kā arī `group_vars/**/*.yml` pret katru projektu `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` failu. Apspiešanas noteikumu atslēga ir `unused-var` (skatīt [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_run_once_tags.py` requires that every `set_fact` marked `run_once: true` carries the canonical run-once tags so re-runs and `--tags` filters keep the fact populated."
msgstr "`test_run_once_tags.py` prasa, ka katru `set_fact` atzīmēts `run_once: true` nes kanonisko priekšgala tagus, lai atkārtoti palaistu un `--tags` filtri saglabāt faktu apdzīvots."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_sed_escape.py` requires that any Jinja-templated replacement passed to `sed` flows through the `sed_escape` filter so substitutions with regex metacharacters land literally."
msgstr "`test_sed_escape.py` pieprasa, lai jebkura Jinja-templēta nomaiņa pārietu uz `sed` plūst caur `sed_escape` filtrē tā aizvieto ar regex metazīmes zemes burtiski."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` enforces that every service whose `meta/services.yml` entry marks it `shared: true` exposes the required role-side bindings, and the inverse: a role consuming the shared form MUST declare the corresponding flag in its `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` nodrošina, ka visi pakalpojumi, kuru `meta/services.yml` ieraksts to iezīmē `shared: true` atmasko vajadzīgās lomas puses saites un apgriezti: loma, kas patērē kopīgo formu, jādeklarē attiecīgais karogs savā `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` scans task-level `vars:` blocks against the same consumer set. The two scanners never overlap because their declaration shapes differ."
msgstr "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` skenē uzdevumu līmeni `vars:` bloki pret to pašu patērētāju kopumu. Abi skeneri nekad nepārklājas, jo atšķiras to deklarēšanas formas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tests/lint/...`                           collision/band checks"
msgstr "`tests/lint/...` sadursmes/joslas pārbaudes"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_unpinned_no_engine_volume.py` stays as the guard: an unpinned role must not declare an engine on-disk data volume."
msgstr "`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_unpinned_no_engine_volume.py` paliek kā aizsargs: nesapinusies loma nedrīkst deklarēt motora datu apjomu uz diska."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tls.py`/`tls_common`: onion branch + app-level flavor override + unit tests."
msgstr "`tls.py`/`tls_common`: sīpolu zara + lietotnes līmeņa aromāta ignorēšana + vienības testi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tls` reads `external` and `TLS_ENABLED`."
msgstr "`tls` lasītājs `external` kā arī `TLS_ENABLED`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tool_objectfs` object-file-storage plugin"
msgstr "`tool_objectfs` Objekta failu glabāšanas spraudnis"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tools/list` returns 10 tools: entity control (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`), timers, broadcast, to-do list read and write, date and time, and `GetLiveContext` for the current state."
msgstr "`tools/list` atgriež 10 rīki: organizācijas kontrole (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`), taimeris, raidījums, darbu saraksts lasīt un rakstīt, datums un laiks, un `GetLiveContext` pašreizējā stāvoklī."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` MUST default to `streamable_http` for server deployments. Stdio MAY exist only for local development and MUST NOT be enabled in a deployed web role by default."
msgstr "`transport` JĀNORĀDA `streamable_http` servera izvietojumiem. Stdio MAI pastāv tikai vietējai attīstībai, un NEDRĪKST būt ieslēgtam izvērstā tīmekļa lomā pēc noklusējuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` accepts `streamable_http` and `sse` only. A stdio MCP server is a local process the client spawns, so it inherits the client container's filesystem and network with no endpoint to authenticate, no proxy to route through, and nothing for a probe to reach. Every property the other rules rely on (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) is undefined for it. Clients that support stdio are pinned away from it in their own role: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` so no flow can spawn a command."
msgstr "`transport` pieņem `streamable_http` kā arī `sse` tikai. Stdio MCP serveris ir lokāls process, kuru klients nārsto, tāpēc tas manto klienta konteinera failu sistēmu un tīklu bez galapunkta, lai autentificētos, bez starpniekservera, lai maršrutētu caur, un nekas, lai zonde sasniegtu. Katrs īpašums citi noteikumi balstās uz (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) tam nav definēts. Klienti, kas atbalsta stdio tiek pinned prom no tā savu lomu: Flowise komplekti `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` lai neviens plūsma nevar radīt komandu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` (case-insensitive)"
msgstr "`true` (Nejutīgs)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` = baseline install contract: always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. Also gates install-failure: a failed `required: true` addon hard-fails the play; a failed `required: false` addon warns, is skipped, and the play continues."
msgstr "`true` = bāzes uzstādīšanas līgums: vienmēr uzstādīts, VAR izlaist `enabled`, NEDRĪKST noteikt `enabled: false`. Arī vārti uzstādīt-neveiksme: neveiksmīga `required: true` adon grūti neiztur atskaņošanu; neizdevās `required: false` addon brīdina, tiek izlaists, un spēle turpinās."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` if the host is in the `web-app-mailu` group, else `false`"
msgstr "`true` ja saimnieks ir `web-app-mailu` grupa, pārējie `false`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` or `false`; appends `--debug` when true"
msgstr "`true` vai `false`; pievieno `--debug` ja patiess"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` stops an agent after `idle_minutes` without a request; `false` keeps it running"
msgstr "`true` aptur aģentu pēc `idle_minutes` bez pieprasījuma; `false` uztur to darbojas"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to allow update PRs (workflow-driven and Dependabot)"
msgstr "`true` lai varētu atjaunināt PR (ar darbplūsmu darbināms un atkarīgs robots)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to keep them for every test (passing runs included); the workflow forwards it as `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP`"
msgstr "`true` saglabāt tos katram testam (iekļauti braucieni garām); darba plūsmu uz priekšu to kā `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to machine-translate the entries a PR leaves empty or fuzzy, one PR per language"
msgstr "`true` lai mašīntulkotu ierakstus PR atstāj tukšu vai izplūdušu, pa vienam PR katrā valodā"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` to run CI on `main` pushes too"
msgstr "`true` palaist CI ar `main` stumj pārāk"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`type:` and `regex:` are enforced by `validate_supplied_value()` in [inventory.py](../../../../../utils/manager/inventory.py) at inventory-creation time, on every path where a value arrives from outside:"
msgstr "`type:` kā arī `regex:` izpilda: `validate_supplied_value()` skaits [inventory.py](../../../../../utils/manager/inventory.py) inventarizācijas radīšanas laikā uz katra ceļa, kur vērtība nonāk no ārpuses:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`type:` and `regex:` hold an operator-supplied value to the shape the schema declares; a generated one is exempt because the algorithm that produced it is named by the same schema."
msgstr "`type:` kā arī `regex:` turēt operatora piegādāto vērtību formai shēma deklarē; radītais ir atbrīvots no nodokļa, jo algoritms, kas to ražo, ir nosaukts ar to pašu shēmu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`type` is one of `openapi_allowlist`, `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix`, `prometheus_readonly`, `n8n_workflow`, `resource_readonly`. `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix` and `resource_readonly` additionally require a non-empty `adapter.scope` naming the exact buckets, prefixes, collections or queries reachable. `openapi_allowlist` and `graphql_allowlist` require a checked-in `specification_path` under the role's own `files/`."
msgstr "`type` ir viens no `openapi_allowlist`, `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix`, `prometheus_readonly`, `n8n_workflow`, `resource_readonly`. `graphql_allowlist`, `named_query`, `s3_prefix` kā arī `resource_readonly` papildus nepieciešams netukšs `adapter.scope` precīzi nosaukt spaiņus, priedēkļus, kolekcijas vai vaicājumus, kas sasniedzami. `openapi_allowlist` kā arī `graphql_allowlist` pieprasīt pārbaudi `specification_path` saskaņā ar saviem uzdevumiem `files/`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`unreviewed_third_party`, not `hosted_only`. The review ran and selected no module; re-review if Odoo SA or the OCA publishes a server."
msgstr "`unreviewed_third_party`, ne `hosted_only`. Pārskatīšana ilga un izvēlējās nav modulis; atkārtotu pārskatīšanu, ja Odoo SA vai OCA publicē serveri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`update/` reuses the already-initialized inventory."
msgstr "`update/` atkārtoti izmanto jau inicializēto inventāru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`update` (optional) controls live upstream monitoring. `update.monitored` defaults to `false`; `update.catalog` MUST name a supported external-test catalog adapter; `update.upstream_id` defaults to `<addon_id>`."
msgstr "`update` (Pēc izvēles) kontroles tiek veiktas augšupēji. `update.monitored` noklusētais `false`; `update.catalog` MUST nosaukt atbalstīto ārējā testa kataloga adapteri; `update.upstream_id` noklusētais `<addon_id>`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`update` reuses the existing inventory; `disable` reaches ansible as an extra-var that renders services disabled, but does not touch the include."
msgstr "`update` atkārtoti izmanto esošo uzskaiti; `disable` sasniedz ansible kā ekstra-var, kas sniedz pakalpojumus invalīdiem, bet neskar iekļaut."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`upstreams.conf.j2 <./templates/upstreams.conf.j2>`__ is rendered to the host and mounted into the frontend as ``conf.d/upstreams.conf``. Its content comes from the ``cache:`` sections of the roles’ ``meta/networks.yml``, so no hostname, repository or upstream URL is written in this role."
msgstr "`upstreams.conf.j2 <./templates/upstreams.conf.j2>`__ ir renderēta uz resursdatoru un uzstādīts priekšpusē kā ``conf.d/upstreams.conf``. Tās saturs nāk no ``cache:`` funkciju sadaļas” ``meta/networks.yml``, tāpēc neviens resursdators nosaukums, krātuve vai augšupējs URL nav rakstīts šajā lomā."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`upstreams.conf`: nginx server-blocks, generated from the `cache:` declarations by [render.py](../../utils/cache/render.py) and therefore untracked. HTTPS (port 443) per hostname for runner-side traffic, HTTP (port 80) for inner-`dockerd` Dockerfile builds. Bind-mounted at `/etc/nginx/conf.d/upstreams.conf`."
msgstr "`upstreams.conf`: nginx servera bloki, kas iegūti no `cache:` Deklarācijas [render.py](../../utils/cache/render.py) un tāpēc atsekoja. HTTPS (ports 443) katram skrējēja puses satiksmes resursdatoram, HTTP (ports 80) lietošanai`dockerd` Dockerfile būvē. Imitēt pie `/etc/nginx/conf.d/upstreams.conf`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`user_username` is resolved from `lookup('users', user_key).username` (fallback: `user_key`)"
msgstr "`user_username` ir atrisināta no `lookup('users', user_key).username` (rezerves: `user_key`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`username` reads `from`."
msgstr "`username` lasītājs `from`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.authorized_keys` (list; may be empty)"
msgstr "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.authorized_keys` (saraksts; var būt tukšs)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.groups` (list)"
msgstr "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.groups` (saraksts)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.username` (defaults to WORKSTATION_USER if missing)"
msgstr "`users.<WORKSTATION_USER>.username` (noklusētais WORKSTATION_USER ja trūkst)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`users` lookup 👥"
msgstr "`users` Lookup 👥"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.cache.base._render_with_templar` and the two templar helpers behind it swallow every exception on purpose: a meta payload renders in rounds, and an expression that cannot resolve yet has to come back unchanged rather than abort the round."
msgstr "`utils.cache.base._render_with_templar` un divi templar palīgi aiz tā norij katru izņēmumu pēc mērķa: meta derīgā krava renders kārtās, un izteiksme, kas nevar atrisināt vēl nāk atpakaļ nemainīgs, nevis pārtraukt kārtu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.cache.records` owns the format and the mirror resolution, so the role's bootstrap task and this key cannot drift apart."
msgstr "`utils.cache.records` pieder formāts un spogulis izšķirtspēju, tāpēc loma ir bootstrap uzdevums un šī atslēga nevar dreifēt atsevišķi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.inventory.bundle_apps` reads each named bundle, walks `all.children`, deduplicates the role groups across all bundles, and prints the resulting application list as CSV. The CSV is exported as `apps` before the delegated script runs."
msgstr "`utils.inventory.bundle_apps` lasīt katru nosaukto saišķi, pastaigas `all.children`, deduplicē lomu grupas visos saišķos, un izdrukā iegūto pieteikumu sarakstu kā CSV. CSV eksportē kā: `apps` pirms deleģētā skripta darbināšanas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` maps a role / application_id to its compose entity name (the longest matching category prefix stripped). The purge orchestrators need the inverse: given an entity name, which application_ids belong to it? This helper walks the roles directory and returns that mapping."
msgstr "`utils.roles.entity.name.get_entity_name` kartē lomu / application_id Sastāvā esošajam subjektam (ilgākais saskaņošanas kategorijas prefikss izņemts). Tīrīšanas orķestram nepieciešams apgriezti: norādot subjekta nosaukumu, kas application_ids Pie tā pieder? Šis palīgs staigā lomu direktorijā un atgriež šo kartēšanu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` discovers all role images via `iter_role_images()`. See [origin.md](origin.md) for the declaration format and supported registries."
msgstr "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` atklāj visus lomu attēlus caur `iter_role_images()`. Skatīt [origin.md](origin.md) par deklarācijas formātu un atbalstītajiem reģistriem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` scans every `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` and yields `ImageRef` objects for each top-level service entry that carries both `image` and `version`."
msgstr "`utils/docker/image/discovery.py` skenē katru `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` un ražas `ImageRef` objekti katram augstākā līmeņa servisa ierakstam, kas satur abus `image` kā arī `version`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`validation.min_length` is declared in many role schemas but enforced nowhere. Do not read it as a guarantee."
msgstr "`validation.min_length` tiek deklarēta daudz lomu shēmas, bet piespiedu nekur. Nelasiet to kā garantiju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`variants=None` returns the plan unchanged (full-matrix mode). This is the runner-split entry point: a role with more variants than one runner should iterate is sliced into bundles (e.g. ``0,1,2`` on one runner and ``3,4`` on the next), each bundle passed as `variants`. Out-of-range indices raise `ValueError` so the caller surfaces a clean operator error."
msgstr "`variants=None` atgriež plānu nemainītu (pilnas matricas režīms). Tas ir skrējējs sadalīts ieejas punkts: loma ar vairākiem variantiem, nekā viens skrējējs būtu iterāts tiek sagriezts saišķos (Piemēram, ``0,1,2`` ar vienu skrējēju un ``3,4`` nākamajā dienā), katrs sainis nodots kā `variants`. Ārpusdiapazona indeksu pieaugums `ValueError` tā zvanītāja virsma ir tīra operatora kļūda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`version` (optional) MUST be a string. `\"\"` means \"track the app's default\". A concrete pin MUST be a string, never an unquoted number."
msgstr "`version` (Pēc izvēles) Jābūt virknei. `\"\"` vidēji \"izsekot programmas noklusētajam\". Betona pin jābūt virkne, nekad nekotēts numurs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`version` MUST be the tag."
msgstr "`version` Jābūt birkai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`vlc` (media player with Blu-ray support)"
msgstr "`vlc` (multivides atskaņotājs ar Blu-ray atbalstu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-*` for end-user applications"
msgstr "`web-app-*` galalietotāju lietojumiem"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-akaunting` — Laravel controller shim (stage shim into the named volume on every deploy)"
msgstr "`web-app-akaunting` — Laravel controller shim (posms shim vērā norādīto apjomu uz katru izvietojumu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-atmo` role layout"
msgstr "`web-app-atmo` lomu izkārtojums"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-baserow` is the one row measured against the pinned source rather than a running instance. Confirm it on the deployed stack with `POST /api/database/fields/<field_id>/generate-ai-field-values/` as the seeded superuser: an unlicensed instance answers HTTP 402."
msgstr "`web-app-baserow` ir viena rinda, ko mēra pret pieliekamo avotu, nevis darbojošos instanci. Apstiprināt to uz izvietotā steka ar `POST /api/database/fields/<field_id>/generate-ai-field-values/` kā sēklas superlietotājs: nelicencēta instance atbild HTTP 402."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-friendica` — addon/hook: header → session"
msgstr "`web-app-friendica` — adon/āķis: galvene → sesija"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-funkwhale` — django header / remote-user auth backend"
msgstr "`web-app-funkwhale` — django galvene / attālinātā lietotāja auth aizmugure"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-hermes/meta/mcp.yml` `direction: client`, held to the 025 schema by the MCP lint suite"
msgstr "`web-app-hermes/meta/mcp.yml` `direction: client`, gada 025 MCP lint suite shēma"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` each gain the RBAC role `agent-user` and keep their existing shared instance unchanged."
msgstr "`web-app-hermes` kā arī `web-app-openclaw` katrs gūst RBAC lomu `agent-user` un saglabāt savu esošo kopīgo instanci nemainīgs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-hermes` is deployed there with privileged host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensors, cameras, host network). The trust boundary is the whole device (Decision #12), so there is no microVM around the agent here."
msgstr "`web-app-hermes` tiek izvērsta tur ar priviliģētu uzņēmējas piekļuvi (`/dev`, GPIO, sensori, kameras, saimniektīkla). Uzticamības robeža ir visa ierīce (Lēmums #12), tāpēc nav mikroVM ap aģentu šeit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-keycloak` does not expose its administration API as a tool server. It provides OAuth infrastructure for MCP servers by provisioning an explicit resource, client policy, scope and redirect contract per provider, with experimental token exchange disabled until the exact versions pass user-delegation and revocation tests."
msgstr "`web-app-keycloak` neatsedz tā ievadīšanu API kā rīku serveri. Tas nodrošina OAuth infrastruktūru MCP serveriem, nodrošinot skaidru resursu, klientu politiku, darbības jomu un pārvirzīt līgumu katram pakalpojumu sniedzējam, ar eksperimentālu marķieru apmaiņu atslēgtu, līdz precīzas versijas iztur lietotāju deleģēšanas un atsaukšanas testus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-keycloak` provides `oidc`"
msgstr "`web-app-keycloak` nodrošina `oidc`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-keycloak` — for SSO/OIDC authentication"
msgstr "`web-app-keycloak` — SSO/OIDC autentifikācijai"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-kix` — native OTRS header-auth module"
msgstr "`web-app-kix` — dzimtā OTRS galvenes modulis"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-magento` — custom `Infinito_HeaderSso` module (bypass FPC/Varnish on the handoff route)"
msgstr "`web-app-magento` — parasts `Infinito_HeaderSso` modulis (apvedceļš FAC/Varnish pa atvienošanas maršrutu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`web-app-matrix` is the one role that already ships an AI credential and points it at the vendor: `meta/secrets.yml` declares `chatgpt_bridge_openai_api_key` with the validation `^sk-[a-zA-Z0-9]{40,}$`. That pattern enforces OpenAI's own key format and therefore **rejects a LiteLLM virtual key by construction**, so the schema has to change before the bridge can reach the gateway at all."
msgstr "`web-app-matrix` ir viena loma, ka jau kuģi AI akreditācijas un norāda to pie pārdevēja: `meta/secrets.yml` deklarē `chatgpt_bridge_openai_api_key` ar validāciju `^sk-[a-zA-Z0-9]{40,}$`. Šis modelis īsteno OpenAI pats galveno formātu un tāpēc **noraida LiteLLM virtuālo atslēgu ar būvniecību**, tāpēc shēma ir jāmaina, pirms tilts var sasniegt vārti vispār."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-opencloud` is the trigger role for this requirement: its `services.yml` was migrated to the dynamic-flag form for `ldap.enabled`, both variants pin the LDAP branch on, but [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](../../roles/web-app-opencloud/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) has only `test.skip(!oidcEnabled, …)` gates. Closing the gap consistently across the role tree is what this requirement tracks."
msgstr "`web-app-opencloud` ir noteicošā loma attiecībā uz šo prasību: `services.yml` tika migrēts uz dinamisko uzliesmošanas formu `ldap.enabled`, abi varianti pin LDAP zaru, bet [files/playwright/playwright.spec.js](../../roles/web-app-opencloud/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) ir tikai `test.skip(!oidcEnabled, …)` vārti. Šīs prasības īstenošanas mērķis ir konsekventi novērst plaisu starp lomu koku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-openwebui` gains a second OpenAI connection pointing at the broker, forwards the caller's identity and restricts each agent model to its group."
msgstr "`web-app-openwebui` iegūst otru OpenAI savienojumu, kas norāda uz brokeri, pārceļ zvanītāja identitāti un ierobežo katra aģenta modeli līdz savai grupai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-wordpress` has no AI surface in core; the requirement applies to whichever connector plugin the role installs, and the role MUST pin one rather than leaving the choice to a site administrator. The pinned connector is `ai-engine`, whose `custom` engine type takes an OpenAI-compatible base URL and an API key per environment."
msgstr "`web-app-wordpress` nav AI virsmas kodols; prasība attiecas uz to, kurš savienotāja spraudnis lomu instalēt, un loma MUST pin vienu, nevis atstājot izvēli vietas administratoram. Pieslēguma veids `ai-engine`, kura `custom` dzinēja tips aizņem ar OpenAI savietojamu bāzes URL un API atslēgu katrai videi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-app-zammad` was pinned at 6.5.0, which ships no AI surface at all. The role is bumped to 7.1.2, the newest line whose contract is still the `ai_provider` / `ai_provider_config` setting pair; past 7.1.x the provider moves into an `AI::ProviderConnection` record and the contract changes. 7.1.2 accepts Elasticsearch `>= 7.8, < 10`, so the role's existing 8.13.4 pin stands."
msgstr "`web-app-zammad` bija piestiprināts pie 6.5.0, kas nav AI virsmas vispār. Loma ir uzspiesta uz 7.1.2, jaunāko līniju, kuras līgums joprojām ir `ai_provider` / `ai_provider_config` ielikšanas pāris; pagātne 7.1x pakalpojuma sniedzējs pāriet uz `AI::ProviderConnection` ieraksts un izmaiņas līgumā. 7.1.2 pieņem Elasticsearch `>= 7.8, < 10`, Līdz ar to 8.13.4 tapu statīvi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-svc-*` and `web-opt-*` for web-facing helpers and redirects"
msgstr "`web-svc-*` kā arī `web-opt-*` uz tīmekli vērstiem palīgiem un novirzēm"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-svc-cdn` provides the primary service key `cdn`"
msgstr "`web-svc-cdn` nodrošina primāro pakalpojumu atslēgu `cdn`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`web-svc-cdn`'s only truthy service roots are `matomo` and `prometheus` (both conditional). Everything else hangs beneath them."
msgstr "`web-svc-cdn`'s tikai patiesības pakalpojumu saknes ir `matomo` kā arī `prometheus` (abi nosacījumi). Viss pārējais karājas zem tiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`weighted` is decision 9's score. It ranks on standing preferences and, once the filter has run, ignores the prompt entirely: the same candidate set returns the same winner whatever was asked. The name is the mechanism, and it names its own configuration: `router_strategy: weighted` is the strategy that reads `router_weights`, which `system_one` ignores."
msgstr "`weighted` ir lēmums 9's rezultāts. Tas ierindo stāv preferences un, kad filtrs ir darbojies, ignorē tūlītēju pilnībā: tas pats kandidāts komplekts atgriežas pats uzvarētājs kāds tika lūgts. Nosaukums ir mehānisms, un tas nosauc savu konfigurāciju: `router_strategy: weighted` ir stratēģija, kas skan `router_weights`, kas `system_one` ignorē."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`whitelist`: set to the single role id only if the diff is confined to one `roles/<role>/`; otherwise omit so all roles run."
msgstr "`whitelist`: iestatīts uz vienu lomu id tikai tad, ja diff ir tikai viens `roles/<role>/`; citādi izlaist tik visas lomas darbojas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
