msgid "`workflow_call`: the workflow is a *reusable workflow* and is only started by another workflow that calls it via `uses:`."
msgstr "`workflow_call`: darba plūsma ir *atkārtoti izmantojama darbplūsma* un to sāk tikai ar citu darbplūsmu, kas zvana to caur `uses:`."

