msgid "`workflow_dispatch`: manual run from the GitHub UI or `gh workflow run`, optionally with inputs."
msgstr "`workflow_dispatch`: manuāla palaist no GitHub UI vai `gh workflow run`, pēc izvēles ar ieejām."

