msgid "`workspace=false` and `chunk_gate=false`."
msgstr "`workspace=false` kā arī `chunk_gate=false`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{\"key\": [...], \"applications\": {...}}`: the full mapping plus the cache key it is valid under. Reserved for the constructor's carrier task (see below)."
msgstr "`{\"key\": [...], \"applications\": {...}}`: pilna kartēšana plus kešatmiņas atslēga, kas ir derīga zem. Rezervēts konstruktora pārvadātāja uzdevumam (skatīt zemāk)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{}` is permitted only when `meta/services.yml` declares no dynamic-enabled service-key, so there is nothing for the baseline to pin (for example pure matrix-driver roles such as `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, whose every service-key originates in `variants.yml`)."
msgstr "`{}` ir atļauta tikai tad, ja: `meta/services.yml` deklarē nav dinamiski aktivētu pakalpojumu taustiņu, tāpēc nav nekā bāzes, lai pin (piemēram, tīri matricas vadītāja lomas, piemēram, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, kura katra pakalpojuma atslēga ir `variants.yml`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`~/.ssh` is intentionally **not** in this list. Denying it would make `git push` over SSH unreachable and defeat the `Bash(git push*)` ask-gate. The trade-off and its mitigations are documented in [security.md](security.md#assumption-10-ssh-is-intentionally-readable-to-allow-git-push-on-ask-) (Assumption 10)."
msgstr "`~/.ssh` ir apzināti **nav** šajā sarakstā. Noliegšana būtu `git push` virs SSH nesasniedzams un sakaut `Bash(git push*)` jautāt-vārti. Kompromiss un tā mazināšana ir dokumentēti [security.md](security.md#assumption-10-ssh-is-intentionally-readable-to-allow-git-push-on-ask-) (Pieņēmums 10)."

