# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ehabberda `mod_admin` HTTP UI ir vienīgā Playwright pārbaudāmā virsma; XMPP klienta pieteikšanās pati darbojas 5222/5269 un tas ir jāīsteno XMPP- aizsargāt klientu ārpus Playwright testa cilpas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberd tikai HTTP virsma ir `ejabberd_web_admin` par `/admin` (skatīt [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Tas autentificē tukša JID pret LDAP pār HTTP Basic, tāpēc nav Keycloak novirzīt sekot un nav in-app pieteikšanās kontroli, lai noklikšķiniet; klients autentifikācija pati iet pāri portiem 5222/5269 un paliek ārpus Playwright cilpas, kā atzīmēts sadaļā Skatīšanās punkti. `acl.admin` papildus sarakstu tikai administrators JID, tāpēc web admin atsaka katru citu kontu tieši. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) tādēļ deklarē `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` kā arī `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona un sākotnēji sasniedzami apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI ir vienīgā Playwright pārbaudāmā virsma; XMPP klienta pieteikšanās pati darbojas 5222/5269 un tas ir jāīsteno XMPP- aizsargāt klientu ārpus Playwright testa cilpas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Ejabberda vienīgā HTTP virsma ir ``ejabberd_web_admin`` par ``/admin`` (skatīt ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona un sākotnēji sasniedzami apgalvojumi darbojas bez nosacījumiem."

